Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]"}, "consequence": {"span": "إذا لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "article": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب/يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target_value": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target_value": "الهيئة (the supervisory authority)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b): \"إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات\" [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "in the case of a personal data breach and where feasible", "target_value": "in the case of a personal data breach (no explicit 'where feasible'; late notification must include reasons)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(b): \"حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات\"; \"إذا لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير\" [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "not later than 72 hours after becoming aware of the breach", "target_value": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Late notification must include reasons for delay", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 4(b): \"إذا لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير\" [1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3]", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.89, "reasoning_note": "Article 4(b) directly requires the controller to notify “the Authority” of a personal data breach within 72 hours after discovery, with an exception where risk is unlikely and a requirement to justify delay. The scope to the supervisory authority is satisfied by the explicit reference to “إخطار الهيئة”. The only divergence is the absence of the GDPR’s “where feasible” phrasing, which is functionally approximated by allowing late notification with reasons.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-346", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's citation for the slot 'scope' is unsupported by the modal wording in the provision.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "يجب عليه وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the notification is to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55, as claimed by the analyst."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the 'scope' slot is too conservative, and the provision could be interpreted as covering the scope of the notification.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "The provision mentions notifying the authority within 72 hours, which aligns with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "074363ee1a72941c8326", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 496.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a996e1811fbd202956fd", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Regulates collection purpose, methods, and data minimization; no obligation to resource or support a DPO."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Obligation to respond to data subject requests; does not address providing resources to a DPO."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National register of controllers; unrelated to DPO resourcing."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; not about resourcing the DPO."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content and availability; no link to DPO resources."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Data accuracy obligation; not about DPO support or resources."}, {"id": "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "reason": "Auditing and inspection framework; does not impose a controller duty to provide resources to the DPO."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Notice at collection; no resourcing obligation toward the DPO."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for a realized interest; unrelated to DPO resourcing."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Selected above."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "Selected above."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "Selected above."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 23"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 23"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "article": "Article 23"}, "scope": {"span": "مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية ... يتولى متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات المعمول بها داخل جهة التحكم والإشراف عليها، وتلقي الطلبات المتعلقة بالبيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 32(3)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "provide the resources necessary for the data protection officer to carry out the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23; Article 32(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "supporting the data protection officer in performing the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target": "Tasks of the DPO are enumerated (e.g., متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه ... وتلقي الطلبات)، but no express duty on the controller to support the DPO in performing them", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 32(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "I included Article 23’s requirement to take necessary organizational, administrative, and technical measures as potential functional support for resourcing and coupled it with Article 32’s enumeration of DPO tasks. However, the text does not explicitly tie these measures to a controller duty to provide resources to the DPO, so coverage is only partial despite the plausible reading noted by the reviewer.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-456", "gdpr_article": 38, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for modality and action might overlook implicit obligations and support mechanisms within the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون: مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implicitly suggests the controller's obligation to support the data protection officer's role."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "المادة الثالثة والعشرون: أمن المعلومات على جهة التحكم", "why": "Obliges the controller to take measures that could include providing resources for data protection."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict might be too narrow, as there are provisions that could be related to the obligation to provide resources.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "why": "This provision could be interpreted as including the provision of resources necessary for the data protection officer to perform their tasks."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "04322a32135a68c65bb5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 501.7, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7946ffbebadfb5b3e49a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["1f0de28c69e3ad65d235"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information; does not address designation/delegation of supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions; no provision on creating or designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object/stop processing; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope and exemptions (incl. free zones); does not create or authorize designation of supervisory authorities (especially for religious bodies)."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward Data Protection Officer; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "eb4759acf73f93169adf", "reason": "Executive regulations issuance; no substantive rule on designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; no rule on supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مجلس الوزراء", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "التفويض لمجلس الوزراء - بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب - تفويض ...", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": "تفويض أي من الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة ... ببعض الاختصاصات المنوطة بالمكتب في هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "أي من الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة وفي نطاق اختصاصها المحلي", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب", "article": "Article 27"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "مجلس الوزراء", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "تفويض لمجلس الوزراء ... تفويض (authorizes the Cabinet to delegate)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "designate a specific independent supervisory authority for supervising churches and religious associations that apply comprehensive rules under Article 91(1)", "target_value": "تفويض بعض اختصاصات المكتب إلى جهات حكومية محلية مختصة ضمن نطاقها المحلي", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة ضمن نطاقها المحلي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the designated specific authority fulfils the conditions laid down in Chapter VI of this Regulation", "target_value": "بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب (no independence/Chapter VI-equivalent condition stated)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "UAE Article 27 only authorizes the Cabinet to delegate some powers of the federal data office to competent local government entities. It does not provide for designating an independent supervisory authority for churches/religious associations nor require Chapter VI-like conditions of independence and powers.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-978", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "eb4759acf73f93169adf", "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "c34922f387019af45e42"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 295.73, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3fdeddcdcaf42baa7473", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "fa368b0d433d7765b715"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; no rule on restricting or permitting movement/transfer of personal data."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Conditions for indirect collection/processing; unrelated to movement/transfer freedom."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure grounds; does not address freedom of movement of data across jurisdictions."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Grounds for collection/processing; no provision on non-restriction of data movement."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Data subject access right; not about transfer/movement restrictions."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Recordkeeping includes noting cross-border transfers; does not create or bar restrictions."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for data subject's interest; no relevance to free movement or its restriction."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "Security measures; not about free movement or prohibition of restrictions."}, {"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "reason": "Records of processing details including outbound transfers; purely administrative."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Regulatory powers and certifications; no rule on intra-jurisdiction free movement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "restrict the free movement of personal data", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "within the Union", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "for reasons connected with the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 29 regulates transfers to outside the Kingdom and imposes conditions and emergency exceptions; it does not establish a prohibition on restricting intra-jurisdiction data movement for data-protection reasons. Article 3 is a savings clause preserving stronger protections under other laws or treaties and contains no free-movement guarantee. Therefore, there is no functional counterpart to the GDPR’s intra-Union free-movement non-restriction rule.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-001", "gdpr_article": 1, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of no counterpart is too absolute; provisions like Article 29 and the overall structure of data protection in the KSA jurisdiction suggest some level of consideration for the free movement and protection of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "المادة التاسعة والعشرون: 1- مع مراعاة ما ورد في الفقرة (2) من هذه المادة، يجوز لجهة التحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية:", "why": "This article discusses the conditions under which personal data can be transferred outside the Kingdom, implying considerations for the protection and movement of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists in Article 29 and Article 3", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "Article 29(3)", "why": "Provides an exception to the conditions for transferring personal data outside the Kingdom in cases of extreme necessity"}, {"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "span": "Article 3", "why": "Allows for the free movement of personal data within the Kingdom, as long as it does not contradict other provisions or international agreements"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "ba8aef540689169aa848", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "06b918a4049719ed530f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 484.14, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "895aa0641e8636ad2c85", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
