{"candidates_selected": ["e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "f10a3fa820a149065de0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "General supervisory powers and tools; no authority to accredit or license a body to monitor codes of conduct."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing safeguards; unrelated to accreditation or code monitoring."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "reason": "Inspection and seizure powers; no accreditation or code-monitoring body."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure conditions; unrelated to accreditation or code monitoring."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection; unrelated to accreditation or code monitoring."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to accreditation or code monitoring."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "Data Protection Officer duties; no accreditation of external monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National register of controllers; no accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "reason": "Sanctions framework; no accreditation or code monitoring."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "Consent requirements; unrelated to accreditation or code monitoring."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تصدر الجهة المختصة", "article": "Article 35"}, "modality": {"span": "تصدر", "article": "Article 35"}, "action": {"span": "تصدر الجهة المختصة القواعد المنظمة للترخيص لجهات تتولى إصدار شهادات الاعتماد", "article": "Article 35"}, "scope": {"span": "لجهات تتولى إصدار شهادات الاعتماد لجهات التحكم وجهات المعالجة", "article": "Article 35"}, "condition": {"span": "وتُنسّق الجهة المختصة مع هيئة الحكومة الرقمية فيما يتعلق بالترخيص للجهات التي تقدم الخدمات نيابة عن الجهات الحكومية", "article": "Article 35"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "competent supervisory authority", "target": "الجهة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 35: \"تصدر الجهة المختصة\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "power", "target": "تصدر (issues rules/licensing framework)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 35: \"تصدر الجهة المختصة\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "accredit a body to monitor compliance with a code of conduct", "target": "issue rules for licensing entities that issue accreditation certificates; license audit/examination entities", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 35; Article 36 (التدقيق والفحص)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "accreditation of a body referred to in Article 41(1) (monitoring body for codes of conduct)", "target": "licensing bodies for certification of controllers/processors and for auditing/fact-finding of processing activities", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 35; Article 36 (التدقيق والفحص)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "Body must show independence, expertise, assessment/monitoring/review procedures, complaint-handling transparency, and no conflicts of interest", "target": "Coordination with Digital Government Authority for licensing when services are provided on behalf of government entities; no criteria for code-monitoring bodies", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 35: \"وتُنسّق الجهة المختصة مع هيئة الحكومة الرقمية...\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No exception text identified"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No temporal condition identified"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No consequence specified"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.61, "reasoning_note": "Article 35 is the closest counterpart but regulates the competent authority issuing rules to license certification bodies, not accrediting a body to monitor code-of-conduct compliance, and it lacks the Article 41(2) criteria. Article 36 similarly concerns licensing of audit/examination entities, not code-monitoring bodies. No provision authorizes accrediting a monitoring body for codes of conduct.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-504", "gdpr_article": 41, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "span": "جهات منح شهادات الاعتماد", "why": "Article 35 mentions accreditation bodies, which could be related to monitoring compliance with a code of conduct"}, {"id": "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "span": "التدقيق والفحص", "why": "Article 36 discusses audit and inspection, which might be connected to monitoring compliance"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart in Article 35, but not a direct match", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "span": "تصدر الجهة المختصة القواعد المنظمة للترخيص لجهات تتولى إصدار شهادات الاعتماد لجهات التحكم وجهات المعالجة", "why": "Potential counterpart to GDPR requirement, but not a direct match"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "67a122f7dc547487996a", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 495.56, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "394d0e431915cb809b53", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties for controllers/processors; no rule addressing courts or treatment of related proceedings."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions for processing; not about court procedure or related actions."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information; incidental mention of judicial procedures only as a refusal ground, no obligation on courts regarding related proceedings."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures for personal data; no judicial procedural rule."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases without consent, including for legal claims/judicial procedures; does not regulate courts' handling of related cases."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction with references to legal claims; no rule for courts on consolidating or treating proceedings as related."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Administrative complaint process; addresses the data protection office, not courts or related proceedings."}, {"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "reason": "Cross-border transfers including for judicial cooperation; no obligation on courts about related actions."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Right to erasure with exceptions for legal claims; not about court procedure."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no judicial procedural content."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no rules on courts or related proceedings."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related organizational duties; unrelated to courts’ treatment of proceedings."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "courts", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "treat proceedings as related", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": null, "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the proceedings are so closely connected that it is expedient to hear and determine them together to avoid the risk of irreconcilable judgments from separate proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": null, "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": null, "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": null, "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.93, "reasoning_note": "All provided UAE PDPL provisions regulate data processing obligations and rights; none address court procedure or the treatment of related proceedings. Incidental references to judicial procedures relate only to lawful bases or exceptions for processing, not to procedural consolidation rules. Therefore, the GDPR unit is not represented in the target texts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1012", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "57844ac856d11c289650", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 273.54, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "0daf09372c660428a1a8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure/right-to-delete rules; not specific to processing of criminal-conviction data or special categories."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Confidentiality and security controls; no special rule for criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualification details; unrelated to special-category processing prohibitions."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification; not a prohibition or authorization regime for criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Supervisory enforcement powers; not a substantive processing condition for the category at issue."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation; no bearing on processing of criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5", "reason": "Data subject rights (access, portability, etc.); not a category-specific processing prohibition."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy placement/content; not a rule on criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "General controller safeguards; no specific prohibition/authorization for criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subject; not a prohibition on processing criminal-conviction data."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "article": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "action": {"span": "معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) من القانون", "article": "Article 25 (a2a61b7c9316716b7e74)"}, "condition": {"span": "الحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "article": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "exception": {"span": "إلا في الحدود والحالات المقررة قانوناً، أو إذا كان تنفيذاً لحكم أو قرار قضائي.", "article": "Article 25 (a2a61b7c9316716b7e74)"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "process personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures", "target_value": "معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) من القانون", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the processing is based on Article 6(1) GDPR", "target_value": "الحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "when under the control of official authority; or when authorised by law that provides appropriate safeguards", "target_value": "إلا في الحدود والحالات المقررة قانوناً، أو إذا كان تنفيذاً لحكم أو قرار قضائي.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 25 (a2a61b7c9316716b7e74); Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 5 (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.46, "reasoning_note": "The target texts impose a permit requirement for processing data referenced in Law Article 5 and restrict disclosure of those data by law or court order, but they never mention criminal-conviction/offence data or related security measures. No GDPR-like rule appears that limits processing such data to official-authority control or statutory authorization with safeguards. Without the text of Law Article 5, equivalence to GDPR Article 10 cannot be established.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-030", "gdpr_article": 10, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "3f916831456908af27d8", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 309.21, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "83f2016bed3d91ea1eaa", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Sets duties toward an already-appointed DPO; does not establish triggers for designation."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles and tasks, not when a DPO must be appointed."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Addresses automated-decision rights; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Concerns restriction of processing; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint procedures and sanctions; not about DPO appointment triggers."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information; does not govern DPO appointment triggers."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "General processor obligations; no rule on when a DPO must be designated (record may include DPO but no trigger)."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; references DPO contact but does not set designation triggers."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; no triggers for DPO appointment (mentions DPO in records only)."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك في أي من الأحوال الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة من شأنها إحداث خطر ذو مستوى عالي على سرية وخصوصية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات نتيجة اعتماد تقنيات جديدة أو مرتبطة بحجم البيانات. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتضمن تقييم ممنهج وشامل للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة بما يشمل التنميط والمعالجة المؤتمتة. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتم على حجم كبير من البيانات الشخصية الحساسة.", "article": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: ... ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها. ج. البيانات الشخصية لدى الجهات الأمنية والقضائية.", "article": "Article 2(2)(ب)، (ج)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "processor", "target": "Controller and processor (المتحكم والمعالج).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "Obligation (يجب).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "designate a data protection officer", "target": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None stated", "target": "No specific scope term stated beyond the general applicability of the law.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "Any of: (a) public authority/body; (b) core activities require regular and systematic monitoring of data subjects on a large scale; (c) core activities involve large-scale processing of special categories of data and criminal-conviction data.", "target": "Any of: high risk due to new tech or data volume; systematic and comprehensive assessment of sensitive personal data incl. profiling/automated processing; large volume processing of sensitive personal data.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "For point (a), courts acting in their judicial capacity are excluded.", "target": "General exclusions from the law’s scope for government entities processing personal data and for data at security and judicial authorities.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 2(2)(ب)، (ج)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None stated", "target": "None stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None stated", "target": "None stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "The UAE PDPL imposes an obligation on processors to appoint a DPO, but its triggers (Art. 10(1)(a)–(c)) differ from GDPR Art. 37(1)(a)–(c): no public-authority trigger, no explicit large-scale monitoring trigger, and a focus on sensitive data and high-risk/new-tech. The PDPL’s scope exclusion for government and judicial entities is broader than the GDPR’s narrow court-in-judicial-capacity carve-out. Therefore, the counterpart is partial rather than complete.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not explicitly exclude courts acting in their judicial capacity from the requirement to appoint a data protection officer, which is a key aspect of the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "Article 2(2)(ب) and (ج)", "why": "The UAE law exempts government entities and data held by security and judicial authorities from the law, which could be interpreted as excluding courts from the requirement to appoint a data protection officer."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not have a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement, as the triggers for designating a data protection officer are not identical.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 10(1)", "span": "أ. إذا كانت المعالجة من شأنها إحداث خطر ذو مستوى عالي على سرية وخصوصية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات نتيجة اعتماد تقنيات جديدة أو مرتبطة بحجم البيانات. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتضمن تقييم ممنهج وشامل للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة بما يشمل التنميط والمعالجة المؤتمتة. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتم على حجم كبير من البيانات الشخصية الحساسة.", "why": "The triggers for designating a data protection officer in the UAE law are not identical to those specified in Article 37(1)(a)–(c) of the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 2(2)(ب)، (ج)", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: ... ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها. ج. البيانات الشخصية لدى الجهات الأمنية والقضائية.", "why": "The UAE law excludes government entities and judicial authorities from its scope, which could be seen as analogous to the exclusion of courts acting in their judicial capacity from point (a) of Article 37(1) of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 518.34, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9f89730624117f98d7fb", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Data portability between controllers; not a cross-border transfer rule."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Internal governance (procedures) requirement; does not set the legal conditions for international transfers."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General protection statement; no operative cross-border transfer norm."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Prohibits publishing/sharing certain data; not specifically about cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; not about international transfers."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Prior authorization for processing special categories; mentions locations but not a transfer permission/prohibition rule."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation; not about transfers."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification; not about transfers."}, {"id": "6822d8664264bc19842c", "reason": "Confidentiality/publishing; not a cross-border transfer regime."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 37"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة. ويحظر عليه نقل البيانات الشخصية إذا تمت معالجتها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون، أو كان من شأنها إلحاق ضرر بصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 23"}, "action": {"span": "نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "article": "Article 37"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "ضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة", "article": "Article 38"}, "exception": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة", "article": "Article 23"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "article": "Article 37"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 37", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "prohibition on transfers unless Chapter V conditions are complied with; subject to other GDPR provisions", "target_value": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة. ويحظر عليه نقل البيانات الشخصية إذا تمت معالجتها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون، أو كان من شأنها إلحاق ضرر بصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Articles 23, 37, 38", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "transfer personal data to a third country or to an international organisation, including onward transfers", "target_value": "نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 37", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data undergoing processing or intended for processing after transfer; includes onward transfers from the third country/international organisation to another third country/international organisation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "subject to the other provisions of the GDPR", "target_value": "لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 38", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "when the conditions laid down in Chapter V are complied with", "target_value": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 37", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "The Omani texts impose obligatory preconditions (consent, adequate protection) and an explicit prohibition on unlawful or harmful transfers, so the modality is functionally equivalent to the GDPR’s conditional prohibition. However, the materials do not expressly address onward transfers from a recipient in a third country, making the coverage narrower on scope. References to compliance with the law and regulation align with GDPR’s ‘subject to other provisions’ construct.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-545", "gdpr_article": 44, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN law does not fully align with the GDPR's requirements for the transfer of personal data to third countries or international organisations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 37", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires explicit consent for the transfer of personal data outside Oman, but it does not mention the conditions laid down in Chapter V of the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 23", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة", "why": "This provision allows the transfer of personal data outside Oman if it is done in accordance with the regulation, but it does not fully align with the GDPR's requirements for adequate protection."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of weaker modality is not supported by the provisions, which provide a comprehensive framework for regulating the transfer of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة. ويحظر عليه نقل البيانات الشخصية إذا تمت معالجتها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون، أو كان من شأنها إلحاق ضرر بصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision explicitly prohibits the transfer of personal data if it violates the law or harms the data subject, indicating a stronger modality."}, {"id": "434ad096940e27397f81", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires explicit consent from the data subject before transferring personal data outside the Sultanate of Oman, indicating a stronger modality."}, {"id": "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "This provision requires the controller to ensure that the external processing entity has adequate protection for personal data before transferring it outside the Sultanate of Oman, indicating a stronger modality."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "6822d8664264bc19842c"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 603.13, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "cd48d3d385b1cf4be424", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to obtain information (including general procedures in case of breach) but does not establish the controller’s duty to notify data subjects of a specific breach."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; not about breach notification to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints to the authority; not about controller-to-data-subject breach notification."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO facilitation duties; not about breach notification to data subjects."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not create a duty to notify data subjects of breaches."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures (incl. encryption) but no textual exception excusing data-subject notification when such measures exist."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods; not a breach-notification obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وتوقيع الجزاءات الإدارية المشار إليها في المادة (26) من هذا المرسوم بقانون في حال ثبوت مخالفة المتحكم أو المعالج لأحكامه", "article": "Article 9(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "يجب (must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "communicate the personal data breach to the data subject", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات (notify the data subject)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "communication of personal data breaches to data subjects", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات عند وقوع اختراق/انتهاك يؤثر على بياناته وإعلامه بالإجراءات المتخذة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "a personal data breach is likely to result in a high risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "إذا كان الانتهاك/الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بيانات صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "no communication required if: (a) adequate protective measures (e.g., encryption) render data unintelligible; (b) subsequent measures remove the likely high risk; or (c) individual communication would involve disproportionate effort", "target": "No statutory exceptions stated for notifying data subjects; procedures/conditions delegated to the Executive Regulations but not expressed as exceptions in the statute.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "without undue delay", "target": "خلال المدة التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية (within a period set by regulation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "Possible administrative penalties by the Office if non-compliance is established", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 9(2) mandates controller-to-data-subject notification upon a breach that would affect privacy/confidentiality/security, but it neither mirrors GDPR’s ‘high risk to rights and freedoms’ test nor states any textual exceptions. The cited phrases are a trigger condition and a delegation to implementing procedures, not statutory exceptions akin to GDPR Art. 34(3). Therefore the exception slot remains uncovered on the face of the statute.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-362", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision in Article 9(2) does not explicitly state 'without undue delay', and the exception in Article 34(3) may be partially covered by the reference to the executive regulations in Article 9(2).", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state 'without undue delay', and the exception may be partially covered."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The exception slot is not entirely uncovered, and Article 9(2) provides some exceptions to the notification requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "why": "This phrase could be interpreted as an exception to the notification requirement, similar to Article 34(3) of the GDPR."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "why": "This phrase implies that there are specific procedures and conditions that must be followed, which could be considered as a form of exception."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 497.05, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "34d4b25131fea25c537a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "reason": "Addresses health-data handling specifics, not processor notification or sub-processing changes."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Concerns data-subject information at collection; no rule on sub-processor change notifications."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Accuracy duty; unrelated to sub-processing or controller notification."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "DPIA content and sharing; does not require informing controller of sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "0269f42c0015a544c475", "reason": "Marketing communications; unrelated to processor/sub-processor arrangements."}, {"id": "435273e8cc311e8d0b3c", "reason": "Health-data safeguards; no rule on notifying controller of sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Data-subject request handling timelines; not about sub-processing."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Consent withdrawal; no bearing on sub-processor change notifications."}, {"id": "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "reason": "Prohibits making consent a condition for service; unrelated to sub-processing."}, {"id": "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "reason": "Complaints processing; not about controller notice of sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "Controller registry; no sub-processor notification rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة المعالجة", "article": "Article 17(5)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة المعالجة ... الالتزام بالآتي", "article": "Article 17(5)"}, "action": {"span": "إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, "scope": {"span": "قبل قيامها بأي تعاقدات لاحقة مع جهات معالجة فرعية", "article": "Article 17(5)"}, "condition": {"span": "الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "جهة المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة المعالجة ... الالتزام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "inform the controller of any intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors", "target_value": "إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "sub-processing", "target_value": "جهات معالجة فرعية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the controller has given general written authorisation to engage other processors", "target_value": "الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "before implementing the intended changes", "target_value": "قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "Article 17(5)(ج) expressly requires notifying the controller “قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات” (before entering into those sub-processor contracts), which is a before-implementation notice of the intended addition/replacement. While GDPR’s duty is conditioned on general authorization, the KSA text imposes a stronger baseline (prior approval plus pre-contract notice and an objection window), thus functionally covering the GDPR requirement.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-226", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-226] in the sense that it does not explicitly address the scenario of general written authorisation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "span": "Article 17(5)(ج)", "why": "This provision requires the processor to notify the controller before engaging sub-processors, but it does not explicitly cover the scenario where the controller has given general written authorisation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction's Article 17(5)(ج) does not explicitly require the processor to inform the controller of intended changes before implementing them, which may not be equivalent to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "span": "ج- الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم، على أن يتم إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات وتمكين جهة التحكم من الاعتراض عليها خلال مدة يتفق عليها بين جهة التحكم وجهة المعالجة.", "why": "This provision only requires notification before engaging with sub-processors, but does not specify that this notification must occur before implementing the changes."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "0269f42c0015a544c475", "435273e8cc311e8d0b3c", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "cf114b62f7d3612bb117", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 509.05, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c7d67c3d242e403a6914", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Relates to obtaining a ministry permit and its contents; does not address courts, stays of proceedings, or parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Sets internal controls for processing; no judicial competence or suspension of proceedings."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Creates an administrative complaint mechanism to the ministry; not a court process and contains no rule on court suspension or lis pendens."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Concerns revocation of permits; no linkage to court proceedings or cross-border lis pendens."}, {"id": "90a1f5873d102c323383", "reason": "Mentions courts but only to allow confiscation as a sanction; does not regulate staying/suspending proceedings or parallel cases."}, {"id": "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "reason": "Administrative decision timelines and ministerial grievance; no judicial stay or parallel proceedings rule."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Representation of incapacitated persons; unrelated to court suspension or parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions by the minister; does not involve court power to suspend proceedings."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Duty to cooperate with the ministry; no court-related lis pendens or suspension."}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Notification of permit data changes; no judicial elements."}, {"id": "3ea4b464db31878217fb", "reason": "Sets timeframe for administrative complaint decisions; not a court process and no rule on staying proceedings."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Administrative follow-up after breach reports; no court stay or parallel proceedings provision."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "any competent court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "suspend its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.83, "reasoning_note": "The cited Omani provisions establish an administrative complaint pathway (Arts. 12, 43) and do not regulate judicial proceedings, stays, or lis pendens, nor do they address parallel proceedings in another state. Article 31’s court reference concerns confiscation sanctions, not suspension of proceedings. Therefore, no distributed counterpart covers the GDPR Art. 81 permission for courts to suspend proceedings.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-927", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 37}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Mechanism for addressing disputes related to data processing"}, {"id": "3ea4b464db31878217fb", "span": "تتولى الإدارة المختصة البت في الشكوى أو البلاغ خلال (60) ستين يوماً من اليوم التالي لانتهاء المدة المحددة في المادة (42) من هذه اللائحة", "why": "Administration's decision on a complaint implies a potential judicial or quasi-judicial process"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "823830174d241884bd73", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "90a1f5873d102c323383", "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "3ea4b464db31878217fb", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 405.85, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "714d8171b985a730cb98", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "General right to obtain information; 13(1)(ح) mentions procedures in case of breach, but not the mandatory content of a post-breach communication to data subjects."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Provides general contact methods with the controller; does not regulate breach-notification content."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; unrelated to breach-notification content to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing/objection rights; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; does not prescribe content of data-subject breach communications."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support/communication; does not require including DPO contact in breach communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; no specific rule on content of data-subject breach communications."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no rule on including DPO contact in data-subject breach communications."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; unrelated to breach-notification content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله.", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "موافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات...\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"يجب\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "include at least the information and measures referred to in Article 33(3)(b), (c) and (d) in the communication", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"أن يخطر صاحب البيانات... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله\". By contrast, Article 9(1)(ب)(ج)(د) lists DPO data, likely effects, and measures for authority notifications only.", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "content of the communication to data subjects under Article 34(1)", "target": "الإجراءات المتخذة (measures taken) only", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله\" (no requirement to include DPO contact or likely consequences).", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "when communicating a personal data breach to data subjects pursuant to Article 34(1)", "target": "if the breach would affect the confidentiality, secrecy, and security of the data subject’s personal data", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No exceptions stated in Article 9(2) regarding content of the notice.", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "notification within a period set by the Executive Regulations", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية...\"", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No consequences specified in Article 9(2) for content non-compliance.", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.76, "reasoning_note": "Article 9(2) obliges notifying the data subject and providing the measures taken, but it does not require including DPO contact details or the likely consequences. The items mirroring GDPR 33(3)(b)–(d) appear in Article 9(1) for authority notifications, and there is no textual cross-reference importing them into the data-subject notification.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-364", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement, as Article 9(2) only requires notification of the procedures taken, but does not explicitly require the inclusion of the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 9(2) only requires notification of the procedures taken, but does not explicitly require the inclusion of the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require the controller to include all the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "أ. بيان طبيعة الاختراق أو الانتهاك، وصورته، وأسبابه، والعدد التقريبي له وسجلاته. ب. بيانات مسؤول حماية البيانات المعين لديه. ج. الآثار المحتملة والمتوقعة لحدوث الاختراق أو الانتهاك. د. بيان الإجراءات والتدابير المتخذة من قبله والمقترح تنفيذها لمواجهة هذا الاختراق أو الانتهاك والتقليل من آثاره السلبية.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to report certain information to the authority, but it does not explicitly require the controller to include all the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 504.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2ccd6a1eb895fd5218a5", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "9548224453cca1301899"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards for data; no provision on penalties or their effectiveness/proportionality/deterrence."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Controller’s internal compliance procedures; not about penalties design or ensuring EPD characteristics."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right/principles; no penalty standard."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial rules for exercising data subject rights; not penalties."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and safeguards; not sanctions’ EPD standard."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions to access-related obligations; not penalties."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions for certain processing contexts; not penalties."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restriction; not penalties."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "article": "Article 32"}, "action": {"span": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "ensure that penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are effective, proportionate and dissuasive", "target_value": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 27; Article 23", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 23 establishes a monetary penalty and Article 27 empowers the competent department to take all necessary measures to implement and enforce the law, but no text requires that penalties be effective, proportionate, and dissuasive. Thus, while enforcement powers and a specific sanction exist, the EPD quality standard is not expressed, yielding only partial coverage. This addresses the objection by recognizing distributed relevance yet noting the missing EPD criterion.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-950", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology and distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "why": "Implies that authorities are obligated to ensure effective enforcement of the law, including penalties"}, {"id": "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "Imposes a penalty for violating certain provisions, which could be considered effective, proportionate, and dissuasive"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the slot 'action' may be incorrect, as the concept of ensuring effective, proportionate, and dissuasive penalties could be present in the QAT provisions under different terminology and distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "This article provides a specific penalty for non-compliance, which could be considered as a form of penalty."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This article grants the competent authority the power to take necessary measures to implement and enforce the law, which could include ensuring that penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "9548224453cca1301899", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 545.15, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2dcdbf03fb0cdd90eb11", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Sets supervisory authority functions (including handling complaints) but does not establish a private right to damages or compensation."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Concerns prior authorization/permit content for processing; no civil remedy or compensation right."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Addresses representation of incapacitated persons; does not create a right to damages for infringements."}, {"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "reason": "Provides administrative sanctions by the Ministry; administrative fines are not compensation to data subjects."}, {"id": "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "reason": "Criminal liability and fines for legal persons; no private compensation mechanism."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Right to lodge a complaint with the Ministry; no entitlement to damages."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualifications; no relevance to compensation."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "reason": "Complaint/report procedure and deadlines; does not provide for compensation."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Lists processing exemptions/lawful bases (e.g., protecting vital interests); it does not establish any right to compensation. The cited phrase \"حماية مصلحة حيوية لصاحب البيانات الشخصية\" is a lawful basis exception, not a compensatory remedy."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Post-breach administrative steps (assessment, directions); no civil damages right."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Obligation to appoint a DPO; no compensation provision."}], "target_frame": {"proposition": {"span": "ويكون المعالج في علاقته بالغير فيما يقدمه من خدمات نائباً عن المتحكم، وذلك في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "article": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)"}, "addressee": {"span": "الغير", "article": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)"}, "modality": {"span": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "article": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "article": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Any person who has suffered material or non-material damage as a result of an infringement of this Regulation has the right to receive compensation from the controller or processor for the damage suffered.", "target_value": "ويكون المعالج ... نائباً عن المتحكم، وذلك في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)", "slot": "proposition"}, {"gdpr_value": "any person who has suffered material or non-material damage", "target_value": "الغير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "receive compensation from the controller or processor for the damage suffered", "target_value": "تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية (المعالج نائب عن المتحكم في علاقته بالغير)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "damage resulting from an infringement of this Regulation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the person has suffered material or non-material damage as a result of an infringement of this Regulation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated in the relevant civil-liability clause", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3 (c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.57, "reasoning_note": "OMN Article 3 (Exec. Reg.) functionally anchors civil liability by deeming the processor an agent of the controller vis-à-vis third parties, which provides a pathway to damages under general civil-liability principles, but it does not expressly grant a right to compensation nor clarify processor civil liability. The reviewer-cited clause about protecting vital interests (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814) is a processing exemption/lawful basis and does not create any compensatory entitlement. Overall, compensation is only indirectly inferable and appears controller-focused, leaving the GDPR unit only partially covered.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-929", "gdpr_article": 82, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart in the target jurisdiction (OMN) for the GDPR requirement is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision provides a mechanism for individuals to submit complaints about non-compliant data processing, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "This provision also provides a mechanism for individuals to submit complaints about non-compliant data processing, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالعقوبات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجوز للوزارة فرض جزاءات إدارية على المخالفات التي يتم ارتكابها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون أو اللائحة أو القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "why": "This provision mentions the imposition of administrative fines, which could be related to the concept of compensation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is too narrow, and there are provisions that could be interpreted as providing a basis for compensation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "حماية مصلحة حيوية لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision could be interpreted as providing a basis for compensation in cases where the infringement of the law has caused damage to the individual."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "f1d11d7b0c4a6479bbe4", "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "823830174d241884bd73", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 523.09, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "fedcbcf08d8d85c7d451", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
