"impose a total administrative fine that exceeds the amount specified for the gravest infringement", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "administrative fines under this Regulation", "target_value": "الجزاءات الإدارية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where a controller or processor intentionally or negligently infringes several provisions for the same or linked processing operations", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "The UAE text empowers the Office to impose administrative sanctions and delegates specifics to a Cabinet decision, but contains no rule capping aggregate fines across multiple infringements tied to the same or linked processing. The GDPR’s specific prohibition on exceeding the gravest-infringement amount is absent. Related provisions only establish sanctioning authority, not limits.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-509", "gdpr_article": 42, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 280.97, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "addde889e2b7cee82fbf", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Administrative grievance against Data Office decisions; no rule on courts suspending judicial proceedings or lis pendens across jurisdictions."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Obligations of processors; no reference to court competence, judicial proceedings, or suspension of cases."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing (including legal claims) but not a procedural rule for courts to stay proceedings."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restrict processing; mentions legal claims only as a basis to continue/retain processing, not court authority to suspend judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights with carve-outs for legal claims; no rule on judicial case management or inter-court stays."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border data transfers and adequacy; the mention of judicial authorities is about oversight in the destination country, not UAE courts staying proceedings."}, {"id": "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "reason": "Transitional compliance; unrelated to court proceedings or suspension."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint to the Data Office and administrative sanctions; no provision on courts or suspending judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no judicial procedure or court stay mechanism."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing (e.g., for marketing/statistics); does not address courts, jurisdiction, or suspension of judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; unrelated to courts or judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; no connection to courts or suspension of proceedings."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "any competent court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "suspend its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "RU-927 is a court procedural rule (lis pendens-style stay) and requires authority for courts to suspend proceedings when a parallel case is pending in another Member State. The cited UAE PDPL provisions regulate data processing rights and administrative complaint mechanisms and do not address courts, jurisdiction, or suspension/stay of judicial proceedings. Articles 16 and 17 concern restricting or stopping data processing by controllers, not judicial case management, so they are not functionally or textually relevant to RU-927.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-927", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict might be too absolute; provisions suggest a framework for handling data processing disputes that could be relevant to parallel court proceedings.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "Implies mechanisms for handling disputes and violations related to data processing."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة", "why": "Talks about stopping processing under certain conditions, suggesting a framework for handling data processing disputes."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "span": "المادة (25) التظلم من قرارات المكتب", "why": "Discusses the appeal of decisions, indicating a process for handling legal disputes."}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect relevance across multiple provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة", "why": "Implies procedures for handling data and potential disputes or claims, potentially related to court proceedings"}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "Relates to the restriction of processing, which could be interpreted in the context of managing legal proceedings"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["ffb151edc5703b569765", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "57844ac856d11c289650", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "c34922f387019af45e42", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "9c38ab11b550755816f5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 486.34, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d6e17b5cd528aa6b0469", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "General scope of the regulation; does not establish supervisory authority powers or conditions to act regarding intended processing."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Defines lawful bases for processing by service providers; no supervisory authority power or trigger tied to intended processing."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "reason": "Provider obligations on transparency, security, and user rights; does not grant the authority power to act based on anticipated infringement."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Provider security and record-keeping duties; does not state supervisory authority powers conditional on prospective infringement."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification duties; no supervisory authority power triggered by considering intended processing would infringe."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لل هيئة", "article": "Article 7(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014", "article": "Article 7(3)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت", "article": "Article 7(3)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(3)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power (may)", "target_value": "يجوز للهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "use any of its powers referred to in Article 58", "target_value": "تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7(3)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "intended processing referred to in paragraph 1 (prior consultation context)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the authority considers the intended processing would infringe the GDPR", "target_value": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7(3)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(3) gives the authority a power to apply penalties upon proven violations, which is different from the GDPR trigger of merely considering that intended processing would infringe. No provision addresses the prior-consultation context or a general authorization to use any supervisory powers upon such consideration. Thus, condition and action are only partially matched, and the specific scope is missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-417", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 6}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may not be entirely accurate, and there may be counter-evidence to support a different conclusion.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "Article 7(3)", "why": "The authority's power to impose penalties and fines is not explicitly linked to intended processing that would infringe the GDPR."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "Article 3", "why": "The conditions under which the collection and processing of data are lawful may be related to the concept of 'intended processing'."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot has a potential counterpart in Article 7(3) of the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "للهيئة في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات", "why": "This provision indicates a condition under which the authority can apply sanctions, potentially aligning with the GDPR's condition for action."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 6, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 531.12, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "aa681513bf0499b80097", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "provide the data subject with the identity of the controller", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "information duties when personal data were not obtained from the data subject", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where personal data have not been obtained from the data subject", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "Paragraphs 1 to 4 do not apply where and insofar as: (a) the data subject already has the information; (b) providing the information proves impossible or would involve a disproportionate effort, in particular for processing for archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes, subject to Article 89(1), or insofar as the obligation in paragraph 1 would render impossible or seriously impair the achievement of the objectives of that processing; (c) obtaining or disclosure is expressly laid down by Union or Member State law to which the controller is subject and which provides appropriate measures to protect the data subject's legitimate interests; or (d) the personal data must remain confidential subject to an obligation of professional secrecy under Union or Member State law, including a statutory obligation of secrecy.", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.21, "reasoning_note": "No Kuwait (KWT) statutory provisions were provided, so no textual counterpart could be mapped for this GDPR duty. This result reflects only the absence of retrieved candidate text and does not assert that KWT law lacks such a norm. Additional text collection from KWT sources is required to verify coverage.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-086", "gdpr_article": 14, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information to verify the analyst's claim of no counterpart existing in the KWT jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.0}], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 286.84, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4dcc66109dc818705e29", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Addresses public-interest processing by public bodies; does not regulate cross-border transfers or supervisory authority authorisation."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to transfer authorisations or adequacy-based transfers."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Data subject access right; no content on transfer authorisations or adequacy."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Collection from non-owner and change of purpose exceptions; no cross-border transfer authorisation rules."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency notice at collection (including whether data will be transferred abroad) but does not address supervisory authority authorisation or adequacy decisions."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Withdrawal of consent; unrelated to supervisory authority transfer authorisations."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure conditions; does not address cross-border transfer authorisations by the authority."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "General consent requirement; no rule on supervisory authority authorisations for transfers."}, {"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "reason": "No-prejudice clause; does not pertain to transfer authorisations."}, {"id": "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "reason": "Accreditation/licensing of certification bodies; unrelated to transfer authorisations."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; no rule on transfer authorisations."}, {"id": "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "reason": "Legal bases for processing without consent; does not regulate cross-border transfer authorisations."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "require any specific authorisation for a transfer based on an adequacy decision", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "transfers of personal data permitted under Article 45(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the transfer is based on a Commission adequacy decision", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided KSA provisions address supervisory authority power to require specific authorisation for cross-border transfers or any adequacy-decision-based rule. The GDPR Art. 45 prohibition therefore has no evident analogue in the cited texts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-550", "gdpr_article": 45, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 20, "total": 32}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 36}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_