{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to data subject/authority; does not address informing identity at collection or timing."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal governance and processor oversight; no duty to inform data subject of controller identity."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no transparency content."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; unrelated to identity notice."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Transfer/disclosure to processor; not about informing data subjects."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National-security exemptions; no transparency obligation."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General principles and security policies; no specific notice-of-identity duty."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; not about transparency."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality/minimization/retention; does not require or affect informing the data subject of controller identity."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access/right-to-be-informed of processing/purposes upon request; not a proactive duty to provide controller identity at collection."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing (consent/legitimate interest); does not establish or modify the notice-of-identity obligation or exception."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد", "article": "Article 9"}, "action": {"span": "أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "article": "Article 9"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المراقب (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على المراقب ... أن يُعلم الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "provide the data subject with the identity of the controller", "target": "إعلام الفرد ... 1- بيانات المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where personal data relating to a data subject are collected from the data subject", "target": "No source-specific condition; duty applies generally before any processing", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "where and insofar as the data subject already has the information", "target": "No exception stated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "at the time when personal data are obtained", "target": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية (before starting processing)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "Article 9 directly requires the controller to inform the individual, before starting processing, of the controller’s details, which functionally covers providing the controller’s identity at collection. Articles 4 and 10 concern legal basis and data quality/retention and do not supply or affect a notice-of-identity obligation or the GDPR’s prior-knowledge exception. Thus RU-054 is matched in Qatar, and the Qatari rule is broader on trigger, timing, and absence of exception.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-054", "gdpr_article": 13, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not adequately address the exception for when the data subject already has the information, potentially leaving a gap in the comparative analysis.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله.", "why": "This provision indicates a requirement for the controller to inform the data subject about the controller's identity but does not explicitly address the exception for when the data subject already has this information."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incomplete analysis of the Qatari law. The combination of Articles 4, 9, and 10 could be seen as providing a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 4", "span": "لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إلا بعد الحصول على موافقة الفرد، ما لم تكن المعالجة ضرورية لتحقيق غرض مشروع للمراقب أو الغير الذي تُرسل إليه البيانات.", "why": "This article could be interpreted as allowing the controller to process personal data without informing the data subject of their identity if the data subject already has this information."}, {"id": "Article 10", "span": "على المراقب التحقق من أن البيانات الشخصية التي يجمعها، أو التي يتم جمعها لصالحه، ذات صلة بالأغراض المشروعة وكافية لتحقيقها، وعليه التحقق من أن تلك البيانات دقيقة ومكتملة ومحدثة بما يفي بالأغراض المشروعة، وألا يحتفظ بها لمدة تزيد على المدة الضرورية لتحقيق تلك الأغراض.", "why": "This article could be seen as implying that the controller should not provide unnecessary information to the data subject, including their identity if the data subject already knows it."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "455aae046cacf7979576", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "f169b712b14aea8718ee"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 539.18, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "8c2442ce3bf7a1c071c1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["67a122f7dc547487996a", "d9a05a425b46428120ee"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Security measures obligations; not about administrative fine decision criteria."}, {"id": "074719119e1aacb53bea", "reason": "Criminal sanctions for sensitive data disclosure; courts and prosecution, not administrative fines or their assessment factors."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "Data protection impact assessment; not about sanctioning criteria."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Lawful basis record-keeping; not sanctioning criteria."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure exceptions; not about administrative fine assessment."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; not sanctioning criteria."}, {"id": "ccbc630de03e970296c4", "reason": "Civil damages right; not administrative fining criteria."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "reason": "Inspection and seizure powers; not criteria for setting fines."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "Data Protection Officer duties; not administrative fine factors."}, {"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "reason": "Credit data processing rules; not sanctioning criteria."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تكون الجهة المختصة الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "article": "d9a05a425b46428120ee"}, "modality": {"span": "لجنة (أو أكثر) ... تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "67a122f7dc547487996a"}, "action": {"span": "وذلك بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "article": "67a122f7dc547487996a"}, "scope": {"span": "مدى تأثيرها", "article": "67a122f7dc547487996a"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "إيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "67a122f7dc547487996a"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الجهة المختصة الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(1) (d9a05a425b46428120ee)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2) (67a122f7dc547487996a)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "give due regard to the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement", "target_value": "بحسب نوع المخالفة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 36(2) (67a122f7dc547487996a)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "including the nature, scope or purpose of processing, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage", "target_value": "مدى تأثيرها", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 36(2) (67a122f7dc547487996a)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "when deciding whether to impose a fine and on the amount in each individual case", "target_value": "إيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2) (67a122f7dc547487996a)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 36(2) provides mandatory fining criteria—type, seriousness, and extent of impact—but does not mention duration of the infringement and does not enumerate GDPR’s specific factors (processing nature/scope/purpose, number of data subjects). Thus, coverage of the factors is narrower/partial even though the decision context and addressee are aligned. No other cited KSA provision fills the duration or detailed scope gap.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-938", "gdpr_article": 83, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 35}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction's provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-938], as they lack clarity and specificity on how to weigh the relevant factors when deciding on the amount of the fine.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(2)", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the nature, scope, or purpose of the processing concerned, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage suffered by them."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target provision does not fully capture the scope and duration of the infringement as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "بحسب نوع المخالفة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention the duration of the infringement and has a narrower scope than the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "074719119e1aacb53bea", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "67a122f7dc547487996a", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "ccbc630de03e970296c4", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 567.16, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f5fbd1d757e74422779e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
