ed", "citation": []}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target": "ولها اتخاذ ما تراه مناسباً", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32"]}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Articles 8 and 31 enumerate warnings, corrective orders, and suspensions, but do not mention monetary penalties or administrative fines. The catch-all “any other measure” clause is too indeterminate to establish a fining power textually. No cited provision authorizes the Ministry to impose an administrative fine.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct counterpart for administrative fine imposition and specific conditions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة الذين يصدر بتحديدهم قرار من الجهة المختصة بالاتفاق مع الوزير، صفة الضبطية القضائية في تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون واللائحة والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "why": "This article discusses the judicial police role of ministry employees but does not mention administrative fines."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article focuses on the controller's obligations regarding data protection but does not address administrative fines."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for the 'action' slot might be incorrect due to the presence of measures in Articles 8 and 31 that could imply the power to impose fines or penalties.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This article mentions the Ministry taking measures to protect personal data, which could include imposing fines."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "span": "يجوز للإدارة المختصة بعد تلقي البلاغ المشار إليه في المادة (30) من هذه اللائحة توثيقه في السجل المعد لذلك", "why": "This article mentions the administration taking measures, including evaluating the controller's actions and directing notification, which could imply the power to impose fines."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "3f916831456908af27d8", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "caad155111190c1aa274", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 570.36, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "877fbc273a5a601aafb4", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
