so I cannot verify whether a counterpart exists. Under the protocol I analyze only the provided target text; in its absence, each slot is marked uncovered and confidence is low. If relevant KWT articles on codes of conduct and accredited monitoring bodies are provided, I will reassess.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-503", "gdpr_article": 41, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information due to the absence of relevant provisions from the target jurisdiction (KWT) to verify the claim of no counterpart.", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.0}], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 283.53, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b9cc7088645858271366", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Investigatory orders to third parties in administrative investigations; does not regulate courts or inter-court communication."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Tasks/powers of the Authority, including cooperation with peer authorities (not courts); no rule about a seized court contacting foreign courts."}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "reason": "Register of notifications/authorisations; unrelated to court proceedings or cross-border coordination."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Addresses inspectors’ powers for administrative inspections; it does not concern a court seized of an appeal nor confirmation of related foreign proceedings. (Addresses reviewer objection: investigative powers are not a proxy for a court’s duty to contact another court.)"}, {"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "reason": "Administrative investigation procedures by the Authority; no court-to-court contact duty."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Delegation of judicial-police officers to assist investigations; this concerns enforcement personnel, not obligations on courts to communicate with foreign courts. (Addresses reviewer objection directly.)"}, {"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "reason": "Complaint mechanism to the Authority; not about court proceedings or inter-court communication."}, {"id": "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "reason": "Data subject right to object to direct marketing; not relevant to courts or cross-border proceedings."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Duty to inform about right to object to marketing; unrelated to courts."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Objections to automated decisions; not relevant to court coordination."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification duties for processing; no relation to appeals or court coordination."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تنشأ في الهيئة لجنة قضائية ( تسمى لجنة الطعون) ، تختص بالفصل في الطعون المقدمة إليها استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة", "article": "Article 34(2)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "لكل ذي شأن، بعد سداد الرسم المقرر، الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة استناداً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 34(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "court seized of proceedings against a decision by a supervisory authority", "target_value": "لجنة قضائية (تسمى لجنة الطعون) تختص بالفصل في الطعون على قرارات الهيئة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 34(2)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "contact the competent court in another Member State to confirm the existence of related proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "proceedings against a decision by a supervisory authority", "target_value": "الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 34(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the seized court has reason to believe that proceedings concerning the same processing are brought before a competent court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Only Article 34 addresses proceedings against Authority decisions and identifies the appeal adjudicator, but the PDPL contains no obligation for a seized tribunal or court to contact a foreign court to verify related proceedings. Articles 36(1) and 50 concern administrative investigative powers and personnel, not inter-court coordination, so they do not fill the action or condition slots. Overall, the cross-border court-contact duty is absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-1009", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 18, "total": 30}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 36}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly require the court to contact the competent court in another Member State to confirm the existence of related proceedings.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "span": "Article 34(2)", "why": "Establishes a committee to hear appeals, but does not require contact with other Member States."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "span": "Article 50", "why": "Mentions the possibility of designating investigators with the power of judicial police officers, but does not require contact with other Member States."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14(1)", "why": "Requires notification of the supervisory authority before starting the processing operation, but does not require contact with other Member States."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Partial coverage of slots, potential counterparts under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "span": "Article 36(1)", "why": "Investigative powers might relate to the condition slot"}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "span": "Article 50", "why": "Appointment of investigators with judicial police powers might relate to the action slot"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "eb633917dcbabe34df47"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 573.49, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d7321d3294e2d626bbea", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["32f2136681f29047cd6a", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "9548224453cca1301899"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising data subject rights; no designation of supervisory authority or sector-specific oversight."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow limitation by controllers; unrelated to designating a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions; no relevance to creating or designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing; no supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; no supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Access right exceptions; no supervisory authority designation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 31"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": "الجهة المختصة: أي جهة حكومية تختص قانوناً بتنظيم أعمال أو إجراءات ذات صلة بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية والإشراف عليها.", "article": "Article 1"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "Member States", "target": "الوزير (minister) empowered to issue implementing decisions.", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 31"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "permission", "target": "No permission stated to designate a specific supervisory authority for religious bodies.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "designate a specific independent supervisory authority for supervising churches and religious associations that apply comprehensive rules", "target": "Definition and existence of a governmental authority that regulates and supervises personal data processing (الجهة المختصة).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 1; Article 26; Article 27; Article 29"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "the designated specific authority fulfils the conditions laid down in Chapter VI (independence etc.)", "target": "No conditions on independence or Chapter-VI-like criteria stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "The Qatari text recognizes a governmental authority that supervises personal data processing (الجهة المختصة), and related oversight functions exist, but there is no text granting permission to designate a specific independent supervisory authority for churches or religious associations. Nor are independence conditions akin to GDPR Chapter VI expressed. Thus, the reviewer’s point about a general supervisory authority is acknowledged, yet RU‑978’s sector-specific designation permission remains absent.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-978", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart present under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "18", "span": "الجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد", "why": "Mentions the competent authority's role in processing personal data"}, {"id": "27", "span": "الإدارة المختصة أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Mentions the administrative unit's role in applying and enforcing the law"}, {"id": "29", "span": "الوزير أن يصدر القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Grants the Minister authority to issue decisions to implement the law"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict claims that there is no counterpart, but the provisions suggest the existence of a competent authority that can supervise and regulate the processing of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "18", "span": "الجهة المختصة", "why": "The concept of 'الجهة المختصة' (the competent authority) could be considered a counterpart to the independent supervisory authority in the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "1", "span": "الجهة المختصة: أي جهة حكومية تختص قانوناً بتنظيم أعمال أو إجراءات ذات صلة بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية والإشراف عليها", "why": "The definition of 'الجهة المختصة' implies that there is a designated authority responsible for regulating and supervising the processing of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "9548224453cca1301899", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 593.51, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "91ce609646979b01f2a7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; no requirement about clarity/plainness of information or communications to individuals."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access/copy rights; does not prescribe using clear or plain language."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Applicability clause; not about the form or clarity of communications."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Regulatory powers and awareness; no operative duty on controllers to use clear/plain language."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Direct marketing must include certain identifiers/opt-out; does not set a clear/plain language standard."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosures; unrelated to data-subject communications or language clarity."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial procedures; no substantive clarity/plainness requirement."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal systems and enablement; no requirement about communication in clear/plain language."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General obligations (lawfulness, safeguards, policies); no express clarity/plainness standard for communications."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Implementation decisions; no content on clarity/plainness."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مالك أو مشغل أي موقع إلكتروني موجه للأطفال، مراعاة ما يلي:", "article": "Article 17"}, "action": {"span": "أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي:", "article": "Article 9"}, "scope": {"span": "وضع إخطار على الموقع حول ماهية بيانات الأطفال، وكيفية استخدامها، والسياسات التي يتبعها في الإفصاح عنها.", "article": "Article 17"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب / على ... أن (صيغة إلزام)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "use clear and plain language for the information and communications provided", "target_value": "إعلام الفرد ووضع إخطار (التزام بالإخطار/التبليغ دون معيار للوضوح أو البساطة)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 9; Article 17", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the information and communications covered by Article 12(1), including information addressed specifically to a child", "target_value": "إعلام الفرد قبل بدء المعالجة بمعلومات محددة؛ وإخطار على مواقع موجهة للأطفال بشأن بيانات الأطفال", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 9; Article 17", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.56, "reasoning_note": "Acknowledging the reviewer's point, the Qatari text imposes duties to inform individuals and to post notices on child-directed websites, which conceptually presupposes comprehensibility. However, it does not expressly require that such information be in “clear and plain” or child-friendly language. Accordingly, coverage is assessed as partial rather than fully uncovered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-049", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The 'action' slot might be partially covered by provisions related to informing individuals about data processing, particularly in the context of child protection.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: ...", "why": "Implies the need for clear communication about data processing."}, {"id": "Article 17", "span": "وضع إخطار على الموقع حول ماهية بيانات الأطفال، وكيفية استخدامها، والسياسات التي يتبعها في الإفصاح عنها.", "why": "Requires clear notice about children's data collection and use in a manner understandable to children."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict that the action of using clear and plain language is 'uncovered' is not entirely accurate, as some provisions imply the need for clear and comprehensible information.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله. 2- الأغراض المشروعة التي يرغب المراقب أو أي طرف آخر في معالجة البيانات الشخصية من أجلها. 3- الوصف الشامل والدقيق لأنشطة المعالجة ودرجات الإفصاح عن البيانات الشخصية للأغراض المشروعة، وإذا لم يتمكن المراقب من ذلك، فيتعين عليه تمكين الفرد من وصف عام لها.", "why": "This provision implies that the information provided to the individual should be clear and comprehensible."}, {"id": "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "span": "مع مراعاة الالتزامات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجب على مالك أو مشغل أي موقع إلكتروني موجه للأطفال، مراعاة ما يلي: 1- وضع إخطار على الموقع حول ماهية بيانات الأطفال، وكيفية استخدامها، والسياسات التي يتبعها في الإفصاح عنها.", "why": "This provision requires the owner or operator of a website directed at children to provide clear notice about the type of children's data being collected, how it is used, and the policies for disclosing it."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "c098856a98e89debe630", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "9548224453cca1301899"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 595.44, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3da80ff4045a8083ec98", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Ministerial decision issuing the regulation; no substantive rule on DPO designation or processor obligation."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy requirement for controller/processor; not about DPO designation or triggers."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no operative duty for processors to appoint a DPO."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment on request; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry powers and functions; does not impose processor DPO duty."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller internal controls; no DPO appointment obligation or triggers."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "General obligation to follow Ministry rules; no specific DPO duty for processors."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً.", "article": "Article 3(b) [865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814]"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المتحكم (controller) is obligated; no appointment duty stated for المعالج (processor).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]; Art 34 [6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Obligation (يلتزم) exists, but only for controller; no modality stated for processor.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "تحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Triggers (a)–(c): public authority; large-scale regular/systematic monitoring; large-scale special/criminal data.", "target_value": "No appointment triggers stated; general designation duty (and only for controller).", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art 20 [05b7537a91d92a0529ad]", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Exception: courts acting in their judicial capacity are excluded from point (a).", "target_value": "General law-level exclusions incl. processing by state administrative units and other public legal persons performing legal competences.", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art 3(b) [865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814]", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "The Omani texts impose DPO designation on controllers, not processors, and state no processor-specific triggers. Article 3(b) is a general exemption for processing by state administrative units and other public legal persons; it does not expressly mention courts or judicial capacity and, even if read to cover courts, is broader and structurally different from GDPR’s narrow exception. Regardless, the core processor duty to appoint a DPO is not stated.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "incomplete citation and potential mismatch in condition and exception slots", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3", "span": "ج- تنفيذ التزام قانوني ملقى على عاتق المتحكم بموجب أي قانون أو حكم أو قرار من المحكمة.", "why": "provides an exception for cases where the processing is done by courts acting in their judicial capacity, which aligns with the GDPR requirement"}, {"id": "Article 20", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، وتحدد اللائحة ضوابط اختيار هذا المسؤول ومهامه.", "why": "does not explicitly mention the triggers in Article 37(1)(a)–(c), which could be considered a defect in the analyst's reasoning"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential implicit coverage of exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity in Article 3", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "Possible implicit exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e8de83975a220288296", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "caad155111190c1aa274", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 591.97, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d4820c8d3ba23e0bf689", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Sets general processing principles; does not address disclosure of personal data in official documents or public-access balancing."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject information rights vis-à-vis controllers; not a rule permitting disclosure of official documents to the public."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; unrelated to public disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to public access to official documents."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Office exemption powers; does not establish or regulate disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure; does not concern public access to official documents."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; not about disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller security/organizational obligations; no permission or framework for public disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfers; not about domestic disclosure of official documents for public access."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; not about disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security of processing; does not address public disclosure of official documents."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: ... ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها.", "article": "Article 2(2)(b)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية.", "article": "Article 2(2)(a)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "public authorities, public bodies, and private bodies performing a public-interest task that hold official documents", "target": "Government entities are expressly outside the PDPL’s scope.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 2(2)(b)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "permission", "target": "no permission stated for disclosure of personal data in official documents", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "disclose personal data contained in official documents", "target": "no action governing disclosure of official documents to the public", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "personal data in official documents held for performance of a task in the public interest", "target": "Government data are excluded from the law’s scope.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 2(2)(a)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "in accordance with law to reconcile public access to official documents with data protection", "target": "no reconciliation condition or FOI-type framework expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Article 2 excludes government entities and government data from the PDPL, and the text contains no permission or framework to disclose personal data in official documents for public access or to balance such access with data protection. General security/organizational duties (Arts. 7, 20), cross‑border transfer rules (Art. 22), and Office exemption powers (Art. 3) do not create or imply an Art. 86‑type disclosure permission. Therefore, the GDPR proposition is not represented in the cited UAE provisions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-957", "gdpr_article": 86, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "No direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-957] in the UAE legislation", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "Article 2(2)(ب)", "why": "Excludes government entities from the law's scope, but does not address disclosure of personal data in official documents"}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "Article 5", "why": "Requires appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, but does not address disclosure of personal data in official documents"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law provides some framework for the protection and processing of personal data, which could be interpreted as including the disclosure of personal data in official documents.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7", "span": "المادة (7) الالتزامات العامة للمتحكم", "why": "Requires the controller to take appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data."}, {"id": "Article 20", "span": "المادة (20) أمن معلومات البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Requires the controller and processor to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to ensure the security of personal data."}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "المادة (3) سلطة المكتب في الإعفاء", "why": "Grants the Office the power to exempt certain establishments from some or all of the requirements of the personal data protection regulations."}, {"id": "Article 22", "span": "المادة (22) نقل ومشاركة البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود", "why": "Allows for the transfer of personal data outside the country under certain conditions."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9d65c2815c41a25064db"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 560.41, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "fa151dbfd7aaf395282f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "c34922f387019af45e42"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information right about procedures (including objection) only; does not confer or define the substantive right to object."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Provides rectification/erasure rights; not a right to object to ongoing processing based on specific legal grounds."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restrict processing under specified conditions; not the RU-178 objection right to processing based on public/legitimate interest."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Administrative complaint mechanism; not a substantive right to object to processing."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; unrelated to objection to processing."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Appeal against supervisory authority decisions; not a right to object to processing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; does not establish an objection right."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not about the data subject’s objection right."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not grant the data subject a right to object."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Sanctions framework; not pertinent to the content of the objection right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 17"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 17"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17"}, "scope": {"span": "1. إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر. 2. إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض إجراء المسوح الإحصائية، إلا إذا كانت المعالجة لازمة لتحقيق المصلحة العامة. 3. إذا كانت المعالجة بالمخالفة لأحكام المادة (5) من هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "article": "Article 17"}, "condition": {"span": "وتكون لها تبعات قانونية أو تؤثر بشكل جسيم على صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "إلا إذا كانت المعالجة لازمة لتحقيق المصلحة العامة.", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "إيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "object to processing of personal data concerning him or her", "target_value": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing based on point (e) or (f) of Article 6(1), including profiling based on those provisions", "target_value": "التسويق المباشر (بما في ذلك التنميط المتعلق بالتسويق)؛ المسوح الإحصائية (مع استثناء للمصلحة العامة)؛ المعالجة بالمخالفة للمادة 5", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17; Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on grounds relating to the data subject's particular situation", "target_value": "القرارات الصادرة عن المعالجة المؤتمتة التي تكون لها تبعات قانونية أو تؤثر بشكل جسيم على صاحب البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناء للمسوح الإحصائية: إلا إذا كانت المعالجة لازمة لتحقيق المصلحة العامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 17(2)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at any time", "target_value": "غير منصوص عليه", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إيقاف المعالجة عقب الاعتراض", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17"}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "UAE law grants an objection right but only for specific purposes (e.g., direct marketing, certain statistics, unlawful processing) and for automated decisions with significant effects, not a general objection to all public/legitimate-interest processing. Article 18’s “significant effect/legal consequences” condition relates to the data subject’s situation in impact terms, supporting only partial correspondence to GDPR’s “grounds relating to particular situation.” The texts do not express the GDPR’s “at any time” temporal element.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-178", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that no counterpart exists for the slot 'at any time' is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "في أي من الحالات الآتية", "why": "The UAE law implies that the right to object is not limited to a specific time frame."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of no counterpart for the condition 'on grounds relating to the data subject's particular situation' is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على القرارات التي تصدر عن المعالجة المؤتمتة وتكون لها تبعات قانونية أو تؤثر بشكل جسيم على صاحب البيانات", "why": "This provision implies that the data subject has the right to object to decisions that significantly affect them, which could be related to their particular situation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "0897840c01b58a706cd5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 607.61, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "96211fc94931a9733ee5", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
