"confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "Article 16 imposes a duty on the controller to decide on a data subject’s request within 45 days of receipt, but it does not require informing the data subject of the action taken. It also covers only a subset of GDPR Arts. 15–22 rights (via Art. 11 items A–E) and lacks the GDPR’s “without undue delay”/one-month timeline. Therefore, the reviewer’s objection is valid: the information-to-data-subject element remains textually uncovered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdicts for 'action' and 'temporal' slots are not fully supported by the cited provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية تقديم طلب كتابي للمتحكم لممارسة أي من حقوقه المنصوص عليها في البنود(أ، ب، ج، د، هـ) من المادة (11) من القانون وذلك بدون مقابل، ويجب على المتحكم البت في الطلب خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (45) خمسة وأربعين يوماً من تاريخ تسلمه الطلب", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the controller shall provide the data subject with information on action taken, and the time limit is 45 days without an 'undue delay' qualifier."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provision does not fully cover the GDPR requirement unit, specifically with regards to the controller's obligation to provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية تقديم طلب كتابي للمتحكم لممارسة أي من حقوقه المنصوص عليها في البنود(أ، ب، ج، د، هـ) من المادة (11) من القانون وذلك بدون مقابل، ويجب على المتحكم البت في الطلب خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (45) خمسة وأربعين يوماً من تاريخ تسلمه الطلب.", "why": "This provision does not explicitly state that the controller must provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d149914917d14049d367", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "6e9c9892919d23a9a4da", "3ea4b464db31878217fb", "dcd007160208896c8632", "09d77a4e064de5fe6273"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 584.5, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3289190e8f9c7875a043", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Sets lawful bases and proof of consent but does not regulate the presentation/form of a consent request, nor intelligibility/easy accessibility, nor the written-declaration scenario."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance/enforcement provisions; no content on how consent requests must be presented."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "المادة الثانية"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "المادة الثانية"}, "action": {"span": "تقديم معلومات واضحة يسهل الوصول إليها حول ممارساتهم وسياساتهم فيما يتعلق بالبيانات الشخصية", "article": "المادة الرابعة (1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "وقبل توفير الخدمة للمستخدم", "article": "المادة الثانية"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الثانية؛ المادة الرابعة", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الثانية", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form", "target_value": "تقديم معلومات واضحة يسهل الوصول إليها ...؛ وتوفير المعلومات بعبارات سهلة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "المادة الرابعة (1)؛ المادة الثانية (1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "قبل توفير الخدمة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "المادة الثانية", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Kuwaiti rules require clear and easily accessible information generally (and simple language), but they do not specifically require that a consent request itself be presented in an intelligible and easily accessible form, nor address the case of a written declaration covering other matters. Thus only partial functional alignment can be inferred from distributed duties to provide clear, accessible information. The reviewer’s objection is valid: the specific GDPR scenario and explicit consent-request presentation are missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-019", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 3}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the requirement to present the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form when consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "span": "المادة الثانية: شروط جمع ومعالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision mentions the requirement to provide clear and accessible information about the service and data processing practices, but does not explicitly mention the requirement to present the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form when consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "المادة الثالثة: مشروعية جمع ومعالجة البيانات", "why": "This provision mentions the requirement for lawful collection and processing of data, which includes obtaining consent from the user, but does not explicitly mention the requirement to present the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form when consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KWT law does not explicitly require the service provider to present the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form, as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "span": "المادة الثانية: شروط جمع ومعالجة البيانات الشخصية يجب على مقدم الخدمة وقبل توفير الخدمة للمستخدم أن يقوم بالتالي:", "why": "This provision requires the service provider to provide clear and easily accessible information about the service, but does not explicitly require the presentation of the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "المادة الرابعة: شروط جمع ومعالجة البيانات يجب على مقدم الخدمة أثناء توفير الخدمة أو بعد انتهائها أن يقوم بجمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية:", "why": "This provision requires the service provider to provide clear and easily accessible information about their practices and policies regarding personal data, but does not explicitly require the presentation of the request for consent in an intelligible and easily accessible form."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 588.28, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "da7e072b1431546cb61d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Administrative grievance against the Office’s decisions; does not address courts, case management, or staying judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "reason": "Cross-border personal data transfers when no adequate protection exists. Even though it mentions transfers necessary for judicial cooperation or legal claims, it regulates data movement by controllers/processors, not a court’s permission to stay proceedings or any lis pendens rule."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward the Data Protection Officer; no content on courts or staying proceedings."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject right to rectification/erasure; no judicial stay or related-proceedings rule."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restriction of processing; unrelated to court procedure or stays."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing; no rule empowering courts to stay proceedings."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfers with adequate protection; concerns data export conditions, not judicial case management or stays. Does not create or imply a permission for courts to stay proceedings."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; no relevance to judicial stays or lis pendens."}, {"id": "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "reason": "Transitional compliance timeline; no judicial procedural content."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Office power to exempt establishments from PDPL requirements; not about courts or proceedings."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the PDPL and exemptions (including judicial data); does not provide a rule on courts staying proceedings."}, {"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "reason": "Delegation of Office powers to local authorities; no court stay or related-proceedings rule."}], "target_frame": {"