ssing courts other than the first seized staying proceedings due to related foreign cases.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1010", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect support of international judicial cooperation", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "span": "إجراء متعلق بتعاون قضائي دولي", "why": "Indicates consideration of international judicial cooperation"}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart may exist under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "span": "المادة (23) نقل ومشاركة البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود لأغراض المعالجة في حال عدم وجود مستوى حماية ملائم", "why": "This article discusses exceptions for transferring personal data outside the country, including when it is necessary for judicial cooperation or to exercise legal rights, which may be related to the concept of staying proceedings in a court when related proceedings are pending in another jurisdiction."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "span": "المادة (22) نقل ومشاركة البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود لأغراض المعالجة في حال وجود مستوى حماية ملائم", "why": "This article discusses the transfer of personal data across borders, which may imply some level of cooperation between courts or judicial authorities."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["ffb151edc5703b569765", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "c34922f387019af45e42", "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "2b337b9a20a4e33b