s for a more definitive comparison.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 2, "latency_s": 107.29, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "17010ed54be87dde176b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["[823830174d241884bd73] Article 12", "[3f916831456908af27d8] Article 8"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "[93f989531fe30cac1ed5] Article 18", "reason": "Regulates data erasure requests and controller refusal grounds; does not grant a judicial remedy against a controller or processor."}, {"id": "[caad155111190c1aa274] Article 1", "reason": "Definitions; no operative right to seek judicial relief."}, {"id": "[b157dcadab6a3e8daf5] Article 11", "reason": "Lists data subject rights (e.g., access, portability, erasure) but does not confer a right to bring a court action."}, {"id": "[2712fe4ebdba355a134b] Article 10", "reason": "Consent and transparency requirements; not about remedies."}, {"id": "[a2a61b7c9316716b7e74] Article 25", "reason": "Substantive processing prohibition; no remedial right to go to court."}, {"id": "[38c6f7484322711d7d32] Article 31", "reason": "Ministry’s post-breach administrative actions; not a data subject judicial remedy."}, {"id": "[a0040ee4dad7d4440e19] Article 5", "reason": "Controller authorization content; unrelated to remedies."}, {"id": "[db6e2be94f2388e169a8] Article 17", "reason": "Controller may refuse repetitive or burdensome requests; no judicial remedy provided."}, {"id": "[546cfd19de051c612c06] Article 16", "reason": "Procedure for exercising certain rights with the controller; no court remedy."}, {"id": "[3a6219e8839cbad1f76e] Article 19", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not about judicial remedies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "article": "Article 12"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 12"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "seek an effective judicial remedy before a court against a controller or processor", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "in addition to any available administrative or non-judicial remedies, including complaint to a supervisory authority", "target": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 12", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the data subject considers their GDPR rights have been infringed due to non-compliant processing", "target": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 12", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.8, "reasoning_note": "No provision grants a data subject a right to bring a court action against a controller or processor. The texts provide only administrative/non-judicial avenues (complaint to the Ministry and Ministry enforcement actions). This directly supports the reviewer’s objection and the counter-evidence from Article 12.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-915", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the modality and action slots might be too strict, as there are provisions that provide some form of remedy for data subjects.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[823830174d241884bd73] Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون، وذلك طبقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة.", "why": "This provision provides a right to submit a complaint, which could be seen as a form of remedy."}, {"id": "[3f916831456908af27d8] Article 8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية: أ- إنذار المتحكم أو المعالج، بالمخالفة التي تقع منه لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This provision mentions the Ministry's ability to take actions to protect data subjects' rights, which could be seen as a form of remedy."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction does not provide a clear and direct right to seek an effective judicial remedy against a controller or processor.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[823830174d241884bd73] Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "why": "This article only provides for a complaint mechanism to the Ministry, but does not explicitly provide for a judicial remedy."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "823830174d241884bd73", "3f916831456908af27d8", "caad155111190c1aa274", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 621.02, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7566d89a308934776d73", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Addresses lawful bases for processing; does not establish a data subject’s right to a judicial remedy or any court review mechanism."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Sets security, record-keeping, and internal complaint-handling obligations for providers; does not grant a right to obtain a judicial remedy before a court or address supervisory authority inaction."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Concerns breach notification to the authority and data subjects; contains no provision on judicial remedies or court access for data subjects."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "Provides the authority’s power to apply administrative penalties under another law; it does not confer on data subjects a right to an effective judicial remedy before a court, nor address complaints, time limits, or authority inaction. The cited clause implies regulatory enforcement, not a court right for individuals."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each data subject", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain an effective judicial remedy before a court", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "regarding a complaint lodged under Article 77", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority does not handle the complaint or does not inform on progress or outcome within three months", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "Without prejudice to any other administrative or non-judicial remedy", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(3) empowers the authority to apply administrative penalties but does not grant data subjects a right to an effective judicial remedy or mention courts, complaint inaction, or a three‑month trigger. The other cited provisions likewise lack any judicial-remedy right for individuals. Therefore RU-912 is not expressed in the provided Kuwaiti texts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-912", "gdpr_article": 78, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 3}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts exist under different terminology or are distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "للهيئة في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014 لإنشاء الهيئة العامة للاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات والمعدل بالقانون رقم (98) لسنة 2015", "why": "Implies the authority's power to apply penalties, suggesting a form of oversight."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "span": "إخطار صاحب البيانات الشخصية في حال حدوث اختراقات لبياناته الشخصية", "why": "Mentions notification of the data subject in case of data breaches, related to complaint handling."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها على مدار الساعة", "why": "Establishment of internal systems for receiving and studying complaints."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for oversight in interpreting Kuwaiti jurisdiction's provisions, particularly regarding judicial remedy rights.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "للهيئة في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014 لإنشاء الهيئة العامة للاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات والمعدل بالقانون رقم (98) لسنة 2015.", "why": "Implies mechanisms for addressing violations, potentially including judicial processes."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "a418980931b429c7909a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 590.72, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a0662a556e73fa736969", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Institutional/administrative functions (coordination, research, awareness); does not impose controller measures."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Transparency/notice to individuals; not about implementing technical/organizational measures."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial rules on rights procedures; not a controller duty to implement measures."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Carves exceptions to Articles 4, 9, 15, 17 only; does not waive or qualify the security/organizational measure duties (e.g., Arts 8, 11, 13) relevant to RU-204."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to individual/authority; not the duty to implement measures."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access obligations; unrelated to implementing measures."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule; not a measures obligation."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality/retention principles; not a requirement to implement technical/organizational measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11 [6c76988b817262e3e312]"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة...", "article": "Article 13 [fcbd13532c69b340214e]"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة.", "article": "Article 8(3) [85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf]"}, "scope": {"span": "التحقق من التزام المعالج بالتعليمات التي يوجهها إليه، واتخاذ الاحتياطات المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، ورصد ومتابعة ذلك بصفة مستمرة.", "article": "Article 11(8) [6c76988b817262e3e312]"}, "condition": {"span": "ويجب أن تكون تلك الاحتياطات متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية المراد حمايتها.", "article": "Article 13 [fcbd13532c69b340214e]"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 chapeau: \"على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:\" [6c76988b817262e3e312]; see also Article 8 chapeau \"يتعين على المراقب\" [85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب / يتعين (mandatory)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13: \"يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج...\" [fcbd13532c69b340214e]; Article 8: \"يتعين على المراقب...\" [85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target_value": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية + إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(3): appropriate administrative, technical, and physical precautions [85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf]; Article 13(1)-(2): necessary, proportionate precautions [fcbd13532c69b340214e]; Article 11(7): audits/reviews of compliance [6c76988b817262e3e312]; Article 12 (limited to disclosures/transfers): ensure processing per the law [75db9db720e9e34a1148]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "التزامات عامة على المراقب وتشمل رقابة المعالج ورصد ومتابعة التزامه بصفة مستمرة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 chapeau and (8): controller duties incl. verifying and continuously monitoring processor compliance [6c76988b817262e3e312]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "تكون الاحتياطات متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية؛ ووفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13(2): proportional to the nature and importance of the data [fcbd13532c69b340214e]; Article 8(3): per competent authority determinations [85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated for these controller measure obligations", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal element expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 is central and imposes necessary, proportionate precautions; Article 8(3) specifies appropriate administrative, technical, and physical measures, and Article 11 adds organizational controls including audits that enable demonstration of compliance. Article 18’s exceptions do not textually apply to these measure obligations (they reference Arts 4, 9, 15, 17), so no exception for the targeted duty is expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The QAT provisions do not fully capture the GDPR's requirements for demonstrating compliance and considering the nature, scope, context, and purposes of processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision does not explicitly require the controller to demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision does not fully capture the GDPR's requirement for considering the nature, scope, context, and purposes of processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the target jurisdiction has a provision that requires the controller to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures is partially supported, but the citation to Article 8(3), Article 11(5,7), and Article 12 is incomplete. Article 13 is more relevant to this claim. Additionally, the analyst's claim that there is no exception to these obligations is incorrect, as Article 18 provides exceptions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية من الضياع أو التلف أو التعديل أو الإفشاء، أو الوصول إليها، أو استخدامها بشكل عارض أو غير مشروع.", "why": "This provision requires the controller and processor to take necessary measures to protect personal data, but it does not explicitly require the controller to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية:", "why": "This provision provides exceptions to the general obligations, allowing the competent authority to process personal data without adhering to certain provisions of the law for specific purposes."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "455aae046cacf7979576"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 690.58, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "8a06c5ef481922e42a65", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "9548224453cca1301899", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5", "reason": "Sets a corporate fine (penalty definition) but does not impose or describe measures by authorities to ensure penalties are implemented."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Controller exemption from disclosure of reasons; unrelated to state measures to implement penalties."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller duties; not about authorities ensuring implementation of penalties."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedures for exercising individual rights; not about implementing penalties."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data minimization/accuracy obligations on controllers; not about implementing penalties."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; not about authorities ensuring penalty implementation."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer; not about implementing penalties."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal compliance systems for controllers/processors; not measures by the state to ensure penalties are implemented."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة ... تنفيذ هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 32"}, "action": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "جميع الجهات المختصة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جميع الجهات المختصة ... تنفيذ هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "take all measures necessary to ensure that the penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are implemented", "target_value": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة ... في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون؛ وتمكين موظفي الوزارة ذوي صفة الضبط القضائي من ضبط وإثبات الجرائم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 27; Article 32; Article 29"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None (implicitly limited to ensuring implementation of penalties)", "target_value": "أحكام هذا القانون / هذا القانون ككل", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 27; Article 32"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.61, "reasoning_note": "Agree that Article 25 only sets penalties and does not ensure their implementation, so it is not relied on for coverage. Instead, Article 32 imposes a general obligation on competent authorities to implement the law, Article 27 authorizes taking all necessary measures to implement the law, and Article 29 provides concrete enforcement powers; together these functionally support implementation of penalties but do not expressly mandate ensuring penalties specifically, hence partial coverage.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-949", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality slot verdict is incorrect, the provisions indicate a strong obligation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 32", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون.", "why": "The phrase 'shall' indicates a strong obligation."}, {"id": "Article 29", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة، الذين يصدر بتخويلهم صفة مأموري الضبط القضائي، قرار من النائب العام بالاتفاق مع الوزير، ضبط وإثبات الجرائم التي تقع بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "The phrase 'must' indicates a strong obligation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions cited do not clearly cover the implementation of penalties as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 25", "span": "يُعاقب الشخص المعنوي المخالف بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال، إذا ارتكبت باسمه ولحسابه إحدى الجرائم المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، وذلك مع عدم الإخلال بالمسؤولية الجنائية للشخص الطبيعي التابع له.", "why": "This article specifies penalties but does not address the implementation of these penalties by the authorities."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك، وبوجه خاص ما يلي: ...", "why": "This article mentions taking measures for the implementation of the law but does not specifically address the implementation of penalties."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5", "9548224453cca1301899", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "455aae046cacf7979576", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 658.28, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "7fa85f8812bca5a13c16", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Defines acts constituting violations and administrative penalties by Cabinet; does not address supervisory authority annual reports or permission to include lists."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Sets complaint handling and possible administrative sanctions; no provision on annual reporting content by the authority."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Obligations regarding DPO support; unrelated to supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller communication mechanisms; no relation to authority annual reports."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment requirements; no supervisory authority reporting rules."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification to the Office and possible sanctions; no annual report or permission to list types of infringements/measures."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; unrelated to authority annual report content."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Grievance of Office decisions; no annual reporting provisions."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information; no supervisory authority annual report content."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing rights; unrelated to authority reporting."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing; unrelated to authority reporting."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no supervisory authority reporting or permission to include lists."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include in the annual report a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken in accordance with Article 58(2)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "content of the annual activity report", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided UAE provisions address an annual report by the supervisory authority or a permission to include lists of types of infringements and measures taken. Several articles discuss violations and administrative penalties in general, but not reporting content. Therefore the GDPR permission has no counterpart in the target text excerpts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": t