{"candidates_selected": ["fca1aa50445ca4475333", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access/information/copy rights; does not provide a restriction-of-processing remedy."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross‑border data flow restriction by controllers; unrelated to a data‑subject right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Obligations when disclosing/transferring to a processor; no data‑subject restriction right."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; does not create a data‑subject right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no operative right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Public‑interest exemptions; not a data‑subject right and not about restriction."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to restriction of processing at the data‑subject’s request."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Transparency/notice obligations; no restriction‑of‑processing right."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right to privacy; does not specify a restriction‑of‑processing mechanism."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller security/organizational duties; no data‑subject restriction right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الفرد", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للفرد", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كانت غير ضرورية لتحقيق الأغراض التي جمعت من أجلها، أو كانت زائدة على متطلباتها، أو تمييزية أو مجحفة أو مخالفة للقانون.", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "في أي وقت", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "data subject", "target": "الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "right", "target": "يجوز للفرد (enumerated entitlements)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية; internal mechanisms to handle requests (not expressly restriction)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(2); Art. 11(4),(6)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure of the personal data and requests restriction of their use instead", "target": "من بين أسباب الاعتراض: أن تكون المعالجة \"مخالفة للقانون\" (لا يُذكر معارضة الحذف وطلب التقييد بدلاً منه)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated in the relevant provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "في أي وقت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No specific consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 5(2) provides a right to object to unlawful processing, and Article 11(4),(6) sets up request‑handling mechanisms, which are related to but do not expressly create a right to obtain restriction instead of erasure. The specific GDPR scenario—unlawful processing where the data subject rejects erasure but seeks restriction—is not articulated. Hence, only a partial counterpart is found.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 11}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion might not fully capture the protections offered by Qatari law, particularly in Article 5, which provides a basis for data subjects to object to or request changes in the processing of their personal data under certain conditions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "span": "يجوز للفرد، في أي وقت، ما يلي: 1- سحب موافقته السابقة على معالجة بياناته الشخصية. 2- الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية إذا كانت غير ضرورية لتحقيق الأغراض التي جمعت من أجلها، أو كانت زائدة على متطلباتها، أو تمييزية أو مجحفة أو مخالفة للقانون.", "why": "This article provides a mechanism for data subjects to influence the processing of their data, including objecting to unlawful processing, which aligns with the GDPR's requirement for restricting processing under certain conditions."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law may provide a partial counterpart to the GDPR's restriction of processing right, despite the lack of explicit language.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "span": "Article 5(2)", "why": "Allows the individual to object to unlawful processing, which could be seen as a related concept to restriction of processing."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "span": "Article 11(4) and (6)", "why": "Provides a mechanism for the individual to request restriction of processing, even if it is not explicitly stated."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 667.34, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "37e05eb1ab217e96f7c4", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful-basis conditions for processing; no breach-notification duty to the authority."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "General criminal/administrative sanctions; does not establish the breach-notification obligation to the authority."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Rules on processing criminal data; no breach-notification to the authority."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; no breach-notification to the authority."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions; not the controller’s breach-notification duty to the authority."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions for a decision; no operative breach-notification rule."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "DPO disciplinary investigation; not breach-notification."}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Investigatory powers to obtain information; not a controller breach-notification duty."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Civil liability; not the breach-notification duty."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Right to object; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Right to rectification/blocking/erasure; unrelated to breach notification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مدير البيانات", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب عليه", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "scope": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "condition": {"span": "بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي حال لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "article": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Article 4(b)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب عليه / يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target_value": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target_value": "الهيئة (السلطة المختصة الوطنية)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "in the case of a personal data breach", "target_value": "بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay after becoming aware", "target_value": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إذا لم يتم الإخطار في المدة المحددة يجب تسبيب التأخير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "[1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3] Art. 4(b)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.83, "reasoning_note": "Article 4(b) squarely imposes a controller duty to notify the national authority of a data breach, with an exception where risk is unlikely. It is more specific on timing, requiring notification within 72 hours of discovery and justification if late, and uses the local term “مدير البيانات” instead of “controller,” which is functionally equivalent in context. This addresses the reviewer’s point about stricter specificity and different terminology.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-345", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's interpretation of the temporal requirement for notifying the competent supervisory authority may not fully align with the GDPR's 'without undue delay' standard, as the BHR law specifies a fixed timeframe of seventy-two hours.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "يجب على مدير البيانات وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "This provision specifies a fixed timeframe for notification, which may not capture the full nuance of the GDPR's 'without undue delay' requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provision is more specific and stricter than the GDPR's requirement, and the terminology used is different.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز 72 ساعة من وقت الاكتشاف", "why": "The provision uses a more specific and stricter time frame than the GDPR's requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["762372b7329c44286e43", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 675.52, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "527ffcb42f51de61a3fc", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
