relevant civil procedure provisions) for a definitive analysis. This addresses the objection by noting the result is non-verifiable without target provisions.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-916", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information to verify the absence of a counterpart in KWT legislation.", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.0}], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 294.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c9ece78e84bd22f124c1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "9548224453cca1301899", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and retention duties for the controller; does not empower a legislator/authority to designate the controller or set nomination criteria."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Controller obligations (including determining processors), not legislative power to designate the controller."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing (consent/necessity); no provision on designating the controller."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to designation or nomination criteria of a controller."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; no authority power to provide for the controller."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial rules on exercising data subject rights; not about designating the controller."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Disclosure/transfer conditions; no provision on controller designation."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller compliance/policy requirements; does not address designation or nomination criteria of a controller."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Union or Member State legislator", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide for the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"]}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "designation of the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the purposes and means of the processing of personal data are determined by law", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "I considered Article 18 (“للجهة المختصة أن تقرر”) but it grants a power to authorize certain processing outside specified articles for public-interest aims, not a power to designate the controller or set nomination criteria. Likewise, Article 31 (minister’s implementing decisions) and Article 9 (duty to inform of controller details) do not provide for designation of the controller. Therefore, RU‑013’s core action remains uncovered in the target text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-013", "gdpr_article": 4, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart might exist under different terminology or application in Article 18", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: 1- حماية الأمن الوطني والأمن العام. 2- حماية العلاقات الدولية للدولة. 3- حماية المصالح الاقتصادية أو المالية للدولة. 4- منع أي جريمة جنائية، أو جمع معلومات عنها، أو التحقيق فيها.", "why": "This article suggests the competent authority has the power to decide on processing personal data for specific purposes, potentially aligning with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-013] under certain conditions."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the 'action' slot might overlook potential counterparts in Qatari law, such as the role of the competent authority in Article 18.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر", "why": "This provision indicates a power granted to a competent authority that could relate to determining the controller or its nomination criteria in specific contexts."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["455aae046cacf7979576", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "f5c366135483fe580381", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "9548224453cca1301899", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 681.21, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "aa1a76c6c9e7b1be094e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "3f916831456908af27d8"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Duty to cooperate with the ministry; does not regulate how public authorities must process data in inquiry scenarios."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; does not create processing obligations for public authorities in inquiries."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Institutional powers and tasks of the ministry; not a substantive obligation governing inquiry-related processing."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent and transparency baseline; not specific to public authority inquiry processing and in any case excluded where Article 3 applies."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requirement to post a privacy policy; not determinative of processing obligations in inquiry contexts."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Procedural requirement to attach a policy when applying for a permit; does not supply the obligation for inquiry-related processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 15"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 15"}, "action": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 15"}, "scope": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً. ... و- كشف أو منع أي جريمة جزائية بناء على طلب رسمي مكتوب من جهات التحقيق.", "article": "Article 3"}, "condition": {"span": "بناء على طلب رسمي مكتوب من جهات التحقيق", "article": "Article 3"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: أ- حماية الأمن الوطني، أو المصلحة العامة. ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً. ... و- كشف أو منع أي جريمة جزائية ...", "article": "Article 3"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية: أ- إنذار المتحكم أو المعالج... ب- الأمر بتصحيح ومحو البيانات الشخصية... ج- وقف معالجة البيانات الشخصية بشكل مؤقت، أو دائم... د- وقف تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى دولة أخرى، أو منظمة دولية...", "article": "Article 8"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "public authorities", "target_value": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج (مع استبعاد جهات عامة عند تنفيذ اختصاصاتها القانونية أو بناء على طلب جهات التحقيق)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 15; Art. 3(b),(f)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 15"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "process those personal data in compliance with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "… لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 3(b),(f); Art. 15"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data received in the framework of a particular inquiry", "target_value": "استبعاد المعالجة عند تنفيذ اختصاصات الجهات العامة أو في كشف/منع الجرائم بطلب من جهات التحقيق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 3(b),(f)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "they receive personal data in the framework of a particular inquiry in accordance with law", "target_value": "بناء على طلب رسمي مكتوب من جهات التحقيق (شرط يؤدي إلى الاستبعاد من سريان القانون)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 3(f)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة ... و- كشف أو منع أي جريمة جزائية ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 3"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إنذار، تصحيح/محو، وقف المعالجة أو التحويل", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 8"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 3 explicitly excludes processing by public authorities when performing their legal competences and when processing occurs for crime detection/prevention upon request from investigative authorities. This removes inquiry-related public authority processing from the law’s scope, so the general compliance obligation in Article 15 does not apply in the RU scenario. Thus, the GDPR requirement for public authorities in inquiries is not replicated in the target text.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-012", "gdpr_article": 4, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may not fully account for indirect or terminology-different counterparts in the OMN jurisdiction's laws, particularly for 'uncovered' slot verdicts.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالتعاون مع الوزارة", "why": "This article implies an obligation for cooperation, which might indirectly support some 'uncovered' aspects under different terminology or distributed provisions."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة", "why": "This obligation to follow Ministry-determined controls and procedures could be seen as supporting the 'action' slot more fully than initially assessed."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully account for the law's exclusions regarding public authority functions and inquiry-related processing, which are crucial for determining the applicability of data protection rules.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: أ- حماية الأمن الوطني، أو المصلحة العامة. ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً.", "why": "This article excludes public authority functions and inquiry-related processing from the law's scope, directly impacting the applicability of data protection rules to public authorities receiving data in the framework of an inquiry."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "3f916831456908af27d8", "823830174d241884bd73", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "487015f110e7b88b5c03"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 717.06, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "52d1ec7e798c55c4d979", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Generic rulemaking/implementation power for the Board (issuing regulations, decisions, measures to implement the law) does not textually authorize restricting data-subject rights or controller/processor obligations, nor does it set Art. 23-type safeguards (respect for essence, necessity/proportionality, enumerated public interests)."}, {"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "reason": "Provides specific statutory exceptions to information duties (e.g., when processing under a legal obligation or court/prosecutor order), but does not articulate a general legislative power to restrict rights nor the Art. 23 conditions."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Sets supervisory authority tasks/powers; no clause empowering the legislator to restrict rights/obligations under specified public-interest/necessity standards."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Regulates international transfers (adequacy/authorization); unrelated to a general legislative power to restrict data-subject rights or controller obligations."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Substantive rules and exceptions for sensitive data processing; not a meta-rule on legislative restrictions of rights/obligations nor tied to Art. 23 safeguards."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Concerns the data subject’s right to object to direct marketing; no legislative-restriction power or safeguards."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of external data protection monitors; irrelevant to legislative restriction of rights/obligations."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of data protection monitors; no legislative-restriction clause."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions and appointment; no provision on legislative restriction of rights/obligations."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for a decision; does not address legislative power to restrict rights/obligations."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent requirements; no clause on legislative restriction of GDPR-style rights/obligations."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Contractual safeguards for extra-territorial transfers under a decision; no legislative-restriction authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Union or Member State legislator", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "restrict, by legislative measure, the scope of the obligations and rights in Articles 12 to 22 and 34, and of Article 5 insofar as its provisions correspond to Articles 12 to 22", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "laws to which controllers or processors are subject", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "only if the restriction respects the essence of fundamental rights and freedoms and is necessary and proportionate in a democratic society to safeguard specified public interests", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 40’s clause about issuing regulations and decisions to implement the law is a generic administrative rulemaking power and does not, on its text, authorize restricting data-subject rights/obligations or set GDPR Art. 23 safeguards. No cited provision states that a legislator may restrict such rights only if necessary/proportionate for enumerated public interests and respecting the essence of rights.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-195", "gdpr_article": 23, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly grant the power to restrict the scope of obligations and rights by legislative measure, but they do provide exceptions to general rules and grant powers to certain authorities.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 40", "span": "مجلس الإدارة هو السلطة التي تتولى رسم سياسة الهيئة التي تسير عليها، والرقابة على أعمالها، واتخاذ ما يكفل لها مباشرة مهامها وصلاحياتها", "why": "This article grants the Board of Directors the power to make decisions and take actions, but it does not explicitly state that they have the power to restrict the scope of obligations and rights."}, {"id": "Article 12", "span": "يُحظَر على مدير البيانات نقْل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة في غير الحالات التالية", "why": "This article implies that there are restrictions on the transfer of personal data, but it does not explicitly state that these restrictions are made by a legislative measure."}, {"id": "Article 17(3)", "span": "لا يسري حكم البند (2) من هذه المادة في الحالتين التاليتين: أ - إذا كانت معالَجة البيانات لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي، وكانت إحاطة صاحب البيانات بالبيانات المشار إليها متعذرة أو تتطلَّب بذل جهود مرهقة غير عادية", "why": "This article provides an exception to the general rule, but it does not explicitly state that this exception is made by a legislative measure."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists in Article 40 of the BHR legislation", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "span": "إصدار اللوائح والقرارات واتخاذ التدابير اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision grants the council the power to issue regulations and decisions necessary for the implementation of the law, including the power to restrict the scope of obligations and rights."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8344697d1f1dc661161", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 666.22, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2d7796ecf6170aa52e8d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance/sanctions and transition clause; does not set processing duties for receipt of data in a particular inquiry nor address public authorities."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة", "article": "Article 1"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة أثناء توفير الخدمة أو بعد انتهائها أن يقوم بجمع ومعالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد الغرض من جمع البيانات والأساس القانوني لمعالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "scope": {"span": "الذين يعملون على جمع ومعالجة وتخزين البيانات الشخصية ومحتوى بيانات المستخدم كلياً أو جزئياً", "article": "Article 1"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "ولا تطبق أحكام هذه اللائحة على الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ورصد المخالفات أو الممارسات المخالفة للقوانين والقرارات والأحكام القضائية", "article": "Article 1"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "public authorities", "target_value": "مقدمو الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة (مزودو خدمات الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f: Article 1"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f: Article 4"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "process those personal data in compliance with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "تحديد الغرض من جمع البيانات والأساس القانوني لمعالجة البيانات؛ ومعالجة البيانات بطريقة تضمن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f: Article 4 (items 2, 4)", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a: Article 5"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of personal data received in the framework of a particular inquiry", "target_value": "جمع ومعالجة وتخزين البيانات الشخصية بواسطة مقدمي الخدمة (وليس السلطات العامة)، مع استثناء صريح للتحريات/التحقيقات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f: Article 1"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "they receive personal data in the framework of a particular inquiry in accordance with Union or Member State law", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناء الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ورصد المخالفات والأحكام القضائية من نطاق اللائحة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f: Article 1"], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 3(2) (“أن تكون ضرورية للامتثال لالتزام قانوني يخضع له مقدم الخدمة”) governs when a service provider may process based on its own legal obligation; it does not address public authorities’ processing of data they receive in a particular inquiry. Moreover, Article 1 excludes practices related to security investigations and law-enforcement-type inquiries from the regulation’s scope. Thus, there is no counterpart obliging public authorities to process inquiry-received data in line with data-protection rules/purposes.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-012", "gdpr_article": 4, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 