a complaint with the Ministry)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the data subject has habitual residence", "target": "Administrative complaint to the Ministry; no right to bring court proceedings stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "No judicial forum in provided texts; cf. Article 12; Article 7"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target": "No judicial proceedings mechanism provided", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "None", "target": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن المعالجة لا تتوافق مع أحكام القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "unless the controller or processor is a public authority of a Member State acting in the exercise of its public powers", "target": "General exemption: law does not apply to processing by public authorities acting within their legal competences", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 3(b)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated for court proceedings", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Agreeing with the objection: the target texts provide only an administrative complaint to the Ministry (Article 12; supported by Article 7) and do not grant a right to bring court proceedings or specify a forum of habitual residence. The public-authority clause in Article 3 is a general scope exemption, not a forum exception tied to a judicial remedy. No court-based remedy comparable to GDPR Article 79 is expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-917", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be too harsh, as there are provisions in the target jurisdiction that could be seen as counterparts to the GDPR requirement unit.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article provides a mechanism for the data subject to seek redress, although it may not be exactly equivalent to the GDPR's Article 79."}, {"id": "Article 7", "span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون، ولها على الأخص الآتي: أ- إعداد واعتماد الضوابط والإجراءات المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article grants the Ministry the responsibility for applying the law and provides for the Ministry to receive and decide on complaints from data subjects."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction does not provide a direct equivalent to the concept of 'bringing proceedings under Article 79' before a court.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "why": "This provision allows a data subject to submit a complaint to the Ministry, but it does not provide a direct equivalent to the concept of 'bringing proceedings under Article 79' before a court."}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "This provision 