", "citation": "Article 19", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target_value": "اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية تضمن المحافظة على البيانات الشخصية؛ والتحقق من التزام جهة المعالجة -بشكل دوري- بإجراء عمليات المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام النظام ولوائحه؛ وعليها التحقق من التزام [جهة المعالجة] بأحكام النظام واللوائح؛ متابعة قيد وتحديث سجلات أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لدى جهة التحكم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 19; Article 17(3); Article 8; Article 32(3)(و); Article 30(3)-(4)(أ)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "سواء تمت المعالجة من قبلها أو من قبل جهة أخرى نيابة عنها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(3)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "بحسب طبيعة النشاط الذي تمارسه جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 22", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "KSA PDPL imposes organizational/technical measures (security) and several compliance-management duties around processors, DPO, and cooperation with the authority. However, it lacks a general Art. 24-style obligation to implement risk/context-appropriate measures across all processing and to be able to demonstrate overall compliance. Risk and demonstration elements are present only in limited or specific contexts.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 35}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d9a05a425b46428120ee", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 346.73, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "339a36a66d99bd67eabf", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing privacy notice; does not regulate responding to data-subject requests or related timelines."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Creates exemptions from Article 6 obligations; does not set duties or timing for informing data subjects about actions on their requests."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "General exemptions (incl. Article 6) unrelated to informing data subjects about action on requests or response timelines."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; unrelated to handling data-subject requests or informing them of actions taken."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing (consent/legitimate purpose); no relevance to responding to requests or timing."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; not about requests under access/rectification/erasure etc., nor timelines for such responses."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and retention; does not address responding to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Transfers to processors; no obligations about responding to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations (security, privacy by design); no specific duty to inform data subjects about actions on their requests or timing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد.", "article": "Article 11"}, "condition": {"span": "لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "article": "Article 11"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على المراقب (صيغة إلزام)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target_value": "الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول، وطلبات تصحيح أو حذف البيانات (دون ذكر النقل/تقييد/اعتراض/قرارات مؤتمتة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target_value": "لتلقي ودراسة ... الطلبات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay and within one month of receipt of the request", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 11 requires internal systems to receive and study requests but does not set any deadline or require informing the data subject of actions taken. Article 26 provides an administrative complaints/appeal mechanism (including a 60-day period for appealing a regulator’s order), which is not a response-time rule for data-subject requests. Therefore, no textual counterpart to the GDPR one-month/undue-delay requirement appears for controller responses to such requests.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' aspects might be too narrow, as provisions like Article 6, in combination with Articles 8 and 11, suggest a mechanism for transparency and accountability, albeit not directly mirroring the GDPR's requirements.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها، في مواجهة أي مراقب", "why": "This provision indicates a right to access and review personal data, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR's requirement for providing information on action taken on requests, especially when considered in conjunction with other provisions."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي: 1- معالجة البيانات الشخصية بأمانة ومشروعية.", "why": "This emphasizes the controller's obligation to process data lawfully and securely, supporting the idea that there are mechanisms for ensuring data subjects' rights are respected."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the 'temporal' slot may be too harsh, as there are some provisions that imply a sense of timeliness or deadlines for processing requests.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الطلبات", "why": "This provision implies that the controller has an obligation to process requests in a timely manner."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "يجوز للمراقب أو المعالج التظلم من هذا القرار، إلى الوزير، خلال ستين يوماً من تاريخ إخطاره به", "why": "This provision suggests that there is some notion of a timeframe for taking action in response to requests or notifications."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "f5c366135483fe580381", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "455aae046cacf7979576", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 596.78, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "e4746759985795cd50b7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "reason": "Training obligation; does not establish design of T&O measures or privacy by design."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; not about designing T&O measures."}, {"id": "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "reason": "DPO registration procedure; unrelated to design of measures."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ allocation of roles; not about privacy by design or T&O measures’ content."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; does not impose controller design obligations."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Access/notice right; not about designing measures."}, {"id": "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "reason": "DPO appointment; not a design obligation for T&O measures."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual clauses; not general design of T&O measures."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Adequacy-based transfers; not about privacy-by-design obligations."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 8 (7e2914aa34ab2739dafd)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات القائمة على معالجة البيانات بأنواعها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "scope": {"span": "2 - أن تكون قد جُمِعت لغرض مشروع ومحدَّد وواضح ... ولا يتم إجراء معالجة لاحقة لها على نحو لا يتوافق مع الغرض الذي جُمِعت من أجله. 3 - أن تكون كافية وذات صلة وغير مفرطة بالنظر للغرض من جمْعها أو الذي تمت المعالجة اللاحقة لأجله.", "article": "Article 3 (7448a27e7806f2c0c143)"}, "condition": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الواجب تطبيقها في المُعالجة لضمان مستوى كافٍ من الأمان عند معالجة البيانات ... وتطبيقها كلها أو بعضها أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة، وذلك بناءً على طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات القائمة على معالجة البيانات بأنواعها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2 (Measures chapeau); Art. 8(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب/على مدير البيانات الالتزام بتطبيق التدابير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 8(1); Art. 2 (chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "design the technical and organisational measures to implement data-protection principles effectively", "target_value": "Apply Privacy by Design when preparing/designing/selecting/using processing-related applications/services/products; establish privacy frameworks and effective measures", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2(1)-(3)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "data-protection principles include, e.g., data minimisation", "target_value": "Principles include purpose limitation and data minimisation (“كافية وذات صلة وغير مفرطة …”)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 3(2)-(3)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)", "target_value": "as part of technical and organisational measures applicable in processing, risk-based, to ensure adequate protection", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2 (chapeau); Art. 8(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No explicit exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "both at the time of the determination of the means for processing and at the time of the processing itself", "target_value": "at the time of preparation/design/selection and during use", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 2(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 2 directly mandates Privacy by Design at both design-time and use, and requires controllers to implement risk-based technical and organisational measures. Coupled with Article 3’s data quality principles (including minimisation), this functionally matches GDPR Article 25(1)’s requirement to design measures to implement data-protection principles effectively. Article 8 reinforces the obligation framework for applying such measures.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-210", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly state that the controller must 'design' the technical and organisational measures to implement data-protection principles effectively.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الواجب تطبيقها في المُعالجة لضمان مستوى كافٍ من الأمان عند معالجة البيانات", "why": "This article discusses the measures to be taken during processing, but does not explicitly state that the controller must 'design' these measures."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات من الإتلاف غير المقصود أو غير المصرَّح به", "why": "This article discusses the security of processing, but does not explicitly state that the controller must 'design' these measures."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law has a more direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement than initially stated", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "Article 2: التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الواجب تطبيقها في المُعالجة لضمان مستوى كافٍ من الأمان عند معالجة البيانات", "why": "This provision directly addresses the GDPR requirement with similar wording"}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8: أمان المعالَجة", "why": "This provision explicitly states the controller's obligation to apply technical and organizational measures to protect personal data"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "762372b7329c44286e43", "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 565.54, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "18ee8c612ce8710f9bce", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service information and consent conditions; does not address handling/response to data-subject requests or timing."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no provisions on responding to data-subject requests or timelines."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification regime; unrelated to responses to data-subject rights requests."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance and sanctions; no specific rule on informing data subjects about actions on their rights requests or response deadlines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "condition": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها على مدار الساعة، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "article": "Article 5(9)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4: \"يجب على مقدم الخدمة\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على (shall/must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4: \"يجب على مقدم الخدمة\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target_value": "Establish mechanisms and technological means enabling users to exercise and process rights requests (access, correction, erasure, restriction, objection, portability), implying communication of outcomes", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(8): \"تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة ... أو الاعتراض ... أو طلب نقل البيانات\"; Article 4(6): \"استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول ... ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر\"; Article 5(9): \"وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى ... وطلبات الوصول ... وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "requests under Articles 15 to 22 (access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection, ADP-related)", "target_value": "access/review, correction, erasure, restriction, objection, portability (no explicit automated decision-making right)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4(6) and 4(8)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target_value": "Internal systems to receive and study data access, correction, and deletion requests", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(9): \"وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى ... وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception specified for responding to rights requests", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No express exception in Articles 4 or 5 regarding responses to data-subject requests"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay and within one month of receipt", "target_value": "No response deadline specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "No timeframe stated in Articles 4 or 5 for responding to data-subject requests"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence tied to this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No specific consequence stated in Articles 4 or 5 for informing on actions taken"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Adjusted the action-slot assessment: while the text does not explicitly require informing the data subject of actions taken, Article 4(6) and 4(8) mandate mechanisms and means to process rights requests, and Article 5(9) mandates systems to receive such requests—together implying some communication of outcomes. However, there remains no express duty to provide an outcome notice, and no response timeframe, so full equivalence is not achieved.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 6}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 6}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the 'action' slot being uncovered does not fully account for provisions that imply informing the data subject about actions taken on their requests.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision suggests a mechanism for informing the data subject about actions taken on their requests."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر", "why": "This implies some form of communication or information provision to the data subject regarding their requests."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 6, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "a418980931b429c7909a", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 461.26, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d5604774225cc2117859", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Sets supervisory authority powers and tasks, not controller-side measures for ensuring/demonstrating compliance."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Obligation to designate a DPO; tangential to Art. 24’s general TOMs obligation."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualification criteria; not an Art. 24 TOMs or demonstration obligation."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Enforcement measures by the authority; not a controller obligation to implement/demonstrate measures."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-response oversight; not the baseline Art. 24 obligation to implement/demonstrate TOMs."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is in accordance with the Regulation", "target_value": "وضع الضوابط والإجراءات، ومنها التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام القانون؛ مع التزامات بالتدقيق والاحتفاظ بالمستندات وتقديمها للوزارة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13(c); Article 16; Article 23; Article 17; Article 27; Article 18"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية (من قبل المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(a)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "The target text clearly obliges the controller to implement technical/procedural measures to ensure processing complies with the law and establishes mechanisms to demonstrate compliance (audits, recordkeeping, cooperation). However, the ‘condition’ is only partially reflected: the law requires identifying risks to the data subject but does not expressly require consideration of nature, scope, context, purposes, or risks to rights and freedoms as phrased in the GDPR. The condition verdict has been adjusted accordingly.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The action slot is not partially covered, as the provisions do not provide clear evidence that the controller is required to implement measures to demonstrate compliance with the law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article requires the controller to implement controls and procedures, but it does not mention the need to demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي للتأكد من أن إجراءات معالجة البيانات الشخصية قد تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article requires the controller and processor to appoint an external auditor, but it does not explicitly require the controller to implement measures to demonstrate compliance."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot verdict is not fully supported by the citation", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "The citation only mentions determining the risks that may occur to the owner of personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "3f916831456908af27d8", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 587.75, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "df6500cc896b74afcefe", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Sets general processing principles; subpara (8) is a delegation to future executive regulations and does not itself establish any certification scheme or empower the Office to direct certification bodies."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; no mention of certifications, certification bodies, or powers of the Office to order them."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject information rights; no relevance to supervisory authority powers over certification bodies."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no certification framework or supervisory authority orders to certification bodies."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification and general power to impose administrative penalties; does not refer to certification bodies or ordering them not to issue certifications."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; no certification-related powers."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward the DPO; unrelated to certification or supervisory authority orders."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; no certification scheme or Office power to direct certification bodies."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Appeal of Office decisions; procedural, not a source of a power to order certification bodies."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints and general power to impose administrative penalties (\"للمكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية\"); no express authority to instruct certification bodies regarding issuance of certifications, nor any mention of a certification regime."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no certification framework or relevant Office powers."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no certification-related authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "order the certification body not to issue a certification", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "certifications under Articles 42 and 43", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the requirements for the certification are not or are no longer met", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Art. 24(3) (and 9(4)) grants a general power to impose administrative penalties but does not mention certification bodies, certifications, or an order to refrain from issuing them. Art. 5(8) is merely a delegation to executive regulations; absent operative regulatory text, it cannot supply the specific power required. The provided UAE provisions contain no certification framework analogous to GDPR Arts. 42–43.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-146", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists in Article 24(3) and implied in Article 5(8)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "span": "المكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية", "why": "The Office has the power to impose administrative penalties, which could include ordering a certification body not to issue a certification."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "أي ضوابط أخرى تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "There may be additional regulations or controls that are not explicitly stated in the provided provisions."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "57844ac856d11c289650", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 441.14, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "26047079587e57031ca6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Addresses rights related to automated decision-making, not restriction of processing conditions."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Provides erasure/rectification rights, not the conditional right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Concerns objection/stop processing for specific purposes (e.g., marketing), not the restriction right triggered by unlawfulness."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information right about procedures; does not create or condition the restriction right."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to restriction of processing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; not a data-subject right."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; not the substantive right to restriction or its conditions."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; unrelated to restriction right."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not grant the restriction right."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO and contact; not the restriction right."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to restriction right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Art. 16(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Art. 16(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Art. 16(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات", "article": "Art. 16(3)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "article": "Art. 16(1)(ج)"}, "exception": {"span": "للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة مقتصرة على تخزين البيانات الشخصية. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية حقوق الغير وفقاً للتشريعات السارية. د. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية المصلحة العامة.", "article": "Art. 16(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم في حال قام برفع التقييد المنصوص عليه في هذه المادة، أن يخطر صاحب البيانات بذلك.", "article": "Art. 16(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target_value": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure of the personal data and requests restriction of their use instead", "target_value": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ...ب...ج...د...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "يجب على المتحكم في حال قام برفع التقييد ... أن يخطر صاحب البيانات بذلك.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(4)"}], "holistic_label": "covered_broader", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "UAE Art. 16(1)(ج) grants a right to restrict where processing is unlawful without additionally requiring the data subject to oppose erasure, so it functionally covers RU-167 but on broader terms. The exceptions in Art. 16(3) allow limited processing during restriction (storage, legal claims, third-party rights, public interest), which parallels GDPR’s permitted grounds and does not negate coverage of the RU-167 scenario. Thus, the mismatch is that the UAE text is broader on the triggering condition rather than narrower.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not provide a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167], as it lacks explicit mention of the data subject's opposition to erasure and request for restriction instead.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "Article 16(1)(ج) provides a condition for restricting processing when the processing is unlawful, but it does not explicitly mention the data subject's opposition to erasure and request for restriction instead."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "المادة (15) حق تصحيح أو محو البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 15(2)(د) mentions the right to request erasure of personal data when the processing is unlawful, but it does not provide a clear counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167]."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not perfectly match the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167] regarding the conditions for restricting processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة 1. يحق لصاحب البيانات إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. اعتراض صاحب البيانات على دقة بياناته الشخصية، وفي هذه الحالة يتم تقييد المعالجة لفترة محددة تسمح للمتحكم التحقق من دقتها. ب. اعتراض صاحب البيانات على معالجة بياناته الشخصية بالمخالفة للأغراض المتفق عليها. ج. أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "why": "The conditions for restricting processing in the UAE law do not fully align with those in the GDPR."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "3. على الرغم مما ورد في البند (1) من هذه المادة، للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة مقتصرة على تخزين البيانات الشخصية. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية حقوق الغير وفقاً للتشريعات السارية. د. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية المصلحة العامة.", "why": "The UAE law provides exceptions to the right to restrict processing that may limit its applicability compared to the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 557.19, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b60be1f6ec8883d1b9af", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; no relation to authority approval of codes of conduct."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality obligations for controllers; no supervisory authority approval mechanism."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security measures and processor notification; no codes of conduct approval role."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial procedures for data subject rights; not about codes of conduct."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right to personal data privacy; no operational rule on codes of conduct."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; unrelated to codes of conduct or their approval."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access rights; no supervisory authority approval of codes."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access obligations; not about codes of conduct."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Security/public interest derogations; no codes of conduct approval."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; no relation to codes of conduct."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and authority-set privacy policies; does not establish approval of industry codes."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 27(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27(1)"}, "action": {"span": "التنسيق مع أي مجموعة أو رابطة مهنية وأي رابطة أخرى تمثل المراقبين أو مشغلي مواقع الإنترنت، وذلك بهدف تشجيع وتطوير التنظيم الذاتي", "article": "Article 27(1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 27(1)"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": ["Article 27(1)"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "approve codes of conduct", "target_value": "التنسيق مع جمعيات بهدف تشجيع وتطوير التنظيم الذاتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 27(1)"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "pursuant to Article 40(5)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the codes of conduct provide sufficient safeguards", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Qatar’s law empowers the competent administration to encourage self-regulation by coordinating with associations, but it does not establish an approval mechanism for codes of conduct nor criteria tied to “sufficient safeguards.” The core GDPR action and condition are missing, and the authority’s role is permissive rather than obligatory. Hence the requirement is not met in the target text.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-392", "gdpr_article": 35, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "455aae046cacf7979576", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 323.22, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "e02350fc9b16a4f41192", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment criteria; no requirement to consult the supervisory authority prior to processing."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO and data subject contact; does not establish controller consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; unrelated to prior consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations and record-keeping/providing records upon request; no prior consultation duty."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no consultation trigger or duty."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing right; unrelated to DPIA-based consultation with authority."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no supervisory authority consultation rule."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint procedure by data subjects; not a controller duty to consult the authority."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller general obligations (including providing information to the Office upon judicial decision); no prior consultation requirement."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods for data subjects; not about consulting the authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "action": {"span": "العمل كحلقة وصل بين المتحكم أو المعالج حسب الأحوال والمكتب بشأن قيامهما بتطبيق أحكام معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 11(1)(د)"}, "scope": {"span": "عمليات المعالجة المقترحة", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند استخدام أي من التقنيات الحديثة التي من شأنها أن تشكل خطراً عالياً على خصوصية وسرية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 21(1); see also 21(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل القيام بإجراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 21(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Obligation appears for DPIA and DPO liaison roles, but no obligation to consult the authority in the specified scenario", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "consult the supervisory authority", "target_value": "DPO acts as liaison with the Office; controller must coordinate with the DPO during DPIA", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11(1)(د); Article 21(5)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "intended processing", "target_value": "عمليات المعالجة المقترحة (proposed/intended processing)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 21(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where a DPIA indicates high risk absent mitigating measures", "target_value": "High-risk processing triggers a DPIA (e.g., use of modern technologies; systematic evaluation; large-scale sensitive data), but no condition tying residual high risk to authority consultation", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 21(1)-(3)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "prior to processing", "target_value": "DPIA must occur before processing; no explicit timing for consulting the authority", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 21(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "The UAE text requires a DPIA before risky processing and establishes a DPO who liaises with the supervisory authority, but it does not mandate that the controller consult the authority when a DPIA shows residual high risk prior to processing. The liaison/coordination mechanisms justify a partial match on the action, yet the specific prior-consultation obligation and trigger are absent. This refines the earlier ‘uncovered’ assessment to ‘partial’ for the action slot.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-415", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Provisions imply consultation or coordination related to DPIA, though not exactly as stipulated in GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "span": "Article 21(5)", "why": "Implies coordination between controller and DPO during DPIA."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the slot 'consult the supervisory authority' might be too harsh, as the provisions imply a level of coordination and oversight.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "span": "Article 21(5)", "why": "The controller must coordinate with the DPO when conducting a data protection impact assessment, implying a level of oversight and coordination."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "Article 11", "why": "The DPO acts as a liaison between the controller/processor and the authority, ensuring compliance with the regulations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "c34922f387019af45e42", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 561.72, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "da9abf8484b725e8c336", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security and breach-risk duties between controller and processor; no reference to the competent authority or cooperation on request."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Information to the individual before processing; unrelated to supervisory authority cooperation."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross‑border data flow restriction rule; no supervisory authority cooperation duty."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Defines competent authority’s power to process certain data for state interests; does not impose controller cooperation."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; no supervisory authority cooperation duty."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller’s duties when disclosing/transfer to a processor; no supervisory authority cooperation duty."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementing decisions; not a controller cooperation duty."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain articles; does not create a cooperation-on-request duty."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Grants enforcement powers to ministry officers; no textual duty on controllers to cooperate on request."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المراقب", "article": "Article 14"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على", "article": "Article 14"}, "action": {"span": "إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات", "article": "Article 14"}, "scope": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب على", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target_value": "إعلام ... الإدارة المختصة بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات (إخطار بالاختراق/الإخلال)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 14; Article 8 (الالتزام بما تحدده الإدارة المختصة)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target_value": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لتطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون (تحديد مهام الجهة المختصة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.55, "reasoning_note": "Article 27 indeed articulates the competent authority’s tasks, helping cover the RU’s scope element, and Article 14 imposes a specific cooperative act (breach notification) toward the authority. However, there is no general controller duty to cooperate “on request” with the authority, and Article 13 does not mention the authority at all. Hence coverage is partial, not fully equivalent to GDPR Art. 31.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-311", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law does not explicitly mention the controller cooperating with the supervisory authority upon request.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة", "why": "This article mentions the controller's obligation to inform the individual and the administration, but not to cooperate with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This article mentions the competent administration taking measures to apply and enforce the law, but does not explicitly state that the controller shall cooperate with the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, and the Qatari law may have a broader coverage of the GDPR requirement unit RU-311 than initially claimed.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This provision suggests that the competent authority has a role in supervising the implementation of the law, which could be related to the scope of the supervisory authority's tasks."}, {"id": "Article 13", "span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية من الضياع أو التلف أو التعديل أو الإفشاء، أو الوصول إليها، أو استخدامها بشكل عارض أو غير مشروع", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller and processor have an obligation to cooperate with the supervisory authority in protecting personal data, which could be related to the condition of 'on request by the supervisory authority'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "9548224453cca1301899", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 582.83, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "837efae7b8386a0a3c31", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification content and timelines; does not impose or describe implementing data-protection policies."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; no duty to implement data-protection policies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات.", "article": "Article 5(7)"}, "scope": {"span": "اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau): \"على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "obligation (على/يجب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau): \"على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate data protection policies", "target_value": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(7)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "as part of measures established under Article 24(1)", "target_value": "policies are one of the required measures under Article 5", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau) and 5(7)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where proportionate in relation to processing activities", "target_value": "no proportionality qualifier for the policy duty itself", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 5(7) (no qualifier). Article 5(1) ties proportionality (\"ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته...\") to security measures, not to 5(7)."}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "none", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "none", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "none", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "I considered the objection: Article 5(1) does contain a proportionality qualifier, but it grammatically applies to the security measures under 5(1), not to the separate policy duty in 5(7). Because 5(7) lacks any proportionality condition, the GDPR’s conditional (“where proportionate”) element is not expressed for the policies obligation. Therefore, the condition slot remains uncovered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-207", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of proportionality qualifier and explicit link to measures established under a specific article", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "المادة الخامسة: أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "No proportionality qualifier stated in Article 5"}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "why": "No explicit link to measures established under a specific article"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdict for the 'condition' slot is incorrect, as Article 5(1) provides a proportionality qualifier.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية للمستخدم ضد الخسارة أو الضرر أو الإفصاح أو الاختراق من طرف آخر غير مصرح له أو استبدال البيانات أو المعلومات بأخرى غير صحيحة أو إضافة معلومات غير صحيحة", "why": "This provision provides a proportionality qualifier for the security measures, which could be applied to the policies duty in Article 5(7)."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["a418980931b429c7909a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 547.47, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f5efb52d20de4fe5120e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "reason": "Definitions article; while it defines controller, processor, individual, and 'website operator' (مشغل الموقع الإلكتروني), it does not create or mention a designated 'representative' for foreign entities nor any requirement about the representative’s place of establishment."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of application; no provision about appointing a representative or where such a representative must be established."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal bases for processing (consent/legitimate purpose); unrelated to appointing or locating a representative."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising data subject rights; does not address representatives or their establishment."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations (fairness, security, privacy policies); no requirement to designate a representative or specify its location."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure alignment; no representative concept or establishment/location rule."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; no mention of representatives or their establishment."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; regulates data transfer restrictions but does not require appointing a representative or set any establishment/location requirement."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions; not about representatives or their establishment."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain controller obligations; confirms controller duties but does not create a representative role or a location requirement for such a role."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from disclosing reasons for refusing rights; unrelated to representatives."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Further exemptions concerning disclosures; no representative or establishment/location requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "representative designated under Article 27", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "be established in one of the Member States where the relevant data subjects are located", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "data subjects whose personal data are processed in relation to the offering of goods or services to them, or whose behaviour is monitored", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "When a representative is designated under Article 27(1)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "I re-examined the cited provisions. The definition of 'website operator' (Article 1) and the exemptions for controller obligations (Article 19) do not create a role analogous to a GDPR Article 27 representative, nor impose any establishment/location requirement for such a role. Across the provided text set, there is no provision requiring designation of a representative or specifying where that representative must be established.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-221", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 9}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 12}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C5 might be too absolute, as there are provisions that relate to data protection and the responsibilities of the controller, which could be seen as indirectly addressing the concept of a representative.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "span": "لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إلا بعد الحصول على موافقة الفرد، ما لم تكن المعالجة ضرورية لتحقيق غرض مشروع للمراقب أو الغير الذي تُرسل إليه البيانات.", "why": "This provision implies that the controller has responsibilities towards the data subjects and must obtain their consent before processing their personal data."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام المواد (4)، (5/البنود 1، 2، 3)، (6) من هذا القانون، في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1- تنفيذ مهمة متعلقة بالمصلحة العامة وفقاً للقانون.", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller may be exempt from certain obligations in specific circumstances, which could be related to the concept of a representative."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion is based on an incomplete analysis of the provisions, and further examination is needed to determine the existence of a counterpart.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "span": "مشغل الموقع الإلكتروني", "why": "This definition could be related to the concept of a representative."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام المواد (4)، (5/البنود 1، 2، 3)، (6) من هذا القانون", "why": "This article implies that controllers have responsibilities towards data subjects, which could be seen as related to the idea of a representative."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["75db9db720e9e34a1148", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "f5c366135483fe580381", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 513.83, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "33d98fa0543eb49cd885", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "32f2136681f29047cd6a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Substantive disclosure/processing obligation; no provision for data-subject judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Delegates procedural details for certain data-subject rights; does not create a right to bring court proceedings."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Public-interest/security exemptions; no data-subject redress before courts."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Controller internal complaint and governance duties; not a judicial remedy for the data subject."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions; no data-subject judicial remedy."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Further exemptions from access obligations; no judicial redress right."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Material scope clause; silent on judicial proceedings by data subjects."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access right content; does not provide for bringing proceedings before courts."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Implementing authority for regulations; no data-subject judicial remedy."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الفرد: الشخص الطبيعي الذي تتم معالجة البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به.", "article": "Article 1"}, "modality": {"span": "للفرد أن", "article": "Article 26"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "الفرد: الشخص الطبيعي الذي تتم معالجة البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 1", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "للفرد أن", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the controller or processor has an establishment", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 26 provides an administrative complaint to the competent authority and ministerial review, but it does not confer a right to bring court proceedings against a controller or processor or specify any judicial venue. Article 29 vests ministry staff with judicial-police powers to detect and prove offenses; it is an enforcement power of officials, not a data-subject judicial remedy. No provision authorizes the individual to sue in court or addresses venue based on a controller/processor’s establishment.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-916", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is too pessimistic, as the provisions suggest some avenues for seeking redress and judicial mechanisms for addressing violations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This article provides a mechanism for individuals to file complaints and seek redress for violations of their rights."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة، الذين يصدر بتخويلهم صفة مأموري الضبط القضائي، ضبط وإثبات الجرائم التي تقع بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This article suggests that there are judicial mechanisms in place for investigating and prosecuting crimes committed in violation of the law."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement is partially incorrect, as Articles 26 and 29 provide some form of judicial recourse.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This article provides a mechanism for the individual to file a complaint with the competent authority."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة، الذين يصدر بتخويلهم صفة مأموري الضبط القضائي، ضبط وإثبات الجرائم التي تقع بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This article grants the employees of the Ministry the power to investigate and prosecute crimes committed in violation of this law."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["ca31304d94e06fa35850", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "9548224453cca13