)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "الحق في طلب إتلاف البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (title)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target": "إيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12(3)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure and requests restriction instead", "target": "إما: إذا علمت الجهة أن المعالجة مخالفة للنظام (يمتد أثره إلى الإتلاف)، وإما: في حال العدول عن الموافقة (يترتب عليه إيقاف المعالجة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(1)(د); Article 12(3)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 12(3)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.53, "reasoning_note": "KSA PDPL provides erasure when processing is unlawful and requires stopping processing upon withdrawal of consent, but it does not grant a right to restrict processing instead of erasure when processing is unlawful. The cited provisions show related remedies, yet the specific GDPR scenario—opposing erasure and requesting restriction—is not textually provided.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' may be incorrect, as there are provisions that could be interpreted as providing some level of protection or control for the data subject.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "span": "Article 8", "why": "Mentions the right to request erasure of personal data, which could be related to the right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "span": "Article 14", "why": "Discusses the processing of personal data for the benefit of the controller, which could be related to the right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "span": "Article 5", "why": "Mentions the right to access personal data, which could be related to the right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "span": "Article 21", "why": "Requires the controller to respond to the data subject's requests regarding their rights, which could include a request to restrict processing."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the condition might be too strict, as related provisions provide a framework for the data subject's rights in cases of non-compliant processing or withdrawal of consent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "span": "Article 8(1)(د)", "why": "Provides the right to request erasure of personal data if processing is non-compliant."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "span": "Article 12(3)", "why": "Requires the controller to stop processing data upon withdrawal of consent without undue delay."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "4919410df7147924356b"