المادة ... الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "exception": {"span": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على مدير البيانات ... إخطار", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "communicate any rectification or erasure of personal data or restriction of processing", "target": "إخطار ... عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed", "target": "أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "after carrying out the rectification or erasure or restriction in accordance with Articles 16, 17(1) or 18", "target": "فقط بعد استجابة المدير لطلب مقدم وفقاً للبند (1) من المادة 23", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "unless this proves impossible or involves disproportionate effort", "target": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "Article 23(5) establishes a duty to notify, but only when the controller has acted on a data subject’s request under Article 23(1) and only to any third party to whom the data were disclosed. This is narrower than GDPR Art. 19, which applies regardless of how rectification/erasure/restriction arose and to each recipient. The exception in BHR (impossibility/cannot be achieved) also omits GDPR’s ‘disproportionate effort’ clause.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-172", "gdpr_article": 19, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR jurisdiction has a narrower scope and an additional temporal requirement that is not present in the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23(5)", "span": "على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة، إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "why": "The BHR jurisdiction has a narrower scope and an additional temporal requirement that is not present in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR jurisdiction does not have a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-172], as Article 23(5) only requires notification to third parties when the controller has responded to a request from the data subject, and does not explicitly state that notification must be made to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "Article 23(5)", "why": "This provision only requires notification to third parties when the controller has responded to a request from the data subject, and does not explicitly state that notification must be made to each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8344697d1f1dc661161", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "762372b7329c44286e43", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "074363ee1a72941c8326"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 631.56, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "60bfe2facaf2db8bc964", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["75db9db720e9e34a1148"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Addresses lawful bases for the controller; does not impose a processor-only-on-instructions rule or speak to processor obligations."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification by the controller; no relevance to processor acting only on controller's instructions."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule aimed at the controller; no processor instruction constraint."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for data subject rights; no processor instruction constraint."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Controller exemptions from giving reasons for rights refusals; unrelated to processor instructions."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; does not regulate processor behavior vis-à-vis controller instructions."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations (fairness, security, privacy policies); no rule restricting processor to controller's instructions."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions relieving the controller from certain duties; does not create a processor instruction rule."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Enforcement/implementation clause; no substantive rule on processor instructions."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Additional controller exemptions relating to data subject rights; no processor instruction rule."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest processing by competent authority; does not establish processor-only-on-instructions duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المراقب", "article": "75db9db720e9e34a1148"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "75db9db720e9e34a1148"}, "action": {"span": "وأن تكون تلك البيانات معالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "75db9db720e9e34a1148"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "75db9db720e9e34a1148"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "processor", "target": "المراقب (controller) is the addressed party; the processor is mentioned only as the recipient of a transfer.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": "Obligation on the controller (يجب), not a prohibition addressed to the processor.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "process personal data", "target": "Processing is mentioned generally (\"تكون تلك البيانات معالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون\"), but not as a restriction on processor activity.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "personal data to which the processor has access", "target": "Generic \"البيانات الشخصية\" without tying scope to processor access.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed relevant to a processor instruction rule.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "on controller's instructions; or required by Union/Member State law", "target": "No exception structure addressing processor actions.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Only Article 12 references the processor, and it imposes duties on the controller to ensure lawful processing when transferring data, not a prohibition on the processor absent controller instructions. There is no target text creating the GDPR-style instruction-only rule or its legal-obligation exception structure. This directly addresses the reviewer’s objection: the available Qatari provisions do not mirror GDPR Art. 29’s processor obligation.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-251", "gdpr_article": 29, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdict for the 'exception' slot is inaccurate, as there are provisions that provide exceptions to the general rule.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "span": "Article 18", "why": "Provides exemptions for processing personal data without adhering to certain provisions of the Law."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "span": "Article 19", "why": "Provides exemptions for the controller from complying with certain provisions of the Law in specific situations."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law provisions partially address principles of lawful data processing and controller/processor responsibilities, but do not directly mirror the GDPR's specific requirements regarding processor obligations and exception structures.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "span": "لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إلا بعد الحصول على موافقة الفرد، ما لم تكن المعالجة ضرورية لتحقيق غرض مشروع للمراقب أو الغير الذي تُرسل إليه البيانات.", "why": "This article establishes a principle of lawful processing but does not explicitly address processor duties or the condition of processing on the controller's instructions."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "span": "يجب على المراقب لدى إفصاحه عن البيانات الشخصية أو نقلها إلى المعالج، مراعاة أن تكون مطابقة للأغراض المشروعة، وأن تكون تلك البيانات معالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This article implies duties related to lawful data processing when transferring data to the processor but does not explicitly state the processor can only process data on the controller's instructions."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f169b712b14aea8718ee", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 626.2, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f0e7b3c30d631a1494a7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "30fc4eea1adc8ce439a8", "762372b7329c44286e43"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "Rules on cross-border transfers and adequacy/derogations; not about general applicability or the scope/exclusions of the law."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Executive decision on contractual safeguards for international transfers; not bearing on when the law applies."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions in an executive decision; no operative scope or exclusions relevant to RU-003."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions related to DPO register in an executive decision; not about applicability/exclusions."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/hiding/erasure rights; not addressing general applicability or RU-003 exclusions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "أن تتم المعالَجة وِفقاً لعقد مكتوب يُبرَم بين مدير البيانات ومعالِج البيانات", "article": "Article 8(3)(ب)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "action": {"span": "التحقُّق من قيام مدير البيانات بمعالجة البيانات وِفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 10(1)(ج)"}, "scope": {"span": "قبل بدء عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام المواد (3) و(4) و(5) من هذا القانون على معالَجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم حصراً للأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية", "article": "Article 6"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controllers and processors", "target_value": "مدير البيانات ومعالِج البيانات (يَرِدان ضمن علاقة تعاقدية ومع التزامات محددة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 8(3)(أ)-(ب); Article 14(2)(أ)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "صيغة إلزام صريحة: \"على مدير البيانات...\" و\"يُحظَر...\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1); Article 15(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "comply with this Regulation", "target_value": "«معالجة البيانات وِفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون»", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data wholly or partly by automated means", "target_value": "«المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً»", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "Exclusions where processing is: (a) outside Union law; (b) by Member States under CFSP; (c) purely personal/household; (d) by competent authorities for criminal law enforcement purposes.", "target_value": "استثناءات خاصة: عدم سريان بعض المواد على المعالجة للأغراض الصحفية/الفنية/الأدبية؛ ونظام خاص لبيانات الدعاوى الجنائية لا يُخرجها من نطاق القانون.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 6; Article 7(1)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Article 7 is a substantive regime for criminal-proceedings data within the PDPL, not an exclusion from the law’s applicability; Article 6 is a journalistic/artistic derogation from specific provisions, not a household/personal-use exemption. Thus, the GDPR Art. 2(2) exclusions (a)-(d) lack functional counterparts in the cited Bahraini texts.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-003", "gdpr_article": 2, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR's exclusions (a)-(d) of Article 2(2) is incorrect.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "span": "Article 7(1)(a)-(e)", "why": "These exceptions are similar to the exclusions listed in points (a) to (d) of GDPR Article 2(2)."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement of 'exclusions where processing is: (a) outside Union law; (b) by Member States under CFSP; (c) purely personal/household; (d) by competent authorities for criminal law purposes' is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "المعالَجة التي تتم مِن قِبَل أية جهة عامة مختصة بالقدر الذي يقتضيه تنفيذ المهام المنوطة بها قانوناً", "why": "This provision provides an exclusion for processing by a public authority, which corresponds to the GDPR exemption for 'outside Union law'."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "span": "معالَجة البيانات لأغراض الصحافة أو الآداب أو الفنون", "why": "This provision provides an exemption for processing for journalistic, artistic, or literary purposes, which corresponds to the GDPR exemption for 'purely personal/household'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "762372b7329c44286e43", "30fc4eea1adc8ce439a8", "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "231a37f671238dbf7112"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 653.0, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "6521aa6849142f8c924a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations and compliance with rules/executive regulations or Office instructions; no mechanism for adherence to codes of conduct by non-subject entities nor use as transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Office authority to exempt certain establishments from PDPL requirements; does not establish codes of conduct or a transfer-safeguard mechanism for third-country entities."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions; unrelated to codes of conduct or cross-border transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Data subject right to stop processing; unrelated to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; no relation to codes of conduct or transfer safeguard permissions."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; not about codes of conduct or cross-border safeguards."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; no codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Appeals against Office decisions; not relevant to codes of conduct or cross-border transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; no relation to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations including recordkeeping of cross-border data movement; does not establish adherence to codes of conduct or permission for non-subject entities to use them as safeguards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "تدابير الحماية الخاصة بالمعالجة عبر الحدود التي تتم وفقاً للمادتين (22) و(23) من هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "article": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Controllers or processors not subject to the Regulation pursuant to Article 3", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "adhere to approved and generally valid codes of conduct", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "To provide appropriate safeguards for personal data transfers to third countries or international organisations under Article 46(2)(e)", "target_value": "تدابير الحماية الخاصة بالمعالجة عبر الحدود التي تتم وفقاً للمادتين (22) و(23) من هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "The code of conduct is approved pursuant to paragraph 5 and has general validity pursuant to paragraph 9", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "I looked for a distributed counterpart (e.g., Office instructions or exemptions) but found no UAE text that creates a code-of-conduct adherence mechanism—especially for entities not subject to the law—or uses such adherence as a cross-border transfer safeguard. Article 13 references cross-border protective measures generally, but not codes of conduct or permissions for foreign controllers/processors. Therefore the core elements (addressee, permission, action, conditions) remain textually absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-487", "gdpr_article": 40, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterparts to GDPR requirements may exist under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "Article 7(5)", "why": "Mentions the appointment of a processor with sufficient guarantees to apply technical and organizational measures"}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "span": "Article 8(9)", "why": "States that the processor must carry out the processing in accordance with the rules, conditions, and controls specified in the regulation"}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "span": "Article 13(1)(ز)", "why": "Mentions protection measures for cross-border processing"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart to codes of conduct and approval may exist under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "span": "إجراء المعالجة وتنفيذها طبقاً للقواعد والاشتراطات والضوابط المحددة بهذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية أو التي يصدر بموجبها تعليمات من المكتب", "why": "Suggests that processors must follow rules and conditions, and the Office has authority to exempt certain establishments"}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "span": "سلطة المكتب في الإعفاء مع عدم الإخلال بأي اختصاصات أخرى مقررة للمكتب بموجب أي تشريع آخر", "why": "Mentions the Office's authority to exempt certain establishments from some or all of the requirements and conditions of the data protection regulations"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "c34922f387019af45e42", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 648.72, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9489503211ba8a2a7dbf", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/blocking/erasure rights; does not address any advisory role of the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; no supervisory authority advisory obligation."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions (privacy by design); no rule on the authority giving advice."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing rules and exceptions; no supervisory authority advice duty."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for DPO register; no advisory competence for the authority."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "International transfers (adequacy list/permits); regulates authorizations, not advisory duties to controllers."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "External DPO disclosure obligations; unrelated to supervisory authority giving advice."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing with possible prior authorization by the authority; this is a permitting mechanism, not an obligation to give advice on processing operations."}, {"id": "daaf1e5a7eedf0d7755e", "reason": "Investigation procedures; no advisory function toward controllers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a (Article 37)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة (the Authority)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a Art. 37", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "No obligation stated for the Authority to give advice on processing operations", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "give advice", "target_value": "No provision requiring the Authority to give advice to controllers", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "on the processing operations referred to in Article 36(2) (prior consultation/high-risk DPIA cases)", "target_value": "No corresponding category of processing operations identified for Authority advice", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Articles 40 and 44 establish governance and implementation powers of the Authority and Article 37 sets confidentiality and permits the Authority to seek external advice, but none impose a duty to give advice to controllers on specific processing operations akin to GDPR Art. 36(2) prior consultation. The cited texts show oversight/administration, not an advisory obligation. No provision functionally substitutes an advice-giving duty in high-risk or prior-consultation scenarios.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-389", "gdpr_article": 35, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential indirect counterpart in oversight and regulatory powers, but not explicitly stated as an obligation for advice on processing operations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "span": "Article 40", "why": "Mentions tasks and powers of the council, including issuing regulations and overseeing work, which could indirectly include advice on processing operations."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, as the provisions imply a role for the authority in overseeing and guiding the processing of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "span": "المهام والصلاحيات", "why": "Article 40 implies a role for the authority in implementing the law and overseeing the processing of personal data."}, {"id": "44", "span": "يمثل الرئيس التنفيذي الهيئة", "why": "Article 44 implies that the executive president of the authority has a role in representing the authority and managing its affairs, which could include guiding the processing of personal data."}, {"id": "37", "span": "الحفاظ على سرية المعلومات والمستندات", "why": "Article 37 discusses the confidentiality of information and documents, which could be related to the processing operations."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "daaf1e5a7eedf0d7755e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 620.83, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "0ba5a83caaa51a78efc0", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Sets general controller duties and adherence to authority-issued privacy policies, but does not assign or describe a monitoring/compliance oversight function akin to a DPO."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Addresses conditions for disclosure/transfer to a processor, not an internal monitoring/compliance role."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security precautions and breach notification by processor to controller; not a monitoring/compliance oversight function."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to the individual and authority; not an internal monitoring/compliance oversight role."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality, relevance, accuracy, and retention obligations; not about monitoring compliance roles."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Transparency/notice to the individual; no monitoring/compliance oversight function."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restriction; unrelated to internal compliance monitoring."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions; does not establish a monitoring/compliance role."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Authority powers to promote awareness/research; not obligations on an internal monitoring role."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; no monitoring/compliance oversight function."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Enforcement powers of officials; not an internal compliance monitoring obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية؛ ... والتحقق من التزام المعالج بالتعليمات التي يوجهها إليه، ... ورصد ومتابعة ذلك بصفة مستمرة.", "article": "Article 11 (بنود 7 و8)"}, "scope": {"span": "تحديد المعالجين المسؤولين عن حماية البيانات الشخصية؛ تدريب وتوعية المعالجين على حماية البيانات الشخصية؛ إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 11 (بنود 2 و3 و7)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "بصفة مستمرة", "article": "Article 11 (بند 8)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data protection officer", "target_value": "المراقب (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على (صيغة إلزام)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "monitor compliance with legal and internal data protection requirements, including audits and related oversight", "target_value": "إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام ...؛ والتحقق من التزام المعالج ... ورصد ومتابعة ذلك", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11 (7)-(8)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "GDPR, other Union/Member State data protection provisions, and the controller’s/processor’s internal policies incl. assignment of responsibilities, awareness-raising/training, and related audits", "target_value": "تحديد المسؤوليات (المعالجين المسؤولين)، تدريب وتوعية المعالجين، تدقيق ومراجعة الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية، والتحقق من التزام المعالج بالتعليمات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11 (2)-(3), (7)-(8)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "بصفة مستمرة (continuous monitoring)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 11 (8)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Qatar’s law does not establish a DPO role; instead, it places monitoring, audits, training, and responsibility-assignment duties directly on the controller. These functions are substantively similar to GDPR Art. 39 tasks but the addressee differs and internal policy-compliance is not expressly framed as a monitored category. Continuous monitoring is explicitly required.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-476", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "455aae046cacf7979576", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 411.66, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "28536b22999223c8b52e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Addresses erasure rights and controller duties; no text about supervisory authorities or any limitation on supervising courts."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Right of access provisions; does not concern the remit of supervisory authorities or courts' judicial processing."}, {"id": "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "reason": "Sets limits on access rights, including for public bodies and judicial requirements; does not regulate supervisory authorities' oversight over courts."}, {"id": "4919410df7147924356b", "reason": "Right to obtain copies of personal data; no mention of supervisory authority powers or exclusions for courts."}, {"id": "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "reason": "Deals with legal guardian consent and exercise of rights; unrelated to supervisory authority jurisdiction or courts."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification to the competent authority and data subjects; does not define or limit supervisory oversight of courts."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing by public entities; while it references governmental functions, it does not address supervisory authority powers or prohibit oversight of courts."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases and exceptions for collection/processing, including to meet judicial requirements; does not regulate supervisory authorities' role regarding courts."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency notice content; no allocation or restriction of supervisory authority competence."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "reason": "General handling of data subject requests; silent on supervisory authorities and courts."}, {"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "reason": "Sanctions framework and committee; does not delineate supervisory authority jurisdiction or exemptions for judicial processing."}, {"id": "bddc41add335b2853d90", "reason": "Confiscation and publication sanctions; no provisions on supervisory authority oversight over courts."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authorities", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "supervise processing operations", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing operations of courts acting in their judicial capacity", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Across the provided KSA provisions, there is no text allocating or restricting a supervisory authority’s power vis-à-vis courts acting in a judicial capacity. Articles 10 and 21 address legal bases and public-interest processing (including judicial requirements) but do not speak to supervisory oversight. Sanctions and committee provisions likewise do not carve out courts from supervision.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-016", "gdpr_article": 6, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect or distributed addressing of similar concepts within the legal framework, or possible oversight in the analysis.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "المادة العاشرة", "why": "Article 10 discusses exceptions for collecting personal data, which might indirectly relate to judicial activities but does not explicitly address supervisory authorities' role regarding courts."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "span": "المادة الحادية والعشرون", "why": "Article 21 outlines conditions for processing personal data for public interest purposes, including judicial activities, but does not directly address the prohibition on supervisory authorities."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "4919410df7147924356b", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "67a122f7dc547487996a", "bddc41add335b2853d90"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 453.53, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c0b4fefcc22c4b4da161", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Enforcement/remedial powers of the ministry; does not govern disclosure of personal data in official documents."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Promulgation clause for the executive regulation; no substantive rule on disclosure."}, {"id": "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "reason": "General scope of the law; does not address public-access disclosure or official documents."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Institutional competencies of the ministry; no operative permission or framework for disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "DPO duties; not about public access to official documents or permissions to disclose."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "Publication of DPO contact; unrelated to disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; does not create a permission for public bodies to disclose official documents."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; no substantive permission to disclose."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent requirement; not a rule on public access to official documents."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General protection declaration; no operative permission to disclose official documents."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة", "article": "Article 3(b) (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)"}, "modality": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية:", "article": "Article 3 (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد أي جهة أو طرف ثالث يتم الإفصاح له عن البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(5) (Executive Regulation) (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "scope": {"span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "article": "Article 3(b) (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)"}, "condition": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5 (Executive Regulation) (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "public authorities, public bodies, and private bodies performing a task carried out in the public interest that hold official documents", "target_value": "وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(b) (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "Exemption from the law’s application for certain processing (\"لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون...\"); separate obligation to obtain a permit before processing.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3 chapeau (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814); Article 5 chapeau (Exec. Reg.) (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "disclose personal data contained in official documents", "target_value": "الإفصاح عن البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(5) (Exec. Reg.) (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data in official documents held for the performance of a task carried out in the public interest", "target_value": "تنفيذ ... للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً (processing by public bodies in exercise of legal competences)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(b) (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "in accordance with applicable Union or Member State law and aiming to reconcile public access to official documents with data protection", "target_value": "Permit required before processing; or PDPL non-applicability when public bodies act within legal competences; no express reconciliation test or reference to 'official documents'.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5 (Exec. Reg.) (a0040ee4dad7d4440e19); Article 3(b) (865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "I considered Article 3(b) and Article 5(5): 3(b) exempts processing by public bodies acting within legal competences from the PDPL, and 5(5) contemplates that disclosures occur by requiring controllers to list disclosure recipients in the permit application. However, the texts do not articulate a substantive permission to disclose personal data in official documents for public access or any balancing test to reconcile access to official documents with data protection, so the correspondence is only partial.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-957", "gdpr_article": 86, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart might exist under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "ي- إذا كانت البيانات متاحة للجمهور وبما لا يخالف أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision might allow the disclosure of personal data in official documents if it is already publicly available and does not violate the law"}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "span": "الغرض من معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision discusses the obligation to obtain a permit from the Ministry before processing personal data, which might be relevant to the condition of disclosing personal data in accordance with applicable law"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the absence of a counterpart in the OMN legislation for the GDPR's permission to disclose personal data might not fully consider the implications of Articles 3(b) and 5(5).", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3(b)", "span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "Suggests public bodies have permissions when performing legal competences, potentially including handling personal data in official documents."}, {"id": "Article 5(5)", "span": "يتم الإفصاح له عن البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies a framework for processing and disclosing personal data under certain conditions, potentially aligning with the GDPR's permission modality."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "3f916831456908af27d8", "6e8de83975a220288296", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "823830174d241884bd73", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 658.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4692d633439555c36510", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and processor-to-controller breach notice; does not concern providing information/communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "High-level principle (transparency, honesty); no concrete duty to provide the specified information/communications."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality/minimization/retention; not about providing information or communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Relates to disclosure/transfer to processors; not about data-subject information/communications."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations and safeguards; no specific duty to provide the listed information/communications."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial procedures for exercising rights; does not itself impose on controllers the duty to provide the specified information/communications."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions; not about the controller’s duty to provide information/communications."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no operative duty relevant to providing information/communications."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد", "article": "Article 14"}, "action": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد. ... استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة لتمكين الأفراد من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر.", "article": "Article 11"}, "scope": {"span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: ... 4- أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية ولازمة لاستيفاء شروط معالجة البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 9"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كان من شأن ذلك إحداث ضرر جسيم بالبيانات الشخصية أو بخصوصية الفرد.", "article": "Article 14"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "article": "Article 9"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "صياغات إلزامية مثل \"يجب\" و\"على\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Articles 11, 14"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "take appropriate measures to provide to the data subject the information and communications specified", "target_value": "إعلام الفرد بمعلومات أساسية قبل المعالجة، ووضع نظم داخلية وتمكين تقني لطلبات الوصول/التصحيح/الحذف، وإعلام الفرد بحدوث إخلال بالاحتياطات في حالات معينة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Articles 9, 11, 14"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "any information referred to in Articles 13 and 14 and any communication under Articles 15 to 22 and 34 relating to processing", "target_value": "معلومات ما قبل المعالجة (تعريف بالمراقب والأغراض ووصف المعالجة)، وتمكين طلبات الوصول والتصحيح والحذف فقط، وإعلام عن الإخلال عند توافر ضرر جسيم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Articles 9, 11(4)(6), 14"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إعلام الفرد بالإخلال مشروط بوجود ضرر جسيم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 14"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated for these duties in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "توقيت محدد لإعطاء المعلومات قبل بدء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "The Qatari law imposes duties to inform individuals pre‑processing (Art. 9), to establish systems and technological means enabling access/correction/deletion (Art. 11), and to notify individuals of certain breaches (Art. 14). However, it lacks counterparts for several GDPR rights communications (e.g., restriction, portability, objection, automated decisions) and conditions breach notice on severe harm, so the coverage of GDPR Art. 12(1)’s scope is narrower. This directly addresses the objection: there is partial, not full, counterpart to Arts. 15–22 and a conditional counterpart to Art. 34.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-047", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 11}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'scope' slot is not entirely supported by the provisions cited.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 13", "span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية من الضياع أو التلف أو التعديل أو الإفشاء، أو الوصول إليها، أو استخدامها بشكل عارض أو غير مشروع.", "why": "This article is not cited by the analyst for the 'scope' slot, but it is relevant for determining the scope of the information to be provided to the data subject."}, {"id": "Article 11(4) and (6)", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد. استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة لتمكين الأفراد من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر.", "why": "These provisions mention the controller's obligation to provide information to the data subject, but the scope of this information is not clearly defined."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari provisions do not fully cover the scope of the GDPR, and there is no direct counterpart to Articles 15-22 and 34.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي:", "why": "This article only requires the controller to inform the data subject about certain information before processing their personal data, but does not fully cover the scope of the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 11", "span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "why": "This article requires the controller to take various measures to protect personal data, but does not directly counterpart Articles 15-22 and 34 of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 11, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "455aae046cacf7979576", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "f5c366135483fe580381", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 681.55, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "5d4494660345a2105218", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service information and consent obligations; does not establish a right to object nor address direct marketing or profiling."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing and consent; no provision on a data subject right to object, and no direct marketing context."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Security, records, and governance obligations; does not provide a right to object nor address direct marketing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم", "article": "Art. 4(6)"}, "modality": {"span": "تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم", "article": "Art. 4(6)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجتها", "article": "Art. 4(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "على معالجتها", "article": "Art. 4(8)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "المستخدمين (صاحب البيانات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "تمكين المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم + وجود آلية للاعتراض", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6); Art. 4(8)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "object to processing of personal data for direct marketing", "target_value": "الاعتراض على معالجتها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(8)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing for direct marketing purposes, including profiling related to such direct marketing", "target_value": "أي معالجة للبيانات الشخصية (غير مخصصة بالتسويق المباشر)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 4(8)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where personal data are processed for direct marketing purposes", "target_value": "لا شرط غائي مذكور (الاعتراض عام وغير مقيد بالتسويق)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا استثناءات منصوص عليها", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at any time", "target_value": "غير منصوص عليه للاعتراض", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص عليه", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Art. 4(8) creates a general right to object to processing, which functionally covers objections to direct marketing, but it does not expressly tie the objection to ‘direct marketing’ or profiling. The GDPR’s temporal element (‘at any time’) is not stated. Marketing is mentioned elsewhere (Art. 4(11)) in a consent context, not as an objection right.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-180", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claims are not entirely supported by the provisions, and some citations are incomplete or misleading.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8)", "why": "The citation only mentions 'objection to processing' without specifying direct marketing or profiling."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8)", "why": "The citation only mentions 'processing' without specifying the scope."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "Article 3", "why": "The article mentions conditions for the lawfulness of processing, which contradicts the analyst's claim that there is no condition for the right to object."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8)", "why": "The citation mentions a mechanism for accessing, correcting, or deleting personal data, which could be interpreted as a temporal limitation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement, particularly with regards to the scope and condition of the right to object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8): \"أو الاعتراض على معالجتها\"", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention 'direct marketing purposes' or 'profiling related to such marketing', which are essential elements of the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(11): \"الحصول على موافقة صاحب البيانات قبل الكشف عن بياناته الشخصية لأي طرف ثالث لأغراض تسويقية لا تتعلق مباشرة بتوفير خدمات الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات التي يطلبها المستخدم\"", "why": "This provision mentions 'أغراض تسويقية' (marketing purposes), but it does not explicitly mention the right to object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes, including profiling."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 653.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a11e0be06b5d6aa7fb5f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Addresses public registers and necessity for that context; does not concern research/historical/statistical safeguards or data-minimisation-linked measures."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Defines DPO roles; not about safeguards for research/historical/statistical processing or data minimisation measures."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Sets authority powers; no operative safeguard or minimisation requirement for the specified processing contexts."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Regulates cross-border transfer contracts; not about Article 89-type safeguards or data minimisation."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification to authority; no link to technical/organizational safeguards for research/historical/statistical processing."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definition of Privacy by Design; supportive concept but no specific obligation tying T&O measures to data minimisation in the Article 89 contexts."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Supervision of DPOs; not about controller safeguards or data minimisation."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers' arrangements; not about data-minimisation safeguards for research/historical/statistical processing."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality obligations of the authority; irrelevant to controller safeguards or data minimisation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية", "article": "Article 2"}, "modality": {"span": "يراعَى بشأن البيانات الشخصية التي تتم معالجتها ما يأتي:", "article": "Article 3"}, "action": {"span": "أن تكون كافية وذات صلة وغير مفرطة بالنظر للغرض من جمْعها أو الذي تمت المعالجة اللاحقة لأجله.", "article": "Article 3(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "المعالَجة اللاحقة لها التي تتم حصراً لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي", "article": "Article 3(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "وتُحفَظ البيانات التي يتم تخزينها لفترات أطول لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي في صورة مجهولة بتحويرها ... ويتعيَّن إنْ تعذَّر ذلك تشفير هوية أصحابها.", "article": "Article 3(5)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controllers", "target_value": "مدير البيانات (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2: \"على مدير البيانات الالتزام...\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Normative 'shall be observed' formulation for data processing qualities", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3: \"يراعَى بشأن البيانات الشخصية...\"; Article 3(5): \"ويتعيَّن...\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "ensure technical and organisational measures are in place to respect the principle of data minimisation", "target_value": "Principle of data minimisation (\"غير مفرطة\") and specific technical safeguard (anonymisation or identity encryption) for research/historical/scientific retention; general T&O measures obligation exists but is framed for security", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3(3); Article 3(5); Article 2(3); Article 8(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "safeguards for processing under Article 89(1)", "target_value": "Subsequent processing and longer storage for historical, statistical, or scientific research purposes", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(2) and 3(5)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "when applying safeguards for processing for archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes", "target_value": "When storing data for longer periods for historical, statistical, or scientific research, apply anonymisation or, if not possible, encrypt identities", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(5)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal element specified beyond 'longer storage' context", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "While the Bahraini law does not expressly tie technical/organizational measures to ‘respecting data minimisation,’ it contains (a) an explicit minimisation duty (Art 3(3)) and (b) specific technical safeguards (anonymisation or identity encryption) when processing/storing for historical, statistical, or scientific research (Art 3(5)). These provisions functionally cover key aspects of GDPR Art 89(1) safeguards, but they omit an explicit linkage to minimisation and do not mention archiving in the public interest, hence a partial match.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-965", "gdpr_article": 89, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly support the analyst's claims regarding data minimization.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[7e2914aa34ab2739dafd]", "span": "Article 8", "why": "The article only mentions protection of data from unauthorized access, destruction, or alteration, but not data minimization."}, {"id": "[7448a27e7806f2c0c143]", "span": "Article 3", "why": "The article only mentions the need for data to be 'كافية وذات صلة وغير مفرطة' (sufficient, relevant, and not excessive), which may not be equivalent to the principle of data minimization."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Bahraini law does not explicitly cover the GDPR requirement of ensuring technical and organizational measures to respect the principle of data minimization.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 2", "span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات من الإتلاف غير المقصود أو غير المصرَّح به", "why": "Article 2 mentions technical and organizational measures for security, but not data minimization."}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "أن تكون كافية وذات صلة وغير مفرطة", "why": "Article 3 mentions sufficient, relevant, and not excessive data, but it is not a direct equivalent of data minimization."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 675.66, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "8fdee5b493274beba431", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Administrative complaint and ministerial review process; no rule on courts staying proceedings or coordination with other states' courts."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Substantive exemptions for controllers (including compliance with a court order); does not address judicial case management or stays."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from disclosing reasons for denying data-subject rights; unrelated to court procedures."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Further exemptions regarding disclosure impacts; no provision on judicial stays or related proceedings."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Empowers officials with judicial-police authority to detect offenses; not about civil/administrative court proceedings or stays."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial regulation of rights-exercise procedures; no judicial stay mechanism."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; not about courts or proceedings."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Restricts controllers from limiting cross-border data flows; no court stay or related-proceedings rule."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Authorizes special processing for public interests (security, etc.); no court coordination provision."}, {"id": "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "reason": "Penalties for violations; no procedural rule for courts."}, {"id": "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "reason": "Nullity of contracts contrary to the law; no linkage to judicial stays."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Implementing decisions by the minister; no court-related content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "any court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "stay its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "related proceedings are pending before a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.93, "reasoning_note": "All provided Qatari provisions concern data protection administration, rights, exemptions, and penalties. None establish or imply a rule allowing a court to stay proceedings due to related proceedings in another state. The requirement is outside the subject matter of the target texts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1010", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "9548224453cca1301899"], "n_llm_calls": 3, "latency_s": 212.39, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "49cfa0d07a2529838597", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Addresses withdrawal of consent procedures, not the presentation or distinguishability of consent within a multi-topic written declaration."}, {"id": "0269f42c0015a544c475", "reason": "Marketing-specific consent conditions and unsubscribe mechanics; does not impose a general requirement to distinguish consent requests within multi-topic written declarations."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "Sets the baseline that consent is generally required and defers to regulations for conditions; does not address how consent must be presented within documents covering other matters."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Concerns right to erasure and related duties; not about consent request presentation."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Right-to-be-informed disclosures (e.g., purposes, optional/mandatory) concern transparency, not the formatting/distinguishability of consent requests within combined written declarations."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Regulates controller–processor arrangements; unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "reason": "Sets limits on disclosure in specific circumstances; not about consent presentation."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Controller–processor selection duty; unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "reason": "Lists alternative legal bases where consent is not required; not about how consent must be presented when sought."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Regulates conditions for disclosure; not the presentation of consent requests."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لِجِهَةِ التَّحَكُّمِ الحُصُولُ عَلَى مُوَافَقَةِ صَاحِبِ البَيَانَاتِ الشَّخْصِيَّةِ", "article": "Article 11(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "عَلَى أَنْ يُشْتَرَطَ فِي المُوَافَقَةِ مَا يَأْتِي:", "article": "Article 11(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أَنْ تَكُونَ هُنَاكَ مُوَافَقَةٌ مُسْتَقِلَّةٌ لِكُلِّ غَرَضٍ مِنْ أَغْرَاضِ المُعَالَجَةِ.", "article": "Article 11(1)(هـ)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يشترط في الموافقة ما يأتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in a manner clearly distinguishable from other matters", "target_value": "أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11(1)(هـ); Article 7"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 11 requires clarity (specified purposes, no misleading) and independent consent per purpose, and Article 7 prohibits tying consent to unrelated services—these support clarity and anti-bundling but do not mandate that, when consent appears inside a broader written declaration, the consent request be made clearly distinguishable from other matters. The cited “explicit consent” text in Article 11(2) applies only in certain cases and speaks to the nature of consent, not its formatting within multi-topic documents. Hence, alignment is only partial and the specific presentational duty of GDPR Art. 7(2) is not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-018", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provisions imply a need for clarity and specificity in consent requests, which partially aligns with the GDPR requirement for distinguishability within written declarations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "الموافقة صريحة", "why": "Implies a need for clarity in consent."}, {"id": "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "span": "لا يجوز أن تكون الموافقة المشار إليها في الفقرة (1) من المادة (الخامسة) من النظام شرطاً لإسداء خدمة أو تقديم منفعة", "why": "Suggests consent should not be bundled with other agreements unless related to the data processing."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "0269f42c0015a544c475", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 490.26, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3eb08ec75f9188850fe8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "e38e0bed35316765ba57"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Defines Data Protection Officer duties and interactions; does not impose an obligation on the supervisory authority to provide written advice after prior consultation."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Concerns timelines for DPO registration decisions; unrelated to supervisory authority advice on intended processing."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Governs data subject right to object; no supervisory authority advisory duty."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Concerns external DPO registration timelines; not about supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "reason": "Sets enforcement measures upon proven violations; not advisory timelines or duties."}, {"id": "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "reason": "Relates to notifying parties of investigation reports; not prior consultation or advisory duties."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security obligations for controllers/processors; no supervisory authority advisory duty."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rights to correction/blocking/erasure; no supervisory authority advisory duty."}, {"id": "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "reason": "Data subject right to object to direct marketing; unrelated to supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "reason": "DPO appointment rules; not about supervisory authority advice to controllers/processors."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "modality": {"span": "للهيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار أن تطلب", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(4)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "للهيئة ... أن تطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 14(4)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "provide written advice to the controller and, where applicable, the processor", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "intended processing referred to in paragraph 1", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where the supervisory authority is of the opinion that the intended processing would infringe the GDPR, in particular where the controller has insufficiently identified or mitigated the risk", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "within up to eight weeks of receipt of the request for consultation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "The Bahrain PDPL excerpts provide for pre-processing notifications and allow the Authority to request completion, but they do not require the Authority to provide written advice to the controller/processor, nor do they set an eight-week timeline for such advice. No infringement-based trigger or equivalent prior consultation mechanism is expressed in the cited provisions.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-416", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "074363ee1a72941c8326", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "c24849787475f274ecac", "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 327.37, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "869c12c808b4f35b416a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "Sets general principles of processing (privacy, transparency, dignity) but does not impose identifier-specific safeguards or a condition tied to identifiers."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; unrelated to using identifiers under safeguards."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Lists exemptions from certain obligations; no rule about identifiers or safeguards for their use."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Execution/publication clause; no substantive rule on identifiers or safeguards."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exempts from a disclosure obligation in limited cases; not about identifier processing or safeguards."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no operative safeguards specific to identifiers."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest derogations; not about safeguards for national IDs or general identifiers."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosing/transferring to a processor; not about identifiers or a safeguards-only-use rule."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow constraint; does not regulate identifiers or require safeguards for their use."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal governance and oversight measures; while protective, it does not establish the identifier-specific safeguard condition."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedures for exercising rights; no identifier-specific safeguards or conditional trigger."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي:", "article": "Article 8"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعين", "article": "Article 8"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controllers", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يتعين (mandatory)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "use national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application only under appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of the data subject", "target_value": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "use/processing of national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية (all personal data; no mention of national IDs or general identifiers)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 8", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where a Member State has determined specific conditions for processing such identifiers", "target_value": "No condition regarding state-determined specific conditions for processing identifiers", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed for this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Qatar’s law imposes a general obligation on controllers to adopt appropriate safeguards for personal data, which can functionally protect data subjects. However, it does not specifically regulate national identification numbers or other general identifiers, nor does it include the conditional trigger where specific conditions for processing such identifiers have been determined. Therefore, the identifier-specific and conditional elements of GDPR Art. 87 remain uncovered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-959", "gdpr_article": 87, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 9}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 12}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'condition' slot is incorrect, as Article 8 of the Qatari law mentions that the controller should take measures according to what is determined by the competent authority.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة", "why": "This phrase suggests that the Qatari law allows the competent authority to determine specific conditions for processing personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully account for the specific conditions and identifiers mentioned in the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision mentions appropriate safeguards, but does not explicitly address national identification numbers or the condition for processing."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة", "why": "This provision mentions the competent authority, but does not exactly match the condition in the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "f5c366135483fe580381", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "a200ece03fd0ba143354"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 540.58, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "085947fc6c548ced90a3", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing; no duty to inform other controllers/third parties about erasure."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual clauses; does not impose post-erasure notification to other controllers."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions; no substantive rule on notifying other controllers upon erasure."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Supervision/inspection of DPOs; not about erasure-related notifications."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Authority powers; no controller obligation to inform other controllers after erasure."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Public registers; not about notifying other controllers to erase."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent; unrelated to notifying other controllers upon erasure."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Definitions (decision); no operative duty relevant to RU-027."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; no duty to notify third parties post-erasure."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Access/right to be informed of processing; not about informing other controllers following erasure."}, {"id": "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "reason": "Procedures to register external DPO; irrelevant to RU-027."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات ... إخطار", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "exception": {"span": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً -", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Obligatory phrasing: \"على مدير البيانات ... إخطار\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "take reasonable steps to inform controllers processing the personal data that the data subject has requested those controllers erase any links to, or copies or replications of, the personal data", "target_value": "Notify any third party to whom the controller disclosed the data about the rectification/erasure/blocking that was carried out", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "taking account of available technology and the cost of implementation; steps may include technical measures", "target_value": "Feasibility carveout: \"مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال\"; no reference to technology/cost or to technical measures", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the controller has made the personal data public and is obliged under paragraph 1 to erase the personal data", "target_value": "Trigger: after the controller has responded (in whole or in part) to a rectification/erasure/blocking request under Art. 23(1) and where third parties were recipients", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Paragraphs 1 and 2 do not apply where processing is necessary for freedom of expression/information; legal obligation/public interest/official authority; public health; archiving/research/statistics; legal claims", "target_value": "Exception for impossibility or where it cannot be achieved (feasibility-based)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Within 15 working days of responding to the request", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 23(5)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified in the provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Art. 23(5) creates an obligation on the controller to notify third-party recipients after rectification/erasure/blocking, but it does not require informing those parties of the data subject’s request that they erase their links/copies, nor does it reference technology/cost or technical measures. The feasibility clause (\"مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال\") conceptually mirrors a reasonableness limit, partially addressing the reviewer’s counter-evidence. However, the GDPR’s specific trigger (data made public) and enumerated exceptions are not reflected in the Bahraini text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-027", "gdpr_article": 8, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no analogous qualifier (no technology/cost or technical measures language) in the target jurisdiction is unsupported.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "ويجب أن تكفل هذه التدابير توفير مستوى مناسب من الأمان بمراعاة ما وصلت إليه أحدث أساليب الحماية التقنية، والتكلفة المترتبة على ذلك، وطبيعة البيانات موضوع المعالجة، والمخاطر التي قد تنشأ من هذه المعالجة.", "why": "This provision provides a qualifier related to technology and cost, which contradicts the analyst's claim."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision in Article 23(5) does not explicitly mention the obligation to take reasonable steps to inform controllers processing the data, and the exception clause could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال", "why": "The exception clause in Article 23(5) could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement of taking reasonable steps to inform controllers processing the data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "7e54d45e18f8371cc670"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 625.47, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f765a5f403d44e78f993", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
