n states that these authorities must monitor application of the law.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-662", "gdpr_article": 57, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The presence of supervisory authorities, obligations, and territorial scope in the UAE provisions suggests a stronger alignment with GDPR requirements than initially assessed.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "11", "span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات التأكد من مدى امتثال المتحكم أو المعالج بتنفيذ أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Implies oversight and compliance responsibilities, potentially covering the 'monitor the application' aspect."}, {"id": "7(6)", "span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Indicates the presence of a supervisory authority and its role in overseeing compliance."}, {"id": "27", "span": "في نطاق اختصاصها المحلي", "why": "Suggests territorial responsibilities for authorities."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart to GDPR requirement exists in Article 11", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات التأكد من مدى امتثال المتحكم أو المعالج بتنفيذ أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Describes the data protection officer's role in monitoring compliance with the regulation"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "0cc06e3d3b107448d