.58, "reasoning_note": "I considered Article 27’s reference to coordination to encourage and develop self-regulation as a potential conceptual counterpart to codes of conduct, but it neither grants controllers/processors permission to adhere to codes nor establishes approval/general validity mechanisms or use as transfer safeguards. I also reviewed Article 2’s household/statistical scope exclusions, which do not correspond to the GDPR addressee of controllers/processors not subject to the GDPR. Article 15 touches cross-border flows but does not provide safeguards via codes of conduct.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-487", "gdpr_article": 40, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 11}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdict for 'action' and 'condition' is incorrect, and Article 27 provides some evidence for the existence of a counterpart.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "التنسيق ... بهدف تشجيع وتطوير التنظيم الذاتي", "why": "This provision mentions self-regulation, which could be related to codes of conduct."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient evidence for uncovered slots and potential counterparts under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "التنسيق ... بهدف تشجيع وتطوير التنظيم الذاتي", "why": "Potential match for action slot, but unclear if related to code of conduct approval or general validity"}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "span": "البيانات الشخصية التي يقوم الأفراد بمعالجتها في نطاق شخصي أو عائلي", "why": "Potential counterpart for addressee slot, but unclear if directly related to controllers or processors not subject to the GDPR"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["dce663972f2d5e58176e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "75852a697f66691bfbfb"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 550.6, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "16fe48517ccb67a81fce", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "Auditing/verification obligation; does not set territorial or establishment-based applicability."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "Details for appointing external auditor; no bearing on territorial scope or establishment condition."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Policy transparency duty; not about applicability based on establishment or location."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualifications in bylaw; unrelated to territorial scope/applicability."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO appointment duty; not addressing establishment/location condition."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Cooperation with authority; does not define when the law applies."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Record-keeping obligation; not about territorial scope or establishment."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Record retention specifics (bylaw); not about territorial scope/applicability."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Bylaw definitions; no establishment/territorial trigger expressed."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subjects; not about territorial scope/applicability."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 15"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 15"}, "action": {"span": "بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 15"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 15"}, "condition": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller or processor with an establishment in the Union", "target": "المتحكم والمعالج (controller and processor) without an establishment qualifier", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 15", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم (is obligated)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "comply with this Regulation for the processing of personal data", "target": "الالتزام بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة لضمان المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing of personal data", "target": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "processing in the context of the activities of an establishment of the controller or the processor in the Union, regardless of where the processing takes place", "target": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية (when processing personal data); no mention of establishment or location", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13; Article 15", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.46, "reasoning_note": "Articles 13 and 15 impose obligations tied to the occurrence of processing personal data, which partially aligns with a processing-context trigger. However, they do not articulate the GDPR’s specific applicability condition based on the activities of an establishment in a territory or the ‘regardless of location’ reach. Thus, the condition slot is only partially covered, not fully.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-008", "gdpr_article": 3, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement is not entirely accurate, as the target jurisdiction's law has provisions that imply a similar condition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This provision implies that the controller and processor must comply with certain controls and procedures when processing personal data, which could be interpreted as being in the context of their activities."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية، ويجب أن تشتمل على وجه الخصوص الآتي: أ- تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة.", "why": "This provision implies that the controller must establish controls and procedures when processing personal data, which could be related to the concept of 'establishment' in the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "span": "المنشأة", "why": "This definition of 'establishment' could be related to the concept of 'establishment' in the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot is not entirely uncovered, as provisions like Article 13 and Article 15 could be interpreted as covering it to some extent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies that the processing of personal data must be carried out in accordance with certain controls and procedures, which could be related to the condition slot."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة", "why": "This provision implies that the processing of personal data must be carried out in accordance with the controls and procedures determined by the Ministry, which could be interpreted as covering the condition slot to some extent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "caad155111190c1aa274", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 622.03, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b46d08fccfe56109dad3", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; does not address security measures or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification obligations; not about implementing security measures like pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "8df6b1810850e58a6a30", "reason": "Definitions section; no operative duty to include pseudonymisation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة ... أن يقوم بجمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية:", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة ... بما في ذلك الأمور التالية: 1.1. معالجة وتشفير البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية للمستخدم", "article": "Article 5"}, "condition": {"span": "ويجب أن تكون هذه التدابير ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته وحساسية أي بيانات شخصية يتم جمعها وتخزينها", "article": "Article 5"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Use of mandatory terms: \"يجب\" / \"على ...\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4; Article 5"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "include pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures", "target": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة ... بما في ذلك: معالجة وتشفير البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 5 (1, 1.1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "personal data processed", "target": "البيانات الشخصية للمستخدم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "as appropriate to the risk", "target": "ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته وحساسية أي بيانات شخصية يتم جمعها وتخزينها", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No temporal qualification", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "Article 5 mandates appropriate security measures and explicitly mentions encryption, but it does not mention pseudonymisation. Encryption is listed as a measure, which is not the same as an obligation to include pseudonymisation “as appropriate.” Therefore, the specific GDPR element (pseudonymisation) remains textually unexpressed in KWT.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-317", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions, especially Article 5, imply the use of technical measures for data protection that could encompass pseudonymisation, suggesting a need to reconsider the 'uncovered' verdict for the action slot.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "معالجة وتشفير البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies the use of technical measures for data protection, which could include pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته وحساسية أي بيانات شخصية", "why": "This suggests a flexible and risk-based approach to data protection, potentially including pseudonymisation for sensitive data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit mention of pseudonymisation in the KWT jurisdiction", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "معالجة وتشفير البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision mentions processing and encrypting personal data, but does not explicitly mention pseudonymisation"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "8df6b1810850e58a6a30"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 612.55, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "4d55c7a6167509ca13fe", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["a023625d7c33737b6c29", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "5483caf68765f09059fb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "Generic obligation to follow ministry rules; does not specifically require maintaining a processing-activities record."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Cooperation/provision of documents upon request; tangential to maintaining a record."}, {"id": "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "reason": "Requires a breach log in a specific register; not the general record of processing activities."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "External auditor access to records; does not establish the duty to maintain the record."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment/reporting; unrelated to maintaining a processing-activities record."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Internal controls/procedures for processing; does not address maintaining a processing-activities record."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Confidentiality and security measures; not about maintaining a processing-activities record."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Submission of a data protection policy for licensing; not the record of processing activities."}, {"id": "d149914917d14049d367", "reason": "Generic duty to provide documents within 30 days; does not create/define the record-keeping obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 29"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 29"}, "action": {"span": "تحديث سجل أنشطة المعالجة", "article": "Article 29"}, "scope": {"span": "سجل أنشطة المعالجة", "article": "Article 29"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "بشكل مستمر", "article": "Article 29"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "maintain a record of processing activities under its responsibility", "target_value": "تحديث سجل أنشطة المعالجة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29; Article 17; Article 27"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing activities under the controller's responsibility", "target_value": "سجل أنشطة المعالجة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "shall not apply to organisations with fewer than 250 employees unless risk, not occasional, or includes special categories", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "بشكل مستمر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 29"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "OMN law explicitly requires controllers to keep and continuously update a record of processing activities and to retain processing-operation documents, functionally covering the GDPR maintenance requirement. However, no small-entity exception comparable to GDPR Art. 30(5) is expressed. The OMN text also adds a continuous-update temporal element.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-253", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "a023625d7c33737b6c29", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "d149914917d14049d367"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 324.91, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b25f1b2fd18bb3ab8e48", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "candidates_excluded": [], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للهيئة", "article": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"}, "modality": {"span": "للهيئة ... تطبيق", "article": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014 لإنشاء الهيئة العامة للاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات والمعدل بالقانون رقم (98) لسنة 2015", "article": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"}, "scope": {"span": "تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة والذين يعملون على جمع ومعالجة وتخزين البيانات الشخصية ومحتوى بيانات المستخدم كلياً أو جزئياً، سواء بشكل دائم أو مؤقت بالوسائل الآلية أو بأي وسائل أخرى والتي تشكل جزءاً من نظام حفظ البيانات، سواء تمت المعالجة داخل دولة الكويت أو خارجها.", "article": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت", "article": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"}, "exception": {"span": "ولا تطبق أحكام هذه اللائحة على الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ورصد المخالفات أو الممارسات المخالفة للقوانين والقرارات والأحكام القضائية والمطالبات المالية الناشئة عن عقد الاشتراك", "article": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "Member States", "target": "الهيئة (الجهة المختصة)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57: \"للهيئة\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "permission/competence (للهيئة ... تطبيق)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57: \"للهيئة ... تطبيق\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "take all measures necessary to ensure that the penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are implemented", "target": "تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014 ... والمعدل بالقانون رقم (98) لسنة 2015", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57: \"تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014 ...\"", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f: \"تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم ...\"", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57: \"في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "ولا تطبق أحكام هذه اللائحة على الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ورصد المخالفات ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f: \"ولا تطبق أحكام هذه اللائحة على الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ...\"", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(3) gives the Authority discretionary power to apply existing penalties, which is weaker than an obligation on the state to take all necessary measures to ensure implementation. The framework is sectoral and conditioned on violations, and Article 1 introduces explicit exclusions, narrowing coverage compared to the GDPR unit. Hence the match is partial and weaker/narrower overall.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-949", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 2}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'weaker_modality' is not supported by the provision Article 7(3)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "للهيئة في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام هذه اللائحة أو قوانين دولة الكويت تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات المنصوص عليها بالقانون رقم 37 لسنة 2014", "why": "The modality of this sentence is obligation, as indicated by the word 'تطبيق' (taṭbīq), which is a strong modal verb"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "inaccurate slot verdicts and potential counterparts for exception slot", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة", "why": "broader addressee than الهيئة"}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "للهيئة ... تطبيق", "why": "obligation for authority to apply penalties"}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "تطبيق الجزاءات والغرامات", "why": "similar action to GDPR's requirement"}, {"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "span": "الممارسات المتعلقة بالتحريات الأمنية ورصد المخالفات أو الممارسات المخالفة للقوانين والقرارات والأحكام القضائية والمطالبات المالية الناشئة عن عقد الاشتراك", "why": "potential counterpart for exception slot"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 2, "candidate_ids": ["9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 526.37, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "390392e66f4897dbe0c9", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "General processing principles/consent; does not establish a right to receive/port data or specify format/conditions."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Obligation to publish a data protection policy and rights-exercise mechanisms; no substantive portability or format rule."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; not about receiving/porting data or its format/conditions."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "DPO contact information; no bearing on the data copy/portability right itself."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Controller authorization filing; unrelated to a data subject’s right to receive/port data."}, {"id": "a3d16e47b198e1ecb3c6", "reason": "Consent requirements generally; does not specify conditions for the portability/copy right."}, {"id": "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "reason": "Direct marketing consent; irrelevant to portability/copy format."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 19"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 19"}, "action": {"span": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية المعالجة / بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية / نقل بياناته الشخصية إلى متحكم آخر", "article": "Article 11(c), Article 19, Article 20"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية المعالجة ... بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية، شريطة التأكد من خلو النسخة التي قدمها من أي بيانات شخصية تحدد هوية شخص آخر", "article": "Article 11(c), Article 19"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "شريطة التأكد من خلو النسخة التي قدمها من أي بيانات شخصية تحدد هوية شخص آخر / لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: أ- حماية الأمن الوطني، أو المصلحة العامة. ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً ...", "article": "Article 19; Article 3"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 19"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق / يكون له الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 11", "Article 19"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "receive the personal data provided to a controller in a structured, commonly used and machine-readable format", "target_value": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية المعالجة بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية؛ ونقل بياناته إلى متحكم آخر", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["Article 11", "Article 19", "Article 20"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "Personal data provided by the data subject; format must be structured, commonly used and machine-readable; exercise without prejudice to Article 17; must not adversely affect others’ rights", "target_value": "نسخة من بياناته الشخصية المعالجة؛ بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية؛ مع استبعاد أي بيانات تحدد هوية شخص آخر", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["Article 11", "Article 19"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Processing based on consent or contract and carried out by automated means", "target_value": "لا يُشترط أساس قانوني محدد (موافقة/عقد) ولا الطابع الآلي لممارسة الحق", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "No right where processing is necessary for a task in the public interest or under official authority; and exercise must not adversely affect rights and freedoms of others", "target_value": "استبعاد بيانات تحدد هوية شخص آخر عند تزويد النسخة؛ كما لا تسري أحكام القانون (ومن ثم الحقوق) على معالجات للمصلحة العامة أو لتنفيذ اختصاصات رسمية وغيرها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ["Article 19", "Article 3"], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 19 grants only a copy in a “readable and clear electronic or paper” format and does not require a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format. The Omani texts do not condition the right on consent/contract or automated processing; portability to another controller exists (Arts. 11(d), 20) but the controller’s transfer duty is only when legally obliged. Exceptions are covered via third-party data exclusion (Art. 19) and general scope carve-outs including public interest/official authority (Art. 3), not as a tailored portability exception.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-174", "gdpr_article": 20, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully support the analyst's verdict, particularly with regards to the format of the personal data and the conditions for processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 19", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أن يطلب من المتحكم نسخة من بياناته الشخصية المعالجة بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية", "why": "The article does not explicitly mention that the format must be 'structured, commonly used and machine-readable' as required by the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 20", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أن ينقل بياناته الشخصية إلى متحكم جديد، على أن يقوم المتحكم بنقل البيانات الشخصية للمتحكم الجديد إذا كان ملزماً قانوناً بذلك", "why": "The article only allows data transfer if the original controller is legally obliged to do so, which is not an explicit condition in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not fully support the analyst's conclusions regarding the modality, action, condition, and exception slots, particularly concerning the specific format and conditions under which personal data can be received.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 19", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أن يطلب من المتحكم نسخة من بياناته الشخصية المعالجة بصيغة مقروءة وواضحة إلكترونية أو ورقية", "why": "Does not explicitly mention 'structured, commonly used, and machine-readable format'."}, {"id": "Article 20", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أن ينقل بياناته الشخصية إلى متحكم جديد", "why": "Does not directly address the condition of processing based on consent or contract and automated means."}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية", "why": "Lists exceptions but does not directly link to the right to receive data in a specific format under these exceptions."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "a3d16e47b198e1ecb3c6", "26ab9db083b17ff619f2"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 675.39, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "00704901cb2d1caf5ae0", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Concerns authority decision timelines for registering an internal data protection officer; not about controller responses to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Concerns authority decision timelines for registering an external data protection officer; not about controller responses to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "reason": "Notification to interested parties about an investigation report by the authority; unrelated to data-subject rights requests or controller reply deadlines."}, {"id": "d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "reason": "Annual reporting by the authority; not about data-subject request handling."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Defines DPO functions and reporting; no timelines or duties to inform data subjects about rights requests."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "DPO disciplinary investigation; not about controller responses to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "61761ad6643b2051eebd", "reason": "Duration of entry in the DPO register; not about data-subject request handling."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Contractual clauses for cross-border transfers; not about informing data subjects of action on their rights requests."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 20(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 20(2)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار صاحب البيانات، دون مقابل، خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلبه بأيٍّ مما يأتي: أ - ما إذا كان قد استجاب للطلب... ج - رفْض الطلب وسبب ذلك.", "article": "Article 20(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "الحق في الاعتراض على المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر", "article": "Article 20 (title)"}, "condition": {"span": "من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلبه", "article": "Article 20(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلبه", "article": "Article 20(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي حالة عدم قبول صاحب البيانات بما أخطره به مدير البيانات بخصوص ما تم بشأن الطلب، أو انقضاء المدة المشار إليها دون أن يصل إلى صاحب البيانات أيّ إخطار بما تم بشأن طلبه، يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات.", "article": "Article 20(2)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(2)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على مدير البيانات إخطار صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(2)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات بما إذا كان قد استجاب للطلب أو استجاب جزئياً مع بيان السبب ومدى الاستجابة أو رفض الطلب وسبب ذلك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target": "طلبات الاعتراض على المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر، وتمتد بذات الإخطار إلى طلبات المادة 21؛ كما توجد مهلة وإخطار لطلبات المادة 18", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 20(2); Article 21(3); Article 18(1),(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target": "من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلبه / من تاريخ الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(2); Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "لا استثناء منصوص عليه لواجب الإخطار في المادة 20(2)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "without undue delay and in any event within one month of receipt of the request", "target": "خلال عشرة أيام عمل (المادة 20(2))؛ وخلال خمسة عشر يوم عمل (المادة 18(1))", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 20(2); Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "في حال عدم الإخطار أو عدم الرضا عما تم بشأن الطلب، لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 20(2); Article 18(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Bahraini law imposes explicit notification duties with fixed short deadlines (10 or 15 working days) for certain rights requests and extends the Article 20(2) notification model to Article 21, but it does not expressly cover all GDPR Arts. 15–22 and lacks the “without undue delay” qualifier. Thus, it is partially aligned and in some respects narrower in scope and different in temporal formulation.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Inconsistent timeframes for informing the data subject", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20(2)", "span": "within 10 days of receipt of the request", "why": "Timeframe is shorter than the one-month period specified in the GDPR"}, {"id": "Article 18(1)", "span": "within 15 days of receipt of the request", "why": "Timeframe is different from the one-month period specified in the GDPR"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law does not fully align with the GDPR requirement of providing information on action taken on a request without undue delay and in any event within one month of receipt of the request.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20(2)", "span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار صاحب البيانات، دون مقابل، خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلبه", "why": "The provision states that the data manager/controller shall notify the data subject within 10 working days, but does not explicitly state that the notification must be made without undue delay and in any event within one month of receipt of the request."}, {"id": "Article 18(1)", "span": "على مدير البيانات، بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "why": "The provision states that the data manager/controller shall notify the data subject within 15 working days, which is a different deadline than the one stated in Article 20(2)."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["074363ee1a72941c8326", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "d4e35bf9645b0a055e79", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "61761ad6643b2051eebd", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 685.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9e1fa1cc9b39a74bda65", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Addresses the competent administration’s handling of breach notifications and possible actions; no duty for the authority to inform a complainant about judicial remedies."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; does not establish an authority obligation to inform complainants of judicial remedies."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Confidentiality constraints on controllers/processors; unrelated to supervisory authority notifications to complainants or judicial remedies."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Lists Ministry enforcement powers to protect data subjects (warnings, orders, suspensions); contains no requirement to inform a complainant of judicial remedies."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller’s internal controls; no connection to authority informing complainants about judicial remedies."}, {"id": "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "reason": "Scope of the law; no procedural duty on the authority regarding informing complainants."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "reason": "Grants data subjects a right to make requests to the controller and decision timelines; not a complaint to the authority and no duty on the authority to inform about judicial remedies."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification by controller to ministry and data subject; no authority obligation to inform about judicial remedies."}, {"id": "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "reason": "Controller record-keeping on breaches; unrelated to authority informing complainants."}, {"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "Obligation to follow ministry-determined controls; no specific duty to inform complainants of judicial remedies."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Application for processing authorization and DPO policy; no authority–complainant notification duty."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "Publishing DPO contact details and right to contact DPO; does not impose on the authority to inform complainants of judicial remedies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "the supervisory authority with which the complaint has been lodged", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "inform the complainant of the possibility of a judicial remedy pursuant to Article 78", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "if a complaint has been lodged with the supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "The cited provisions show enforcement powers (Article 8) and a data subject’s ability to make requests to the controller (Article 16), but none impose a duty on the supervisory authority to inform a complainant of the availability of a judicial remedy. No provided text references complaints to the authority coupled with an obligation to notify the complainant of court remedies.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-910", "gdpr_article": 77, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's law provides a mechanism for the data owner to submit a complaint and for the Ministry to take action to protect the rights of personal data owners, which may be a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-910].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية: أ- إنذار المتحكم أو المعالج، بالمخالفة التي تقع منه لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision mentions the Ministry taking action to protect the rights of personal data owners, which may be related to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-910]."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية تقديم طلب كتابي للمتحكم لممارسة أي من حقوقه المنصوص عليها في البنود(أ، ب، ج، د، هـ) من المادة (11) من القانون وذلك بدون مقابل", "why": "This provision provides a mechanism for the data owner to submit a complaint, which may be related to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-910]."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32", "caad155111190c1aa274", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "3f916831456908af27d8", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 429.88, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9c67896303f70c5a563e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["c24849787475f274ecac"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Investigatory power to obtain data/documents; does not address certifications or powers over certification bodies."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Operational enforcement staffing (judicial officers); no relation to certification issuance."}, {"id": "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "reason": "Corporate criminal liability; not about supervisory powers over certifications."}, {"id": "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "reason": "Appeals against Authority decisions; procedural and not about ordering certification bodies."}, {"id": "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "reason": "Urgent measures to halt or hide processing; no mention of certification schemes or certification bodies."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of information; unrelated to certification powers."}, {"id": "9536e03a0aa7b4781fc7", "reason": "Ends/cancels DPO registry entries; pertains to DPO registration, not certification schemes or certification bodies."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Data subject objection right; not a supervisory power over certifications."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data exceptions, including prior authorization; not a certification regime or control over certification bodies."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "Conditions for internal DPO registration; unrelated to certification issuance."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Investigating DPO misconduct; not about certification bodies or certifications."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مجلس الإدارة", "article": "Article 55"}, "modality": {"span": "فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً مسبَّباً", "article": "Article 55"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "مجلس الإدارة (الهيئة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 55", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً مسبَّباً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 55", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "order the certification body not to issue a certification", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "certifications under Articles 42 and 43", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the requirements for the certification are not or are no longer met", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "Article 55 empowers the Authority to impose measures (including withdrawing a prior authorization), but the texts do not establish a certification scheme, certification bodies, or a power to order such bodies not to issue certifications. The cited “سحب التصريح المسبق” concerns revoking an Authority-issued prior authorization, and the DPO registry termination concerns DPO registration; neither is a functional counterpart to ordering independent certification bodies about certifications.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-146", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 18, "total": 30}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart provision found in Article 55", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "مع عدم الإخلال بالمسئولية المدنية أو الجنائية، عند ثبوت المخالفة يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة وإزالة أسبابها أو آثارها فوراً أو خلال فترة زمنية يحدِّدها المجلس", "why": "This provision provides a similar power to the supervisory authority to order the cessation of a violation and removal of its causes or effects."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law has a more comprehensive framework for addressing violations and terminating certifications than initially thought.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "سحب التصريح المسبق", "why": "This provision suggests that the council has the power to revoke a certification."}, {"id": "9536e03a0aa7b4781fc7", "span": "ينتهي قيد مراقب حماية البيانات الخارجي أو الداخلي في السجل", "why": "This provision suggests that the BHR law has a mechanism for terminating the registration of a data protection officer."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "9536e03a0aa7b4781fc7", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "c24849787475f274ecac", "0c872442bf005518c094", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 615.01, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "9856ae7663a139cf5fce", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Article 10 mandates appointment of a Data Protection Officer under specified risk/scale triggers; it does not require designating a local representative for non-established entities and expressly allows the DPO to be inside or outside the State."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Article 11 defines DPO roles (including liaising with the office) but does not establish a representative-for-service requirement for controllers/processors not established in the jurisdiction."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Article 12 concerns duties toward the DPO; it does not address designation of a territorial representative."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Article 19 requires providing communication channels to data subjects; it does not mandate appointing a representative."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Article 13 provides access-to-information rights; it does not create a representative appointment obligation."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Article 18 addresses automated decision-making and objections; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Article 16 concerns restriction of processing; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Article 15 concerns rectification/erasure; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Article 6 sets consent conditions; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Article 24 provides a complaint mechanism; it does not establish a representative obligation."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Article 26 provides for administrative penalties; it does not define the underlying representative duty."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Article 3 empowers the office to grant exemptions to small-scale processors; it does not impose a representative-in-jurisdiction appointment analogous to GDPR Art. 27."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller or processor to whom Article 3(2) GDPR applies", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "designate in writing a representative established in the Union", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "representation for processing activities to which Article 3(2) applies", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "Where Article 3(2) GDPR applies", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "Does not apply where (a) the processing is occasional, does not include large-scale processing of special categories of data or of data on criminal convictions and offences, and is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons; or (b) the controller or processor is a public authority or body.", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided UAE provisions require controllers/processors not established in the jurisdiction to designate a local representative, nor do they mirror GDPR Art. 27’s triggers or exceptions. Articles 10–12 concern DPOs (who may be inside or outside the State) and do not function as territorial representatives, and Article 3 provides exemption powers rather than imposing a representative obligation. The reviewer’s cited provisions therefore do not supply a counterpart to GDPR Art. 27.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-220", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C5 may be incorrect, as Article 10 of the UAE law discusses the appointment of a data protection officer, which could be considered similar to the concept of designating a representative in the Union.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This provision discusses the appointment of a data protection officer, which could be seen as a similar concept to designating a representative in the Union."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct counterpart to GDPR's Article 3(2) regarding designation of a representative in the Union", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "Article 10(1)", "why": "Does not explicitly address designation of a representative in the Union"}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "span": "Article 3", "why": "Grants exemption authority, but does not provide a clear counterpart to GDPR's Article 3(2)"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 645.85, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "393f825aff29b89c8ce9", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal case data; not about proceedings against the supervisory authority or forum/venue."}, {"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "International data transfer exceptions; no rule on bringing proceedings against the authority."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "General lawful processing bases; no litigation or forum provisions."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/blocking/erasure vis-à-vis controllers; not proceedings against the authority."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Automated decision-making objections; unrelated to venue for actions against the authority."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Data Protection Officer provisions; no forum for actions against the authority."}, {"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "reason": "Complaints to the authority (administrative); not judicial proceedings against the authority or venue."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Definitions in an implementing decision; no venue or proceedings rule."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Transfers to adequate countries; no litigation forum provisions."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Direct marketing objection notice; unrelated to proceedings against the authority."}, {"id": "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "reason": "Ministerial oversight of the authority; not person-initiated proceedings or venue."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لكل ذي شأن", "article": "Art. 34(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "لكل ذي شأن، بعد سداد الرسم المقرر، الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة", "article": "Art. 34(1)"}, "action": {"span": "الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة ... تنشأ في الهيئة لجنة قضائية (تسمى لجنة الطعون)، تختص بالفصل في الطعون المقدمة إليها", "article": "Art. 34(1)-(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة", "article": "Art. 34(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "بعد سداد الرسم المقرر", "article": "Art. 34(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "وذلك خلال ثلاثين يوما من تاريخ علمه بالقرار", "article": "Art. 34(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وتوضع الصيغة التنفيذية من قسم كتاب محكمة الاستئناف على هذا القرار، ويُعتبر - بعد وضع هذه الصيغة عليه - بمثابة الحكم الصادر عن محكمة الاستئناف العليا المدنية... ويجوز الطعن في قرار لجنة الطعون المنهي للخصومة كلها أمام محكمة التمييز", "article": "Art. 34(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "any person bringing proceedings against a supervisory authority", "target": "any interested person (لكل ذي شأن) may challenge", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 34(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (must bring before specified courts)", "target": "entitlement/permission to appeal (لكل ذي شأن ... الطعن)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 34(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "bring the proceedings before the courts of the Member State where the supervisory authority is established", "target": "appeal decisions before a judicial committee established within the Authority; possible further appeal to Court of Cassation", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 34(2)-(4)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "proceedings against a supervisory authority (in general)", "target": "appeals limited to decisions issued by the Authority", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 34(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "payment of prescribed fee", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 34(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "30-day limit from knowledge of the decision", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 34(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Appeals Committee decision deemed a High Civil Court of Appeal judgment; may be appealed to Court of Cassation", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 34(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Article 34 provides a right to appeal Authority decisions before an internal Appeals Committee, not an obligation to bring proceedings before state courts. Court involvement arises only after the Committee’s decision (cassation), so the GDPR venue obligation (proceedings must be before the courts of the authority’s state) is not mirrored. The reviewer’s point about differing modality and forum is thus correct.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-913", "gdpr_article": 78, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not provide a clear counterpart to the proposition, as it does not explicitly state that the proceedings must be brought before the courts of the Member State where the supervisory authority is established.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "span": "لكل ذي شأن، بعد سداد الرسم المقرر، الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة استناداً لأحكام هذا القانون، وذلك خلال ثلاثين يوما من تاريخ علمه بالقرار", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the proceedings must be brought before the courts of the Member State where the supervisory authority is established."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality and process for bringing proceedings against a supervisory authority in BHR do not align with the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "span": "لكل ذي شأن، بعد سداد الرسم المقرر، الطعن في أي قرار يصدر عن الهيئة", "why": "Indicates an entitlement or permission rather than an obligation, and proceedings are brought before a committee, not the courts."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "762372b7329c44286e43", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 674.17, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "bfb9052a1843ce2a8665", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "General scope clause; does not set safeguards or address transparency/intra‑group transfers/workplace monitoring or rule‑making."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance/enforcement framework; does not prescribe inclusion of safeguards in rules or address the specific subject matter."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; does not address inclusion of suitable and specific measures with regard to transparency, intra‑group transfers, or workplace monitoring."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية للمستخدم ... واختبار وتقييم فعالية التدابير التقنية والتنظيمية لضمان أمن المعالجة.", "article": "Article 5"}, "scope": {"span": "تقديم معلومات واضحة يسهل الوصول إليها ... لضمان إجراء عمليات الجمع والمعالجة وبشفافية.", "article": "Article 4(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States and social partners concluding collective agreements under Article 88(1)", "target_value": "مقدمو الخدمة المرخص لهم (مقدم الخدمة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 4: \"يجب على مقدم الخدمة\"; Article 5: \"على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall include)", "target_value": "obligation (\"يجب على\")", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4: \"يجب على مقدم الخدمة\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include suitable and specific measures in those rules to safeguard data subjects’ human dignity, legitimate interests and fundamental rights", "target_value": "توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة وحفظ السرية وسلامة المعالجة؛ تقديم معلومات واضحة وبشفافية؛ تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(1),(4),(7); Article 4(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "with particular regard to transparency of processing, intra‑group transfers, and monitoring systems at the workplace", "target_value": "شفافية المعالجة؛ الإخطار عند كشف البيانات لشركة زميلة أو مالكة أو طرف ثالث؛ إخطار صاحب البيانات قبل نقل البيانات إلى خارج الكويت (لا أحكام عن نظم المراقبة في مكان العمل)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(1), 4(5), 4(9)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "when adopting rules under Article 88(1)", "target_value": "no equivalent condition on adopting employment rules or collective agreements", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no temporal element stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no specific consequence tied to these duties in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.56, "reasoning_note": "The Kuwaiti provisions impose general transparency, security, and transfer‑related obligations on telecom service providers, not on states or social partners adopting employment rules. They cover transparency and some transfer scenarios but do not address workplace monitoring or the rule‑making context required by GDPR Art. 88(2). Therefore only partial functional overlap exists.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-961", "gdpr_article": 88, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 419.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3d557baee19c86c0581b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; does not regulate portability or direct controller-to-controller transfer."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Policy/notice obligation about mechanisms to exercise rights; no operative rule on direct transfer."}, {"id": "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "reason": "General transfer/cross-border permissions and prohibitions; not a data-subject portability right and does not state technical feasibility."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "DPO contact details; not about portability."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Prior authorization content; unrelated to portability."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent baseline for processing; does not set portability conditions."}, {"id": "434ad096940e27397f81", "reason": "Cross-border transfer consent/derogations; not a portability rule."}, {"id": "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "reason": "Adequacy for external processors in cross-border transfers; does not articulate technical feasibility for portability."}, {"id": "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "reason": "Access/copy right with third-party data redaction; not a portability/direct transfer limitation."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice including mention of the right; does not create or define direct transfer or its conditions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20"}, "modality": {"span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الحق", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": "نقل بياناته الشخصية إلى متحكم آخر", "article": "Article 11(d)"}, "scope": {"span": "يقوم المتحكم بنقل البيانات الشخصية للمتحكم الجديد", "article": "Article 20"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كان ملزماً قانوناً بذلك", "article": "Article 20"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "data subject (صاحب البيانات الشخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "a right is granted to the data subject", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "have the personal data transmitted directly from one controller to another", "target_value": "right to transfer personal data to another controller; controller transfers to the new controller only if legally obliged", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 11(d); Article 20"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in exercising Art. 20(1) portability; direct controller-to-controller transfer; without prejudice to Art. 17", "target_value": "general right to transfer to another controller; direct controller transfer mentioned only when a separate legal obligation exists", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11(d); Article 20"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where technically feasible; and only when Art. 20(1) applies (consent or contract; automated processing)", "target_value": "no textual condition of technical feasibility or linkage to consent/contract + automated means; instead, transfer by the controller occurs only if legally obliged", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 20"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "not applicable where processing is necessary for a public interest/official authority task; and must not adversely affect the rights and freedoms of others", "target_value": "no corresponding exception stated for portability/direct transfer", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "none", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "none", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Articles 11 and 20 recognize a portability-type right, but direct controller-to-controller transmission is only contemplated where a separate legal obligation exists. There is no text conditioning portability on technical feasibility or on the consent/contract + automated basis, nor are GDPR-like exceptions stated. Articles 23 and 38 regulate (especially cross-border) transfers and adequacy/security, but they do not establish a technical-feasibility condition for direct portability.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-177", "gdpr_article": 20, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may not fully capture the nuances of OMN legislation regarding data portability, especially concerning conditions and exceptions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "span": "يحق لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أن ينقل بياناته الشخصية إلى متحكم جديد", "why": "Directly mentions data portability but lacks specific conditions and exceptions mentioned in the GDPR proposition."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "span": "تنفيذ التزام قانوني ملقى على عاتق المتحكم", "why": "Mentions legal obligations, which might relate to public interest or official authority tasks, but does not directly address the GDPR's conditions and exceptions."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'condition' slot is unsupported, as the OMN jurisdiction has provisions that imply technical feasibility is a requirement for data transfer.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "span": "Article 23", "why": "Implies that data transfer must be done in a way that does not harm the data subject or violate the jurisdiction's regulations, which includes technical feasibility."}, {"id": "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "span": "Article 38", "why": "Requires the controller to ensure that the external entity has adequate protection for personal data, which implies that the transfer must be done in a way that is technically feasible and secure."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "434ad096940e27397f81", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "4ddc7494f19d84324dd8", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 674.02, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "c3997daf36e6079d5b0d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "reason": "General obligation to follow ministry rules; does not address providing information or communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Cooperation with the ministry; unrelated to providing information/communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment/reporting; no obligation to provide information/communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Record retention for processing documents; not an information/communication duty toward data subjects."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Designation of a DPO; the data-subject-facing publication duty appears in Article 36 instead."}, {"id": "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "reason": "Breach documentation in an internal register; no communication to data subjects."}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Notification to authority of permit amendments; not about informing data subjects."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application content to the ministry; not a duty to provide information/communications to data subjects."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال -", "article": "Article 21"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 21"}, "action": {"span": "بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية في مكان ظاهر يتيح لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الاطلاع عليها قبل معالجة بياناته", "article": "Article 21"}, "scope": {"span": "على أن تتضمن تلك السياسة - على الأقل - آلية وإجراءات ممارسة صاحب البيانات الشخصية لحقوقه المنصوص عليها في القانون وهذه اللائحة", "article": "Article 21"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل معالجة بياناته", "article": "Article 21"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "controller or processor (as applicable)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 21: \"يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال -\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "obligation (يلتزم/يجب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 21: \"يلتزم\"; Article 36: \"يجب\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "take appropriate measures to provide to the data subject the information and communications specified", "target_value": "publish/make available a privacy policy in a visible place for data subjects to view before processing; publish DPO contact details", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 21: \"بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية في مكان ظاهر يتيح لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الاطلاع عليها\"; Article 36: \"يجب على المتحكم نشر البيانات المتعلقة بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية\"; Article 31 (re breach notices): authority may direct notifying data subjects", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "any information referred to in Articles 13 and 14 and any communication under Articles 15 to 22 and 34 relating to processing", "target_value": "at minimum, mechanisms/procedures for exercising data subject rights in the policy; publication of DPO identity and contact details; breach notice to data subjects only upon authority’s direction", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 21; Article 36; Article 31", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "before processing (for policy visibility requirement)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 21: \"قبل معالجة بياناته\"", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "OMN law contains more prescriptive, specific duties to surface certain information (e.g., a visible pre-processing privacy policy and publication of DPO contact details), which are indeed more detailed than GDPR Art. 12’s general formulation. However, the OMN texts provided do not require providing the full set of Articles 13/14 information and communications under 15–22 and 34; breach notification to data subjects appears only when directed by the authority. Hence the overall mapping is partial.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-047", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions in the target jurisdiction do not fully align with the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال - بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية في مكان ظاهر يتيح لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الاطلاع عليها قبل معالجة بياناته", "why": "Article 21 does not explicitly mention the provision of information under Articles 13 and 14, and the communications under Articles 15-22 and 34."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "span": "يجب على المتحكم نشر البيانات المتعلقة بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، والتي تتضمن اسمه وبيانات التواصل معه بأي وسيلة", "why": "Article 36 seems to be related to the communication of information to the data subject, but it does not fully align with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, and the target jurisdiction's provisions seem to have more specific and detailed requirements than the GDPR's general obligations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم أو المعالج - بحسب الأحوال - بوضع سياسة حماية البيانات الشخصية في مكان ظاهر يتيح لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الاطلاع عليها قبل معالجة بياناته", "why": "This provision seems to have a more specific and detailed requirement than the GDPR's general obligation to provide information."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "span": "يجب على المتحكم نشر البيانات المتعلقة بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision seems to have a more specific and detailed requirement than the GDPR's general obligation to provide information."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 652.3, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "022bdd74affc8f84724b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; does not address providing DPO contact details to data subjects."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; no relation to providing DPO contact details."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; requires giving DPO details to the regulator, not to the data subject at collection."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no obligation to provide DPO contact details."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; record-keeping may include DPO info but not provision to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; irrelevant to providing DPO contact details."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no specific duty to provide DPO contact details."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations (e.g., records including DPO info); no duty to provide DPO contact details to data subjects."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; not pertinent to the requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المتحكم أو المعالج", "article": "Article 10(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "على المتحكم أو المعالج تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات وإخطار المكتب بذلك", "article": "Article 10(3)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات", "article": "Article 10(3)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم والمعالج تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات ... وذلك في أي من الأحوال الآتية", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "على المتحكم أو المعالج", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 10(3)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على المتحكم أو المعالج تحديد ... وإخطار المكتب بذلك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 10(3)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with the contact details of the data protection officer", "target_value": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات؛ ولصاحب البيانات التواصل مباشرة مع مسؤول حماية البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 10(3); Art. 12(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where personal data are collected from the data subject and provision is applicable (i.e., a DPO is designated)", "target_value": "تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات في أحوال محددة (شرط قابلية التطبيق)؛ لا شرط يتعلق بجمع البيانات من صاحب البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 10(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "unless and insofar as the data subject already has the information", "target_value": "no exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at the time when personal data are obtained", "target_value": "no timing specified for providing DPO contact details to the data subject", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Art. 10(3) obliges determining a DPO contact address and notifying the regulator, and Art. 12(2) allows the data subject to contact the DPO directly, but neither text requires the controller to provide the DPO’s contact details to the data subject, let alone at the time of collection. There is also no timing requirement nor the GDPR exception for when the data subject already has the information. Thus, coverage is partial at best and lacks the GDPR’s specific informational duty and timing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-058", "gdpr_article": 13, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for providing contact details of the data protection officer may not be entirely accurate due to the presence of relevant provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This provision directly addresses the requirement of providing contact details of the data protection officer."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "على المتحكم والمعالج توفير كافة السبل لضمان أداء مسؤول حماية البيانات الأدوار والمهام الموكلة إليه", "why": "Ensuring the data protection officer can perform their duties implies the data subject should have a means to contact them."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no explicit duty to provide DPO contact details to the data subject is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 10(3)", "span": "تحديد عنوان الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This provision requires the controller to determine the contact address of the DPO, which implies that the controller should provide the contact details of the DPO to the data subject."}, {"id": "Article 12(2)", "span": "لصاحب البيانات التواصل مباشرة مع مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This provision gives the data subject the right to communicate directly with the DPO, which implies that the controller should provide the contact details of the DPO to the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 628.29, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "3a7b56123a53ef13737c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Obligations of the processor, not the controller; not the addressee of RU-211."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful-basis exceptions; does not regulate integrating safeguards into processing."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; unrelated to integrating safeguards into processing."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; unrelated to integrating safeguards into processing."}, {"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "DPIA (risk assessment) obligation; relates to assessment not the integration of safeguards."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support duties; unrelated to integrating safeguards into processing."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Data subject contact mechanisms; unrelated to integrating safeguards."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; unrelated to integrating safeguards."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; unrelated to the general obligation to integrate safeguards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "scope": {"span": "وذلك بهدف الامتثال لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون بما فيها الضوابط المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) منه", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "article": "674524dee00496cb5de7"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "يجب على المتحكم"}, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "يجب"}, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "integrate the necessary safeguards into the processing", "target_value": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة ... أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها، وذلك بهدف الامتثال... وتشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات"}, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "safeguards necessary to meet the requirements of the GDPR and protect the rights of data subjects", "target_value": "بهدف الامتثال لأحكام المرسوم بقانون بما فيها ضوابط المادة (5)؛ وحماية السرية والخصوصية عبر تدابير أمن مناسبة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [{"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "وذلك بهدف الامتثال لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون بما فيها الضوابط المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) منه"}, {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "اتخاذ الإجراءات والتدابير التقنية والتنظيمية الملائمة ... حفاظاً على سريتها وخصوصيتها"}, {"article": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "وضع واتخاذ إجراءات وتدابير تقنية وتنظيمية ملائمة، لضمان تطبيق مستوى أمن المعلومات الذي يتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة"}], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)", "target_value": "الالتزام العام بتطبيق التدابير الملائمة (لا يُصاغ كشرط مستقل)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها"}, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا استثناء منصوصاً عليه في النص الحاكم لهذا الالتزام", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "both at the time of the determination of the means for processing and at the time of the processing itself", "target_value": "سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": {"article": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها"}, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(2) requires the controller to apply appropriate measures both when determining the means of processing and during the processing itself, functionally integrating safeguards into processing. It also ties those measures to compliance with the law (and Article 5 principles) and, with Article 7(1)/20, to protecting confidentiality and privacy. Therefore, despite different wording (“apply” vs “integrate”), the UAE text covers the GDPR RU’s substance.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-211", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not explicitly support the claim of a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement of integrating necessary safeguards into processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "why": "The provision only mentions 'applying appropriate measures' without explicitly stating that these measures are 'safeguards' or that they are integrated into the processing."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "Article 20(1)", "why": "The provision does not explicitly support the claim that the UAE law has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement of integrating necessary safeguards into processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require the controller to integrate necessary safeguards into the processing, although it does have related provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها", "why": "This provision requires the application of appropriate measures during processing but does not explicitly state the integration of safeguards."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "يجب على المتحكم والمعالج وضع واتخاذ إجراءات وتدابير تقنية وتنظيمية ملائمة", "why": "This provision requires the implementation of technical and organizational measures to ensure the security of personal data, which could be related to integrating safeguards."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "57844ac856d11c289650", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 638.36, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "dda816c2f472c7c22110", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Article 9 obliges the controller to inform the individual, before processing, of 'بيانات المراقب' (controller's data). This is a data-subject notice duty, not an internal record-of-processing obligation, and it does not require maintaining a record nor specifying fields that a record must contain."}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "reason": "Article 1 provides definitions; it does not create a record-of-processing obligation or specify record content."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Article 2 sets the law's scope; it does not address records of processing or their contents."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Article 6 concerns data subject access rights; it does not establish or describe a controller's record of processing."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Article 8 lists general controller obligations (lawfulness, safeguards, policies) but does not mandate a record of processing or fields within such a record."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Article 10 addresses data relevance, accuracy, and retention; it does not pertain to maintaining a record of processing or including controller identifiers in such a record."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Article 11 requires internal procedures and audits but does not require a formal record of processing or prescribe its contents."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Article 12 governs disclosure/transfer to a processor; it does not address records of processing."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Article 13 imposes security measures and processor breach notification; it does not create or describe a record of processing."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Article 14 concerns breach notification to the individual and authority; it does not address records of processing or their content."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Article 22 sets content requirements for direct marketing communications (including sender identity and an address), which is unrelated to an internal record of processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include the name and contact details of the controller in the record", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the record of processing activities maintained under Article 30(1)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "Article 9’s phrase 'بيانات المراقب' appears in a data-subject notice context (informing the individual before processing), not as part of a controller-maintained record of processing. No provided provision establishes a record-of-processing regime or specifies that such a record must include the controller’s name/contact details; thus RU-255 remains uncovered.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-255", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 10}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 11}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions imply a need for transparency and accountability, suggesting controllers should be identifiable.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "بيانات المراقب", "why": "Implies the controller's details must be made available to the individual."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement is not supported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "بيانات المراقب", "why": "Article 9 requires the controller to inform the individual of its data, which could include the name and contact details."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 11, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "c098856a98e89debe630", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "455aae046cacf7979576", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 623.73, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "2a6bb531caf38baa2ea3", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "Addresses appointment/independence of an external auditor, not a cross-border representative nor any establishment/location requirement."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions excerpt does not introduce a representative concept or a location/establishment rule."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; unrelated to representatives or establishment/location."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaint mechanism for data subjects; no representative or establishment/location obligation."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "Requires appointment of an external auditor; not a representative serving as point of contact for foreign controllers/processors."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Legal representation for incapacitated persons; unrelated to GDPR Art. 27-type representative."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "reason": "Publication of DPO contact details; DPO is not a GDPR Art. 27 representative and no establishment/location rule is stated."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Prior authorization content (including DPO contact); no representative designation or member-state establishment requirement."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry’s regulatory powers are generic; no textual obligation to designate a representative or to have it established where data subjects are located."}, {"id": "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "reason": "Marketing consent; unrelated to representative or establishment/location."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Requires a controller to designate a DPO; a DPO is an internal compliance role, not a cross-border representative, and no location/establishment rule appears."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Scope/exemptions; contains no representative concept or location/establishment requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "representative designated under Article 27", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "be established in one of the Member States where the relevant data subjects are located", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "data subjects whose personal data are processed in relation to the offering of goods or services to them, or whose behaviour is monitored", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "When a representative is designated under Article 27(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.83, "reasoning_note": "I considered Art. 20 (يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية) and Art. 7 (ministry regulatory powers), but these address a DPO/internal governance and generic rulemaking, not a cross‑border representative. The texts contain no duty for a controller/processor to designate a representative, nor any requirement that such a representative be established where the affected data subjects are located. Therefore the specific, location‑tied obligation of GDPR Art. 27(3) is absent.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-221", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement in the OMN jurisdiction is not entirely accurate. While there is no direct equivalent, some provisions relate to the concept of representation or responsibility in data processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies a level of responsibility and oversight, which could be related to the concept of a representative designated under Article 27 of the GDPR."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The requirement to designate a data protection officer could be seen as a form of representation or responsibility, similar to the concept in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'C5' may be too absolute, as some provisions suggest mechanisms for designating responsible individuals or entities for data protection.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller must designate a Data Protection Officer, which could be related to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "span": "إصدار الضوابط والإجراءات اللازمة لمعالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision outlines the Ministry's responsibility to issue regulations and procedures for personal data processing, which could include guidelines for designating a representative or Data Protection Officer."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "caad155111190c1aa274", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "823830174d241884bd73", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 620.18, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "5dc3fa102fae140cf365", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Accuracy/quality of data processing; no Data Protection Officer (DPO) or controller duty to ensure DPO involvement."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "General security measures; no requirement to involve a DPO or ensure their involvement."}, {"id": "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "reason": "External auditing framework; does not impose controller duty to involve the DPO."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping for authorities; no DPO involvement obligation."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; no DPO involvement requirement."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection due diligence; no DPO involvement requirement."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Response timelines to data subject requests; no duty to ensure DPO involvement in all issues."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Information security obligations; no DPO involvement requirement."}, {"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "reason": "Records of processing include DPO details where applicable, but do not require controller to ensure DPO involvement."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Legitimate interest processing documentation; no DPO involvement obligation."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection; no DPO involvement requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"text": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 32(1)"}, "modality": {"text": null, "article": null}, "action": {"text": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في جهة التحكم متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات المعمول بها داخل جهة التحكم والإشراف عليها، وتلقي الطلبات المتعلقة بالبيانات الشخصية وفقاً لأحكام النظام ولوائحه", "article": "Article 32(3)"}, "scope": {"text": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"text": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"text": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"text": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"text": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "ensure that the data protection officer is properly involved in issues relating to the protection of personal data", "target": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية ... متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات ... والإشراف عليها، وتلقي الطلبات المتعلقة بالبيانات الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 32(3)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "all issues relating to the protection of personal data", "target": "مهام محددة لمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية (مثل الإشراف على إجراءات تقويم الأثر، تمكين أصحاب البيانات من حقوقهم، إشعار الجهة المختصة عن حوادث التسرب، معالجة المخالفات، تحديث السجلات)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 32(3)(أ-ز)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "in a timely manner", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 32(3) sets out DPO functions that imply involvement in several defined issues, but there is no express obligation on the controller to ensure the DPO’s proper and timely involvement in all issues relating to data protection. No text mirrors GDPR Art. 38(1)’s ‘properly and in a timely manner’ requirement or its ‘all issues’ breadth. The reviewer’s objection is correct on explicitness; coverage here is only partial/narrower.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-454", "gdpr_article": 38, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart for the GDPR requirement 'in a timely manner' and 'obligation' is unsupported.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 21", "span": " خلال مدة محددة", "why": "This provision implies a temporal aspect, as it mentions a 'specified period' for responding to requests."}, {"id": "Article 32(1)", "span": "تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين أو تحديد شخص أو أكثر ليكون مسؤولاً عن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies an obligation, as it uses the word 'shall' (تقوم) which indicates a mandatory action."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly require the controller to ensure the data protection officer's proper and timely involvement in all issues related to personal data protection.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "Article 32(3)", "why": "Only mentions the data protection officer's general oversight and supervisory functions, but does not explicitly require proper involvement in all issues related to personal data protection."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "span": "Article 21", "why": "Only mentions responding to requests from data subjects within a specified period, but does not explicitly require timely involvement in all issues related to personal data protection."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 663.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "b375a274b6301341171c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "9d65c2815c41a25064db"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; does not address security measures or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; not about implementing security measures such as pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO; not about security measures."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; not an operative security obligation."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; not about including pseudonymisation in security measures."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; RU addressee is the controller and this article does not expressly mention pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles and anonymisation; does not set a specific risk-based obligation to include pseudonymisation as a security measure."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; irrelevant to security measures."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; not a security-measure obligation."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; not about security measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 7( chapeau )"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على", "article": "Article 7( chapeau )"}, "action": {"span": "تشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20(1)(أ)"}, "condition": {"span": "إجراءات وتدابير تقنية وتنظيمية ملائمة، لضمان تطبيق مستوى أمن المعلومات الذي يتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7( chapeau )"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7( chapeau )"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures", "target_value": "تشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(2); Article 20(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data processed", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "as appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "ملائمة ... يتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "Articles 7(2) and 20(1)(a) expressly include a “data masking” mechanism (آلية إخفاء البيانات) among required appropriate security measures and tie measures to processing risk, which functionally matches GDPR’s pseudonymisation-as-appropriate requirement. This corrects the earlier partial assessment by recognizing the direct textual treatment of pseudonymisation in the UAE statute. The obligation is on the controller and is risk-based, satisfying RU-317.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-317", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provisions do not explicitly require pseudonymisation as a security measure.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها، وذلك بهدف الامتثال لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون بما فيها الضوابط المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) منه، وتشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This provision mentions data masking mechanisms, but it is not clear that it requires pseudonymisation specifically."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "تشفير البيانات الشخصية وتطبيق آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This provision mentions encryption and data masking, but it is not clear that it requires pseudonymisation specifically."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction has provisions that directly address pseudonymisation, contradicting the analyst's verdict of partial coverage.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "span": "تطبيق التدابير الملائمة سواء أثناء تحديد وسائل المعالجة أو أثناء المعالجة نفسها، وذلك بهدف الامتثال لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون بما فيها الضوابط المنصوص عليها في المادة (5) منه، وتشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This provision directly supports the concept of pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "تشفير البيانات الشخصية وتطبيق آلية إخفاء البيانات", "why": "This provision explicitly mentions data masking mechanism, which is a form of pseudonymisation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 634.35, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "a75a49feea593826fb5a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules on data subject rights; no supervisory authority reporting or annual report content."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Controller exemptions regarding disclosure; unrelated to supervisory authority reports."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Security-related processing by competent authority and a special register; not about public reporting or annual reports."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "General implementation and publication clause; no reporting content."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Material scope of the law; no reporting duties or permissions."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification by controller; not supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; no reporting aspects."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions for certain purposes; not about authority reporting."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Inspection/police powers to detect offenses; no reporting or annual report content."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Controller internal governance and audits; not supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Complaint handling and corrective orders; no annual reporting permission or content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Art. 27"}, "modality": {"span": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Art. 27"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء البحوث، ورصد التطورات ... وإعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأنها", "article": "Art. 27(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "في مجالات التكنولوجيا المتصلة بالمسائل التي يشملها هذا القانون", "article": "Art. 27(3)"}, "condition": {"span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Art. 27"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 27"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة (بما فيها إعداد التقارير)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 27"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include in the annual report a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken in accordance with Article 58(2)", "target_value": "إعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأن التطورات التقنية المتصلة بمسائل القانون", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 27(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "content of the annual activity report", "target_value": "تقارير حول التطورات في مجالات التكنولوجيا المتصلة بمسائل القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 27(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 27"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Art. 27 expressly empowers the competent authority to prepare reports, which conceptually supports a permission to report on matters within the law. However, it does not mention an annual report nor specify listing types of infringements or measures, so only partial functional overlap with the GDPR unit is present. The action is therefore assessed as partial rather than uncovered, addressing the reviewer’s concern.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law does not explicitly require the inclusion of a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken in the annual report, and the scope of the report is not specified.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "إعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأنها", "why": "This provision mentions reporting, but does not specify the content of the report."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision states the purpose of the reporting, but does not explicitly require the inclusion of a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion that the 'action' slot is 'uncovered' might be too narrow, given the potential interpretation of Article 27's provisions on research, monitoring, and reporting.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "إجراء البحوث، ورصد التطورات ... المتصلة بالمسائل التي يشملها هذا القانون وإعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأنها", "why": "This provision suggests the possibility of reporting on infringements and measures taken, although not explicitly in the context of an annual report."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 618.46, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "5d82efe768e8e9d34d28", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping about disclosures/transfers; does not grant or condition permission to transfer for legal claims."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; no cross-border transfer permission ground."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for a verified interest; unrelated to cross-border transfer permissions."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure obligations; no transfer permission for legal claims."}, {"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "reason": "Scientific/research/statistical processing without consent; not a transfer permission basis."}, {"id": "295bad3524a8fa35d18c", "reason": "Territorial scope; no transfer permission conditions."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing by public bodies; not a cross-border transfer ground."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing/certification/audit framework; not a transfer permission basis."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "General processing legal bases (including judicial requirements for public bodies), not specific cross-border transfer permissions."}, {"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "reason": "Record of processing contents (including noting transfers and their legal bases); does not itself authorize transfers."}, {"id": "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "reason": "Communication means for data subject requests; irrelevant to transfer permissions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "action": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "إلى خارج المملكة ... لجهة خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: أ- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لالتزام بموجب اتفاقية تكون المملكة طرفاً فيه. ب- إذا كان ذلك لخدمة مصالح المملكة. ج- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لالتزام يكون صاحب البيانات الشخصية طرفاً فيه. د- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لأغراض أخرى وفق ما تحدده اللوائح. ... وتكون الشروط الواجب توافرها ... على النحو الآتي: أ- ألا يترتب على النقل أو الإفصاح مساس بالأمن الوطني أو بمصالح المملكة الحيوية. ب- أن يتوافر مستوى مناسب لحماية البيانات الشخصية في خارج المملكة ... ج- أن يقتصر النقل أو الإفصاح على الحد الأدنى من البيانات الشخصية الذي تدعو الحاجة إليه.", "article": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يسري ما ورد في الفقرة (2) من هذه المادة على حالات الضرورة القصوى للمحافظة على حياة صاحب البيانات الشخصية أو مصالحه الحيوية أو الوقاية من عدوى مرضية أو فحصها أو معالجتها.", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller or processor", "target_value": "controller only (جهة التحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجوز (permission)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "transfer personal data to a third country or an international organisation", "target_value": "transfer/disclose personal data to outside the Kingdom/to an entity outside the Kingdom", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "transfers of personal data to a third country or an international organisation", "target_value": "cross-border transfers/disclosures (to outside KSA / to an external entity)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the transfer is necessary for the establishment, exercise or defence of legal claims", "target_value": "permitted when fulfilling a treaty obligation, serving the Kingdom’s interests, fulfilling an obligation the data subject is party to, or other purposes set by regulations; plus adequacy, national-security, and data-minimization conditions", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "emergency life/public-health carve-out from the adequacy/minimization conditions", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 29(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal specification", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 29 permits cross-border transfers on enumerated grounds; it does not state a general ‘legal claims necessity’ ground. The treaty-obligation ground could incidentally cover some legal-claim scenarios implemented via international conventions, but this is not textually coextensive with the GDPR legal-claims basis.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-571", "gdpr_article": 46, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'the transfer is necessary for the establishment, exercise or defence of legal claims' is partially covered in Article 29(1) and Article 10(7) of the KSA jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية", "why": "This phrase in Article 29(1) could be interpreted to include the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "ضروريا لتحقيق مصالح مشروعة لجهة التحكم", "why": "This phrase in Article 10(7) could be related to the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition for transferring personal data for legal claims might not be entirely uncovered, as Article 29(1) provides for transfers based on conventions the Kingdom is a party to, which could encompass legal claims.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: أ- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لالتزام بموجب اتفاقية تكون المملكة طرفاً فيه.", "why": "This provision indicates that personal data can be transferred for purposes related to conventions the Kingdom is a party to, which could include legal claims or agreements."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "295bad3524a8fa35d18c", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "d29636711e8dc90e5e69"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 631.19, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "1e8ec97fd638d7fb2891", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security measures and processor-to-controller breach notice; no supervisory authority advice/consultation duty."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions; no role for the authority to provide advisory opinions on intended processing."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Minister sets procedures for data subject rights; not about supervisory authority advising controllers."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subjects; no supervisory authority consultation or advice."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from disclosing reasons for refusal of rights; unrelated to authority advice."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restriction; no advisory function by the authority."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller’s obligations when disclosing to a processor; no supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; no supervisory authority prior consultation/advice."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing; no supervisory authority consultation/advice."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; no supervisory authority advisory role."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الإدارة المختصة", "article": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, "modality": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، بعد التحقيق في الشكوى وثبوت جديتها، أن تصدر قراراً", "article": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تصدر قراراً (power/discretion, not a duty to advise)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide written advice to the controller and, where applicable, the processor", "target_value": "no advisory function stated; authority issues enforcement decisions after complaints (not advice)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "intended processing referred to in paragraph 1 (high-risk processing subject to prior consultation)", "target_value": "no scope regarding intended processing or prior consultation", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the authority considers the intended processing would infringe the GDPR, particularly where risks are insufficiently identified/mitigated", "target_value": "no condition tied to an authority advice function; complaint-driven enforcement only", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no exceptions stated for an advice/consultation duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "within up to eight weeks of receipt of the request for consultation", "target_value": "no timeframe for authority advice/consultation", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no consequence clause related to an advice/consultation duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Articles 26 and 14 show the competent authority investigates complaints and receives breach notifications, but they do not establish a prior-consultation regime or an obligation to provide written advice to controllers/processors within a set period. The GDPR unit is proactive advisory oversight tied to intended high-risk processing, whereas the Qatari provisions are reactive enforcement/notification mechanisms. Therefore, the specific advisory duty and eight-week timeline are absent.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-416", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This provision shows that the competent authority has a role in investigating complaints and issuing decisions, which could be related to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة، إذا كان من شأن ذلك إحداث ضرر جسيم بالبيانات الشخصية أو بخصوصية الفرد.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to notify the individual and the competent authority in case of a breach of security measures, which could be related to the condition of the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 547.37, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "cd44c3a0157e4db91bc1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing; no mention of designating or naming a representative."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance/penalties; no operative rule on representation or extraterritorial controllers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5"}, "modality": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5"}, "action": {"span": "4. الاحتفاظ بسجلات أنشطة المعالجة، على أن تتضمن السجلات كافة المعلومات التالية: 4.1. اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة، وممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت", "article": "Article 5"}, "scope": {"span": "تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة ... سواء تمت المعالجة داخل دولة الكويت أو خارجها.", "article": "Article 1"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت", "article": "Article 5"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller or processor to whom Article 3(2) GDPR applies", "target": "licensed service providers (مقدمي الخدمة) subject to the Regulation", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 5: \"على مقدم الخدمة\"; Art. 1: \"تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall designate)", "target": "obligation (على مقدم الخدمة ...)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5: \"على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "designate in writing a representative established in the Union", "target": "retain records of processing including the name and contact details of the provider and its representative if the provider is outside Kuwait", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(4)–(4.1): \"الاحتفاظ بسجلات ... 4.1. اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة، وممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت\"", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "representation for processing activities to which Article 3(2) applies", "target": "applies to licensed service providers’ processing, whether inside or outside Kuwait", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 1: \"تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم... سواء تمت المعالجة داخل دولة الكويت أو خارجها\"; Art. 5(4.1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where Article 3(2) applies (non-EU entity offering goods/services to, or monitoring, individuals in the Union)", "target": "if the service provider is outside Kuwait (إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(4.1): \"... ممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "no representative required if processing is occasional, not large-scale special/criminal data, low risk; or if public authority/body", "target": "no exceptions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "none", "target": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "none", "target": "none stated specific to this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Art. 5(4.1) contemplates a ‘representative’ by requiring its contact details in records if the provider is outside Kuwait, but it does not impose a duty to designate such a representative, nor set EU-style triggers or exceptions. Hence only partial functional overlap with GDPR Art. 27.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-220", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 2}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart for representation in Article 5, 4.1, might partially address the GDPR requirement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "4.1. اسم وبيانات الاتصال بمقدم الخدمة، وممثله إذا كان خارج دولة الكويت ومسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Mention of a representative's contact details if outside Kuwait could imply a form of representation for processing activities"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 550.48, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "09953fb800caa09b9520", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "5483caf68765f09059fb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Addresses only the controller; mentions technical/procedural measures for lawful processing, not a processor duty nor risk-appropriate security."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice obligations on the controller; unrelated to security measures."}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "reason": "Controller’s assessment for cross-border transfers; does not impose processor security measures."}, {"id": "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "reason": "Controller must ensure adequate protection before cross-border transfer; not a general processor security obligation."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Record-keeping duty for controller/processor; no general security measures beyond retention logistics."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy publication; not security measures."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "External auditor appointment; compliance oversight, not substantive security measures."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Controller’s breach preparedness at licensing; not a general processor security duty."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Controller’s DPO designation; not security measures."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor on ministry request; does not establish processor security measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 15"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 15"}, "action": {"span": "أن يوفر أنظمة الحماية الفنية للاحتفاظ الآمن بمستندات المعالجة", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 15"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المعالج (مذكور مع المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "أن يوفر أنظمة الحماية الفنية للاحتفاظ الآمن بمستندات المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "The target texts impose duties on processors in general and require a specific technical protection for retention of processing records, but they do not establish a general obligation on processors to implement risk-appropriate technical and organisational security measures. No text expresses the GDPR-style conditioning on state of the art, costs, or a comprehensive risk assessment for processors.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-316", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot's 'uncovered' verdict may be too absolute; provisions like Article 13 and Article 39 address similar concerns.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "This provision indicates consideration of risks, aligning with part of the GDPR's condition."}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article discusses assessing protection levels and risks, touching upon aspects like the state of the art and the nature and scope of processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not fully supported by the provided provisions, particularly with regards to the 'action' and 'condition' slots.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention 'technical and organisational measures' or 'a level of security appropriate to the risk'."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "أ- تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "This provision does not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-316] regarding the consideration of 'the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 669.88, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "f758816646efe79dfada", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security safeguards; does not address authority requests for information."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no supervisory information-request power."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject right to rectification/erasure; not about authority’s power to obtain information."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information from controller; not supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restriction; unrelated to authority information orders."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles (liaison function); does not confer a power to compel information."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; unrelated to supervisory information requests."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no authority request power."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Obligations toward DPO; not about supervisory requests."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods; no supervisory authority power."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:", "article": "Art. 7 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام", "article": "Art. 7 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تزويد المكتب ... بأي معلومات يطلبها", "article": "Art. 7(6)"}, "scope": {"span": "تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية", "article": "Art. 7(6)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة", "article": "Art. 7(6)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "المتحكم (controller), not the supervisory authority; requests are by \"المكتب\" (the Office).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 7 (chapeau); Art. 7(6)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "power", "target": "Obligation on the controller: \"يجب على المتحكم الالتزام\" to provide information the Office requests.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 7 (chapeau); Art. 7(6)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "order the controller, the processor, and, where applicable, their representative to provide any information the supervisory authority requires", "target": "\"تزويد المكتب ... بأي معلومات يطلبها\" (provide the Office with any information it requests).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 7(6)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "investigative powers", "target": "\"تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته\" (for the performance of the Office’s competences).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 7(6)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "Where applicable regarding the representative; the information is required for the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target": "\"بناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة\" (based on a decision of the competent judicial authority) and tied to the Office’s competences.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 7(6)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed in the cited provisions.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(6) functionally creates an authority-driven information provision mechanism, but it is framed as a duty on the controller, conditioned on a competent judicial decision, and references \"the Office\" (المكتب) rather than expressly empowering a supervisory authority. It does not extend to processors or representatives. These divergences justify narrower/weaker coverage relative to GDPR Art. 58(1)(a).", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-680", "gdpr_article": 58, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully capture the nuances of the UAE jurisdiction's provisions regarding the power of the supervisory authority to request information from the controller.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "تزويد المكتب، وبناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة، بأي معلومات يطلبها تنفيذاً لاختصاصاته الواردة في هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية.", "why": "This provision suggests that the Office has the power to request information from the controller, but the request must be based on a decision by the competent judicial authority."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "مسك سجل خاص للبيانات الشخصية، على أن يتضمن هذا السجل بيانات كل من المتحكم ومسؤول حماية البيانات، وبيان وصف فئات البيانات الشخصية لديه، وبيانات الأشخاص المصرح لهم بالوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية، والمدد الزمنية للمعالجة وقيودها ونطاقها، وآلية محو البيانات الشخصية أو تعديلها أو معالجتها لديه، والغرض من المعالجة، وأي بيانات متعلقة بحركة ومعالجة تلك البيانات عبر الحدود، وبيان الإجراءات التقنية والتنظيمية الخاصة بأمن المعلومات وعمليات المعالجة، على أن يقوم المتحكم بتوفير هذا السجل للمكتب متى ما طلب منه ذلك.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to maintain a record of processing activities, which includes information about the processing, and to provide this record to the Office upon request."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely supported by the provisions. The condition in Article 7(6) and the translation of 'المكتب' and 'يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:' are not accurately represented.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "بناءً على قرار من الجهة القضائية المختصة", "why": "This condition is not present in the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "المكتب", "why": "The translation of 'المكتب' is more accurate to 'the office', which may not necessarily be the same as the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:", "why": "The translation of 'يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:' is more accurate to 'the controller shall comply with the following:', which does not necessarily convey the same meaning as 'power'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9d65c2815c41a25064db", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "877fafe0080725188d05", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 345.85, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d3c93408dbd76adcf657", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of data protection officers; unrelated to data subject access rights or purposes of processing."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "Disclosure obligations of external DPOs; not about the data subject’s right to obtain information on purposes."}, {"id": "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "reason": "Registration requirement for DPOs; not operative on access rights."}, {"id": "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "reason": "Procedures for registering internal DPOs; irrelevant to right of access/purpose information."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contract clauses; mentions informing of purposes in transfer context, not a general right of access."}, {"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "reason": "Transparency at collection/from third parties; while it includes purposes, it is a proactive notice duty, not the data subject’s request-based access right."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Right to object to direct marketing; not about obtaining information on purposes."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ obligations and disclosure of joint processing; not the right to obtain purposes information."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; does not grant the access right to purposes."}, {"id": "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "reason": "Definitions only; no operative right to obtain information on purposes."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO roles and duties; unrelated to the data subject’s access right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة", "article": "Article 18(3)"}, "action": {"span": "على مدير البيانات، بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب ... وفي حالة وجود معالَجة ... يلتزم مدير البيانات بإخطار صاحب البيانات في صورة مفهومة بما يأتي: ... ج - الغرض من معالجة البيانات.", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)(ج)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته ... وفي حالة وجود معالَجة من أيّ نوع لهذه البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لِمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب ... إذا لم يكن مستوفياً ... وله رفْضُه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة", "article": "Article 18(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب ... لمدير البيانات خلال فترة لا تجاوز عشرة أيام من تسلُّمه طلباً ... أن يُخطِر مقدِّم الطلب باستيفاء أيّ نقص", "article": "Article 18(1)-(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": "في حالة رفض الطلب ... أو انقضاء المدة المحددة للاستجابة له دون أن يصل إلى صاحب البيانات أيّ إخطار ... يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 18(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "حقه في المعرفة (مع التزامات مقابلة على مدير البيانات بالإخطار)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1), 18(3)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller information on the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "إخطار صاحب البيانات بما في ذلك بيان الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)(ج)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "purposes of the processing", "target_value": "الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)(ج)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "بناءً على طلب مُثبت الهوية، ويُقدَّم الإخطار إذا كانت هناك معالَجة قائمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "عدم قبول الطلب إذا لم يكن مستوفياً؛ ورفْضه إذا تضمَّن تعسفاً في استعمال الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 18(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "الرد خلال 15 يوم عمل؛ مهلة 10 أيام لاستيفاء النقص", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 18(1)-(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "حق تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة عند الرفض أو عدم الرد خلال المدة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 18(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered_with_qualifications", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 expressly grants a request-based right that includes disclosure of the purpose(s) of processing when the data are processed. However, it conditions exercise on an identity-backed request and allows refusal for incomplete or abusive requests, which are limitations absent from the RU text. The right is thus covered but with narrower conditions and explicit exceptions.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-124", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The right to obtain information about the purposes of the processing may be subject to exceptions, such as in cases of historical, statistical, or scientific research purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "17(3)", "span": "لا يسري حكم البند (2) من هذه المادة في الحالتين التاليتين: أ - إذا كانت معالَجة البيانات لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي، وكانت إحاطة صاحب البيانات بالبيانات المشار إليها متعذرة أو تتطلَّب بذل جهود مرهقة غير عادية.", "why": "This provision suggests that there may be exceptions to the right to obtain information about the purposes of the processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The data subject's right to obtain information on the purposes of the processing is not absolute, but rather subject to certain conditions and limitations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "على مدير البيانات، بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "why": "This provision implies that the data subject must request the information in order to receive it."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "لمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب المشار إليه في البند (1) من هذه المادة، إذا لم يكن مستوفياً، بشرط الالتزام بمتطلبات البند (2) من هذه المادة وفوات مدة الإعذار. وله رفْضُه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة", "why": "This provision states that the controller may refuse the request if it is deemed to be an abuse of the data subject's right to access their personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "762372b7329c44286e43", "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 344.91, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "d49e8d9f68e074ef6827", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "823830174d241884bd73", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Addresses breach incident reports and follow-up measures, not supervisory authority competence to handle data subject complaints."}, {"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "reason": "Concerns controller’s ability to refuse individual requests; unrelated to authority handling of complaints."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Sets general exclusions from the law’s scope; does not regulate complaint handling by the authority."}, {"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "reason": "Defines controller–processor relationship and liabilities; not about authority complaint powers."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Relates to prior authorization/permit content; not about complaints."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "Provides for external auditing on request of the ministry; not complaint handling."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Lists data subject rights; does not assign authority competence over complaints."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Requires appointment of a data protection officer; not relevant to supervisory complaint-handling power."}, {"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "reason": "Grants inspectors judicial enforcement capacity; not about deciding complaints."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 7"}, "modality": {"span": "ولها على الأخص الآتي", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": "ج- تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى التي يودعها أصحاب البيانات الشخصية، والبت فيها", "article": "Article 7"}, "scope": {"span": "تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 7"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة التي تحددها اللائحة", "article": "Article 7"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الوزارة (الجهة المشرفة/الرقابية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7 [498c9cb637b86367567b]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "ولها على الأخص الآتي (سلطة/اختصاص)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7 [498c9cb637b86367567b]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "handle a complaint lodged with it", "target_value": "تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى ... والبت فيها؛ ويجوز لصاحب البيانات التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(c) [498c9cb637b86367567b]; Article 12 [823830174d241884bd73]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "a case under this Regulation", "target_value": "تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون (في نطاق قانون حماية البيانات الشخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7 [498c9cb637b86367567b]", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the subject matter relates only to an establishment in its Member State or substantially affects data subjects only in its Member State", "target_value": "لا تُذكر أي قيد إقليمي؛ للوزارة اختصاص عام بتلقي والبت في الشكاوى", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 7(c) [498c9cb637b86367567b]", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "by derogation from paragraph 1", "target_value": "لا يوجد نص مقابل بشأن الاستثناء من قاعدة سابقة أو آلية جهة رائدة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "خلال المدة التي تحددها اللائحة (زمن البت في الشكاوى)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(c) [498c9cb637b86367567b]", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا يُحدد أثر أو جزاء خاص مرتبط بسلطة نظر الشكوى في هذا السياق", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.76, "reasoning_note": "OMN law expressly empowers the Ministry to receive and decide data-subject complaints, which functionally covers the local-only scenario. It does not replicate the GDPR’s one‑stop‑shop/derogation structure or territorial condition, but the general competence subsumes it. Procedural timing is specified but does not affect coverage.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-652", "gdpr_article": 56, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "823830174d241884bd73", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 188.72, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "54d6006164d7eeef3ddc", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to the individual/authority; no record-keeping duty or joint-controller identification."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Rules for special categories and permits; no requirement to maintain records or include joint-controller details."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Security/public interest exemptions and an authority-held register; not a controller’s record of processing and no joint-controller detail requirement."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General principle of privacy; no operative obligation to record joint-controller details."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing (consent/legitimate interest); no record-keeping or joint-controller identification."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer to a processor; no record-keeping or joint-controller details."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and processor-to-controller breach notice; no record-keeping or joint-controller details."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; not an operative requirement about records or joint controllers."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Direct marketing communications content/consent; no relation to controller records or joint controllers."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access rights; no controller record-keeping duty or joint-controller identification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "article": "Article 9"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "على المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "include the name and contact details of the joint controller in the record", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "the record of processing activities maintained under Article 30(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where applicable (a joint controller exists)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Art. 9 requires transparency to the individual about the controller or any party processing on the controller’s behalf, but this is not a duty to include joint-controller details in an internal record of processing. Art. 11 requires the controller to identify processors responsible for protecting personal data, not joint controllers, and does not create a record-of-processing obligation. Therefore, despite some thematic alignment on identifying actors, the specific GDPR Art. 30(1) record content requirement remains unaddressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-257", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart provision found under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to inform the individual of their data, which could include the name and contact details of the joint controller."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Provisions in Qatari law (Article 9 and Article 11) suggest some alignment with GDPR requirement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله", "why": "Related to joint controllers"}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "تحديد المعالجين المسؤولين عن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies record-keeping of processors responsible for protecting personal data"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "c098856a98e89debe630", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 302.43, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "ff94384035cc726d727b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Regulates international data transfers to adequate countries; no provision on religious bodies continuing pre-existing comprehensive rules."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Defines corporate group 'binding rules' for data protection and intra-group transfers; addressee and subject are corporate groups and cross-border transfers, not churches/religious communities or continuation of their pre-existing sectoral rules."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations; no permission for religious bodies to apply pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Authority functions; does not address sectoral pre-existing rules for religious entities."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definition of privacy by design; unrelated to permission for churches to retain their own rules."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Contractual safeguards for extra-territorial transfers; not about religious associations’ pre-existing comprehensive rules."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality obligations of the authority; no relevance to religious entities’ internal codes."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions related to data protection officers; no provision on churches’ rules."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Rules for public registers; not about sectoral pre-existing data-protection codes."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO roles and registration; no sector-specific continuation clause."}, {"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "Derogations for international transfers; not about religious entities’ rules."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "Internal DPO registration conditions; no connection to churches’ pre-existing rules."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "churches and religious associations or communities", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "permission", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "continue to apply their pre-existing comprehensive data-protection rules", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "in a Member State", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the entities applied such comprehensive rules at the time of entry into force of this Regulation and the rules are brought into line with this Regulation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "None of the cited Bahraini provisions provide a permission for churches or religious associations to continue applying pre-existing comprehensive data-protection rules. The ‘قواعد المؤسسة’ definition concerns corporate-group binding rules for data protection and intra‑group transfers, and Article 5 concerns contractual grounds for cross‑border transfers; neither addresses religious entities or the continuation of their sectoral codes.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-975", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct counterpart, but presence of related provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "span": "قواعد المؤسسة: مجموعة من السياسات والإجراءات الملزمة التي جُمِعَت أو أُدمِجَت في وثيقة مكتوبة واحدة", "why": "Definition of institutional rules, which could be related to data protection"}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى مدير بيانات أو طرف ثالث خارج المملكة بناءً على عقد", "why": "Provision for transferring personal data outside the Kingdom, which might be relevant"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "0c872442bf005518c094"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 221.63, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "ccdf9216109b9b01d779", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
{"candidates_selected": ["9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "Sets overall sectoral scope (telecom providers) but does not grant a power to set specific conditions for processing national ID numbers or other general identifiers."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Provides legal bases for processing; does not address a state power to determine specific conditions for national identification numbers or other identifiers."}, {"id": "8df6b1810850e58a6a30", "reason": "Definitions (including personal data and identifiers) but no normative grant of power and no specific mention of national identification numbers."}, {"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Obligations on service providers prior to processing; no grant of power to set conditions for national IDs or other general identifiers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز للهيئة", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "action": {"span": "إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "article": "Article 7(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "الهيئة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "يجوز", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "determine specific conditions for the processing of national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application", "target_value": "إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 7(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 7(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.46, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(2) gives the Authority a general power to issue data-privacy instructions, which could conceptually include setting conditions, but the text does not mention national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application. No provision specifically targets such identifiers or empowers setting conditions for their processing. Hence only partial alignment with GDPR Art. 87.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-958", "gdpr_article": 87, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly mention 'national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application', which is the specific scope mentioned in the proposition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "why": "The provision mentions 'data privacy' in general, but it does not explicitly mention 'national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application'."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provision does not explicitly address national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "why": "The provision does not mention national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application."}, {"id": "8df6b1810850e58a6a30", "span": "البيانات الشخصية: ... كتحديد الاسم والهوية، ... وأي معرف آخر يسمح بالاتصال عبر الإنترنت بالشخص", "why": "The definition of personal data includes identifiers, but does not specifically mention national identification numbers."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "8df6b1810850e58a6a30", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 320.62, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260801, "id": "0bd5f45ff86f215cce6e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 0}
