null, "source": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "source": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "body with appropriate expertise accredited by the competent supervisory authority", "target": "مسؤول حماية البيانات (internal/external DPO role)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "permission", "target": "assigned role/duty: يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات ... التأكد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "carry out monitoring of compliance (with a code of conduct)", "target": "التأكد من مدى الامتثال لتنفيذ أحكام القانون (monitoring/ensuring compliance with the law)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "codes of conduct pursuant to Article 40", "target": "أحكام المرسوم بقانون ولائحته والتعليمات (no codes of conduct mentioned)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "body has appropriate expertise and is accredited by the competent supervisory authority", "target": "تتوفر فيه المهارات والدراية الكافية (expertise present); no accreditation by authority", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "without prejudice to SA tasks; not applicable to public authorities' processing", "target": "No corresponding exceptions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Articles 11 and 10 establish an internal (or contracted) Data Protection Officer tasked with ensuring compliance with the law and regulator instructions, not an accredited external body monitoring compliance with codes of conduct. The texts contain no reference to codes of conduct, no accreditation by the supervisory authority for monitoring such codes, and no related exceptions. Therefore, the DPO provisions are not a functional counterpart to GDPR Art. 41.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-503", "gdpr_article": 41, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts or related provisions exist in the UAE jurisdiction, such as Article 11, which discusses the roles of the Data Protection Officer in ensuring compliance and could be interpreted as related to monitoring compliance with codes of conduct.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "11", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article discusses the roles of the Data Protection Officer, which could include monitoring compliance with data protection regulations and potentially codes of conduct."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "The article mentions the role of Data Protection Officer in ensuring compliance with the law and instructions."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "The article discusses the appointment of a Data Protection Officer, implying a mechanism for ensuring compliance with data protection regulations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5d949837d7aab073cd67"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 552.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e74656797ff19dea9760", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General principle of data privacy and lawful processing; does not establish or describe a subject access right."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Defines special-category data and related authorization; not about data subject access."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Creates national-interest exemptions from specified articles (4, 9, 15, 17) but does not govern or limit Article 6 subject access."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure alignment; not about data subject access."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Provides rights to withdraw consent, object, erase, and rectify; does not grant access."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and processor notification; not about access."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not about access."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing transparency information; distinct from a right to access one's data."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing; not about access."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restrictions; not about access."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد", "article": "Article 6"}, "modality": {"span": "وله بوجه خاص الحق", "article": "Article 6"}, "action": {"span": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "condition": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "article": "Article 2"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "في أي وقت", "article": "Article 6"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "للفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "وله بوجه خاص الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain access to personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 2; Article 6"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في أي وقت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 6"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 6 directly grants the individual access to their personal data (including a copy), satisfying the core of GDPR Art. 15. The GDPR’s explicit condition “where the data are being processed” is not restated in Article 6, but the law’s scope clause (Article 2) applies rights when personal data are processed, and Article 6 makes the right exercisable vis-à-vis a controller, so we treat the condition as satisfied on a distributed basis. Accordingly, the condition slot is marked partial, while the overall requirement is functionally covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-123", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the condition aspect is incorrect, as the Qatari law provides a counterpart to the GDPR's condition through Articles 2 and 6.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "why": "This provision implies that the law is concerned with the processing of personal data, which aligns with the GDPR's condition."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها", "why": "This provision, read in conjunction with Article 2, suggests that the right to access is indeed related to the processing of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition for the right to access personal data as specified in the GDPR is not explicitly and directly covered by the cited provisions in the Qatari law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 2", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "why": "This provision defines the scope of application but does not directly address the condition for the right to access as specified in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 494.67, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "db05d78d81c192876160", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions and coordination; not breach notification timing or authority notification."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Procedures for registering external DPOs; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Procedures for registering internal DPOs; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rights to rectification/blocking/erasure; not breach notification."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Investigation of DPO non-compliance; not breach notification."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Right to object to harmful processing; not breach notification."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Compensation for damage; not breach notification."}, {"id": "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "reason": "Appointment of DPO; not breach notification."}, {"id": "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "reason": "Authority’s notification of investigation reports to stakeholders; not data breach notification."}, {"id": "9536e03a0aa7b4781fc7", "reason": "Termination/cancellation of DPO registration; not breach notification."}, {"id": "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b", "reason": "Objection to direct marketing; not breach notification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "modality": {"span": "ويجب عليه وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة ... خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "scope": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "Article 4"}, "condition": {"span": "بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "Article 4"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4"}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي حال لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "article": "Article 4"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall notify)", "target": "يجب عليه ... لإخطار الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "notify the supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target": "إخطار الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "in the case of a personal data breach and where feasible", "target": "حالة حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات; مع اشتراط تبرير التأخير إذا تجاوز الإخطار المهلة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "unless the breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "not later than 72 hours after becoming aware of the breach", "target": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "إذا لم يُخطر خلال المهلة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 4"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 4 expressly requires notifying “the Authority” (الهيئة), which functions as the supervisory authority under the statute; the text need not repeat “competent” where a single authority is designated. The 72-hour limit from discovery is stated verbatim, and the risk-based exception is present (though phrased in terms of rights only). The explicit “where feasible” qualifier is not stated, but the rule requiring reasons for late notification functionally substitutes for feasibility; hence the condition slot is marked partial.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-346", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law allows for flexibility in the notification period, which undermines the analyst's claim of a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "This phrase could be interpreted as allowing the data controller to notify the Authority at any time within the 72-hour period, rather than requiring notification within 72 hours."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "وفي حال لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "why": "This provision allows for some flexibility in the notification period, which undermines the analyst's claim of a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Target Jurisdiction's provision in Article 4 does not explicitly state that the notification must be made to the 'competent supervisory authority,' and the 'feasibility' condition is not clearly met.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "why": "The provision refers to 'الهيئة' (the Authority) instead of 'competent supervisory authority.'"}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "The provision does not explicitly include the 'feasibility' condition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "074363ee1a72941c8326", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "9536e03a0aa7b4781fc7", "1fdf77ac047fc519d30b"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 563.66, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "97e619b88117ac7b168a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Concerns conditions for disclosure of personal data; does not address DPO resourcing or support."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Information security controls; no linkage to supporting or resourcing the DPO."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Relates to processing for a realized interest and record-keeping; not about DPO or resources."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Sets disclosure safeguards and documentation; no DPO or resourcing obligation."}, {"id": "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "reason": "Access right limitations; not about DPO support or resources."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Data quality obligations; unrelated to DPO resourcing."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Collection principles (purpose, minimization); not about DPO or resources."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; no duty to resource the DPO."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure obligations; not about DPO support or resources."}, {"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "reason": "Credit data processing specifics; not about DPO support or resources."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين أو تحديد شخص أو أكثر", "article": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون (1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية", "article": "المادة التاسعة عشرة"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية تضمن المحافظة على البيانات الشخصية", "article": "المادة التاسعة عشرة"}, "scope": {"span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في جهة التحكم متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات المعمول بها داخل جهة التحكم والإشراف عليها، وتلقي الطلبات المتعلقة بالبيانات الشخصية وفقاً لأحكام النظام ولوائحه", "article": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون (3)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة 32(1): \"تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين أو تحديد شخص أو أكثر\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "obligation (على جهة التحكم / تقوم جهة التحكم)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة 19: \"على جهة التحكم اتخاذ ما يلزم...\"؛ والمادة 32(1): \"تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين...\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide the resources necessary for the data protection officer to carry out the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target_value": "اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية (عام) + تعيين/تحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "المادة 19: \"اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل...\"؛ والمادة 32(1)-(3): تعيين المسؤول وتحديد مهامه", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "supporting the data protection officer in performing the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target_value": "مهام مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية: متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام، مراقبة الإجراءات، تلقي الطلبات، وغيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة 32(3)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Addressing the objection: Article 32 establishes a DPO role with defined tasks, and Article 19 imposes an obligation on the controller to take necessary organizational/administrative/technical measures, which conceptually implies providing means to enable compliance, including the DPO’s functions. However, there is no explicit duty to provide resources to the DPO, so coverage is assessed as partial via distributed implication rather than direct text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-456", "gdpr_article": 38, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict can be falsified as the provisions provide a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-456] under different terminology.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون: مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 32 implies that the controller has an obligation to provide the necessary resources for the data protection officer to perform their tasks."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في جهة التحكم متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات المعمول بها داخل جهة التحكم والإشراف عليها", "why": "Article 32(3) outlines the tasks of the data protection officer, which suggests that the controller is obliged to provide the necessary resources for the data protection officer to carry out these tasks."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the modality and action slots may be too strict, as some provisions in the KSA jurisdiction imply a responsibility to provide resources for data protection.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون: مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article implies that the controller must appoint or designate a person to be responsible for data protection, which may include providing necessary resources."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "span": "المادة التاسعة عشرة: على جهة التحكم اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية", "why": "This article states that the controller must take measures to ensure the protection of personal data, including when transferring it, which may imply a responsibility to provide resources for data protection."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "8394f801a0a97e521f68"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 517.9, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "c9967459e5116636b412", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
