but it does not explicitly state that this is an Article 6(1)-type lawful-basis condition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "3f916831456908af27d8", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 591.83, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "2d8afebf6b7ea02b3997", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Addresses duties toward an already appointed DPO (roles/resources/conflict of interest), not the obligation or triggers to designate."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Concerns rights related to automated processing and human review; no bearing on DPO designation."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Concerns the right to restrict processing; unrelated to DPO appointment triggers."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles and tasks after appointment; does not establish the obligation or conditions to appoint."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanisms and sanctions; not about DPO designation."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information; no DPO appointment obligation."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "General processor obligations and record-keeping; does not impose DPO designation triggers."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to DPO appointment."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to DPO appointment."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification mentions DPO contact details but does not create or define the appointment obligation or its triggers."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "General discretionary exemption power for establishments not processing large volumes; it does not mention DPOs or courts, and is not a specific carve-out comparable to GDPR Art. 37(1)(a)'s court exception."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك في أي من الأحوال الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة من شأنها إحداث خطر ذو مستوى عالي على سرية وخصوصية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات نتيجة اعتماد تقنيات جديدة أو مرتبطة بحجم البيانات. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتضمن تقييم ممنهج وشامل للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة بما يشمل التنميط والمعالجة المؤتمتة. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتم على حجم كبير من البيانات الشخصية الحساسة.", "article": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "controller and processor", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 10(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب (must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات (appoint a DPO)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "(a) public authority/body (with court carve-out for (a)); (b) core activities require regular/systematic monitoring on a large scale; (c) core activities are large-scale processing of special categories and criminal data", "target_value": "(a) high risk due to new technologies or data volume; (b) systematic and comprehensive evaluation of sensitive personal data incl. profiling/automated processing; (c) large volume of sensitive personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "For point (a), courts acting in their judicial capacity are excluded", "target_value": "No specific exception stated; no court carve-out; general exemption power in Art. 3 is not DPO-specific", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated in the appointment provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "Article 10 directly obligates processors to appoint a DPO but under a different, risk/sensitivity-based trigger set than GDPR Art. 37. There is no target-text analogue to the GDPR court exception, and Article 3’s general exemption authority is discretionary and not DPO-specific. Thus, the match is partial due to differing triggers and the absence of the court carve-out.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity is not explicitly mentioned in the counterpart provision.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "span": "المادة (3) سلطة المكتب في الإعفاء", "why": "This article mentions the authority's power to exempt certain establishments, but does not specifically mention courts acting in their judicial capacity."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article requires the appointment of a data protection officer, but does not explicitly exclude courts acting in their judicial capacity."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart to GDPR requirement found in Article 3 of the UAE law", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "span": "المادة (3) سلطة المكتب في الإعفاء", "why": "Article 3 grants the authority to exempt certain entities from some or all of the requirements of the data protection regulations, which could potentially apply to courts acting in a judicial capacity"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "877fafe0080725188d05", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 543.74, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "671ccc35319886aa7da1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Data portability right; not a cross-border transfer regime for controllers."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Generic requirement to set internal procedures (including transfer procedures); does not establish cross-border transfer conditions/prohibitions."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General protection statement; no operative cross-border transfer rule."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Special-category disclosure ban; not specific to cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Enforcement powers (including stopping transfers to a country or international organisation); not a controller-facing transfer condition."}, {"id": "ae67f8fe376642167563", "reason": "Permit for special-category processing; not a general cross-border transfer condition."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; unrelated to transfers."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application content for special categories; not a general cross-border transfer regime."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation; not about transfers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 37"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 37"}, "action": {"span": "نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "article": "Article 37"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 23"}, "condition": {"span": "بضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة", "article": "Article 38"}, "exception": {"span": "ولا يشترط الحصول على موافقة صاحب البيانات الشخصية في إحدى الحالات الآتية: 1- إذا كان تنفيذاً لالتزام دولي بموجب اتفاقية تكون سلطنة عمان طرفاً فيها. 2- إذا كان النقل أو التحويل قد تم بطريقة تؤدي إلى إخفاء هوية صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 37"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 37"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 37"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": "Obligation to obtain explicit consent before transfer; permission to transfer subject to regulatory controls; prohibition if processing is unlawful or harmful", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 37; Article 23"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "transfer personal data to a third country or to an international organisation, including onward transfers", "target_value": "transfer or transmit personal data outside Oman (no express mention of onward transfers or international organisations in controller obligations)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 37"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data that are undergoing processing or intended for processing after transfer; includes onward transfers from the third country or international organisation", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية (no express statement about data ‘intended for processing after transfer’ or onward transfers)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "subject to the other provisions of the GDPR; Chapter V conditions must be complied with", "target_value": "explicit consent; ensure adequate protection not less than Omani law at the foreign recipient; comply with regulatory controls; no harm to national security/high state interests", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23; Article 37; Article 38"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "when the conditions laid down in Chapter V are complied with", "target_value": "consent not required if based on an international obligation or if data are anonymised", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 37"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "before transferring (قبل نقل أو تحويل)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 37"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "The OMN texts set transfer conditions (consent, adequacy, regulatory controls, and national security) but do not structure a default prohibition unless a Chapter V–style regime is met, and they do not address onward transfers. Article 23 authorizes transfers subject to regulation and only prohibits them in limited cases, and controller-facing provisions do not expressly reference transfers to international organisations. Hence RU-545 is only partially covered.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-545", "gdpr_article": 44, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 18, "total": 30}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential inconsistency in the interpretation of modality, scope, and conditions for personal data transfer between GDPR and OMN jurisdiction", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة.", "why": "Conditional permission for data transfer under OMN jurisdiction might align with GDPR's conditions under Chapter V"}, {"id": "Article 37", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Explicit consent required for data transfer in OMN jurisdiction could be seen as a specific condition similar to those in GDPR"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-545], specifically with regards to onward transfers and the conditions for transferring personal data outside Oman.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة.", "why": "This provision allows the controller to transfer personal data outside Oman, but does not explicitly prohibit transfers unless certain conditions are met."}, {"id": "Article 37", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية،", "why": "This provision requires explicit consent for transferring personal data outside Oman, but does not cover onward transfers."}, {"id": "Article 38", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires the controller to ensure adequate protection for personal data transferred outside Oman, but does not explicitly address transfers to third countries or international organisations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "3f916831456908af27d8", "ae67f8fe376642167563", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 620.97, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "480379223b233a23984f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information generally; mentions procedures in case of breach but does not impose a controller duty to notify data subjects of an actual breach."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no data-breach notification to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; no breach-notification duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing/objection; unrelated to breach notice to data subjects."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; no breach-notification duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint to authority; not a controller duty to notify data subjects of breaches."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no data-subject breach notification requirement."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not create or qualify a duty to notify data subjects of breaches."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures (e.g., encryption) obligations; does not state exceptions to data-subject breach notification."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations and records; no data-subject breach notification duty."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Contact methods; does not impose breach-notification to data subjects."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 9 (title)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "communicate the personal data breach to the data subject", "target_value": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "communication of personal data breaches to data subjects", "target_value": "الإبلاغ/إخطار صاحب البيانات عن الانتهاك أو الاختراق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "a personal data breach is likely to result in a high risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "إذا كان الانتهاك/الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بيانات صاحب البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "no notification if: (a) data rendered unintelligible (e.g., encryption); (b) subsequent measures remove likelihood of high risk; or (c) disproportionate effort to notify individually", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay", "target_value": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "UAE Article 9(2) creates a clear duty for controllers to notify data subjects of a breach, but the timing is set by executive regulations rather than “without undue delay.” The statute text provided contains no exceptions analogous to GDPR Art. 34(3). Article 5’s general security duty is not an exception to breach notification and does not displace the notification requirement.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-362", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE regulation may have a counterpart to the GDPR requirement, albeit with some differences in terminology and scope.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 9 provides a framework for notification of personal data breaches, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": " خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "why": "The regulation does not specify the exact timeframe for notification, but provides a framework for notification, which could be seen as a partial coverage of the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not explicitly state that notification of personal data breaches to data subjects must be without undue delay, and there may be exceptions to this requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "why": "This provision implies that the notification may not be without undue delay, as the timing and procedures are determined by the Executive Regulations."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات", "why": "This provision does not explicitly state that there are no exceptions to the notification requirement."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "أن تكون البيانات الشخصية محفوظة بشكل آمن بما فيها حمايتها من أي انتهاك أو اختراق أو معالجة غير مشروعة أو غير مصرح بها", "why": "This provision could be interpreted as an exception to the notification requirement, as the controller may take measures to protect against breaches."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 609.19, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "1caeee0c219f6e12b85e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "DPIA content and sharing with processors; does not address informing about changes to sub-processors."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Data subject request handling; unrelated to sub-processing notifications."}, {"id": "a2fc439bdbcbe5a48a04", "reason": "Rectification notice to recipients; not about processor-to-controller notice for sub-processors."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Withdrawal of consent; unrelated to sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "reason": "Health data processing safeguards; no rule on notifying controller about sub-processors."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National register of controllers; no operative duty on sub-processor change notices."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Transparency to data subjects; not about controller notification of sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "General framework on choosing processors and stating regulations may include rules on subsequent contracting; no explicit obligation to inform controller before adding/replacing sub-processors."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; no sub-processing notification duty."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO duties at the controller; not about processor notifying controller of sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "High-level DPIA requirement; no sub-processor change notice."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على جهة المعالجة قبل قيامها بأي تعاقدات لاحقة مع جهات معالجة فرعية الالتزام بالآتي:", "article": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على جهة المعالجة", "article": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "action": {"span": "إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات وتمكين جهة التحكم من الاعتراض عليها خلال مدة يتفق عليها بين جهة التحكم وجهة المعالجة.", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "scope": {"span": "أي تعاقدات لاحقة مع جهات معالجة فرعية", "article": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "condition": {"span": "الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "processor (جهة المعالجة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "must (يجب على)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "inform the controller of any intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors", "target_value": "notify the controller before entering into sub-processor contracts and allow objection", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "sub-processing", "target_value": "sub-processor contracting (جهات معالجة فرعية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the controller has given general written authorisation to engage other processors", "target_value": "no limitation to general authorisation; instead, processor must obtain prior approval in all cases and notify before sub-processor contracting", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] (no exceptions stated)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "before implementing the intended changes", "target_value": "before entering into those (sub-processor) contracts", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5)(ج) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(5) [593beb6b1fe15a8fda31] (no specific consequence stated)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "While the KSA text does not hinge the notice duty on a ‘general written authorisation’, it imposes a stricter, general rule: the processor must notify the controller before any sub-processor contracting and even obtain prior approval and allow objection. This functionally satisfies the GDPR RU’s core obligation to inform the controller before implementing changes to sub-processing. The condition slot is thus broader in the KSA text, not absent.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-226", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provision requires prior approval from the controller, whereas the GDPR requirement only obliges the processor to inform the controller of intended changes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[593beb6b1fe15a8fda31]", "span": "Article 17(5)(ج)", "why": "The provision requires prior approval from the controller, which may not fully align with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction's provision does not explicitly address the requirement of informing the controller of intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors before implementing the changes, in the context of general written authorization.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "span": "ج- الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم، على أن يتم إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات وتمكين جهة التحكم من الاعتراض عليها خلال مدة يتفق عليها بين جهة التحكم وجهة المعالجة.", "why": "This provision requires prior approval and notification, but does not explicitly address the requirement of informing the controller of intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors before implementing the changes, in the context of general written authorization."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "a2fc439bdbcbe5a48a04", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 562.2, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "385473c7d8c572d82488", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Revocation of authorization; no rule about courts suspending proceedings or lis pendens."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "External auditor appointment and access; no judicial competence or suspension of proceedings."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; not about court procedure or inter-jurisdictional lis pendens."}, {"id": "498c9c637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry powers and cooperation with foreign DP authorities; administrative cooperation, not court authority to suspend proceedings."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Record retention; unrelated to court proceedings."}, {"id": "90a1f5873d102c323383", "reason": "Court may order confiscation as an additional penalty; does not address suspending proceedings or lis pendens."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "reason": "Administrative complaint mechanism to the competent authority; not a court rule and no permission to suspend judicial proceedings. (Addresses reviewer objection.)"}, {"id": "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "reason": "Administrative timeline for deciding authorization requests and ministerial appeal; not a court rule on suspending proceedings. (Addresses reviewer objection.)"}, {"id": "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "reason": "Duty to notify amendments to authorization data; no relation to court proceedings."}, {"id": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "reason": "Minister’s administrative sanctions (including suspension of authorization), not judicial suspension of court proceedings."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "reason": "Data subject may request to halt processing pending a decision; not a court or lis pendens rule."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rule on courts suspending proceedings."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "any competent court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "suspend its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.88, "reasoning_note": "No provision grants courts a permission to suspend proceedings due to parallel cases elsewhere. Article 41 and Article 7 regulate administrative complaints and authorization processing, not judicial lis pendens or court procedure. The only court-related text (Article 31) concerns confiscation penalties, not suspension.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-927", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart may exist under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "Implies a mechanism for handling disputes and complaints related to data protection"}, {"id": "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "span": "تتولى الإدارة المختصة دراسة طلب التصريح والبت فيه خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (45) خمسة وأربعين يوماً من تاريخ استيفاء البيانات والمستندات المطلوبة", "why": "Suggests a system for handling requests and complaints"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart in Article 41 and Article 7", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "Mechanism for handling disputes and complaints related to data processing"}, {"id": "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "span": "تتولى الإدارة المختصة دراسة طلب التصريح والبت فيه خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (45) خمسة وأربعين يوماً من تاريخ استيفاء البيانات والمستندات المطلوبة", "why": "Competent authority's responsibility to study and decide on requests for authorization"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "90a1f5873d102c323383", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "c7ddf58d01bb4d45c9d5", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "caad155111190c1aa274"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 494.9, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "870ec43deab20fdf3fb6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "General right to obtain information; not the content requirements of a data-subject breach communication."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Requires providing contact methods for the controller generally; does not prescribe content of breach notifications."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint procedure; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing/objection; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no prescription of breach notice content to data subjects."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties and contact; does not require including this in data-subject breach notices."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to breach-notification content."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; no specific rule on breach notice content to data subjects."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no requirement to include DPO contact in data-subject breach notices."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; unrelated to breach-notification content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": "وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall include)", "target_value": "obligation (يجب على المتحكم ... وموافاته بالإجراءات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include at least DPO/contact (33(3)(b)), likely consequences (33(3)(c)), and measures taken/proposed incl. mitigation (33(3)(d)) in the communication", "target_value": "provide the data subject with the measures taken (وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله); no express requirement to include DPO/contact or likely consequences in the data-subject notice", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 9(2); cf. Art. 9(1)(b),(c),(d) (authority notice only)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "content of the communication to data subjects under Article 34(1)", "target_value": "content of the breach notification to the data subject (measures taken)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "when communicating a personal data breach to data subjects pursuant to Art. 34(1)", "target_value": "when a breach would affect the privacy/confidentiality/security of the data subject’s personal data", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None (not specified in this RU)", "target_value": "within the period set by the executive regulations", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "no specific consequence tied to inclusion of information in the data-subject notice", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "The UAE text requires notifying the data subject of a breach and providing him with the measures taken, but it does not require including the DPO/contact point or the likely consequences in that communication. Those elements appear only for notifications to the regulator in Art. 9(1), not for the data-subject notice in Art. 9(2). Therefore, the target provision only partially covers the GDPR RU-364 content requirement.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-364", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-364] under different terminology and distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 9 of the UAE jurisdiction requires the controller to report the breach to the authorities and provide certain information, including the nature of the breach, its consequences, and the measures taken to mitigate its effects."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "1. بالإضافة إلى التزامات المتحكم المنصوص عليها في هذا المرسوم بقانون، يلتزم المتحكم بمجرد علمه بوجود أي اختراق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات الذي من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته، بإبلاغ المكتب عن هذا الاختراق أو الانتهاك ونتائج التحقيق خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون، على أن يكون الإبلاغ مشفوعاً بالبيانات والمستندات الآتية:", "why": "Article 9(1) of the UAE jurisdiction requires the controller to report the breach to the authorities and provide certain information."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require the controller to include all the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR when notifying the data subject of a personal data breach.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية 1. ... 2. وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية، خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون، وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله.", "why": "This provision only requires the controller to notify the data subject and provide him with the measures taken, but it does not specify that the notification must include all the information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 581.5, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "10e449837c44898234fa", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; does not address penalty standards or a duty to ensure effectiveness/proportionality/deterrence."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementing decisions; no standard on penalties being effective, proportionate, or dissuasive."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Rules for exercising data subject rights; not about penalties or their qualitative standards."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and security; not a state obligation to ensure penalty effectiveness/proportionality/deterrence."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from disclosure obligations; not about penalties' E/P/D standard."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain obligations; not a penalty-standard provision."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Supervisory authority functions (awareness, research); does not set E/P/D standards for penalties."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Complaint handling and remedial orders; not about ensuring penalties are effective/proportionate/dissuasive."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule; unrelated to penalty standards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "article": "Article 32"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "Member States", "target": "جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "ensure that penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are effective, proportionate and dissuasive", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Articles 23, 24 (penalties exist but no E/P/D standard)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 32 directly establishes an obligation on competent authorities to implement the law, which functionally maps to the GDPR modality and addressee. However, no provision requires that the statutory penalties be effective, proportionate, and dissuasive; Articles 23 and 24 set fine maxima but contain no such qualitative standard. Thus, the core ‘ensure E/P/D’ action is not textually expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-950", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's citation of Article 23 and Article 24 as evidence for the 'action' slot is unsupported, and the 'addressee' slot verdict is questionable.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون.", "why": "This article could be interpreted as a counterpart to the GDPR's 'Member States' addressee."}, {"id": "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال، كل من خالف أياً من أحكام المواد (4)، (8)، (9)، (10)، (11)، (12)، (14)، (15)، (22) من هذا القانون.", "why": "This article only mentions the penalties for violating specific provisions, but does not explicitly state that the penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the modality of obligation is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "why": "This article establishes an obligation for competent authorities to implement the law, which could be seen as a counterpart to the modality of obligation in the GDPR requirement unit [RU-950]."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "9548224453cca1301899", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 581.25, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "39427e8cc7eb346aee58", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Creates an administrative complaint mechanism to the ministry; does not grant or mention a right to monetary compensation from a controller or processor."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Relates to permit application content for processing; no civil remedies or compensation right."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Addresses cancellation of permits as an administrative sanction; no private compensation right."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Sets ministry powers (including receiving complaints); does not create a compensatory remedy for individuals."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Imposes breach notification duties; does not confer a right to damages."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions provision; contains no compensation entitlement."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Concerns designation of a DPO; unrelated to compensation rights."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Concerns retention of processing records; no compensation right."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "Lists DPO tasks; does not address individual compensation."}], "target_frame": {"proposition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "addressee": {"span": "الغير", "article": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "article": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"}, "condition": {"span": "الضرر الناتج عن الاختراق", "article": "38c6f7484322711d7d32"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Any person who has suffered material or non-material damage as a result of an infringement of this Regulation has the right to receive compensation from the controller or processor for the damage suffered.", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "proposition"}, {"gdpr_value": "any person who has suffered material or non-material damage", "target_value": "الغير", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "receive compensation from the controller or processor for the damage suffered", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "damage resulting from an infringement of this Regulation", "target_value": "بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the person has suffered material or non-material damage as a result of an infringement of this Regulation", "target_value": "الضرر الناتج عن الاختراق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "The target texts provide an administrative complaint pathway and characterize the processor as an agent for purposes of civil liability, but they do not state a right for an individual to receive compensation from a controller or processor. The reviewer’s objection is valid: no provision explicitly or functionally grants the GDPR-style compensation right. Mentions of harm (from breaches) and violations are not linked to a compensatory remedy.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-929", "gdpr_article": 82, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts for the right to receive compensation might exist under different terminology or through the application of civil liability provisions in Articles 3 and 41.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "span": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "why": "Implies application of civil liability, which could include compensation for damages."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة", "why": "Provides a mechanism for reporting violations, which could be a precursor to seeking compensation."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the right to receive compensation, which is the core of the proposition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام القانون وهذه اللائحة", "why": "This provision implies that the data subject or any other person with an interest has the right to submit a complaint or report, but it does not explicitly mention the right to receive compensation."}, {"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم في سبيل معالجته للبيانات الشخصية التعاقد مع المعالج", "why": "This provision implies that the controller may contract with the processor, but it does not explicitly mention the right to receive compensation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["823830174d241884bd73", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "caad155111190c1aa274", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "db1b46495b01511abeef"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 548.42, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "3e9a193145e90d96fd0b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
