nal data must remain confidential subject to an obligation of professional secrecy under Union or Member State law, including a statutory obligation of secrecy.", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.26, "reasoning_note": "No Kuwait provisions were provided to analyze against the GDPR requirement. Without target text, each slot is marked uncovered on an absent basis. Provide relevant statutory excerpts to enable a substantive comparison.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-088", "gdpr_article": 14, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 2, "latency_s": 104.45, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "f1b86bb9d04aa1d883aa", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["93fde8c87940ae524c86"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; no duty to inform data subjects or disclose controller identity."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of the authority’s information; unrelated to controller-to-data-subject information duties."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing; no information duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "30fc4eea1adc8ce439a8", "reason": "Prior authorization regime; not an information duty toward data subjects."}, {"id": "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "reason": "Definitions only; does not itself impose the duty to provide identity information."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ transparency generally; not tied to the scenario where data were not obtained from the data subject."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "reason": "Journalism/arts exemption; not an information duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing conditions; not an information duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "On-request notification right; not the proactive duty when data were obtained from a third source."}, {"id": "d958c933b41c24227c12", "reason": "Confidentiality of processing; no duty to inform identity in the non-direct collection scenario."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Rectification/blocking/erasure; not an information duty on initial indirect collection."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إحاطة صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "action": {"span": "اسم مدير البيانات كاملاً ... وعنوانه", "article": "Article 17(1)(أ) (as referenced by Article 17(2)(أ))"}, "scope": {"span": "إحاطة صاحب البيانات ... بالمعلومات المشار إليها", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حالة الحصول على البيانات من غير صاحبها", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يسري حكم البند (2) من هذه المادة في الحالتين التاليتين: أ - إذا كانت معالَجة البيانات لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي، وكانت إحاطة صاحب البيانات بالبيانات المشار إليها متعذرة أو تتطلَّب بذل جهود مرهقة غير عادية... ب - إذا كانت معالَجة البيانات تتم لغرض تنفيذ التزام يرتِّبه القانون ... أو أمر من محكمة مختصة أو النيابة العامة أو قاضي التحقيق، أو النيابة العسكرية.", "article": "Article 17(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال خمسة أيام من البدء في تسجيل هذه البيانات", "article": "Article 17(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على مدير البيانات (duty to inform)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "provide the data subject with the identity of the controller", "target": "إحاطة صاحب البيانات بـ \"اسم مدير البيانات كاملاً ... وعنوانه\"", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(2)(أ) in conjunction with Article 17(1)(أ)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "information duties when personal data were not obtained from the data subject", "target": "إحاطة صاحب البيانات بالمعلومات عند الحصول على البيانات من غير صاحبها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where personal data have not been obtained from the data subject", "target": "في حالة الحصول على البيانات من غير صاحبها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "Art. 14(5): data subject already has info; impossible/disproportionate effort (esp. research/statistics), or obligation would impair objectives; obtaining/disclosure laid down by law with safeguards; professional secrecy confidentiality", "target": "Art. 17(3): exception when (a) research/historical/statistical and informing is impossible or requires extraordinary burdensome efforts; (b) processing to execute a legal obligation or pursuant to court/prosecutorial orders.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 17(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None specified in this RU", "target": "خلال خمسة أيام من البدء في تسجيل هذه البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 17(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Not specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 17(2) requires informing the data subject, within five days of indirect collection, including the controller’s name and address, which covers the RU’s core obligation. However, Article 17(3) introduces exceptions (research with impossibility/extraordinary effort; processing to execute legal obligations or court/prosecutorial orders) that only partially overlap with GDPR Art. 14(5). This analysis explicitly incorporates those exceptions in the slot verdict.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-086", "gdpr_article": 14, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may not fully account for the exceptions and nuances in the provisions, particularly in Article 17(3).", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "span": "Article 17(3)", "why": "This provision provides exceptions to the obligation to provide information to the data subject, which may narrow the scope of the obligation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully account for the exception introduced in Article 17(3)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "span": "لا يسري حكم البند (2) من هذه المادة في الحالتين التاليتين: أ - إذا كانت معالَجة البيانات لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي، وكانت إحاطة صاحب البيانات بالبيانات المشار إليها متعذرة أو تتطلَّب بذل جهود مرهقة غير عادية", "why": "This provision introduces an exception to the rule that is not fully accounted for in the analyst's slot verdicts"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "30fc4eea1adc8ce439a8", "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "d958c933b41c24227c12", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 513.25, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "143fa99a70b8d354ff0d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5d949837d7aab073cd67", "0897840c01b58a706cd5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; does not address administrative fines or aggregation/caps."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restrict processing; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO duties; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases without consent; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object; no relevance to administrative fines."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; mentions the Office may impose penalties by reference to Article 26 but contains no rule on fine aggregation or a cap."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للمكتب", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "modality": {"span": "للمكتب توقيع", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "action": {"span": "توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "الجزاءات الإدارية المشار إليها في المادة (26) من هذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة المتحكم أو المعالج لأحكامه أو مخالفة القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "المكتب (the Office)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 24(3)"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition (shall not)", "target": "permission to impose (للمكتب توقيع)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 24(3)", "Article 26"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "impose a total administrative fine that exceeds the amount specified for the gravest infringement", "target": "impose administrative sanctions (no rule on totals or caps)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 24(3)", "Article 26"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "administrative fines under this Regulation", "target": "administrative sanctions under the Decree-Law", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["Article 24(3)", "Article 26"], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where a controller or processor intentionally or negligently infringes several provisions for the same or linked processing operations", "target": "in case a violation by the controller or processor is proven (generic; no multiple/linked infringement condition)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 24(3)"], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Articles 24(3) and 26 establish the Office’s authority to impose administrative sanctions and a mechanism to define them, but they contain no textual rule capping the total fine to the amount for the gravest infringement, nor any reference to multiple infringements for the same or linked operations. The reviewer’s counter-evidence shows general sanctioning power, not a cap or aggregation rule. On the provided text, the GDPR prohibition lacks a counterpart.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-509", "gdpr_article": 42, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions provide a framework for administrative penalties and exceptions to the processing of personal data, which could be considered as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "span": "المادة (24) تقديم الشكوى", "why": "Article 24 mentions the supervisory authority's power to impose administrative penalties."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "span": "المادة (26) الجزاءات والمخالفات الإدارية", "why": "Article 26 mentions the Council of Ministers' authority to determine administrative penalties."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "span": "المادة (4) حالات معالجة البيانات الشخصية بدون موافقة صاحبها", "why": "Article 4 provides exceptions to the processing of personal data, which could be relevant to multiple infringements or same/linked operations."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart in the UAE jurisdiction is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "span": "للمكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية", "why": "This provision grants the Office the authority to impose administrative sanctions, which could potentially include a cap on the amount of the fine."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "span": "يصدر مجلس الوزراء - بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب - قراراً بتحديد الأفعال التي تشكل مخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون ولائحته التنفيذية، والجزاءات الإدارية التي يتم توقيعها", "why": "This provision suggests that there is a mechanism in place to determine the administrative sanctions, which could potentially include a cap on the amount of the fine."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "57844ac856d11c289650", "877fafe0080725188d05", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 571.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "ce03bac371eaaa7679bc", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to obtain information from the controller; no rule on courts, lis pendens, or suspension of judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no provision on court competence or staying proceedings."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security of processing; unrelated to judicial proceedings or inter-court coordination."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no rule addressing courts or suspension due to foreign proceedings."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Administrative grievance against Office decisions; not a court-to-court lis pendens or stay mechanism."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border data transfers; does not concern judicial proceedings or court stays."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the PDPL; no judicial coordination or suspension of proceedings."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; not about court procedures or stays."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; no content on courts or proceedings."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to judicial proceedings or inter-state court coordination."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no rule on courts or suspension of proceedings."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints to the supervisory office; administrative process, not court lis pendens or stays."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "any competent court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "suspend its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.89, "reasoning_note": "The UAE PDPL provisions provided address data subject rights, controller/processor obligations, and administrative complaint/grievance processes, not judicial coordination or lis pendens rules. No text authorizes UAE courts to suspend proceedings due to parallel cases in another state. Therefore, the GDPR Article 81 permission has no counterpart in the cited UAE statute.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-927", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5d949837d7aab073cd67"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 293.46, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "513762096add5eb9c507", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
