 must remain confidential subject to an obligation of professional secrecy.", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.46, "reasoning_note": "No target-jurisdiction provisions were available for analysis, so no textual counterpart could be identified. All slots are therefore unexpressed in the target text. If relevant Kuwait provisions are supplied, the analysis can be updated.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-086", "gdpr_article": 14, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 2, "latency_s": 111.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "95205893a0eb871fa8e1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Addresses withdrawal of consent for processing; no text on international transfers, adequacy mechanisms, or supervisory authority approvals."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Sets general grounds for disclosure; does not address cross-border transfer regimes, adequacy decisions, or any prohibition on supervisory authority requiring authorization."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "General consent requirement; no relation to international transfers or supervisory authority authorization."}, {"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "reason": "Savings clause preserving stronger protections in other laws or international treaties; does not mention adequacy decisions, cross-border transfer authorizations, or limits on supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "reason": "Consent mechanics; no content on cross-border transfers, adequacy, or supervisory authority authorization."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Controller–processor selection obligations; unrelated to international transfer authorization or adequacy."}, {"id": "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "reason": "Exceptions to consent as a lawful basis; does not regulate cross-border transfers or supervisory authority authorization for transfers."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Data subject access right; no bearing on international transfers or supervisory authority authorization."}, {"id": "61ba0c29028cbdc39cc7", "reason": "Direct marketing communications; no bearing on international transfer authorization or adequacy."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure obligations; no bearing on international transfers or supervisory authority authorization."}, {"id": "0003cd906d382a2dcf02", "reason": "Copying of identification documents; unrelated to international transfer authorization or adequacy."}, {"id": "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "reason": "Prohibits conditioning services on consent; no relation to cross-border transfers or supervisory authority authorization."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "require any specific authorisation for a transfer based on an adequacy decision", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "transfers of personal data permitted under Article 45(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the transfer is based on a Commission adequacy decision", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.55, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided KSA provisions address adequacy-based international transfers or restrict the supervisory authority from requiring specific authorization. Article 3 is a general savings clause about stronger protections in other laws or treaties, and Article 6 provides lawful-basis exceptions; neither establishes an adequacy regime nor a prohibition on authority approvals. Therefore, the GDPR Art. 45 prohibition is not textually present in the cited KSA materials.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-550", "gdpr_article": 45, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential indirect support through recognition of international agreements", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "span": "المادة الثالثة: لا تخل الأحكام والإجراءات المنصوص عليها في النظام بأي حكم يمنح حقًا لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو يقرر حماية أفضل لها، ينص عليه نظام آخر أو اتفاقية دولية تكون المملكة طرًفا فيها.", "why": "Indicates the KSA's potential recognition of international agreements, which could include Commission adequacy decisions."}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for accommodation of adequacy decisions through international agreements and public interest exceptions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "span": "المادة الثالثة: لا تخل الأحكام والإجراءات المنصوص عليها في النظام بأي حكم يمنح حقًا لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو يقرر حماية أفضل لها، ينص عليه نظام آخر أو اتفاقية دولية تكون المملكة طرًفا فيها.", "why": "Suggests respect for international agreements that could include adequacy decisions"}, {"id": "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "span": "المادة السادسة: لا تخضع معالجة البيانات الشخصية للموافقة المشار إليها في الفقرة (1) من المادة (الخامسة) من النظام، في الأحوال الآتية: ...", "why": "Provides exceptions for public interest or official authority tasks that could encompass transfers based on adequacy decisions"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["952167864cc3b0d724c1", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "61ba0c29028cbdc39cc7", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "0003cd906d382a2dcf02", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 521.73, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "951a18f6b60ec54df3a8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to data subject/authority; not about informing identity at collection."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosing/transferring data to a processor; not about data-subject information duties."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal governance and complaint/access handling; not the pre-collection information duty."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restrictions; unrelated to identity disclosure to data subjects."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; does not impose the information duty at collection."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Article 21 exempts the controller only from obligations under Article 6; it does not qualify Article 9’s duty to inform about the controller’s identity."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General transparency principle; does not specify informing identity at collection."}, {"id": "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "reason": "Special rules for children’s websites; not the general identity disclosure duty at collection."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations and privacy policies; no explicit duty to inform identity at the time of collection."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and breach notice from processor to controller; not data-subject information at collection."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data minimization/accuracy/retention; not the identity information duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب ... أن يُعلم الفرد", "article": "Article 9"}, "action": {"span": "أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "article": "Article 9"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "controller (المراقب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9: \"على المراقب\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "obligation to inform (على المراقب ... أن يُعلم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with the identity of the controller", "target_value": "inform the individual of the controller’s details (بيانات المراقب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9: \"أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب\"", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where personal data relating to a data subject are collected from the data subject", "target_value": "No source-specific condition; applies generally", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9 (general duty without limiting source of data)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "where and insofar as the data subject already has the information", "target_value": "No corresponding exception stated for Article 9 duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "at the time when personal data are obtained", "target_value": "before starting any processing (قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 9", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Article 9 directly requires the controller to inform the individual of the controller’s details, but only “before starting processing,” which may occur after data are obtained, and it contains no exception for cases where the individual already has the information. Article 21 does not alter this duty because it expressly exempts only obligations under Article 6, not the Article 9 information duty. Therefore, the identity-disclosure obligation is covered in substance, but the temporal alignment and the GDPR-specific exception are not.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-054", "gdpr_article": 13, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction may have an implicit counterpart to the GDPR exception", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "why": "This phrase could be interpreted as implying that the controller only needs to provide the information when it is necessary"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not account for the exception in Article 21", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "Article 21", "why": "This provision provides an exception to the controller's obligation to inform the data subject, which is not accounted for in the analyst's verdict"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "455aae046cacf7979576"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 626.53, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "26f7004b4456b98f7bef", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["67a122f7dc547487996a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9f1a7c4e431c85895eff", "reason": "Breach-notification content and timing; does not set criteria for deciding administrative fines."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "DPIA requirement; unrelated to sanctioning criteria."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "Sets supervisory functions and tools, but not factors for imposing fines."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "reason": "Information security obligations; not about fine-calculation criteria."}, {"id": "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rule on sanctions."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure conditions; not about sanction decision-making."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for a realized interest; unrelated to sanctions."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases for collection/processing; not sanction criteria."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor-selection obligations; not sanction criteria."}, {"id": "ccbc630de03e970296c4", "reason": "Civil compensation for damage; distinct from administrative fine criteria."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure right; not about administrative fines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تكون بقرار من رئيس الجهة المختصة، لجنة (أو أكثر) ... تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة ... وذلك بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "action": {"span": "وذلك بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "each supervisory authority", "target": "لجنة تُشكَّل بقرار من رئيس الجهة المختصة تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع الغرامة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "تتولى ... وإيقاع عقوبة ... وذلك بحسب نوع المخالفة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "give due regard to the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement", "target": "إيقاع العقوبة بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 36(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "including the nature, scope or purpose of processing, number of data subjects affected, and level of damage", "target": "نوع المخالفة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 36(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "when deciding whether to impose an administrative fine and on the amount in each individual case", "target": "عند نظر المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 36(2) requires the sanctioning committee (within the supervisory authority) to base fines on the type of violation, its seriousness, and the extent of its impact. It does not expressly require consideration of duration, the nature/scope/purpose of the processing, or the number of data subjects, so alignment with GDPR Art. 83(2) is only partial. The reviewer’s objection is valid as to these unexpressed factors.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-938", "gdpr_article": 83, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not fully supported by the provisions cited, and the KSA provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(2)", "why": "Does not explicitly mention the 'duration' of the infringement as a factor to be considered when imposing penalties."}, {"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(2)", "why": "Does not fully capture the scope of the GDPR requirement unit, which includes the 'nature, scope, or purpose of the processing concerned, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage suffered by them'."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provisions do not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-938], specifically with regards to considering the duration of the infringement, the nature, scope, or purpose of the processing concerned, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage suffered by them.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(2)", "why": "The article does not explicitly mention the duration of the infringement, the nature, scope, or purpose of the processing concerned, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage suffered by them."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9f1a7c4e431c85895eff", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "67a122f7dc547487996a", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "ccbc630de03e970296c4", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 610.94, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "43512cc05a03b820cb1a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "General right to obtain information; mentions procedures in case of a breach but not the content of post-incident communication to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to breach communications."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support duties; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Territorial/material scope; not breach notification content."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; does not specify breach communication content to data subjects."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "describe in clear and plain language the nature of the personal data breach in the communication", "target_value": "Unexpressed for data-subject notice; only requires notifying the data subject and informing them of procedures taken. The requirement to state the nature of the breach appears only in the notification to the Office.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 9(2); cf. Article 9(1)(a)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "content of the communication to data subjects under Article 34(1)", "target_value": "إخطار صاحب البيانات عن الاختراق/الانتهاك وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "when communicating a personal data breach to data subjects pursuant to Article 34(1)", "target_value": "إذا كان الانتهاك/الاختراق يمس خصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated specific to this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 9(2) requires notifying data subjects and informing them of procedures taken, but it does not require describing the nature of the breach, nor does it mandate clear and plain language. The phrase mandating a statement of the nature of the breach appears in Article 9(1)(a) and applies to notifications to the Office, not to data-subject communications.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-363", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law requires a description of the nature of the breach, which could be considered as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "بيان طبيعة الاختراق أو الانتهاك، وصورته، وأسبابه، والعدد التقريبي له وسجلاته", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller is required to provide a description of the nature of the breach."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies that the controller must communicate the breach to the data subject in a way that is clear and understandable."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 444.3, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "1dc52000a45f809243b6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["3f916831456908af27d8", "498c9cb637b86367567b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Post-breach procedural steps; does not confer sanctioning or fining power."}, {"id": "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "reason": "General scope of the law; no enforcement powers."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General statement of protection; no supervisory powers or fines."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Preamble issuing the regulation; no operative enforcement content."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; does not establish fining authority."}, {"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "reason": "Confers judicial policing status to staff; does not itself authorize administrative fines."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Controller security obligations; unrelated to supervisory fining powers."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Policy transparency obligation; no enforcement powers."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaint right; does not specify fining powers."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment; no fining authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "498c9cb637b86367567b"}, "modality": {"span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية:", "article": "3f916831456908af27d8"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "3f916831456908af27d8"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "الوزارة (الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق القانون)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "power", "target": "تتخذ الوزارة ... أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "3f916831456908af27d8", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "impose an administrative fine", "target": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "3f916831456908af27d8", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target": "تراه الوزارة ضرورياً", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "3f916831456908af27d8", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.48, "reasoning_note": "Article 8 empowers the Ministry to take various measures and, by catch-all, any other necessary measure. While this could conceptually encompass an administrative fine, neither Article 8 nor the provided regulation text explicitly authorizes fines or a fining framework analogous to GDPR Article 83. Hence, coverage of a specific fining power is only partial at best.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for implicit inclusion of administrative fine-like measures under broader powers granted to the Ministry", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً", "why": "This provision grants the Ministry broad powers to take any necessary measures, which could potentially include financial penalties or administrative fines, even if not explicitly stated."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بضمان سرية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "While this article discusses the controller's obligation to ensure the confidentiality of personal data, it implies a regulatory framework where non-compliance could lead to enforcement actions, potentially including fines, although this is not directly stated."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart to GDPR's administrative fine provision under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision suggests the Ministry has the authority to take necessary actions, potentially including fines, to protect personal data, which could be a counterpart to the GDPR's requirement for supervisory authorities to impose administrative fines."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "6e8de83975a220288296", "3f916831456908af27d8", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "caad155111190c1aa274", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "823830174d241884bd73", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 582.43, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "7a4053725fd42c4933a4", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
