son.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-662", "gdpr_article": 57, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information to verify the absence of a counterpart in KWT legislation.", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.0}], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 276.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "4e0c1cbf66fd7609554d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "Scope of the regulation; does not address complaints, representation, or data-subject delegation."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no relation to complaint mechanisms or third‑party representation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau): \"على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي\""}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها", "article": "Article 5(9)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Article 5 chapeau)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة (provider obligation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f (Article 4 chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "mandate a qualified not-for-profit body to lodge the complaint on the data subject's behalf", "target_value": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها؛ تحديد آلية لممارسة الحقوق (بما في ذلك الاعتراض)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a (Article 5(9)); 9f3112d28a1b850ba61f (Article 4(8))", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "Representative must be not-for-profit, properly constituted under Member State law, have public-interest objectives, and be active in protecting data subjects' rights and freedoms regarding personal data", "target_value": "No qualifications or recognition of third‑party representatives", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "The target text establishes provider-side mechanisms to receive complaints and to enable users to exercise rights, but it does not grant data subjects a right to mandate a representative, nor does it recognize or qualify not‑for‑profit representative bodies. Thus, while complaint channels exist, the representation element of GDPR Art. 80 is not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-918", "gdpr_article": 80, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect support of data subject rights through transparency and accountability mechanisms", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4, points 1, 5, 6, and 8", "why": "These points imply a level of transparency and accountability that could support data subject rights, including complaint mechanisms."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be too conservative, as there are provisions that could be interpreted as providing a mechanism for data subjects to lodge complaints through representatives.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها", "why": "This provision implies a mechanism for receiving and studying complaints, which could potentially be used by a data subject to lodge a complaint through a representative."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision provides a mechanism for data subjects to exercise their rights, including potentially lodging a complaint through a representative."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 602.93, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "8587e1b88d624b16450a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "reason": "Cross-border transfer conditions (adequacy not met); not about territorial scope or applicability triggers."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfer conditions (adequacy met); not about territorial scope or applicability triggers."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward DPO; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints/enforcement; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information; not about territorial scope."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; not about territorial scope."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "كل متحكم أو معالج متواجد خارج الدولة يقوم بمزاولة أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لأصحاب البيانات في الدولة.", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (1)(ج)"}, "modality": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (1)"}, "action": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية سواء كلها أو جزء منها عن طريق وسائل الأنظمة الإلكترونية التي تعمل بشكل تلقائي وآلي، أو غيرها من الوسائل الأخرى", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (1)"}, "condition": {"span": "متواجد خارج الدولة يقوم بمزاولة أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لأصحاب البيانات في الدولة", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (1)(ج)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية. ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها. ج. البيانات الشخصية لدى الجهات الأمنية والقضائية. د. صاحب البيانات الذي يقوم بمعالجة بياناته لأغراض شخصية. هـ. البيانات الشخصية الصحية التي لديها تشريع ينظم حماية ومعالجة تلك البيانات. و. البيانات والمعلومات الشخصية المصرفية والائتمانية التي لديها تشريع ينظم حماية ومعالجة تلك البيانات. ز. الشركات والمؤسسات الواقعة في المناطق الحرة في الدولة ولديها تشريعات خاصة بحماية البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "المادة (2)، البند (2)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller not established in the Union", "target_value": "كل متحكم أو معالج متواجد خارج الدولة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "المادة (2)، البند (1)(ج)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (2)، البند (1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "comply with this Regulation for the processing of personal data", "target_value": "تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (2)، البند (1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية سواء كلها أو جزء منها ... أو غيرها من الوسائل الأخرى", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة (2)، البند (1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the controller is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات صريحة على نطاق السريان (البيانات/الجهات الحكومية، الأمنية والقضائية، الأغراض الشخصية، البيانات الصحية/المصرفية ذات تشريعات خاصة، والمناطق الحرة ذات تشريعات خاصة).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "المادة (2)، البند (2)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 2(1)(ج) does extend the PDPL to controllers located outside the UAE, but only when processing personal data of data subjects in the State. GDPR RU-011’s trigger is different: presence in a place where the forum’s law applies by virtue of public international law, regardless of the data subjects’ location. On a textual basis, the UAE text lacks that specific public-international-law condition, so the condition slot remains uncovered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-011", "gdpr_article": 3, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the slot 'condition' is incorrect, as there is a counterpart in Article 2(1) of the UAE law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "المادة (2) نطاق سريان المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Article 2(1) of the UAE law states that the provisions of the decree-law apply to the processing of personal data, which includes processing by controllers or processors located outside the State, if the processing is related to data subjects in the State."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the absence of a counterpart for the condition related to public international law might be too narrow.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "span": "المادة (2) نطاق سريان المرسوم بقانون", "why": "Article 2(1) implies application to controllers outside the state under certain conditions, potentially covering public international law scenarios by intent if not by explicit mention."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 636.3, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "0df9431397bf07bfc801", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information right about procedures for objection; does not establish the direct-marketing objection right itself."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure grounds; not a right to object to processing for direct marketing."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing in specified cases; not the direct-marketing objection right."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making/profiling decisions; not specifically about direct marketing objection."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no right to object to direct marketing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Jurisdictional scope; not an individual right to object."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to objection to marketing."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Regulatory exemptions; not a data subject right to object."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Regulatory complaint mechanism; not the substantive right to object to marketing."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Appeal of regulator decisions; not the right to object to marketing."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to objection to direct marketing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 17"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 17"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17"}, "scope": {"span": "لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر", "article": "Article 17"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر", "article": "Article 17"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "object to processing of personal data concerning him or her for direct marketing", "target": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing for direct marketing purposes, including profiling related to such direct marketing", "target": "لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where personal data are processed for direct marketing purposes", "target": "إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated for this case", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "at any time", "target": "No temporal qualifier stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated (effect of stopping processing expressed as part of the right)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 17", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 17 directly grants a right to object to processing for direct marketing, explicitly including related profiling. However, it does not state that this right may be exercised “at any time”; the phrase “في أي من الحالات الآتية” enumerates cases, not timing. Accordingly, the temporal element is uncovered while the other elements are covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-180", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the phrase 'at any time' is not covered by the UAE jurisdiction is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة يحق لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1. إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر.", "why": "Article 17 implies that the data subject can object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes, which can be exercised at any time."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "span": "المادة (13) حق الحصول على المعلومات 1. يحق لصاحب البيانات وبناءً على طلب يقدمه إلى المتحكم ومن دون أي مقابل الحصول على المعلومات الآتية: أ. أنواع البيانات الشخصية التابعة له التي يتم معالجتها. ب. أغراض المعالجة.", "why": "Article 13 provides the data subject with the right to access information about their personal data, which implies that they can exercise their rights, including the right to object, at any time."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction's Article 17 does not explicitly state that the right to object to processing for direct marketing purposes can be exercised 'at any time', which is a key aspect of the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة يحق لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1. إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر.", "why": "Article 17 provides a right to object to processing for direct marketing purposes but does not explicitly mention that this right can be exercised 'at any time'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "c34922f387019af45e42", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ffb151edc5703b569765"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 581.36, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "3a75854ad6807f50c153", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification timing and content; does not address rectification rights."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; no rectification right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المستخدمين", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "modality": {"span": "ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "action": {"span": "تصحيحها بشكل مباشر", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته", "article": "Article 4(12)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "المستخدمين", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the rectification", "target_value": "تصحيحها بشكل مباشر", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 4(6); Art. 5(9)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "inaccurate personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "بياناته", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 4(12)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "KWT texts recognize a data subject right to correct and require providers to enable direct correction and handle correction requests, functionally covering rectification. However, they do not articulate the GDPR’s temporal qualifier of “without undue delay,” and 24/7 intake availability does not substitute for a rectification-time requirement.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-140", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no temporal requirement for rectification is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 4(6)", "span": "تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم ... وتصحيحها", "why": "This provision implies a duty to enable users to correct their personal data, but does not explicitly state a temporal requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KWT provisions do not provide a clear and explicit counterpart to the GDPR's requirement of rectification without undue delay.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(6)", "why": "Does not explicitly state that the correction must be made without undue delay."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(9)", "why": "Does not provide a clear equivalent to the GDPR's requirement of 'without undue delay'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 596.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "3c62064e3cb0563c6ae2", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
