an administrative fine", "target_value": "اتخاذ أيٍّ من التدابير المنصوص عليها في المادة (55)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 54"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target_value": "التدابير المنصوص عليها في المادة (55)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 54"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target_value": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 54"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في أول جلسة تالية لانقضاء الآجال ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 54"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 54 authorizes the Board to take measures listed in Article 55 upon a proven violation, but the provided corpus contains no text authorizing the Authority to impose administrative (pecuniary) fines. Article 60 concerns criminal reconciliation for specified offenses with payment of the statutory minimum fine, and Article 59 addresses criminal liability of legal persons—neither is an administrative fine imposed by the Authority. Without the text of Article 55, fines cannot be inferred from the reference alone.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The power to impose an administrative fine is not explicitly stated, but there are hints of measures being taken.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "54", "span": "التصرف في التحقيق", "why": "The President of the Executive Council takes action based on an investigation, which may include imposing measures."}, {"id": "59", "span": "مسئولية الشخص الاعتباري", "why": "The responsibility of a legal person is mentioned, and the possibility of imposing a fine is implied."}, {"id": "60", "span": "التصالح", "why": "The possibility of a settlement is mentioned, which implies that there may be a fine or penalty involved."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart for the action 'impose an administrative fine' is unsupported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "d962cad99243b9952541", "span": "اتخاذ أيٍّ من التدابير المنصوص عليها في المادة (55)", "why": "This provision implies the possibility of taking measures, including administrative fines, as prescribed in Article 55."}, {"id": "79c959efd73d5d166449", "span": "التصالح", "why": "This provision implies a form of administrative fine or penalty."}, {"id": "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "span": "مسئولية الشخص الاعتباري", "why": "This provision implies that a legal person can be held liable for certain actions, which could include the imposition of an administrative fine."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "d962cad99243b9952541", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "76c486b163e12a997fd8", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "79c959efd73d5d166449", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 606.1, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "93ae34fd9fba6d4b213f", "condition": "stability", "r