dpr_value": null, "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.6, "reasoning_note": "I have treated Article 15’s reference to cross-border personal data flows as contributing to the scope, addressing the reviewer’s point. However, the text does not tie this cross-border element to supervisory authority cooperation with third countries or international organisations, and the operative duty is permissive and domestic in focus. Significant gaps remain on international cooperation for enforcement and on obligatory modality.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-607", "gdpr_article": 50, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for broader interpretation of cooperation mechanisms and international scope within Article 27", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "التنسيق مع مجموعات/روابط مهنية لأغراض التنظيم الذاتي والتوعية والتدريب", "why": "Could be related to developing international cooperation mechanisms for personal data protection"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the 'scope' slot is incorrect, as Article 15 mentions the flow of personal data across borders, which is relevant to international cooperation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "span": "مع مراعاة الالتزامات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يُحظر على المراقب اتخاذ أي قرار أو إجراء من شأنه الحد من تدفق البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود", "why": "This provision mentions the flow of personal data across borders, which is relevant to international cooperation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f5c366135483fe580381", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "455aae046cacf7979576", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 570.51, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "b724a0443b45e9912d54", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "231a37f671238dbf7112"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-conviction data and identifies judicial/public bodies allowed to keep registers; does not address DPO appointment obligations or exceptions."}, {"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "Cross-border transfer exceptions; no DPO appointment content."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent requirements; no DPO appointment content."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no DPO appointment content."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing conditions; no DPO appointment content."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rights (rectification, blocking, erasure); no DPO appointment content."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Concerns investigation of a DPO’s breaches; does not specify who must appoint a DPO or when."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Automated decision-making objection right; no DPO appointment content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز لمدير البيانات أن يعيِّن مراقباً لحماية البيانات ... يجوز لمجلس الإدارة أن يُصدِر قراراً يُلزِم بموجبه فئات معينة من مدراء البيانات بأن يعيِّنوا مراقباً لحماية البيانات.", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لمدير البيانات أن يعيِّن ... يجوز لمجلس الإدارة أن يُصدِر قراراً يُلزِم بموجبه فئات معينة من مدراء البيانات بأن يعيِّنوا ...", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يعيِّن مراقباً لحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "scope": {"span": "فئات معينة من مدراء البيانات", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "condition": {"span": "يجوز لمجلس الإدارة أن يُصدِر قراراً يُلزِم بموجبه فئات معينة ...", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة بالتعيين المشار إليه خلال ثلاثة أيام عمل من قيامه بذلك.", "article": "Article 10(4)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "Controller (مدير البيانات); possible obligation only for categories of controllers by Board decision", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (must designate)", "target_value": "Optional for controllers; Board may impose obligation on certain controller categories", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "appoint a Data Protection Officer (تعيين مراقب حماية بيانات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "limited to certain categories of controllers if so decided by the Board", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Triggers: (a) public authority; (b) core activities require large-scale regular/systematic monitoring; (c) core activities are large-scale special categories or criminal data", "target_value": "Only if the Board issues a decision obliging specified controller categories", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Courts acting in their judicial capacity excluded from point (a)", "target_value": "No exception stated regarding courts or judicial capacity for DPO appointment", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Notify the Authority within three working days after appointment", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 10(4)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 10(4) establishes DPO appointment as optional for controllers and allows the Board to mandate it for certain controller categories; it does not impose any DPO appointment obligation on processors nor tie such obligation to GDPR-like triggers. Article 14 and 30 reference the DPO framework but do not expand appointment obligations to processors. Article 7 concerns criminal data processing by judicial/public bodies and does not operate as a DPO appointment exception for courts.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 20, "total": 32}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions provided do not clearly match the GDPR's triggers for designating a data protection officer, but they do suggest some level of requirement for appointing a DPO, indicating a need for further analysis to determine the extent of alignment with GDPR requirements.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "Article 10(4)", "why": "Mentions the Board may impose the obligation to appoint a DPO on certain controllers by decision, indicating some level of requirement for designating a DPO."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusions about the absence of counterparts and the nature of obligations and exceptions require refinement based on the provided provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "Article 10(4)", "why": "Indicates the possibility of obligatory appointment of a data protection officer for certain categories of controllers as decided by the Board."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "span": "Article 7", "why": "Implies special treatment for judicial activities, which might relate to the exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "762372b7329c44286e43", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "eb633917dcbabe34df47"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 651.79, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "8c599310e4be08ccb806", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
