 provisions do not explicitly state the controller's obligation to provide resources for the data protection officer.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "Article 10(1)", "why": "The article discusses the role of the data protection officer but does not explicitly address the controller's obligation to provide resources."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct and explicit provision matching the GDPR requirement for the controller to provide resources for the data protection officer's tasks.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "يتولى مراقب حماية البيانات ما يأتي:", "why": "This provision discusses the tasks of the data protection officer but does not explicitly address the controller's obligation to provide resources."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 590.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e5c31018f302e3f070d8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
