{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Article 49 empowers an investigation committee to order third parties to provide data and to seek a domestic court order to compel compliance; it does not address inter-jurisdictional court-to-court contact or related-proceedings checks."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Article 23 regulates data subject rights to rectification/blocking/erasure and controller duties; it contains no provisions on court cooperation or parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Article 4 sets lawful bases for processing; no judicial cooperation or court duties are specified."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Article 58 provides criminal penalties and sanctions; it does not impose obligations on courts to liaise with foreign courts."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Article 12 concerns international transfers to adequate jurisdictions; it is unrelated to court-to-court coordination."}, {"id": "652b328bac75ed18d3be", "reason": "Article 2 defines scope and territorial application; it does not regulate court communication about related proceedings."}, {"id": "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "reason": "Article 13 sets transfer exceptions and mentions orders by domestic authorities; it does not establish inter-jurisdictional court contact duties."}, {"id": "bcc7ee2c6007b34ff5a5", "reason": "Article 51 concerns hearing witnesses by an investigation committee; no provisions on courts or international judicial cooperation."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Article 1 (definitions in an implementing decision) concerns terminology for BCR; it contains no rules on court procedures or cooperation."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Article 36 sets inspection powers and law-enforcement status for inspectors; it does not address court coordination."}, {"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "reason": "Article 47 outlines investigation initiation and procedure by the authority; it does not regulate court-to-court communication."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Article 50 allows deputizing law-enforcement officers to assist the investigation committee; no court cooperation obligations are provided."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "court seized of proceedings against a decision by a supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "contact the competent court in another Member State to confirm the existence of related proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings against a decision by a supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the seized court has reason to believe that proceedings concerning the same processing are brought before a competent court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "None of the Bahrain PDPL provisions provided establish a duty for courts to contact foreign courts to confirm related proceedings. They address authority investigations, inspections, transfers, DS rights, and penalties, not inter-jurisdictional judicial cooperation.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1009", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement in the BHR jurisdiction is not entirely accurate. While there may not be a direct equivalent, some provisions in the BHR jurisdiction touch upon similar concepts.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "span": "لها أنْ تُجرِي تحقيقاً من تلقاء نفسها أو بناءً على طلب الوزير أو مما تتلقاه من بلاغات أو شكاوٍ جدية", "why": "This provision in Article 47 indicates that the BHR jurisdiction has a mechanism for investigating potential breaches, which could be related to the concept of a court seizing proceedings against a decision by a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "span": "المفتشين الذين يندبهم الرئيس التنفيذي من بين موظفي الهيئة أو من غيرهم للقيام بأعمال التفتيش للتحقق من تنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision in Article 36 mentions inspectors who can be appointed to verify the implementation of the law, which might be connected to the idea of a competent court in another Member State confirming the existence of related proceedings."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provided provisions do not directly address the GDPR requirement regarding court cooperation across jurisdictions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "span": "Article 49", "why": "Does not directly pertain to inter-jurisdictional court cooperation on data protection."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "Article 23", "why": "Focuses on individual rights rather than court procedures or cooperation."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "762372b7329c44286e43", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "652b328bac75ed18d3be", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "bcc7ee2c6007b34ff5a5", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "4415e9a46823d9615000"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 584.3, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "dda16a4363e710dbd83e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["9548224453cca1301899", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Sets procedures for exercising data-subject rights; does not address designating a supervisory authority or sectoral oversight for religious organizations."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Defines special category data and related permits; no provision on establishing or designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; unrelated to designation of supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General principle of processing; no authority designation mechanism."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; no relevance to designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access rights; no supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Empowers ministry staff as judicial officers; enforcement, not designation of a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no mechanism for designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain obligations; unrelated to designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions; no authority designation content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة (and generally, الوزير per Article 31)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art 27; Art 31", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تتخذ", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art 27", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a specific independent supervisory authority for supervising churches and religious associations that apply comprehensive rules under Article 91(1)", "target_value": "generic power to take necessary measures / issue decisions to implement the law; no mention of designating a specific independent supervisory authority or sectoral supervision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art 27; Art 31", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art 27", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the designated specific authority fulfils the conditions laid down in Chapter VI (independence, etc.)", "target_value": "no independence or Chapter VI-equivalent conditions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "—", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "—", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Articles 31 and 27 authorize the minister to issue implementing decisions and the competent administration to take necessary measures, but they do not textually permit designating a specific independent supervisory authority, nor do they mention churches/religious associations or independence criteria. Thus, the suggested indirect designation mechanism is not supported by the provided text. No provision supplies the Chapter VI–type conditions required by the GDPR clause.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-978", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or distribution across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة، الذين يصدر بتخويلهم صفة مأموري الضبط القضائي، قرار من النائب العام بالاتفاق مع الوزير، ضبط وإثبات الجرائم التي تقع بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Implies the existence of a regulatory body with oversight capabilities"}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Suggests the presence of a competent authority with regulatory powers"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect designation mechanisms in Qatari law", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "span": "يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Article 31 could be interpreted as a basis for the Minister to issue decisions related to the designation of supervisory authorities"}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Article 27 implies the competent administration has the power to take necessary actions, potentially including the designation of specific authorities"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "f5c366135483fe580381", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "9548224453cca1301899", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 607.08, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "5dffded8b4a2a024a07a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Institutional/administrative powers; no requirements on clarity of data-subject information or communications."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules to be set by minister; does not establish a plain-language duty."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "General implementing authority; no substantive rule on communication clarity."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Direct marketing content/consent requirements; no mandate to use clear/plain language."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Data disclosure between controller and processor; unrelated to language used in communications to individuals."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and breach notice to controller; no plain-language requirement for data-subject communications."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; no communication-language standard."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations and privacy policies; does not specify clear/plain language for communications."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Execution/publication clause; no substantive communication-language rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "use clear and plain language for the information and communications provided", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 6; Art. 9; Art. 17 (no text requiring clear or plain language)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the information and communications covered by Article 12(1), including information addressed specifically to a child", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 6; Art. 9; Art. 17 (these provisions regulate notices/information but do not address clarity/plain language)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "The selected Qatari provisions impose information/notice duties (e.g., Art. 9 to inform individuals; Art. 17 for child-directed sites) but none requires that such information be in clear or plain language or otherwise child-friendly wording. Therefore, the GDPR Art. 12(1) plain-language obligation is not textually present. This directly addresses the reviewer’s objection.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-049", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the slot 'action' may be too narrow, as the Qatari law contains provisions that imply the need for clear and plain language.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله. 2- الأغراض المشروعة التي يرغب المراقب أو أي طرف آخر في معالجة البيانات الشخصية من أجلها.", "why": "This article implies the need for clear communication, which may include the use of clear and plain language."}, {"id": "Article 17", "span": "مع مراعاة الالتزامات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجب على مالك أو مشغل أي موقع إلكتروني موجه للأطفال، مراعاة ما يلي: 1- وضع إخطار على الموقع حول ماهية بيانات الأطفال، وكيفية استخدامها، والسياسات التي يتبعها في الإفصاح عنها.", "why": "This article addresses the issue of communicating with children and implies the need for clear and plain language."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the controller is obliged to use clear and plain language is not explicitly supported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي:", "why": "This article requires the controller to inform the individual of certain information, but it does not explicitly state that the language used must be clear and plain."}, {"id": "Article 17", "span": "مع مراعاة الالتزامات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يجب على مالك أو مشغل أي موقع إلكتروني موجه للأطفال، مراعاة ما يلي:", "why": "This article requires the owner or operator of a website directed at children to provide notice on the website, but it does not explicitly state that the language used must be clear and plain."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "9548224453cca1301899", "c098856a98e89debe630", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "83fae53ff99059f02f05"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 646.29, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "9c2888eeda6015c55b4b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy obligation; no requirement to designate a DPO."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment upon Ministry request; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach handling and Ministry actions; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Internal controls for processing; no DPO designation trigger."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no operative DPO requirement."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; no DPO designation obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 20"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 20"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 20"], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 20"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "تحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 20"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Triggers in Art. 37(1)(a)–(c): public authority/body; large-scale regular/systematic monitoring; large-scale special/criminal data", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 20", "Article 7"], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "For point (a), except for courts acting in their judicial capacity", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["Article 3"], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "The target text obligates only the controller to designate a DPO and contains no triggers or obligation for processors. Article 3 is a general scope exemption and does not create a courts-in-judicial-capacity exception, and Article 7 merely empowers the Ministry to issue controls without stating DPO triggers. Accordingly, the processor-focused GDPR requirement and its specific exception are not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the triggers in Article 37(1)(a)–(c), and the exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity is not clearly stated.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The controller is obligated to designate a data protection officer, but the triggers are not mentioned."}, {"id": "Article 34", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The controller is obligated to designate a data protection officer, but the triggers are not mentioned."}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ج- تنفيذ التزام قانوني ملقى على عاتق المتحكم بموجب أي قانون أو حكم أو قرار من المحكمة", "why": "The law does not apply to the processing of personal data in certain circumstances, including the execution of a legal obligation imposed on the controller by a court decision, but the exception is not clearly stated in relation to the obligation to designate a data protection officer."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts for 'condition' and 'exception' slot verdicts might exist in Articles 3 and 7", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3", "span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "Possible exclusion of courts acting in their judicial capacity"}, {"id": "7", "span": "إعداد واعتماد الضوابط والإجراءات المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Potential authority for establishing conditions or triggers for designating a data protection officer"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "caad155111190c1aa274", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 579.35, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "67b5e7e0a4ab85b96caa", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to obtain information from the controller; does not address disclosure of personal data in official documents for public access nor identify public authorities/public-interest bodies."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restrict processing; no rule on public access to official documents or a permission to disclose such documents."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to disclosure of official documents or reconciling public access with data protection."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Regulatory power to exempt certain establishments; does not regulate disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no provision on public access to official documents."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security of personal data; while relevant to safeguarding data, it does not create a permission framework for disclosure of official documents or address public access."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; no bearing on disclosure of official documents for public access."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations (privacy/security by design); although they govern protective measures around processing (including any disclosures), they do not authorize or structure disclosures of personal data contained in official documents for the purpose of public access or require balancing with data protection."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfer conditions; deals with international transfers, not domestic disclosure of official documents or public access regimes."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no specific permission or regime for disclosure of personal data in official documents for public access."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to voluntary disclosure of official documents."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية. ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها.", "article": "Article 2"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "public authorities, public bodies, and private bodies performing a task in the public interest that hold official documents", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "permission", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "disclose personal data contained in official documents", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "personal data in official documents held for the performance of a task carried out in the public interest", "target": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية. ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 2"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "in accordance with Union or Member State law to reconcile public access to official documents with data protection", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 2 expressly excludes government data and government entities from the PDPL’s scope, so the law does not regulate disclosures of personal data contained in official documents by public authorities or bodies performing public tasks. Provisions like Articles 7 (security/organizational measures) and 22 (cross‑border transfers) may touch on protection or transfers generally, but they do not establish a permission to disclose official documents for public access or the balancing condition required by GDPR Art. 86. Accordingly, no functionally equivalent rule is found in the cited UAE text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-957", "gdpr_article": 86, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7", "span": "اتخاذ الإجراءات والتدابير التقنية والتنظيمية الملائمة لتطبيق المعايير القياسية اللازمة لحماية وتأمين البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Requires the controller to take appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data"}, {"id": "Article 22", "span": "نقل ومشاركة البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود لأغراض المعالجة", "why": "Allows for the transfer of personal data outside the country under certain conditions"}, {"id": "Article 5", "span": "ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Provides guidelines for the processing of personal data, including the principle of transparency and the requirement to ensure that personal data is accurate and up-to-date"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE legislation, while not directly mirroring the GDPR provision, contains elements that could be interpreted as related to the disclosure of personal data in official documents, suggesting a need for a more nuanced comparison.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7", "span": "اتخاذ الإجراءات والتدابير التقنية والتنظيمية الملائمة لتطبيق المعايير القياسية اللازمة لحماية وتأمين البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies a responsibility to protect personal data, which could include ensuring disclosures are made in accordance with applicable laws."}, {"id": "Article 22", "span": "نقل ومشاركة البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود لأغراض المعالجة", "why": "Discusses the transfer of personal data across borders, implying circumstances under which personal data can be disclosed or transferred."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 550.01, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "9184be3c390f6e410348", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "General territorial/material scope; no right to object or conditions for exercising it."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to a data subject's right to object."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations on security/governance; no objection right."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; does not establish a data subject right to object."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint handling before the authority; not a substantive objection right."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to objection."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Appeal of authority decisions; not about objecting to processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 17 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 17 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17 (chapeau)"}, "scope": {"span": "إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر", "article": "Article 17(1); see also Article 18(1) \"بما فيها التنميط\" (automated-decision context)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "لا يجوز لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على القرارات التي تصدر عن المعالجة المؤتمتة في الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة المؤتمتة ضمن شروط التعاقد ... ب. إذا كانت المعالجة المؤتمتة ضرورية وفق تشريعات أخرى نافذة في الدولة ... ج. إذا تمت الموافقة المسبقة من صاحب البيانات ...", "article": "Article 18(2); see also Article 17(2): \"إلا إذا كانت المعالجة لازمة لتحقيق المصلحة العامة\" (re: المسوح الإحصائية)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "إيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17 (chapeau)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "object to processing of personal data concerning him or her", "target_value": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing based on point (e) or (f) of Article 6(1), including profiling based on those provisions", "target_value": "حالات محددة: التسويق المباشر (بما في ذلك التنميط المتعلق به)، المسوح الإحصائية (مع قيد المصلحة العامة)، والمعالجة المخالفة للمادة (5)؛ واعتراض محدود يخص قرارات المعالجة المؤتمتة بما فيها التنميط", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 17(1)-(3); Art. 18(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on grounds relating to the data subject's particular situation", "target_value": "لا يُشترط الارتكان إلى ظروف خاصة بصاحب البيانات؛ تُحصر بموجبات موضوعية مُحددة (التسويق المباشر، المسوح الإحصائية مع قيد، مخالفة المادة 5، قرارات مؤتمتة)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 16(1); Art. 17; Art. 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات تمنع الاعتراض على القرارات المؤتمتة (تعاقد، التزام تشريعي، موافقة) واستثناء على حق الإيقاف في المسوح الإحصائية عند لزوم المصلحة العامة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 18(2); Art. 17(2)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at any time", "target_value": "غير منصوص عليه زمنياً؛ الحق مقيد بحالات محددة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 16; Art. 17; Art. 18"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إيقاف المعالجة (وعن القرارات المؤتمتة: إدخال العنصر البشري في المراجعة عند الطلب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 17 (chapeau); Art. 18(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.61, "reasoning_note": "Articles 16, 17, and 18 do create rights to object/stop or restrict processing, but only for enumerated contexts (e.g., direct marketing including related profiling, certain statistical surveys, unlawful/contrary-purpose processing, or automated decisions). They do not provide a general right to object to processing based on public interest or legitimate interests on “grounds relating to the data subject’s particular situation.” Thus the GDPR element of a situation-specific ground remains unexpressed in the target text.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-178", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict could be more nuanced, as the target jurisdiction's law provides related rights that could be seen as broader or more comprehensive.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "المادة (18) حق المعالجة والمعالجة المؤتمتة", "why": "This article provides the right to object to automated decision-making, including profiling, which could be interpreted as a broader right to object."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "This article provides the right to restrict processing, which could also be seen as a related right."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart for 'on grounds relating to the data subject's particular situation' might be too narrow, as related provisions can be found in Articles 16, 17, and 18.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "This article allows the data subject to restrict processing if they object to the processing of their personal data, which might be related to their particular situation."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة", "why": "This article provides the data subject with the right to stop processing in certain situations, which could be related to their particular situation."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "المادة (18) حق المعالجة والمعالجة المؤتمتة", "why": "This article provides the data subject with the right to object to decisions made by automated processing, including profiling, which could be related to their particular situation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "ffb151edc5703b569765"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 637.41, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "26a5ff034bbaf6fb83f7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "6822d8664264bc19842c", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Focuses on attaching a policy and breach-response precautions for licensing, not on implementing technical/organisational measures across the design and operational stages."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing information duties to data subjects; does not impose technical/organisational measures for processing."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Enforcement powers of the authority; not a controller obligation to implement measures."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "Defines DPO tasks; ancillary governance and monitoring, not a direct obligation on the controller to implement measures."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General declaration of protection; no operative requirement about measures."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment on request; audit/oversight rather than design/operational measures."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Record-keeping duty; not an implementation of technical/organisational measures for processing."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Retention of processing documents and their protection; tangential to processing measures and does not address by-design/operational implementation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": "لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures for the processing", "target_value": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون؛ ووضع واستخدام وتفعيل الأنظمة وإجراءات الاختبار والتعافي", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 26(1)-(3) [495e30846d7a1f70c077]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "measures may include pseudonymisation and aim to meet GDPR requirements and protect data subjects’ rights", "target_value": "لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون؛ وضمان سرية البيانات الشخصية وعدم نشرها إلا بموافقة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 26 chapeau [495e30846d7a1f70c077]; Article 21 [6822d8664264bc19842c]; Article 21 (policy rights mechanism) [bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account state of the art, cost of implementation, nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, and the risks to rights and freedoms", "target_value": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13(a) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "both at the time of the determination of the means for processing and at the time of the processing itself", "target_value": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13 (chapeau) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 and 26 establish a controller obligation to put in place technical and procedural measures and specific security controls, but the condition is narrower: only risk to the data subject is specified, without state of the art, cost, or context factors. The temporal element covers processing-stage compliance but not an express by-design requirement.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-209", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully cover the GDPR requirement, as they do not explicitly mention considering all the specified factors and do not clearly cover both the design and operational stages.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision only mentions establishing controls and procedures for processing, but does not explicitly mention considering technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بضمان سرية البيانات الشخصية وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This provision only mentions ensuring confidentiality, but does not explicitly mention implementing measures at both the design and operational stages."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot verdict is not fully supported by the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "This provision only partially supports the condition slot verdict, as it mentions risk assessment but not the other factors required by the GDPR proposition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["487015f110e7b88b5c03", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "3f916831456908af27d8", "6822d8664264bc19842c", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "5483caf68765f09059fb"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 609.36, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "2c1741e230f4654454ee", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Concerns ministry enforcement officers' powers to detect offences; does not regulate courts or cross-border court-to-court communication."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Provides controller exemptions when acting under public interest, legal obligation, or a competent court order; no duty on courts to contact foreign courts or verify parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Sets an administrative complaint and ministerial review process; no judicial coordination or cross-border proceedings."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Requires controller breach notifications to the individual and competent authority; unrelated to courts or parallel judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Lists controller obligations (fairness, safeguards, policies); no court obligations or cross-border judicial communication."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right to data privacy and processing principles; no procedural rules for courts or coordination with foreign courts."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Governs controller disclosures to processors; no relation to courts or parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Provides exceptions to a controller obligation; not about judicial communication or proceedings."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Authorizes minister to set procedures for individual rights; no court-to-court cooperation rules."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Addresses cross-border data flows by controllers; does not impose or imply any obligation on courts to contact foreign courts about parallel cases."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Empowers the minister to issue implementing decisions; contains no rule on judicial coordination."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Security and law-enforcement exemptions; does not regulate civil or criminal court communication with foreign courts."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "a competent court of a Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "contact the court in the other Member State to confirm the existence of the parallel proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the court has information that such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "The cited Qatari provisions regulate controller duties, administrative complaints, enforcement, and cross-border data flows, but none impose or imply a duty on courts to contact foreign courts to verify parallel proceedings. Article 14 (breach notification) and Article 15 (cross-border data flow) address controller conduct, not judicial coordination. There is no textual basis in the provided Qatari articles for court-to-court communication about parallel cases.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-926", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict might be too absolute, and there might be some basis for cooperation and coordination between courts, even if it's not explicitly stated.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This provision implies a hierarchical structure for dispute resolution, which could potentially include cooperation between courts."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية:", "why": "This provision mentions the processing of personal data for certain purposes, including the protection of national security and the prevention of crime, which could potentially involve cooperation between courts."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "span": "يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This provision grants the Minister the power to issue decisions necessary for the implementation of the law, which could potentially include guidelines for cooperation between courts."}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law has provisions related to international cooperation, complaint procedures, and the protection of personal data, which could potentially be used to achieve similar goals to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة، إذا كان من شأن ذلك إحداث ضرر جسيم بالبيانات الشخصية أو بخصوصية الفرد.", "why": "This provision shows that the Qatari law requires the controller to notify the individual and the competent authority in case of a breach of the security measures, which could be related to the coordination with other jurisdictions."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "span": "مع مراعاة الالتزامات المنصوص عليها في هذا القانون، يُحظر على المراقب اتخاذ أي قرار أو إجراء من شأنه الحد من تدفق البيانات الشخصية عبر الحدود، إلا إذا كانت معالجة تلك البيانات مخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون، أو كان من شأنه إلحاق ضرر جسيم بالبيانات الشخصية أو بخصوصية الفرد.", "why": "This provision prohibits the restriction of the flow of personal data across borders, unless it is necessary to protect the data or the individual's privacy, which implies that the Qatari law recognizes the importance of international cooperation in the protection of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["ca31304d94e06fa35850", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "f5c366135483fe580381", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "9548224453cca1301899", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 541.78, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a09fc98cae1c0c043f1b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Defines Board powers (internal governance, issuance of regulations); no authority to accredit bodies to monitor codes of conduct."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions (including Privacy by Design); no provisions on codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Authority’s oversight of data protection officers; does not establish accreditation of code-of-conduct monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection powers of inspectors; unrelated to accrediting monitoring bodies for codes of conduct."}, {"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "reason": "CEO functions (representation, administration); no authority to accredit external monitoring bodies for codes."}, {"id": "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "reason": "Ministerial oversight of the Authority; no content on codes of conduct or accreditation powers."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Referral of DPO to investigation; not about accrediting monitoring bodies or codes of conduct."}, {"id": "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "reason": "Urgent measures regarding processing; no accreditation or codes-of-conduct regime."}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "reason": "Register of notifications and permits; no mention of codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification to the Authority of processing; does not address codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Data in public registers; unrelated to codes of conduct or accreditation powers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تتولى الهيئة مباشرة كافة المهام والصلاحيات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 30"}, "modality": {"span": "ولها في سبيل ذلك القيام بوجه خاص بما يلي:", "article": "Article 30"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "competent supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30 (chapeau)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "ولها في سبيل ذلك القيام بوجه خاص بما يلي:", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "accredit a body to monitor compliance with a code of conduct", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "accreditation of a body referred to in Article 41(1) (monitoring compliance with a code of conduct)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "body meets criteria (independence, expertise, assessment and monitoring procedures, complaint-handling transparency, no conflicts of interest)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 30 confirms the Authority’s general powers and expressly to accredit data protection officers (Art. 30(6)), but there is no provision on accrediting bodies to monitor compliance with codes of conduct, nor any qualifying criteria akin to GDPR Art. 41(2). Articles 40 and 44 concern internal governance and do not establish an external accreditation regime. Therefore, the GDPR requirement is not textually present.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-504", "gdpr_article": 41, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "30", "span": "6 - اعتماد مراقبي حماية البيانات وِفقاً لأحكام المادة (10) من هذا القانون", "why": "Suggests authority has a role in approving or accrediting bodies or individuals related to data protection"}, {"id": "44", "span": "إعداد مشروع الهيكل التنظيمي للهيئة وعرضه على مجلس الإدارة لاعتماده", "why": "Indicates power to prepare and submit organizational structure for approval, potentially encompassing accreditation of compliance monitoring bodies"}, {"id": "40", "span": "المهام والصلاحيات مجلس الإدارة", "why": "Outlines tasks and competencies of the Board of Directors, including approval of organizational structure and internal regulations"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 454.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "756dc96abe954533fb8b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "General scope of application; no duty on the supervisory authority to develop international cooperation mechanisms."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; no reference to international cooperation or supervisory authority roles."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; does not address international cooperation by a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no relevance to supervisory authority cooperation with third countries or IOs."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; no international cooperation mechanism or supervisory authority duty."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; interaction with the Office domestically, not international cooperation mechanisms."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Controller/processor duties toward DPO; no international cooperation content."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; domestic reporting to the Office, no cross-border cooperation mechanism."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no provisions on international cooperation or supervisory authority obligations."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller communication channels for data subjects; unrelated to international cooperation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المعتمدة من المكتب", "article": "Article 22"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 22"}, "action": {"span": "انضمام الدولة إلى الاتفاقيات الثنائية أو متعددة الأطراف المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 22"}, "scope": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج الدولة", "article": "Article 22"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": n