to bilateral/multilateral DP agreements) and links adequacy to enforceability by foreign regulatory/judicial authorities, but it does not impose an obligation on the UAE supervisory authority to take steps to develop such mechanisms. No provision mentions cooperation with international organisations. Hence, the target text only partially reflects the GDPR Art. 50 requirement.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-607", "gdpr_article": 50, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly support the deontic modality claim (obligation) regarding the development of international cooperation mechanisms by supervisory authorities.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "span": "انضمام الدولة إلى الاتفاقيات الثنائية أو متعددة الأطراف المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies international cooperation but does not explicitly state an obligation on supervisory authorities to develop such mechanisms."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdicts do not accurately reflect the provisions of the UAE law, particularly with regards to international cooperation mechanisms and the protection of personal data in relation to third countries and international organisations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "span": "انضمام الدولة إلى الاتفاقيات الثنائية أو متعددة الأطراف المتعلقة بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision suggests that the UAE law provides a basis for the development of international cooperation mechanisms to facilitate the effective enforcement of legislation for the protection of personal data."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "span": "أَن