 in any controller-maintained record. Art. 16 establishes an authority-run register of notifications/permits, not a controller’s record of processing, and it does not specify joint-controller details. Accordingly, the specific Art. 30(1) record entry obligation is not present in the provided texts.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-257", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "span": "في حال تمت مُعالجة البيانات من قبل أكثر من مدير بيانات بصورة مشتركة", "why": "Implies shared responsibility and potential for joint controller details"}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "span": "تقيِّد فيه ما يأتي: أ - الإخطارات المشار إليها في البند (1) من المادة (14) من هذا القانون", "why": "Suggests a register that could include details about joint controllers"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "a55a0ab8369bad4528f9", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "a8603a05076226e9b8fc", "93fde8c87940ae524c86"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 453.87, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "c34ef8ee5ab82e42ca9e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Addresses lawful bases for processing; does not speak to codes of conduct or cross-border transfer safeguards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تطبق هذه اللائحة على جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة", "article": "Article 1"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية، إذا لزم الأمر إلى خارج دولة الكويت", "article": "Article 5 (4.4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "Controllers or processors not subject to the Regulation pursuant to Article 3", "target": "جميع مقدمي الخدمة المرخص لهم من قبل الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "permission", "target": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "adhere to approved and generally valid codes of conduct", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "To provide appropriate safeguards for personal data transfers to third countries or international organisations under Article 46(2)(e)", "target": "نقل البيانات الشخصية، إذا لزم الأمر إلى خارج دولة الكويت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "The code of conduct is approved pursuant to paragraph 5 and has general validity pursuant to paragraph 9", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.59, "reasoning_note": "The Kuwaiti text acknowledges cross-border transfers and permits the authority to issue privacy guidance, which relates conceptually to modality and scope. However, it contains no permission for controllers/processors (especially those outside the regime) to adhere to approved, generally valid codes of conduct as transfer safeguards, nor any approval/validity conditions. Accordingly, the GDPR requirement is largely not instantiated in the target provisions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-487", "gdpr_article": 40, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdict for 'modality' is unsupported by the citation, as Article 7(2) implies a permission modality.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "why": "This provision implies a permission modality, as it allows the Authority to issue instructions or guidelines."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is partially correct, but it can be revised to better reflect the actual provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية، إذا لزم الأمر إلى خارج دولة الكويت", "why": "This provision can be related to the scope of transferring personal data to third countries or international organizations."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "span": "يجوز للهيئة إصدار تعليمات أو إرشادات متعلقة بخصوصية البيانات كلما اقتضى الحال ذلك", "why": "This provision can be related to the modality of permission."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 611.57, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a6a7cc130b7e14664329", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "3f916831456908af27d8", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "823830174d241884bd73"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ae67f8fe376642167563", "reason": "Regulates processing of special categories (including religious beliefs) and prior permits; does not establish supervisory-subjection or authority independence."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Addresses disclosure prohibitions; no supervision or oversight structure."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent and transparency duties; no supervisory-subjection rule."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions in the regulation; no operative supervision requirement."}, {"id": "4f65c1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "Clarifies law’s material scope; no supervisory-subjection rule."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General statement of protection; no oversight mechanism."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO appointment (internal governance); does not establish being subject to an independent supervisory authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 16"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي", "article": "Article 16"}, "action": {"span": "إصدار الضوابط والإجراءات اللازمة لمعالجة البيانات الشخصية والتحقق من التزام المتحكم والمعالج بها", "article": "Article 7(b)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "churches and religious associations", "target_value": "المتحكم والمعالج (controllers and processors)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16; also Article 8 (measures against المتحكم أو المعالج)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Obligations to comply with oversight measures (e.g., appoint an external auditor upon the Ministry’s request)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 16; Article 8", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "be subject to the supervision of an independent supervisory authority", "target_value": "Supervision/oversight by the Ministry: responsibility to apply the law and verify controllers’ compliance; enforcement powers; complaint handling", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 7(a)-(c); Article 8; Article 9; Article 12", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "they apply comprehensive rules in accordance with Article 91(1)", "target_value": "No special condition regarding churches’ own comprehensive rules", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.55, "reasoning_note": "Considering the broader OMN framework, controllers (which would include religious entities acting as controllers) are under ministerial oversight: the Ministry applies the law, verifies compliance, can compel audits, and has enforcement powers. However, the text does not create a special regime tied to churches’ comprehensive rules nor does it state that the supervisory authority is independent, which are key elements of GDPR Art. 91(2). The match is therefore partial.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-977", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction has some form of supervision, although not explicitly stated as independent", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي للتأكد من أن إجراءات معالجة البيانات الشخصية قد تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article mentions the Ministry's power to request an external auditor, which could be seen as a form of supervision"}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article grants the Ministry the responsibility of applying the law, which could be interpreted as a form of supervision"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on a narrow interpretation of the absence of a direct counterpart, without considering the broader framework of supervision and oversight established by the OMN provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 7", "span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "The Ministry is responsible for applying the law and overseeing compliance, which could include supervision of churches and religious associations."}, {"id": "Article 16", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي", "why": "The obligation to appoint an external auditor upon the Ministry's request could be seen as a form of supervision."}, {"id": "Article 9", "span": "يكون لموظفي الوزارة الذين يصدر بتحديدهم قرار من الجهة المختصة بالاتفاق مع الوزير، صفة الضبطية القضائية", "why": "The grant of judicial police power to certain officials could be interpreted as a form of independent supervision."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["ae67f8fe376642167563", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "3f916831456908af27d8", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "caad155111190c1aa274", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "823830174d241884bd73"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 567.86, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a52bbdf53e08999aa5be", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5d949837d7aab073cd67", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Controller/processor breach-notification duties to the Office; not a data subject right to lodge a complaint."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Rights regarding automated processing decisions; not about lodging complaints with a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; does not establish a data subject complaint right."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; not a complaint mechanism."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Right to rectification/erasure; not a complaint right."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; not a complaint right."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions framework; does not grant the data subject a right to complain."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Territorial/material scope; not a complaint right."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; not a complaint right."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object/stop processing; not a complaint mechanism."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات أن يتقدم", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يتقدم إلى المكتب بشكوى", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "إلى المكتب", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كان لديه ما يحمله على الاعتقاد بوقوع أي مخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون، أو بأن المتحكم أو المعالج يقوم بمعالجة بياناته الشخصية بالمخالفة لأحكامه", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "يتولى المكتب استلام الشكاوى ... والتحقق منها بالتنسيق مع المتحكم والمعالج؛ للمكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية", "article": "Article 24(2)-(3)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "every data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "لصاحب البيانات أن يتقدم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority", "target_value": "التقدم بشكوى إلى المكتب", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in particular with an authority in the Member State of residence, place of work, or place of the alleged infringement", "target_value": "إلى المكتب (single national authority; no venue options stated)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "if the data subject considers that processing of his/her personal data infringes the Regulation", "target_value": "إذا كان لديه ما يحمله على الاعتقاد بوقوع مخالفة لأحكام المرسوم بقانون أو معالجة بياناته بالمخالفة لأحكامه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "المكتب يستلم ويتحقق من الشكاوى وقد يوقع جزاءات إدارية عند ثبوت المخالفة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 24(2)-(3)"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "UAE law expressly grants the data subject a right to submit a complaint to the national supervisory authority (the Office) when they believe the Law has been violated. Unlike GDPR’s multi-venue formulation across Member States, the UAE regime provides a single authority, which is functionally equivalent. No exceptions or time limits are stated; the law adds that the Office will handle complaints and may impose administrative penalties.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-907", "gdpr_article": 77, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["5d949837d7aab073cd67", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "c34922f387019af45e42", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 320.46, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "03d15696fbf6a739ea31", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "reason": "Provides an administrative complaint mechanism to the authority, not a data subject's right to bring judicial proceedings before courts or any forum-of-residence rule."}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Regulates the authority’s investigative powers and court orders to compel third parties; it does not grant data subjects a right to initiate court proceedings or specify venue."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Lists the authority’s tasks (receiving complaints, investigations); no provision on judicial proceedings by data subjects or court venue."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection and enforcement powers; no data subject right to bring court proceedings or venue rule."}, {"id": "652b328bac75ed18d3be", "reason": "Scope of application; does not address judicial remedies or venue for data subjects."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Provides rectification/blocking/erasure via requests to the controller; not a judicial remedy or venue rule."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent requirements; unrelated to judicial proceedings or venue."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no judicial redress or venue provisions."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-case data; no right for data subjects to bring court proceedings or any venue rule."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Definitions (for a decision/Regulations); does not address judicial remedies."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Disciplinary investigation of data protection officers; no judicial redress for data subjects."}, {"id": "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "reason": "Right to seek non-automated decision-making; not a judicial remedy or venue rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the data subject has his or her habitual residence", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the controller or processor is a public authority of a Member State acting in the exercise of its public powers", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 25 provides an administrative complaint to the authority, not a judicial remedy or any forum-of-residence right. Article 49 concerns the authority’s investigative powers and ancillary court orders, not a data subject’s ability to bring court proceedings. No cited provision grants data subjects a right to initiate court proceedings or specifies venue analogous to GDPR Art. 79.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-917", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 18, "total": 30}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 38}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart may exist under different terminology or distributed across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "span": "Article 25", "why": "Allows for submission of complaints related to data protection violations"}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "span": "Article 49", "why": "Discusses the power to request data in investigations, implying a form of judicial proceeding"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart provision exists under different terminology", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "span": "Article 25", "why": "Allows data subjects to submit complaints related to personal data processing"}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "span": "Article 49", "why": "Provides a framework for data subjects to seek redress and for authorities to investigate and enforce compliance"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["762372b7329c44286e43", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "652b328bac75ed18d3be", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "eb633917dcbabe34df47", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 524.78, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "88ce6a4adaa35bd9f3ef", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security measures; no duty to consult or notify the authority based on DPIA/high risk."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data exceptions and prior permit in a specific case; not a DPIA-based prior consultation duty."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rule on prior consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing exceptions; no DPIA-based consultation or prior authority engagement rule."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO roles/coordination; does not impose a controller duty to consult the authority prior to processing based on DPIA findings."}, {"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "reason": "Technical/organizational measures; no link to consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "DPO disciplinary matters; irrelevant to prior consultation."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Authority functions; does not create a controller duty to consult prior to processing."}, {"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "reason": "Investigation powers; not a prior consultation obligation."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "External DPO disclosure; unrelated to prior consultation with the authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Art. 14(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة", "article": "Art. 14(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة", "article": "Art. 14(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "قبل بدء عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً، أو لمجموعة عمليات من ذلك بقصد تحقيق غرض واحد أو عدة أغراض ذات صلة ببعضها", "article": "Art. 14(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "ويُعفى مدير البيانات من تقديم الإخطار المشار إليه بشأن ما يأتي: أ - المعالَجة التي يكون الغرض الوحيد منها إمساك سجل وفقاً للقانون بهدف توفير معلومات للجمهور... ب - معالجة البيانات التي تتم في سياق أنشطة الجمعيات... ج - معالجة صاحب العمل لبيانات العاملين لديه... د - الحالات التي يتم فيها تعيين مراقب حماية بيانات.", "article": "Art. 14(1)(أ-د)"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل بدء عملية المعالجة", "article": "Art. 14(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وعلى مقدِّم الطلب التوقف عن المعالَجة لحين استيفاء النقص بالإخطار.", "article": "Art. 14(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 14(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Obligation to notify the Authority (على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 14(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "consult the supervisory authority", "target": "notify the Authority (إخطار الهيئة)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 14(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "intended processing", "target": "intended automated processing or related group of operations", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 14(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where a DPIA under Article 35 indicates high risk absent mitigating measures", "target": "No condition tying authority engagement to DPIA high-risk findings", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 14(1); Art. 3"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "Exemptions from prior notification (a–d), e.g., public registers, non-profits, employer processing within necessity, DPO appointed cases", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 14(1)(أ-د)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "prior to processing", "target": "prior to processing (قبل بدء عملية المعالجة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 14(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "processing must stop until notification deficiencies are remedied", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 14(4)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain law mandates DPIAs in specified high-risk scenarios and requires prior notification to the Authority for automated processing, but it does not require prior consultation with the Authority when a DPIA reveals unmitigated high risks. The closest analogue (prior notification) is broader in trigger and differs in action (notify vs consult). Thus, the core conditional consultation duty is missing while some temporal/addressee elements align.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-415", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "3daba86dc4c13ff4e918", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 342.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "990e73f3b59273a21572", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["67a122f7dc547487996a", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "reason": "Regulates credit-data processing controls and notifications; not about supervisory authority sanctioning powers."}, {"id": "f102bf5a48cbbce16003", "reason": "Controller obligations for credit data security/consent; not about supervisory authority power to fine."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Substantive disclosure bases; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Operational rules for disclosure; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "eef2332de931ce118731", "reason": "Data retention/destruction duties; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Transparency to data subjects; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Information at collection; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "reason": "Definitions; no operative sanctioning power."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-interest processing conditions; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تكون الجهة المختصة الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح.", "article": "Article 30(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "لجنة (أو أكثر) ... تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "action": {"span": "إيقاع عقوبة الإنذار أو الغرامة", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "تُعاقب بالإنذار أو بغرامة لا تزيد على (خمسة ملايين) ريال ... وتجوز مضاعفة عقوبة الغرامة في حالة تكرار المخالفة", "article": "Article 36(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "article": "Article 36(2)"}, "exception": {"span": "ودون إخلال بأي عقوبة أشد منصوص عليها في نظام آخر", "article": "Article 36(1)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الجهة المختصة الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "لجنة ... تتولى النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع عقوبة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2); Article 30(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "impose an administrative fine", "target_value": "إيقاع عقوبة ... الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(1)-(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target_value": "بالإنذار أو بغرامة (لا نص يربط الغرامة بتدابير تصحيحية أخرى كخيارات تكميلية أو بديلة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 36(1)-(2); cf. Article 37(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target_value": "بحسب نوع المخالفة المرتكبة وجسامتها ومدى تأثيرها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 36(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "دون إخلال بأي عقوبة أشد منصوص عليها في نظام آخر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 36(1)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "KSA PDPL empowers the competent authority (via a committee) to impose administrative fines and to calibrate sanctions based on case-specific factors, matching the power and individual-circumstances elements. However, the text does not state that fines may be imposed in addition to, or instead of, other corrective measures; Article 37 shows other measures (e.g., seizure) exist but no provision links them to fines as combinable/alternative remedies. Therefore the scope is narrower than the GDPR formulation.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 29}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement that each supervisory authority has the power to impose an administrative fine.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(1)-(2)", "why": "The article mentions a committee formed by the head of the supervisory authority imposes sanctions, but it does not explicitly state that the supervisory authority has the power to impose an administrative fine."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly mention the additional measures referred to in paragraph 2.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "span": "Article 36(1)-(2)", "why": "The provision only mentions the penalty of warning or fine, without referencing any additional measures."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "f102bf5a48cbbce16003", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "67a122f7dc547487996a", "eef2332de931ce118731", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "33d22a1a65039b5be3f9", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 586.96, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "b4fd966c23975bba96b2", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["dec351a1e477287e3b22", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; no rule on joint controllers or designating a data-subject contact point in a joint arrangement."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; does not address joint controllers or contact-point designation."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations (including multiple processors); not about joint controllers or a designated contact point for data subjects."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject rectification/erasure rights; no provision on contact-point designation by joint controllers."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfers; unrelated to joint-controller contact-point designation."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no joint-controller contact-point rule."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; no joint-controller contact-point rule."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints to the authority; not about designation of a contact point by joint controllers."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of law; no operational rule on joint controllers or contact points."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"text": "على المتحكم", "article": "Article 19"}, "modality": {"text": "على المتحكم توفير", "article": "Article 19"}, "action": {"text": "توفير طرق وآليات مناسبة وواضحة لتمكين صاحب البيانات من التواصل معه", "article": "Article 19"}, "scope": {"text": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"text": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"text": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"text": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"text": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "joint controllers", "target_value": "controller (المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 19", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission (may)", "target_value": "obligation on controller to provide contact methods; data subject may contact DPO", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 19; Article 12(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate in the arrangement a contact point for data subjects", "target_value": "provide ways for data subjects to contact the controller; data subject may directly contact the DPO; DPO receives requests/complaints", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 19; Article 12(2); Article 11(1)(ب)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "the arrangement between the joint controllers", "target_value": "no reference to joint-controller arrangements", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "none stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "UAE PDPL expressly ensures data subjects can contact the controller (Art. 19) and the DPO directly (Arts. 12(2), 11(b)), which functionally provides contact points. However, it does not address joint controllers nor permit them to designate a single contact point in their joint arrangement. Therefore, only the contact-point aspect is present, while the joint-controller/arrangement element is missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-216", "gdpr_article": 26, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 11}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law implies the necessity of a contact point for data subjects through Articles 19 and 11, suggesting an indirect counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "span": "المادة (19) طرق التواصل مع المتحكم", "why": "Implies the need for a contact point for data subjects."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Outlines the DPO's role in receiving requests and complaints, supporting the existence of a contact mechanism."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, as the UAE jurisdiction does provide methods for data subjects to contact the controller or DPO, but it does not explicitly mention joint controllers designating a contact point.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "span": "المادة (19) طرق التواصل مع المتحكم على المتحكم توفير طرق وآليات مناسبة وواضحة لتمكين صاحب البيانات من التواصل معه وطلب ممارسة أي من حقوقه المنصوص عليها في هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "This article discusses the methods for data subjects to contact the controller, but it does not explicitly mention joint controllers designating a contact point."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "لصاحب البيانات التواصل مباشرة مع مسؤول حماية البيانات بكل ما يتعلق ببياناته الشخصية ومعالجتها لتمكينه من ممارسة حقوقه وفقاً لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون", "why": "This article allows data subjects to contact the DPO directly, which could be considered a contact point."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "c34922f387019af45e42", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 561.9, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "5b171508ff2d30832fcd", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5d949837d7aab073cd67", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; no rule on liability for damages."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; does not address liability or compensation."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject rectification/erasure rights; no liability-for-damages provision."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases/exemptions; no liability or compensation."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; does not create liability for damages."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; no liability-for-damages rule."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no liability-for-damages rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم أو المعالج", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة المتحكم أو المعالج لأحكامه أو مخالفة القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "article": "Article 24(3)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "للمكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية المشار إليها في المادة (26)", "article": "Article 24(3)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller involved in processing", "target": "المتحكم أو المعالج", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 24(3)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall be liable)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "be liable for the damage caused by processing that infringes this Regulation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "damage caused by processing", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the processing infringes this Regulation", "target": "في حال ثبوت مخالفة المتحكم أو المعالج لأحكامه أو مخالفة القرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(3)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "للمكتب توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية المشار إليها في المادة (26)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 24(3)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "The UAE PDPL provisions selected address administrative enforcement (complaints and penalties) and, for processors, joint liability for statutory obligations, but they do not establish controller liability to compensate data subjects for damage caused by unlawful processing. The condition of infringement is textually present, yet a civil damages liability rule akin to GDPR Art. 82 is absent. Therefore the core requirement is not met.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-930", "gdpr_article": 82, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["674524dee00496cb5de7", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "877fafe0080725188d05", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "c34922f387019af45e42", "57844ac856d11c289650", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 331.81, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "6a3ee859cd02838f9a98", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Institutional powers of the ministry; does not regulate DPO designation or its triggers."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions and general interpretive clause; no operative rule on DPO designation."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; no bearing on DPO appointment triggers."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit revocation grounds; not about DPO obligations."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller’s internal safeguards; does not address DPO designation conditions."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; unrelated to DPO designation."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Privacy policy content; no rule on DPO appointment."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 20"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 20"}, "action": {"span": "بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم (is obligated)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "تحديد/تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Triggers in Art. 37(1)(a)-(c) (public authority; large-scale regular/systematic monitoring; large-scale special/criminal data)", "target_value": "No conditions/triggers; a general obligation to designate a DPO (and DPO details must be in the permit application before processing).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34; Reg. Art. 5", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Courts acting in their judicial capacity are excluded from point (a).", "target_value": "No exception stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for DPO designation timing.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "broader", "confidence": 0.79, "reasoning_note": "OMN imposes an unconditional duty on controllers to designate a DPO, which exceeds GDPR’s trigger-based obligation and contains no judicial-courts carve-out. The core elements (addressee, modality, action) are directly covered, while the conditional triggers and exception are not mirrored. Overall, the target text is broader than the GDPR requirement unit.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-430", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6