the supervisory authority has the power to take actions that could be interpreted as a form of withdrawal of a certification."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "span": "طلب الوثائق أو المعلومات اللازمة من جهة التحكم", "why": "This provision suggests that the supervisory authority has the power to request documents or information from the controller, which could be related to the power to withdraw a certification."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart for 'withdraw a certification' might exist under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "span": "جهات منح شهادات الاعتماد", "why": "Mentions certification bodies and the supervisory authority's role in issuing rules for licensing them"}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "اتخاذ ما يأتي: أ- طلب الوثائق أو المعلومات اللازمة", "why": "Grants the supervisory authority the power to take various actions, potentially including withdrawing a certification"}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "span": "حجز الوسائل أو الأدوات المستخدمة في ارتكاب المخالفة", "why": "Suggests the supervisory authority has the right to seize means or tools used in committing a violation, which could include withdrawing a certification"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 619.35, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "d5588a0b8e1498818eab", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Controller-level condition/record-keeping for legitimate interest; no obligation on a legislator nor any requirement to specify categories of personal data in legislative measures."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "Consent framework for processing; does not impose drafting/content requirements on legislative measures or specify categories of personal data therein."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure right and related controller duties; no legislator-focused mandate to include categories of personal data in laws."}, {"id": "772962994f8e191e84a3", "reason": "Research/statistics exception conditions; while referencing sensitive data, it does not require legislators to include categories of personal data in legislative measures."}, {"id": "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "reason": "Rules on legal guardians and consent for minors; unrelated to legislative content requirements."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Controller duty to respond to data subject requests; no legislator-facing drafting obligation."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing, certification, and oversight framework; not a requirement about contents of legislative measures or categories of data."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing processing conditions; no requirement that legislative measures specify categories of personal data."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Controller’s selection of processors; contract/oversight obligations, not legislative drafting requirements."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public-sector processing safeguards for public interest address controller behavior (\"على الجهة العامة...\"); they do not impose requirements on legislators about what legislative measures must contain, nor do they require specifying categories of personal data."}], "target_frame": {