"reasoning_note": "KSA texts show that regulations may be mandated to specify rules/controls (e.g., Art. 10 last sentence; Art. 24 on credit data), but there is no requirement that such legislative measures include specific provisions on the categories of personal data. The cited public-interest provision (Art. 21 of the Implementing Regulations) governs controller conduct and does not impose legislator-facing drafting requirements or a duty to enumerate data categories. Therefore, the GDPR unit’s core element remains absent.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-197", "gdpr_article": 23, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts exist under different terminology or are distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "المادة العاشرة", "why": "Discusses conditions for collecting and processing personal data, implying regulatory oversight that could encompass legislative measures."}, {"id": "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "span": "المادة الرابعة والعشرون", "why": "Mentions regulations for additional controls and procedures for credit data, suggesting a framework for handling specific categories of personal data."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "span": "المادة الحادية والعشرون", "why": "Outlines necessities and considerations for processing data for public interest, indicating a structured approach to data handling that could relate to legislative measures."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential indirect counterparts or related provisions exist, suggesting a need for further analysis or clarification.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "span": "ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية لأغراض المصلحة العامة", "why": "This article discusses safeguards for processing personal data for public interest, indicating an awareness of the need for specific provisions in data processing."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["04322a32135a68c65bb5", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "772962994f8e191e84a3", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "08b4c74d887bbe3b2039", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 666.62, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e607a88e67b8291960b7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
