quirements and protect data subjects’ rights", "target": "يركز على أمن المعالجة (السرية، النزاهة، التوافر) والتشفير والسياسات؛ ذكر حماية الحقوق والحريات يظهر في سياق ما بعد الاختراق", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 5(1.1)-(1.4); Art. 4(4); Art. 6(5)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "taking into account state of the art, cost, nature, scope, context and purposes, and risks (likelihood/severity)", "target": "تكون التدابير ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطة مقدم الخدمة وحساسية البيانات؛ التزام بممارسات إدارة المخاطر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 5(1); Art. 5(3)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "both at design stage and at time of processing", "target": "مراعاة ضوابط التصميم/التغيير/التطوير (تصميمياً) + استخدام التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية أثناء المعالجة (تشغيلياً)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5(6); Art. 4(4); Art. 5(1), 5(1.4)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "mostly_covered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Art. 5(6) explicitly anchors a design-stage duty by requiring observance of controls in the design/change/development of products, systems and services, while Art. 4(4) and Art. 5 impose implementation of appropriate technical and organisational measures during processing. Conditions are narrower than GDPR (no explicit state of the art/cost), and the scope is more security-focused than GDPR’s broader privacy-by-design aims.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-209", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit consideration for all technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors in KWT provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 5", "span": "1. توفير التدابير الأمنية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية للمستخدم ضد الخسارة أو الضرر أو الإفصاح أو الاختراق من طرف آخر غير مصرح له أو استبدال البيانات أو المعلومات بأخرى غير صحيحة أو إضافة معلومات غير صحيحة.", "why": "Does not explicitly mention consideration of the state of the art, cost of implementation, and other factors as required by GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly require implementation of measures at both design and operational stages.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "المادة الخامسة: أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 5 does not explicitly require implementation of measures at both design and operational stages."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["a418980931b429c7909a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 663.32, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e89d37d25b2a64997db2", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["6c76988b817262e3e312", "f5c366135483fe580381", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Sets general controller security/design obligations; does not require consulting the authority, a DPIA, or prior consultation conditions."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Addresses safeguards and processor-to-controller notifications of breaches/risks; no supervisory authority consultation or DPIA-triggered prior step."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; unrelated to prior consultation with an authority."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosing/transferring data to a processor; no authority consultation requirement."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data minimization/accuracy/retention; no prior consultation with authority or DPIA trigger."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from Article 6 transparency; not about consulting the authority."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Public-interest processing exemptions; does not create a DPIA-based prior consultation duty."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule; no prior consultation with authority."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing information to the individual; no supervisory authority consultation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المراقب", "article": "Article 14"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "consult the supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "intended processing", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 indicates the processing would result in a high risk in the absence of measures", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "prior to processing", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Articles 11 and 27 show internal pre-processing reviews and the existence of an overseeing authority, but there is no textual duty to consult that authority prior to processing based on a DPIA revealing high residual risk. Article 14 requires notifying the competent administration after a harmful breach, which is post-incident notification, not prior consultation. The target text contains no DPIA concept and no prior-consultation trigger tied to high risk.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-415", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart found in Article 8 and implied in Article 11 and Article 27", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي: 1- معالجة البيانات الشخصية بأمانة ومشروعية. 2- مراعاة الضوابط الخاصة بتصميم أو تغيير أو تطوير المنتجات والنظم والخدمات المتعلقة بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية. 3- اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة.", "why": "Requires the controller to take measures to protect personal data, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement"}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية: 1- مراجعة إجراءات حماية الخصوصية قبل إدراج عمليات معالجة جديدة.", "why": "Implies a level of oversight and responsibility that could be related to the GDPR requirement"}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Gives the competent authority the power to take necessary actions to apply and enforce the law, which could include consulting with the controller"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions imply data protection obligations and oversight, suggesting a need to reconsider the 'uncovered' verdicts in light of broader data protection principles.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 11", "span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية", "why": "Implies obligations for data protection, suggesting some alignment with GDPR principles on controller responsibilities."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Indicates administrative oversight and regulatory actions, which could be interpreted as related to supervisory authority functions."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "455aae046cacf7979576", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 644.89, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "ef44e9b4beae5b82336f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Addresses right to object to direct marketing, not rectification/completion of personal data."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Sets controller data-quality obligations (accuracy, adequacy) but does not confer a data-subject right to complete data."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "reason": "Sectoral journalism/art/literature derogations; no rectification/completion right."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing rules; no rectification/completion right."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Compensation for damage; not a rectification/completion right."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "International data transfers; unrelated to rectification/completion."}, {"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "reason": "Information duties; only references the existence of a rectification right but does not establish its substance."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; not a rectification/completion right."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Right to be informed of processing; not rectification/completion."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Public registers framework; not a rectification/completion right."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Penalties; no rectification/completion right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب ... وعلى مدير البيانات، ما لم يكن لديه مسوِّغ مقبول قانوناً، الاستجابة للطلب", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "action": {"span": "لتصحيح ... البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به ... إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به ... إذا كانت البيانات ... ناقصة", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون، وعلى الأخص إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة، أو إذا كانت معالجتها غير مشروعة.", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن لديه مسوِّغ مقبول قانوناً ... لا يسري حكم البند (1) ... على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور الاطلاع عليه، إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة", "article": "Article 23(1), Article 23(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الطلب", "article": "Article 23(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً ... إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب", "article": "Article 23(5)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "كل صاحب بيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم بطلب وعلى مدير البيانات الاستجابة له ما لم يكن لديه مسوِّغ مقبول قانوناً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "have incomplete personal data completed, including by providing a supplementary statement", "target_value": "طلب تصحيح البيانات بما في ذلك عندما تكون ناقصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "incomplete personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به ... إذا كانت ... ناقصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون (ومنها كون البيانات ناقصة/غير محدثة/غير صحيحة)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "ما لم يكن لدى مدير البيانات مسوِّغ مقبول قانوناً؛ واستثناء السجلات العامة ذات الإجراءات الخاصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(1)-(2)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "الاستجابة خلال عشرة أيام عمل", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إخطار الأطراف الثالثة بالتغييرات خلال خمسة عشر يوماً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(5)"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 23 grants a right to request correction when data are incomplete, but it conditions the right on unlawful processing and does not mention completion by a supplementary statement. The GDPR’s purposive qualifier is absent, and the specific supplementary-statement mechanism is not expressed. The analysis reflects these gaps.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-141", "gdpr_article": 16, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The citation does not fully support the claim regarding the completion of incomplete personal data by providing a supplementary statement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "يجوز لكل صاحب بيانات أن يتقدم إلى مدير البيانات بطلب، مشفوع بما يثبت هويته، لتصحيح أو حَجْب أو مسح البيانات الشخصية الخاصة به بحسب الأحوال، إذا كانت معالجتها تتم بالمخالفة لأحكام القانون، وعلى الأخص إذا كانت البيانات غير صحيحة أو ناقصة أو غير محدَّثة، أو إذا كانت معالجتها غير مشروعة.", "why": "The article provides a right to request correction but does not explicitly mention completion by supplementary statement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "762372b7329c44286e43", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 542.32, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a19058af15e270791335", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["6e9c9892919d23a9a4da", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure grounds; not a right to object to direct marketing or a duty to stop such processing."}, {"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to direct marketing objection."}, {"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "reason": "Procedural ground to refuse certain requests; no marketing-specific stop requirement."}, {"id": "dcd007160208896c8632", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to direct marketing."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Transparency notice content; does not create a right to object to marketing or require stopping processing."}, {"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Record of processing obligations; not about objection to marketing."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rule addressing marketing objection/cessation."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Prohibits certain disclosures; not a right to object to marketing processing."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "reason": "General procedure and temporary suspension pending decision; not a substantive right to object to direct marketing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 22"}, "modality": {"span": "التوقف عن إرسال المواد الإعلانية أو التسويقية أو التجارية", "article": "Article 22(4)"}, "action": {"span": "إرسال المواد الإعلانية أو التسويقية أو التجارية", "article": "Article 22(4)"}, "scope": {"span": "أي مادة إعلانية أو تسويقية أو ذات أغراض تجارية", "article": "Article 22"}, "condition": {"span": "فور تلقي طلب الإيقاف من صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 22(4)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "فور تلقي طلب الإيقاف", "article": "Article 22(4)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 22"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "prohibition: shall no longer process upon objection", "target": "التوقف عن إرسال المواد الإعلانية أو التسويقية أو التجارية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 22(4)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "process the personal data for direct marketing purposes", "target": "إرسال المواد الإعلانية أو التسويقية أو التجارية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 22(4)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing for direct marketing purposes", "target": "أي مادة إعلانية أو تسويقية أو ذات أغراض تجارية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 22"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where the data subject objects to processing for direct marketing purposes", "target": "فور تلقي طلب الإيقاف من صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 22(4); Article 11(a); Article 10"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "N/A"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "فور تلقي طلب الإيقاف", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 22(4)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "N/A"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "The reviewer’s point is valid: Article 22 obliges stopping the sending of marketing materials upon a stop request, not ceasing all processing for direct marketing. While Article 10 (consent required) and Article 11(a) (right to cancel consent) can indirectly halt marketing processing upon consent withdrawal, this is not framed as an unconditional right to object to all direct-marketing processing. Therefore, the target is narrower than GDPR Art. 21(2) and only partially covers RU-181.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-181", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction might not fully cover the GDPR requirement unit [RU-181], as Article 22(4) only mentions stopping the sending of advertising or marketing materials, and not the processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6e9c9892919d23a9a4da", "span": "التوقف عن إرسال المواد الإعلانية أو التسويقية أو التجارية", "why": "This provision only mentions stopping the sending of advertising or marketing materials, but not the processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "span": "يحظر على المتحكم والمعالج نشر أو مشاركة أو الإفصاح عن البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision prohibits the publication or sharing of personal data, but does not explicitly address the objection of the data subject to processing for direct marketing purposes."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction's provisions may not fully cover the GDPR requirement unit [RU-181], as Article 22 only addresses stopping the sending of materials, not the broader concept of processing personal data for direct marketing purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6e9c9892919d23a9a4da", "span": "يجب على المتحكم قبل إرسال أي مادة إعلانية أو تسويقية أو ذات أغراض تجارية لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الالتزام بالآتي:", "why": "This article only mentions stopping the sending of materials, but does not explicitly address the processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "6e9c9892919d23a9a4da", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "dcd007160208896c8632", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "caad155111190c1aa274", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "546cfd19de051c612c06"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 623.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "014d634a1b12eebc1324", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "reason": "Addresses prohibitions on disclosing personal data in certain sensitive contexts; does not mention breach notification to, or exceptions from notifying, the competent authority."}, {"id": "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "reason": "Concerns legal guardian matters; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Concerns withdrawal of consent; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "reason": "Concerns processing for research/statistics; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Concerns response timelines to data subject rights requests; not breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Concerns data subject access rights; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Concerns record-keeping available to authority upon request; not breach notification of breaches."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Concerns data accuracy; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Concerns transparency at collection; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Concerns lawful bases and collection; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08", "reason": "Concerns handling of data subject rights requests; unrelated to breach notification to authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "تشعر", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تشعر جهة التحكم الجهة المختصة", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "الجهة المختصة", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند علمها بحدوث تسرب لبيانات شخصية أو تلفها أو وصول غير مشروع إليها", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند علمها بحدوث تسرب لبيانات شخصية أو تلفها أو وصول غير مشروع إليها؛ وفقاً لما تحدده اللوائح", "article": "Article 20(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "تشعر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target_value": "تشعر جهة التحكم الجهة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target_value": "الجهة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "in the case of a personal data breach", "target_value": "عند علمها بحدوث تسرب لبيانات شخصية أو تلفها أو وصول غير مشروع إليها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the personal data breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay after becoming aware of the personal data breach", "target_value": "عند علمها بحدوث تسرب ...؛ وفقاً لما تحدده اللوائح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 20(1) squarely imposes an obligation on the controller to notify the competent authority upon becoming aware of a breach, but it does not contain the GDPR’s risk-based exception and does not articulate the ‘without undue delay’ standard. Article 16 restricts disclosure of personal data in certain sensitive contexts; it neither mentions breach notification nor creates a risk-threshold exception for notifying the authority. Therefore, the GDPR exception remains uncovered and the temporal element only partially covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-345", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdict for the 'exception' slot is incorrect, and there is a counterpart in the KSA provisions for this exception.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "span": "تشعر جهة التحكم صاحب البيانات الشخصية إذا كان من شأن حدوث تسرب لبيانات شخصية أو تلفها أو وصول غير مشروع إليها أن يرتب ضرراً على بياناته أو يتعارض مع حقوقه أو مصالحه؛ وفقاً لما تحدده اللوائح.", "why": "This provision implies that the controller should notify the data subject if the breach is likely to result in harm to their rights or interests, which can be inferred to mean that the controller is not required to notify the data subject if the breach is unlikely to result in harm."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The exception to notifying the authority might be partially covered under Article 16.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "span": "المادة العشرون: 1- تشعر جهة التحكم الجهة المختصة عند علمها بحدوث تسرب لبيانات شخصية أو تلفها أو وصول غير مشروع إليها؛ وفقاً لما تحدده اللوائح.", "why": "This provision matches the GDPR requirement of notifying the competent supervisory authority in the case of a personal data breach."}, {"id": "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "span": "المادة السادسة عشرة: على جهة التحكم ألا تفصح عن البيانات الشخصية في الأحوال المنصوص عليها في الفقرات (1) و (2) و (5) و (6) من المادة (الخامسة عشرة من النظام)، متى اتصف الإفصاح بأي مما يأتي:", "why": "This provision provides exceptions for disclosing personal data, which could be interpreted as applicable to notifying the authority as well."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "17d4b446ea6ed7965d08"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 636.96, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "46d292ab1c775412c0d0", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["c24849787475f274ecac"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Criminal penalties (imprisonment/fines) imposed by courts, not an administrative fine cap imposed by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "General tasks/powers of the authority; does not specify an administrative fine cap."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions/registration; not about supervisory authority administrative fines."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Disciplinary investigation of DPOs; not about administrative fines by the authority."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations; no administrative fine cap."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Civil compensation; not an administrative fine imposed by the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification regime; not related to administrative fine caps."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Data subject right to object; not an administrative fine provision."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject right to rectification/erasure; not an administrative fine provision."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not an administrative fine cap."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of corporate DPO providers; not about fines by the supervisory authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "بما لا يجاوِز", "article": "Article 55(1)(ج)"}, "action": {"span": "توقيع غرامة إدارية بما لا يجاوِز عشرين ألف دينار", "article": "Article 55(1)(ج)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة... فوراً أو خلال فترة زمنية يحدِّدها المجلس، وفي حالة عدم امتثاله لذلك التكليف في الفترة المحددة، فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً...", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "مجلس الإدارة (Board of the Authority)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 55(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": "بما لا يجاوِز (not exceeding) — a limit that functions as a prohibition on exceeding the cap", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 55(1)(ج)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "impose an administrative fine exceeding the higher of EUR 20,000,000 or 4% worldwide annual turnover (preceding year)", "target_value": "توقيع غرامة إدارية بما لا يجاوِز عشرين ألف دينار (cap is a fixed BHD 20,000; no turnover-based tier)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 55(1)(ج)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "in accordance with paragraph 2", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "for infringements of data subjects’ rights (Articles 12–22)", "target_value": "عند ثبوت المخالفة (upon establishing a violation) — not limited to specific rights", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 55(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إمهال للتوقف/الإزالة فوراً أو خلال فترة يحددها المجلس قبل تقرير الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 55(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s Article 55 provides the supervisory authority with an administrative fine capped at BHD 20,000 and thus functions as a counterpart but with different specifications (fixed, much lower cap; no 4% turnover tier). It applies generally to violations, not specifically to data-subject-rights infringements, and there is no cross-reference analogous to the GDPR’s internal paragraph scope.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-514", "gdpr_article": 42, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction provisions do not explicitly state a cap on the administrative fine based on the total worldwide annual turnover of the preceding financial year.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "Article 55(1)(ج)", "why": "The provision states that the administrative fine shall not exceed 20,000 dinars, but does not mention a cap based on the total worldwide annual turnover."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "span": "Article 58", "why": "The provision lists various penalties for non-compliance, but does not explicitly mention a cap on the administrative fine for infringements of the data subjects' rights."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Bahraini law has a counterpart to the GDPR's administrative fine, but with different specifications.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 55", "span": "توقيع غرامة إدارية بما لا يجاوز عشرين ألف دينار", "why": "This article mentions an administrative fine, but with a different specification than the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 58", "span": "يعاقَب بالحبس مدة لا تزيد على سنة وبالغرامة التي لا تقل عن ألف دينار ولا تتجاوز عشرين ألف دينار", "why": "This article lists various penalties for non-compliance with the law, including an administrative fine."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "c24849787475f274ecac", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 680.77, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "b6a3ac276d9c5249d975", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Regulates disclosure of personal data; no data subject right to human intervention or automated decision-making rights."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Sets lawful bases for collection/processing; does not address rights against solely automated decisions or human intervention."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Conditions for processing from non-direct sources; no automated decision-making or human intervention right."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Marketing processing conditions; no relevance to human intervention in automated decisions."}, {"id": "085e0379de48628139e3", "reason": "Right to rectification/restriction for accuracy checks; not a right to human intervention in automated decisions."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "Requires impact assessments; no data subject right to obtain human intervention."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "reason": "Inspection/enforcement powers; not about data subject rights or automated decisions."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection and controller responsibility; no automated decision-making right."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping obligations; no right to human intervention."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Processing for an actual interest; no automated decision-making right."}, {"id": "5df1b1c5bce760454262", "reason": "Scientific/research/statistical processing safeguards; does not create a right to human intervention."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهات التحكم", "article": "Article 4(5)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهات التحكم", "article": "Article 4(5)"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "اتخاذ قرارات مبنية على المعالجة الآلية للبيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(5)"}, "condition": {"span": "التي تتضمن أنشطتها -على نطاق واسع أو بصورة متكررة-", "article