 were available, so no textual counterpart to GDPR Art. 26(1) on joint controller arrangements could be identified. As a result, the substantive slots are marked uncovered. Slots marked “None” in the GDPR unit are treated as covered by default.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-215", "gdpr_article": 26, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 2, "latency_s": 101.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "47ea137b64f2a46b6111", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Addresses duties of controllers/processors toward the Data Protection Officer; contains no rule on multiple controllers determining respective responsibilities by arrangement."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures for processing; no reference to joint controllers or allocation of compliance responsibilities."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles; does not regulate arrangements between multiple controllers or distribution of responsibilities."}, {"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "reason": "Institutional delegation provision; unrelated to controller responsibility allocation."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; no content on joint control or arrangements between controllers."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers and contact; does not address joint controller arrangements or allocation of duties."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Data subject rights regarding automated processing; no rule requiring multiple controllers to agree on respective responsibilities."}, {"id": "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "reason": "Cross-border transfer conditions; no mention of joint controllers or responsibility allocation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "في جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم، وقبل البدء بالمعالجة، تزويد صاحب البيانات بالمعلومات المنصوص عليها في الفقرات (ب) و(د) و(ز) من البند (1) من هذه المادة.", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "joint controllers", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على المتحكم الالتزام بما يأتي:", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[674524dee00496cb5de7] Article 7", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "determine their respective responsibilities for compliance by means of an arrangement, in a transparent manner", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "responsibilities for compliance, in particular regarding data subject rights and duties to provide information (Arts 13 and 14)", "target_value": "في جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم، وقبل البدء بالمعالجة، تزويد صاحب البيانات بالمعلومات ...", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[717a67a0d311f88c5fd9] Article 13(2); [dec351a1e477287e3b22] Article 19; [3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2] Article 5(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless and insofar as Union or Member State law determines those responsibilities", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "While Articles 5, 13, and 19 impose transparency and rights/information duties on a controller, the UAE text contains no provision requiring multiple controllers to enter into an arrangement to determine their respective compliance responsibilities. Articles 10–12 concern the DPO and do not allocate responsibilities among joint controllers. Accordingly, the specific Art. 26 GDPR requirement for a transparent inter-controller arrangement is absent from the provided UAE provisions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-215", "gdpr_article": 26, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law, while not explicitly mirroring the GDPR's joint controller provision, contains elements across several articles that could be interpreted as addressing shared responsibilities and data protection obligations among controllers and processors.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "المادة (12) واجبات المتحكم والمعالج تجاه مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article outlines duties towards the data protection officer, implying shared responsibilities."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "المادة (18) حق المعالجة والمعالجة المؤتمتة", "why": "This article discusses the right to object to automated processing, which could relate to shared controller responsibilities in complex processing operations."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "The appointment of a data protection officer suggests a framework for responsibility allocation among controllers."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provisions, while not directly mirroring the GDPR's joint controller requirements, distribute responsibilities and obligations across several articles that could support a framework for determining respective responsibilities among joint controllers.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "المادة (12) واجبات المتحكم والمعالج تجاه مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article outlines obligations towards the data protection officer, implying a level of responsibility and accountability."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "المادة (5) ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article discusses the principles for processing personal data, including transparency and fairness, which are relevant to joint controllers' responsibilities."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "span": "المادة (19) طرق التواصل مع المتحكم على المتحكم", "why": "This article provides for mechanisms of communication, which could be part of a framework for joint controllers to determine their responsibilities."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "c34922f387019af45e42", "6201d16404c0d4b9f63d", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 581.71, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "ff0338905a9efe583f99", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Sets procedural safeguards for disclosure (documentation, minimization), not a special prohibition/authorization framework for processing criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "reason": "Limits the right of access; does not regulate the processing of criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Consent withdrawal mechanics; no rule on criminal-conviction data processing."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping requirements; no substantive rule on processing criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency at collection; no special-category prohibition comparable to GDPR Art. 10."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to authorization to process criminal-conviction data."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Data quality (accuracy); not a rule on criminal-conviction data processing."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Response timelines for data-subject requests; no relevance to Art. 10-like prohibition."}, {"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "reason": "Cross-border transfer conditions; does not address criminal-conviction data processing."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not a substantive restriction/exception framework for criminal-conviction data."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "modality": {"span": "ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله.", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "action": {"span": "معالجة تلك البيانات", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "condition": {"span": "ومع ذلك، يجوز لجهة التحكم ... جمعها من غير صاحبها مباشرة، أو معالجتها لغرض آخر غير الذي جمعت من أجله، وذلك في الأحوال الآتية: 1- إذا وافق صاحب البيانات الشخصية ... 3- إذا كانت جهة التحكم جهة عامة ... 7- إذا كان جمع البيانات أو معالجتها ضروريا لتحقيق مصالح مشروعة ... ولم تكن تلك البيانات بيانات حساسة.", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "exception": {"span": "إذا كانت جهة التحكم جهة عامة، وكان جمع البيانات الشخصية أو معالجتها؛ مطلوباً لأغراض المصلحة العامة أو لأغراض أمنية أو لتنفيذ نظام آخر أو لاستيفاء متطلبات قضائية.", "article": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": "ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "process personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures", "target": "معالجة تلك البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures", "target": "البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the processing is based on Article 6(1) GDPR", "target": "وذلك في الأحوال الآتية: (منها) الموافقة، كون الجهة عامة ولأغراض أمنية/المصلحة العامة/تنفيذ نظام آخر/متطلبات قضائية، المصالح المشروعة (مع استبعاد البيانات الحساسة).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10 and Article 15", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "when the processing is under the control of official authority; or when authorised by Union or Member State law that provides appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of data subjects", "target": "إذا كانت جهة التحكم جهة عامة ... لأغراض المصلحة العامة أو لأغراض أمنية أو لتنفيذ نظام آخر أو لاستيفاء متطلبات قضائية.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10 (c511c9bf7779067e64f4)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.57, "reasoning_note": "I incorporated the cited counter-evidence: the KSA texts clearly regulate ‘processing’ (معالجة) and provide distributed lawful bases/exceptions (including when the controller is a public authority or to meet legal/judicial requirements). However, they do not single out criminal-conviction/offence data nor require authorization-by-law with appropriate safeguards, so the GDPR Art. 10-specific prohibition is only partially mirrored.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-030", "gdpr_article": 10, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit provisions addressing the processing of personal data related to criminal convictions and offenses", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "المادة العاشرة: لا يجوز لجهة التحكم جمع البيانات الشخصية إلا من صاحبها مباشرة، ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله", "why": "Article 10 does not explicitly address the processing of personal data related to criminal convictions and offenses"}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "span": "لا يجوز لجهة التحكم أن تعالج البيانات الشخصية دون اتخاذ خطوات كافية للتحقق من دقتها واكتمالها وحداثتها وارتباطها بالغرض الذي جمعت من أجله", "why": "Article 14 implies a general obligation to ensure lawfulness but does not specifically address the processing of personal data related to criminal convictions and offenses"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the scope and condition are uncovered is not entirely accurate, as there are provisions that provide counterparts to the GDPR requirement under different terminology and distribution.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "span": "معالجة تلك البيانات", "why": "This provision mentions processing of personal data, although not explicitly mentioning criminal convictions and offences or related security measures."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "span": "أغراض المصلحة العامة أو لأغراض أمنية أو لتنفيذ نظام آخر أو لاستيفاء متطلبات قضائية", "why": "This provision provides exceptions for processing personal data, including when it is necessary for public interest, security, or judicial requirements."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "8394f801a0a97e521f68"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 638.06, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "69e1b68cfb217899aa64", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
