{"candidates_selected": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "823830174d241884bd73", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; does not address judicial proceedings or forum."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Pre-processing authorization content; not about remedies or courts."}, {"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "reason": "Grants investigative officers \"judicial police\" status; not a data subject right to sue or venue."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "DPO tasks; no remedy or forum rule."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External audit; no remedy or forum rule."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Policy must include a mechanism to exercise rights; does not create a court proceeding or venue right."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Appointment of DPO; no remedy or forum rule."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Representation of incapacitated persons; does not establish judicial proceedings or forum."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12"}, "action": {"span": "التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "article": "Article 12"}, "scope": {"span": "تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى التي يودعها أصحاب البيانات الشخصية، والبت فيها", "article": "Article 7(ج)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 12"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً.", "article": "Article 3(b)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "يجوز", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the data subject has his or her habitual residence", "target_value": "التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة (آلية إدارية وليست قضائية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 12; Article 7(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target_value": "تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى ... والبت فيها (مسار إداري لدى الوزارة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 7(ج); Article 12"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن المعالجة لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "unless the controller or processor is a public authority of a Member State acting in the exercise of its public powers", "target_value": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على ... تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 3(b)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 3(b) does mirror the public-authority carve-out category, but the OMN text otherwise provides an administrative complaint path (Articles 12, 7, 31) rather than a right to bring court proceedings or a forum-of-habitual-residence rule. No provision mentions courts, jurisdiction, or judicial remedies against controllers/processors, so the core of GDPR Art. 79 remains unmet despite the analogous exception.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-917", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the slot 'action' and 'scope' is not entirely accurate, as there are some provisions in the OMN law that could be related to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "span": "Article 9", "why": "Grants the employees of the Ministry the power of judicial police in applying the provisions of the law, which could be interpreted as allowing for some form of judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "span": "Article 7", "why": "States that the Ministry is responsible for receiving and deciding on complaints from data subjects, which could be seen as a form of proceedings."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be overly pessimistic, and the target jurisdiction's provisions may provide more coverage for the GDPR requirement unit [RU-917] than initially thought.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3(b)", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً.", "why": "This provision could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR's exception for public authorities acting in the exercise of their public powers."}, {"id": "Article 7", "span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون، ولها على الأخص الآتي: ... ج- تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى التي يودعها أصحاب البيانات الشخصية، والبت فيها، خلال المدة التي تحددها اللائحة.", "why": "This provision could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR's requirement for proceedings to be brought before the courts."}, {"id": "Article 31", "span": "يجوز للإدارة المختصة بعد تلقي البلاغ المشار إليه في المادة (30) من هذه اللائحة توثيقه في السجل المعد لذلك، ولها اتخاذ ما تراه مناسباً من الإجراءات الآتية: ...", "why": "This provision could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR's requirement for proceedings to result in a decision or judgment."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "823830174d241884bd73", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "de5924c49336b5580d1e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 635.61, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "c059b433ca4e438e586b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "d9a05a425b46428120ee"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure/deletion triggers and notifications; not an overarching duty to implement TOMs or demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Purpose limitation/collection source rules; do not establish accountability measures or risk-based TOMs."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification duties; incident response not a general requirement to implement appropriate TOMs."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Narrow documentation duty for a specific legal basis (realized interest); tangential to Art. 24-style accountability."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure-stage safeguards and record-keeping; too context-specific to stand in for a general TOMs obligation."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency notice elements; does not impose implementing TOMs or demonstration of compliance."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "المادة الثانية والعشرون (Article 22)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "المادة الثانية والعشرون (Article 22)"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الوسائل المناسبة للحد من الأضرار التي قد تنتج عن ذلك، بما في ذلك وضع الضوابط الإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "article": "المادة الحادية والعشرون (Article 21)"}, "scope": {"span": "أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لدى جهة التحكم", "article": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون الفقرة (3)(و) (Article 32(3)(w))"}, "condition": {"span": "بحسب طبيعة النشاط الذي تمارسه جهة التحكم", "article": "المادة الثانية والعشرون (Article 22)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الثانية والعشرون: \"على جهة التحكم إجراء تقويم للآثار...\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الثانية والعشرون"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target_value": "اتخاذ الوسائل المناسبة للحد من الأضرار، بما في ذلك وضع الضوابط الإدارية والتقنية اللازمة؛ وتوثيق نتائج التقويم (إشراف مسؤول حماية البيانات)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "المادة الحادية والعشرون فقرة (3); المادة الثانية والثلاثون فقرة (3)(ب); المادة الثلاثون فقرة (4)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "أنشطة معالجة البيانات الشخصية لدى جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون فقرة (3)(و); مع ملاحظة أن التزامات أخرى تنطبق فقط في سياقات محددة (مثلاً جهة عامة/مصلحة عامة – المادة 21؛ منتجات/خدمات للعموم – المادة 22)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "بحسب طبيعة النشاط الذي تمارسه جهة التحكم؛ واتخاذ الوسائل المناسبة للحد من الأضرار", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "المادة الثانية والعشرون؛ المادة الحادية والعشرون فقرة (3)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "I incorporated the reviewer’s pointers: Article 21 requires taking appropriate means (including admin/technical controls) to limit harms, and Article 32 tasks the DPO with supervising impact assessments and documenting results. While these and DPIA/audit provisions reflect risk-based and demonstrability elements, KSA’s framework distributes these duties across specific contexts and does not state a single, general Art. 24-style obligation applicable to all processing.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 18, "total": 30}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 35}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'scope' slot is incorrect, as the target jurisdiction's provisions do cover all processing activities under the controller's responsibility.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[c511c9bf7779067e64f4]", "span": "المادة العاشرة: لا يجوز لجهة التحكم جمع البيانات الشخصية إلا من صاحبها مباشرة، ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله.", "why": "This article implies that the controller is responsible for ensuring compliance with the law for all processing activities."}, {"id": "[d9a05a425b46428120ee]", "span": "4- للجهة المختصة في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح، اتخاذ ما يأتي: أ- طلب الوثائق أو المعلومات اللازمة من جهة التحكم للتأكد من التزامها بأحكام النظام واللوائح.", "why": "This article grants the competent authority the power to request documents from the controller to verify compliance with the law, suggesting that the controller is responsible for ensuring compliance with the law for all processing activities under its responsibility."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdicts are not entirely accurate, and there are provisions that can be seen as related to the GDPR requirement, but not exactly matching.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "span": "اتخاذ الوسائل المناسبة للحد من الأضرار", "why": "related to risk assessment"}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "span": "الإشراف على إجراءات تقويم الأثر", "why": "related to impact assessment"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 659.28, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "2198bf90e5cbd84cd91f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["6c76988b817262e3e312", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "75852a697f66691bfbfb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and processor-to-controller breach notice; does not address responding to data subject requests or timelines."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest exemptions from certain articles; no rule on informing data subjects about action on requests."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance deadline; unrelated to data subject request handling."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure conditions; not about data subject requests."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Administrative complaint process and ministerial review; not an obligation to inform data subjects of action on their requests."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations (privacy-by-design, safeguards); no procedural duty to inform on requests or timeframe."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to individuals and authority; unrelated to DS request response duty/timelines."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; not about data subject requests."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": "إخطاره بمعالجة بياناته الشخصية وبالأغراض التي تجري من أجلها تلك المعالجة.", "article": "Article 6"}, "scope": {"span": "تلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "article": "Article 11"}, "condition": {"span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها", "article": "Article 6"}, "exception": {"span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام المادة (6) من هذا القانون، في أي من الحالتين الآتيتين: 1- إذا كان من شأن الإفصاح الإضرار بالمصالح التجارية لشخص آخر. 2- إذا كان من شأن تنفيذ هذا الالتزام الإفصاح عن بيانات شخصية تتعلق بفرد آخر لم يوافق على ذلك، وأن الإفصاح قد يترتب عليه ضرر مادي أو معنوي لهذا الفرد أو أي فرد آخر.", "article": "Article 21"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target_value": "إخطاره بمعالجة بياناته والأغراض (إخطار الفرد) وإتاحة نظم لتلقي ودراسة الطلبات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 6; Article 11", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target_value": "الشكاوى وطلبات الوصول وتصحيح/حذف البيانات؛ وحقوق السحب والاعتراض والتصحيح والحذف", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 11; Article 5; Article 6", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target_value": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول وطلب المراجعة (يفترض تحقق الطلب من الفرد)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إعفاءات من الالتزام بإخطار/تمكين الحقوق المنصوص عليها في المادة 6 في حالتي الضرر بالمصالح التجارية أو الإفصاح عن بيانات الغير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 21", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay and within one month of receipt", "target_value": "no specific timeframe stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 11(4) requires systems to receive and study access/correction/deletion requests, and Article 6 requires notifying individuals of certain matters, which partially aligns with providing information to the data subject. However, the law does not state that the controller must inform the data subject of action taken on a request, nor does it set a one‑month or undue‑delay timeframe. Exceptions in Article 21 further limit the duty compared to the GDPR rule.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 12}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of uncovered aspects can be challenged by considering the distributed nature of relevant provisions across the Qatari law, which collectively address data subject rights and controller obligations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 6", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها", "why": "Implies a form of communication from the controller to the data subject regarding their data."}, {"id": "Article 11(4)", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "why": "Addresses the controller's obligation to establish systems for receiving and studying requests from data subjects."}, {"id": "Article 26", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "why": "Provides a temporal framework for administrative actions in response to complaints."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'action' slot may be incorrect, as Article 11(4) and Article 6 may provide some coverage for this slot.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "why": "This provision establishes internal systems for receiving and studying complaints, requests for access to data, requests for correction or deletion of data, which may be related to the action of providing information on action taken on a request."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها", "why": "This provision implies that the controller has an obligation to provide information to the data subject, which may be related to the action of providing information on action taken on a request."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "f5c366135483fe580381", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 581.04, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e8f317b82da803e033f1", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "reason": "Training is an organizational measure but does not impose a design-phase requirement to implement principles."}, {"id": "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "reason": "Administrative procedure for registering a DPO; unrelated to design of measures."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions; no operative obligation about design of measures."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllership coordination duties; not about privacy by design or design of measures."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; not a controller-facing design obligation."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "DPO duties on conflicts and confidentiality; not about controller’s design of measures."}, {"id": "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "reason": "DPO appointment; not about design of technical/organizational measures."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual clauses; context-specific, not a general design obligation."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Adequacy/transfer rules; not about design of measures."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO tasks/independence; oversight rather than controller’s design obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات القائمة على معالجة البيانات بأنواعها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "scope": {"span": "وضع أطر حماية الخصوصية (privacy framework) ... المتعلقة بحماية البيانات في ضوء القانون والقرارات المعمول بها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "condition": {"span": "وتطبيقها كلها أو بعضها أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة، وذلك بناءً على طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e): \"على مدير البيانات\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "على ... الالتزام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "design the technical and organisational measures to implement data-protection principles effectively", "target": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) ... ووضع أطر حماية الخصوصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e), points 1 and 2", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "data-protection principles include, for example, data minimisation", "target": "أطر حماية الخصوصية في ضوء القانون والقرارات؛ أمثلة تشغيلية تشمل تنظيم مُدة الاحتفاظ بالبيانات ومحوها", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e), points 2 and 3", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)", "target": "Risk/context-based application during processing", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "both at the time of the determination of the means for processing and at the time of the processing itself", "target": "عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e), point 1", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 2 explicitly requires Privacy by Design at preparation/design/selection/use stages and mandates effective organizational/technical structures, directly addressing the ‘design’ element and effectiveness. While it does not literally list ‘data-protection principles’ or ‘data minimisation,’ it requires privacy frameworks in light of the law and includes principle-like controls (e.g., retention/deletion), so principle implementation is captured conceptually. This addresses the reviewer’s objection by pointing to the explicit “تصميم” wording and the effectiveness language.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-210", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition 'as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)' could be considered as covered in the target jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات القائمة على معالجة البيانات بأنواعها", "why": "This provision supports the idea that the data controller has an obligation to implement technical and organizational measures, including privacy by design, which could be considered as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly state that the controller shall 'design' the technical and organizational measures, and it does not explicitly mention the implementation of data-protection principles.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الواجب تطبيقها في المُعالجة لضمان مستوى كافٍ من الأمان عند معالجة البيانات", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that the controller shall 'design' the technical and organizational measures."}, {"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "span": "مستوى كافٍ من الأمان", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the implementation of data-protection principles."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "b6efa51e73b9b96a9b0f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 622.35, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "2dc9bb79ebef3f587944", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification duties (to authority and data subject); does not address informing data subjects about actions on rights requests or any DSAR response timeline."}, {"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service transparency/consent; no obligation to inform data subjects about actions taken on rights requests or timelines."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; no DSAR response or notification duty."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General compliance and sanctions; no specific rule on notifying data subjects of actions taken on rights requests or timing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة أثناء توفير الخدمة أو بعد انتهائها أن يقوم بجمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية:", "article": "Article 4 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "condition": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها على مدار الساعة، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها.", "article": "Article 5(9)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يجب/على (mandatory)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target": "تحديد آلية ومعالجة طلبات حقوق أصحاب البيانات (إنشاء آلية ووسائل لتمكين ومباشرة الطلبات)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(8); Article 5(9); Article 4(6)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target": "طلبات الحصول على البيانات، تصحيحها، إزالتها، تقييدها، الاعتراض، ونقل البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4(8); Article 5(9)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target": "وجود نظم لتلقي الطلبات وتمكين أصحاب البيانات من مباشرة حقوقهم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(9); Article 4(6)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated for notifying data subjects about actions on rights requests", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "without undue delay and within one month of receipt", "target": "No time limit for responding to or informing about rights requests", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated specific to this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Articles 4(8) and 4(6) require establishing mechanisms and technological means to enable and handle data-subject rights, and Article 5(9) requires systems to receive such requests, but there is no duty to inform the data subject about action taken on a request. No timeline comparable to “without undue delay and within one month” is set; Article 6’s 24-hour notification applies only to personal data breaches, not DSARs. Hence the coverage is partial and lacks the temporal component.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 6}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 6}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the 'action' and 'condition' slots may be incorrect due to the presence of relevant provisions in Article 4.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision suggests a mechanism for providing information on action taken on a request."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر", "why": "This provision implies a mechanism for users to access and correct their personal data, which could be related to the condition of upon receipt of the data subject's request."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be too narrow, as the target jurisdiction's provisions provide some coverage of the GDPR requirement unit [RU-034].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8): \"تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة...\"", "why": "This provision partially covers the action of providing information on action taken on a request."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(6): \"استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم مباشرة\"", "why": "This provision covers the condition of providing information on action taken on a request upon receipt of the request."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "span": "Article 6: \"إخطار صاحب البيانات في حال حدوث اختراقات لبياناته الشخصية\"", "why": "This provision covers the temporal aspect of providing information on action taken on a request without undue delay and within one month of receipt of the request."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 6, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "a418980931b429c7909a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 645.05, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "627b563f28bfe3c08315", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "General scope exemptions from the law; does not set controller measures or compliance-demonstration duties."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry powers/responsibilities; not a controller obligation to implement or demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation; not the Art. 24-type obligation to implement measures to ensure/demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualification details; not about implementing technical/organizational measures under Art. 24."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-response evaluation by authority; tangential and not the general Art. 24 obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "source": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "source": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "source": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "source": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "source": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "source": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "source": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "source": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون؛ وتعيين مدقق خارجي للتأكد من أن إجراءات المعالجة قد تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون؛ والاحتفاظ بمستندات عمليات المعالجة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 16 [b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8]; Article 17 [b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8]; Article 27 [5483caf68765f09059fb]; Article 23 [6ada991a77a31372fb4c]; Article 18 [a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf]", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13(a) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "OMN Article 13 imposes technical/organizational measures to ensure lawful processing, and Articles 16, 17, 27, and 23/18 create mechanisms to demonstrate compliance (audits, records, cooperation), but demonstration is mainly upon request and ‘appropriateness’ is not explicit. The condition is narrower: it requires identifying risks to the data subject but omits nature, scope, context, and purposes factors of GDPR Art. 24. Hence, action is partially covered and the condition is narrower, addressing the reviewer’s objection.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential incomplete coverage of GDPR requirements, particularly regarding the full scope of considerations for technical and organizational measures and demonstration of compliance.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "Narrower coverage of risk assessment compared to GDPR's broader considerations."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج - بناء على طلب الوزارة - بتعيين مدقق خارجي", "why": "Contribution to the distributed basis for technical and organizational measures, but collective coverage needs verification."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition and action slot verdicts are not fully covered by the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "The provision only partially covers the GDPR requirement for considering risks."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision does not fully align with the GDPR requirement to ensure and demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 619.63, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "6bbce17784dfd900c5ac", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ffb151edc5703b569765"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; no mention of certification bodies or supervisory orders."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO-related duties; no link to certification or powers over certification bodies."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject rectification/erasure right; unrelated to certification bodies or SA powers over them."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; no certification scheme or supervisory power to block certifications."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Data subject right to stop processing; not about certification or SA orders to certification bodies."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; no certification scheme or SA authority to direct certification bodies."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no certification or SA power to block issuance."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases; no certification framework or SA orders to certification bodies."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no certification scheme or SA power re certification issuance."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المكتب", "article": "Article 9(4) [e05de90f481c9410c6e0]"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "المكتب (UAE Data Office acting as supervisory authority)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0 Art. 9(4)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "No specific power to order certification bodies not to issue certifications is stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "order the certification body not to issue a certification", "target_value": "No mention of certification bodies or orders to them.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "certifications under Articles 42 and 43", "target_value": "No certification mechanism referenced in the provided provisions.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "requirements for the certification are not or are no longer met", "target_value": "No conditions tied to certification issuance are stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No rule on certification issuance; no exceptions stated.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal aspect stated (no underlying certification rule).", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified (no underlying certification rule).", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.7, "reasoning_note": "While the UAE ‘Office’ is identified and holds oversight/sanctioning powers (e.g., Art. 9(4), Art. 24(3), Art. 25), the provided texts do not establish any certification scheme or powers over certification bodies. General controller/processor obligations do not imply a supervisory authority power to order a certification body not to issue a certification. Therefore, the specific GDPR-equivalent power is textually absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-146", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for regulatory oversight and enforcement mechanisms to address data protection, albeit not directly mirroring GDPR's certification body provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Indicates authority's role in oversight and enforcement of data protection regulations."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "span": "المادة (24) تقديم الشكوى", "why": "Provides a mechanism for complaints, suggesting a pathway for addressing violations."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for implied supervisory authority powers within the data protection framework", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المكتب", "why": "Reference to a supervisory authority ('Maktab') with potential oversight powers"}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "الالتزامات العامة للمعالج", "why": "General obligations of the processor, including following controller instructions and implementing protective measures"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "ffb151edc5703b569765", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "57844ac856d11c289650", "9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 560.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "d5e4339236bddc812609", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Addresses rights relating to automated decision-making, not restriction of processing on grounds of unlawfulness or as an alternative to erasure."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Provides a right to object/stop processing on specific grounds (e.g., direct marketing), not the right to restriction when processing is unlawful."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information right; only mentions procedures for restriction, not the substantive right or its conditions."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to restriction or unlawful processing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; does not create a right to restriction."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; not the right or conditions for restriction."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; unrelated to restriction conditions."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not grant the data subject a right to restriction in the specified scenario."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO duties; not about restriction."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; not about restriction."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 16(1)(ب)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "article": "Article 16(1)(ج)"}, "exception": {"span": "للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة مقتصرة على تخزين البيانات الشخصية. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية حقوق الغير وفقاً للتشريعات السارية. د. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية المصلحة العامة.", "article": "Article 16(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم في حال قام برفع التقييد المنصوص عليه في هذه المادة، أن يخطر صاحب البيانات بذلك.", "article": "Article 16(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "يحق (a right)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة (compel the controller to restrict/stop processing)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية (processing of his/her personal data)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 16(1)(ب)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure and requests restriction instead", "target": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية (processing carried out unlawfully). No requirement to oppose erasure.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(1)(ج)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Controller may continue processing despite restriction in specified cases (storage-only; legal claims; protection of others' rights; public interest).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 16(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No explicit temporal condition tied to unlawful-processing restriction.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "Obligation to notify the data subject when lifting the restriction.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 16(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 16(1)(c) UAE grants a right to restriction whenever processing is unlawful, which subsumes the GDPR scenario where the data subject prefers restriction over erasure. While the UAE text does not replicate the ‘opposes erasure’ qualifier, functional equivalence is met because the right exists in all unlawful-processing cases. The UAE provision introduces exceptions in Art. 16(3), but that does not negate coverage of RU‑167’s core right.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not provide a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167], as it does not explicitly provide a right to restrict processing when the data subject opposes erasure of the personal data and requests restriction of their use instead.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "Article 16(1)(ج) only provides a right to restrict processing if the processing is unlawful, but it does not explicitly state that the data subject can oppose erasure of the personal data and request restriction of their use instead."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "المادة (15) حق تصحيح أو محو البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 15(2)(د) provides a right to request erasure of personal data if the processing is unlawful, but it does not provide an option to restrict processing instead of erasure."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not provide a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167], as the conditions for restricting processing are not identical.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "The conditions for restricting processing in Article 16(1) of the UAE law are broader than those specified in the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167]."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "المادة (15) حق تصحيح أو محو البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 15 of the UAE law does not explicitly provide for a situation where the data subject opposes erasure and requests restriction instead."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 620.44, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "cd28f8a4dd45e464f148", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to the individual and competent department; no mention of codes of conduct or any approval mechanism."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Obligation on controller/processor to implement safeguards; does not establish codes of conduct or supervisory approval criteria."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial procedures for exercising data subject rights; unrelated to codes of conduct or their approval."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right and processing principles; no supervisory approval of codes of conduct."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from providing information (Art. 6); not about codes of conduct or approval."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and policies set by the competent department; no regime for approving codes of conduct."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "General implementation powers for the minister; no specific provision on codes of conduct approval."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Promulgation and execution clause; no substantive rule on codes of conduct."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer; no relation to codes of conduct or their approval."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions for specific purposes; not about codes of conduct."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Inspection/criminal enforcement powers; no connection to codes of conduct approval."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك (authorizing power)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 27", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "approve codes of conduct", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "pursuant to Article 40(5)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where the codes provide sufficient safeguards", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 27 empowers the competent department and mentions coordination to encourage self-regulation, but it does not create an obligation to approve codes of conduct, nor an approval mechanism or criteria. General powers (Art. 27) and controller safeguard duties (Art. 13) do not textually supply the missing elements (approval act, linkage to codes of conduct, and the ‘sufficient safeguards’ condition). Potential future regulations or indirect implications are beyond the scope of the present textual comparison.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-392", "gdpr_article": 35, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart to GDPR requirement under different terminology and distribution across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "تنسيق مع أي مجموعة أو رابطة مهنية وأي رابطة أخرى تمثل المراقبين أو مشغلي مواقع الإنترنت", "why": "Could be related to approving codes of conduct"}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "سياسات حماية الخصوصية، التي تضعها الإدارة المختصة", "why": "Could be seen as a form of code of conduct"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect implications or future regulatory developments to address gaps in scope and condition for approving codes of conduct", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Suggests the competent department has the authority to take necessary measures, which could include addressing codes of conduct and safeguards indirectly"}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Indicates an obligation to protect personal data, which could be related to the condition of providing sufficient safeguards"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "9548224453cca1301899", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 594.25, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "efb2c4d88a110d62b87d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Sets general processing principles; contains no duty to consult the supervisory authority prior to processing when a DPIA shows high risk."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Triggers appointment of a DPO in high-risk contexts but does not require the controller to consult the supervisory authority before processing."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Obligations toward the DPO; no supervisory-authority consultation requirement."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Rights related to automated decision-making; no relevance to prior consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations (including providing records on request) but not a controller duty to consult the authority prior to processing."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; no supervisory-authority consultation requirement."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restriction; not about controller consultation with the authority."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations include record-keeping and providing information to the Office upon judicial decision, but not prior consultation in high-risk DPIA scenarios."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; does not impose a controller duty to consult the authority before processing."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods for data subjects; unrelated to supervisory-authority consultation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "عمليات المعالجة المقترحة", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند استخدام أي من التقنيات الحديثة التي من شأنها أن تشكل خطراً عالياً على خصوصية وسرية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل القيام بإجراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 21(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 21(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "consult the supervisory authority", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "intended processing", "target": "عمليات المعالجة المقترحة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 21(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 indicates the processing would result in a high risk in the absence of mitigating measures", "target": "عند استخدام أي من التقنيات الحديثة التي من شأنها أن تشكل خطراً عالياً على خصوصية وسرية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 21(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "prior to processing", "target": "قبل القيام بإجراء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 21(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "I considered distributed counterparts: Art. 21 establishes DPIA (with high-risk triggers) and timing before processing, and Art. 11 designates the DPO as a liaison with the Office. However, no provision requires the controller to consult the supervisory authority prior to processing when a DPIA shows residual high risk, and Art. 5’s principles do not create such a duty. Thus, the specific GDPR Art. 36 prior consultation obligation is not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-415", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provisions do not explicitly require consultation with the supervisory authority before processing when a DPIA indicates a high risk.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "span": "Article 21(5) على المتحكم التنسيق مع مسؤول حماية البيانات عند تقييم أثر حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision discusses coordination with the data protection officer but does not explicitly require consultation with the supervisory authority."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart provisions exist under different terminology or are distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "span": "المادة (21) تقييم أثر حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article discusses the assessment of the impact of data protection, which relates to the GDPR requirement for consulting a supervisory authority when a data protection impact assessment indicates high risk."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "span": "المادة (5) ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article outlines controls for processing personal data, emphasizing principles that could encompass the spirit of consulting a supervisory authority when high risks are identified."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "c34922f387019af45e42", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 610.14, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "cb0832058c18e336d185", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards and processor-to-controller notification; no duty to cooperate with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross‑border data flow rule; does not address cooperation with the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Controller’s duty to inform the individual; not about supervisory authority cooperation."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial regulations enabling provision; no controller duty to cooperate."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Authority exemptions for certain processing; does not impose cooperation duties on controllers."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions from specified articles; no cooperation-on-request obligation."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller duties regarding disclosure/transfer to processor; unrelated to supervisory authority cooperation."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations (security, design, policies) without a textual duty to cooperate with the authority on request."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Criminal enforcement powers for ministry officers; no controller cooperation duty stated."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المراقب", "article": "Article 14"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 14"}, "action": {"span": "إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات", "article": "Article 14"}, "scope": {"span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "cooperate with the supervisory authority", "target_value": "إعلام ... الإدارة المختصة بحدوث أي إخلال", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 14"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in the performance of the supervisory authority's tasks", "target_value": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on request by the supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Articles 14 and 27 provide interaction with the authority (breach notification) and describe the authority’s tasks, but no text creates a general duty for controllers to cooperate upon the authority’s request. Article 26 enables binding remedial orders after complaints, which is not a general on‑request cooperation obligation. Thus, any counterpart is limited and does not meet the GDPR’s on‑request condition.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-311", "gdpr_article": 31, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit cooperation requirements in the Qatari law provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 27", "span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "No explicit mention of cooperation with the supervisory authority"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists under different terminology and distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 27", "span": "الإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Implies cooperation between administration and controllers"}, {"id": "Article 14", "span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة", "why": "Requires notification and implies cooperation between controller and administration"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["fcbd13532c69b340214e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "9548224453cca1301899", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 621.59, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "5dc1fd59201a3e3991ef", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-contract information and consent duties; does not establish or require implementation of internal data protection policies."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; does not address creation or implementation of data protection policies."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification obligations; no requirement to implement internal data protection policies."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات.", "article": "Article 5(7)"}, "scope": {"span": "المادة الخامسة: أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية ... على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5 (title + chapeau)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي (mandatory)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate data protection policies", "target_value": "تطوير والالتزام بسياسات داخلية للحماية وخصوصية البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5(7)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "as part of the measures referred to in Article 24(1)", "target_value": "السياسات الداخلية مذكورة ضمن قائمة تدابير أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية التي يجب اتخاذها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau) + Art. 5(7)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where proportionate in relation to processing activities", "target_value": "لا يوجد قيد تناسبية صريح متعلق بإلزام السياسات الداخلية", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 5(7) (no proportionality qualifier stated)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا استثناءات منصوص عليها لهذا الالتزام", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا قيد زمني محدد لهذا الالتزام", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا عاقبة محددة منصوص عليها في النص المختار", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "The target law expressly requires developing and adhering to internal data protection/privacy policies and places them within a broader set of security measures. However, it does not condition this obligation on proportionality to processing activities; thus the condition is broader than GDPR’s. The condition slot has been revised to reflect the absence of a proportionality qualifier, addressing the reviewer’s objection.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-207", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no proportionality qualifier expressed for the policy obligation is incorrect.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "التدابير الأمنية المناسبة", "why": "This provision implies that the measures taken should be proportionate to the risk."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "تبعاً لمستوى البيانات المحددة بسياسة تصنيف البيانات لمقدم الخدمة", "why": "This provision suggests that the service provider shall take measures that are proportionate to the level of sensitivity of the personal data being processed."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition slot verdict is not fully supported by the cited provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(1) (\"ملائمة لطبيعة ونطاق أنشطته وحساسية أي بيانات...\")", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state 'where proportionate in relation to processing activities'."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "Article 5(1.1) (\"تبعاً لمستوى البيانات المحددة بسياسة تصنيف البيانات\")", "why": "The provision discusses data classification, but does not directly relate to proportionality in relation to processing activities."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "a418980931b429c7909a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 604.95, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "f33f0db38b09e1f0ddff", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Creates exemptions from disclosure obligations where harm may result; it does not create or regulate a 'representative' role or its establishment/location."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Addresses cross-border flow of personal data and when a controller may not restrict it; it contains no requirement to designate or locate a representative."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Empowers a competent authority to authorize certain processing without compliance for specified state interests; this is not a private 'representative' of a controller and imposes no establishment/location requirement for any representative."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Imposes conditions on a controller when disclosing/transferring data to a processor; it does not concern any representative designated to interface with data subjects or regulators, nor where such a representative must be established."}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "reason": "Provides definitions (controller, processor, competent authority, website operator, etc.) but contains no concept analogous to a GDPR Art. 27 'representative' and no establishment/location rule for such a role."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations (fair/lawful processing, safeguards, policies); no representative designation or establishment/location requirement."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to any representative role or where such an entity must be established."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising individual rights; does not address designation or establishment of a representative."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; does not create a representative role or specify establishment/location requirements."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "representative designated under Article 27", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "be established in one of the Member States where the relevant data subjects are located", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "data subjects whose personal data are processed in relation to the offering of goods or services to them, or whose behaviour is monitored", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "When a representative is designated under Article 27(1)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "The cited Qatari provisions speak about controllers, processors, and a governmental competent authority; they do not create a private ‘representative’ role for foreign controllers or specify where such an entity must be established. GDPR Art. 27’s representative-location obligation has no functional counterpart in the provided Qatari text. Accordingly, RU-221 is uncovered despite the existence of controller/authority concepts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-221", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 9}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart found in Article 1 definition of 'Jeha Almukhtassa' and 'Muraqib', and related obligation in Article 12", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "span": "الجهة المختصة: أي جهة حكومية تختص قانوناً بتنظيم أعمال أو إجراءات ذات صلة بمعالجة البيانات الشخصية والإشراف عليها", "why": "Definition of 'Jeha Almukhtassa' could be interpreted as a potential counterpart to the concept of a representative"}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "span": "المراقب: الشخص الطبيعي أو المعنوي الذي يقوم منفرداً أو بالاشتراك مع آخرين بتحديد كيفية معالجة البيانات الشخصية والغرض منها", "why": "Definition of 'Muraqib' implies a responsible entity for personal data processing"}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "span": "يجب على المراقب لدى إفصاحه عن البيانات الشخصية أو نقلها إلى المعالج، مراعاة أن تكون مطابقة للأغراض المشروعة", "why": "Related obligation in Article 12"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C5 may be incorrect, as there are provisions in the Qatari law that relate to the concept of a representative.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "الجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون", "why": "This article implies that there is a competent authority that has the power to make decisions regarding data processing, which could be related to the concept of a representative."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "span": "يجب على المراقب لدى إفصاحه عن البيانات الشخصية أو نقلها إلى المعالج، مراعاة أن تكون مطابقة للأغراض المشروعة", "why": "This article implies that there is a controller that is responsible for ensuring that data is processed in accordance with the law, which could be related to the concept of a representative."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 9, "candidate_ids": ["75852a697f66691bfbfb", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "f5c366135483fe580381", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 549.29, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "e586c6088203ac351f9b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Sets ministerial procedures for exercising certain rights; does not grant a data subject the power to bring court proceedings."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Concerns law-enforcement officers’ powers to detect offenses; not a data subject judicial remedy."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller obligations on disclosure/transfer; no judicial remedy for data subjects."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain obligations; no provision on court proceedings by data subjects."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Implementing decisions; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and related exemptions; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Execution and publication clause; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Law’s material scope; no judicial remedy."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller security and governance obligations; no judicial remedy."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد", "article": "Article 26"}, "modality": {"span": "للفرد أن يتقدم", "article": "Article 26"}, "action": {"span": "أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 26"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "article": "Article 26"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وللإدارة المختصة، بعد التحقيق في الشكوى وثبوت جديتها، أن تصدر قراراً مسبباً بإلزام المراقب أو المعالج، بحسب الأحوال، بتدارك تلك المخالفة خلال مدة تحددها.", "article": "Article 26"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "data subject", "target": "الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "power", "target": "للفرد أن يتقدم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the controller or processor has an establishment", "target": "أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "None", "target": "في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "أن تصدر قراراً مسبباً بإلزام المراقب أو المعالج ... بتدارك تلك المخالفة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 26"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.74, "reasoning_note": "Article 26 creates an administrative complaint route to the competent authority and a ministerial appeal for controllers/processors; it does not grant a data subject the power to bring court proceedings. No text identifies courts as the forum or ties venue to the controller/processor’s establishment. Therefore, while related administratively, the judicial right in GDPR Art. 79 remains textually absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-916", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'C5' may be too absolute, as the Qatari law provides some mechanisms for individuals to submit complaints and appeal decisions, which could be seen as related to the concept of bringing proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This provision provides a mechanism for individuals to submit complaints to the competent authority, which could be seen as related to the concept of bringing proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "يجوز للمراقب أو المعالج التظلم من هذا القرار، إلى الوزير، خلال ستين يوماً من تاريخ إخطاره به.", "why": "This provision provides a mechanism for appeal, which could be seen as a form of judicial review."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "f5c366135483fe580381", "9548224453cca1301899", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 493.9, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "3bf1c4a48c0d2f0abea8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "952167864cc3b0d724c1"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Sets lawful bases/purpose-limitation; no data-subject right to restriction or a mechanism to request restriction."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Addresses controller documentation when relying on legitimate interest; no right to restriction."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Regulates disclosure conditions; does not confer a right to restriction."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Information-at-collection duties; no restriction right."}, {"id": "4919410df7147924356b", "reason": "Right to obtain a copy; different right."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Right of access; different right."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification; no restriction right."}, {"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping; no data-subject right to restriction."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "General duty to respond to rights requests; does not create a restriction right or the RU condition."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Conditions for processing data collected indirectly; no restriction right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "الحق في طلب إتلاف البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8 (title)"}, "action": {"span": "إيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 12(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 12(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا علمت أن البيانات الشخصية تجرى معالجتها بطريقة مخالفة للنظام", "article": "Article 8(1)(د)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "article": "Article 12(3)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "الحق في طلب إتلاف البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (title)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target": "إيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 12(3)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure of the personal data and requests restriction of their use instead", "target": "إذا علمت أن البيانات الشخصية تجرى معالجتها بطريقة مخالفة للنظام", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(1)(د); Article 12(3)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "دون تأخير غير مبرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 12(3)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Articles 8 and 12 do not yield a right to restriction when processing is unlawful and the individual prefers restriction over erasure. Article 8(1)(د) mandates destruction upon unlawful processing, while Article 12(3) requires stopping processing only upon withdrawal of consent—neither provision grants the data subject a choice to restrict instead of erase in the unlawfulness scenario. Thus, the GDPR-specific condition-and-remedy pairing is not expressed in the KSA text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 29}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of a partial match underestimates the alignment between the KSA provisions and the GDPR requirement regarding the right to restrict processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12(3)", "span": "في حال العدول عن الموافقة، فيجب على جهة التحكم إيقاف المعالجة دون تأخير غير مبرر", "why": "Directly addresses the action of stopping processing upon the data subject's request."}, {"id": "Article 8(1)(د)", "span": "إذا علمت أن البيانات الشخصية تجرى معالجتها بطريقة مخالفة للنظام", "why": "Indicates a condition under which the processing might be considered unlawful."}], "confidence": 0.9}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the condition being uncovered might overlook the collective implications of Articles 8 and 12 in the KSA provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 8(1)(د)", "span": "إذا علمت أن البيانات الشخصية تجرى معالجتها بطريقة مخالفة للنظام", "why": "Addresses unlawfulness, potentially laying groundwork for restriction."}, {"id": "Article 12(3)", "span": "في حال العدول عن الموافقة، فيجب على جهة التحكم إيقاف المعالجة دون تأخير غير مبرر", "why": "Implies a form of restriction upon withdrawal of consent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "4919410df7147924356b", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "ba8aef540689169aa848"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 677.15, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "8d8ed0c4992e2011db2d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "reason": "Sets general processing/transparency conditions; does not assign a monitoring role to a DPO or specify monitoring duties."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Defines legal bases for processing; no content on DPO functions or monitoring of compliance."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي:", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 5(11)"}, "scope": {"span": "عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(11)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data protection officer", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة (with only identification/contact for a DPO)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau); Art. 5(4.1); Art. 6(2.2)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "obligation (على مقدم الخدمة ...)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 5 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "monitor compliance with legal and internal data protection requirements, including assignment of responsibilities, awareness-raising/training, and related audits", "target_value": "conduct comprehensive audits on compliance; identify and train responsible persons; develop internal policies", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(11); Art. 5(8); Art. 5(7)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "GDPR, other Union or Member State data protection provisions, and the controller’s/processor’s internal policies (including assignment, training, audits)", "target_value": "compliance with personal data protection under Kuwaiti telecom regulation and internal policies/training", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 5(11); Art. 5(7); Art. 1"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.55, "reasoning_note": "The target text requires the provider to conduct audits, develop internal policies, and identify/train responsible persons, which partially covers the monitoring function, but it does not assign this duty to the DPO. It also does not reference GDPR or EU/Member State laws, limiting scope to Kuwaiti regulation. DPO is mentioned only for identification/contact, not as the obligated monitor.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-476", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The obligation to monitor compliance with external data protection provisions is not fully covered in the target jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision only mentions conducting audits and reviews to ensure compliance with personal data protection, but does not explicitly state that the data protection officer is responsible for monitoring compliance with external data protection provisions."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KWT provisions do not explicitly mention the GDPR or the role of a data protection officer in monitoring compliance with Union or Member State data protection provisions, suggesting a potential gap in coverage.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "إجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة شاملة عن مدى الالتزام بحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision indicates a requirement for comprehensive audits to ensure compliance with personal data protection, which could be seen as partially covering the obligation to monitor compliance."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["a418980931b429c7909a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 674.02, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "bfb8f3aa4c8b6002314e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "5d949837d7aab073cd67"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "Concerns controllers’ Data Protection Impact Assessments; does not set criteria for the supervisory authority’s fining decisions."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles for controllers; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject information rights; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Data subject right to restrict processing; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support duties; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to stop processing; no supervisory authority fining criteria."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المكتب", "article": "Article 9(4)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "each supervisory authority", "target": "المكتب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(4); Art. 24(3)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "give due regard to the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "including the nature, scope or purpose of the processing concerned, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage suffered by them", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": null, "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": null, "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "when deciding whether to impose an administrative fine and when deciding on the amount in each individual case", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": null, "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Articles 9(4) and 24(3) empower the Office to impose administrative penalties but do not prescribe factors it must consider when deciding to fine or in setting the amount. Article 21 concerns controllers’ DPIAs (nature/scope/purpose of processing for risk assessment) and does not create fining criteria for the Office. Thus, the GDPR-style duty to give due regard to specified factors at the fining decision stage is not expressed in the provided UAE provisions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-938", "gdpr_article": 83, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 17}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no duty to consider factors for fining power is not entirely accurate, as Article 21 implies that the Office should consider the nature, scope, and purpose of the processing when assessing its impact.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "span": "المادة (21) تقييم أثر حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article discusses the assessment of the impact of data processing on data protection, which includes considering the nature, scope, and purpose of the processing."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This article mentions that the Office shall verify violations and impose administrative penalties."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 563.71, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "85ca436787f39dd1bd4c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5bd7541a2690632a7c77"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "reason": "Appeals procedure; no rules on consent presentation or form."}, {"id": "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "reason": "Urgent measures by authority; not about consent or form of requests."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Public registers data; unrelated to consent request formatting."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection powers; no norms on consent presentation."}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "reason": "Authority register of notifications/permits; not about consent collection."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "reason": "Sanctions framework; does not specify consent request distinguishability."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Controller notification to authority; no consent presentation requirements."}, {"id": "79c959efd73d5d166449", "reason": "Criminal settlement; no relevance to consent form or presentation."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing legal bases/exemptions; no rule on how consent is presented within multi-topic documents."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rights to rectification/blocking/erasure; not about consent request formatting."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing; unrelated to consent request presentation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": "يشتَرَط للاعتداد بموافقة صاحب البيانات ... ما يأتي:", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أن تكون مكتوبة وصريحة وواضحة ومحدَّدة بمعالجة بيانات معينة.", "article": "Article 24(1)(ب)"}, "scope": {"span": "في الحالات المشار إليها في هذا القانون", "article": "Article 24(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يشتَرَط للاعتداد بموافقة صاحب البيانات ... ما يأتي:", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 24(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in a manner clearly distinguishable from other matters", "target_value": "أن تكون مكتوبة وصريحة وواضحة ومحدَّدة بمعالجة بيانات معينة.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 24(1)(ب)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": "في الحالات المشار إليها في هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 24(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s Article 24 requires consent to be written, explicit, clear, and specific, but it does not require a consent request embedded in a multi-topic written declaration to be clearly distinguishable from those other matters. The reviewer’s objection is correct: Article 24(1)(ب) speaks to clarity/specificity of consent itself, not the distinguishable presentation of the request within combined documents. Accordingly, the core action, scope, and condition are not expressed in the target text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-018", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct and explicit counterpart to GDPR requirement in target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "span": "مكتوبة وصريحة وواضحة ومحدَّدة بمعالجة بيانات معينة", "why": "Indirectly supports the principle of clear and specific consent but does not directly address distinguishability within written declarations."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit provision supporting the distinguishability of consent requests within written declarations concerning other matters.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 24(1)(ب)", "span": "موافقة صاحب البيانات ... مكتوبة وصريحة وواضحة ومحدَّدة", "why": "Does not explicitly address the requirement for distinguishability within a multi-topic written declaration."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "c24849787475f274ecac", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "79c959efd73d5d166449", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 630.05, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "d3b00205e4d35bb23fdc", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["d9a05a425b46428120ee", "f10a3fa820a149065de0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO appointment and internal duties; not powers of the supervisory authority to investigate."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure/Destruction rights; unrelated to supervisory authority investigative powers."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "Data Protection Impact Assessment obligations for controllers; not supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not supervisory authority investigative powers."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Collection principles; not supervisory authority investigative powers."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Disclosure exceptions; not supervisory authority investigative powers."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy requirement; not supervisory authority investigative powers."}, {"id": "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "reason": "Certification bodies licensing; not investigative/audit powers of the authority."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection/oversight by controller; not supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "Controller impact assessment for public products; not supervisory authority powers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تكون الجهة المختصة الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح.", "article": "Article 30(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "للجهة المختصة ... اتخاذ ما يأتي:", "article": "Article 30(4)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد الأدوات والآليات المناسبة في شأن مراقبة ومتابعة التزام جهات التحكم بأحكام النظام واللوائح", "article": "Article 30(4)(ج)"}, "scope": {"span": "في شأن مراقبة ومتابعة التزام جهات التحكم بأحكام النظام واللوائح", "article": "Article 30(4)(ج)"}, "condition": {"span": "في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "article": "Article 30(4)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الجهة المختصة (الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "للجهة المختصة ... اتخاذ ما يأتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(4)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "carry out investigations in the form of data protection audits", "target_value": "تحديد الأدوات والآليات لمراقبة ومتابعة الالتزام؛ وجود إطار للتدقيق والفحص وترخيص جهات تقوم به", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 30(4)(ج); Article 36(1),(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "investigative powers", "target_value": "مراقبة ومتابعة التزام جهات التحكم بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30(1), Article 30(4)(ج)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 30(4)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No express exceptions stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal element stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No consequence specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Article 30(4) grants supervisory monitoring powers (including requesting information, setting monitoring mechanisms, and using other bodies), and Article 36 establishes an audit/inspection framework and licensing. These provisions enable audit-like investigations, but they do not expressly state that the authority itself may conduct data protection audits. Hence, partial coverage.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-681", "gdpr_article": 58, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not explicitly grant the supervisory authority the power to carry out investigations in the form of data protection audits.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 36", "span": "المادة السادسة والثلاثون: التدقيق والفحص", "why": "Article 36 focuses on audit and inspection of personal data processing activities, but does not explicitly grant the supervisory authority the power to carry out investigations."}, {"id": "Article 30(4)", "span": "للجهة المختصة في سبيل مباشرتها مهماتها المتعلقة بالإشراف على تطبيق أحكام النظام واللوائح، اتخاذ ما يأتي:", "why": "Article 30(4) grants the supervisory authority certain powers, but does not explicitly mention the power to carry out investigations in the form of data protection audits."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that no counterpart exists for the GDPR requirement is not entirely accurate. The authority's powers, as listed in Article 30(4), could be used to conduct investigations in the form of data protection audits.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 30(4)", "span": "للجهة المختصة ... اتخاذ ما يأتي:", "why": "The authority's powers, as listed in this article, could be used to conduct investigations in the form of data protection audits."}, {"id": "Article 36", "span": "المدقيق والفحص", "why": "This article defines and organizes audits and licensing, providing a framework for the authority to conduct investigations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "e33bde5f24e463a1e604", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 593.78, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "fceeaa912ea7ff079177", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Addresses controller exemptions from specified obligations and rights (including when executing a legal obligation or a competent court order). It does not regulate the supervisory authority’s competence nor carve out courts’ processing from supervision; the phrase \"تنفيذ التزام قانوني أو أمر من محكمة مختصة\" concerns controller compliance with court orders, not a prohibition on supervising courts."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exempts controllers from disclosing reasons for refusing data subject rights; unrelated to supervisory authority supervision or courts’ judicial capacity."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Establishes data subject access rights; no bearing on supervisory authority’s supervision of courts."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "States general privacy principles; does not address supervisory authority scope or courts."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Regulates cross-border data flow; not about supervisory supervision or courts."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing; no relation to supervisory authority’s oversight of courts."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Further exemptions from data subject rights; not about supervisory authority scope or courts."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedures for exercising data subject rights; no relevance to supervisory authority supervision of courts."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Allows a competent authority to process data for state interests; does not concern supervisory authority oversight or courts’ judicial capacity."}, {"id": "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "reason": "Nullity of contracts conflicting with the law; unrelated to supervisory authority supervision or courts."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الإدارة المختصة", "article": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": "بعد التحقيق في الشكوى", "article": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "supervisory authorities", "target": "الإدارة المختصة (competent department of the Ministry)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4"]}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "prohibition", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "supervise processing operations", "target": "التحقيق في الشكاوى وإصدار قرارات تصحيحية تجاه المراقب أو المعالج", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4"]}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing operations of courts acting in their judicial capacity", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.7, "reasoning_note": "Qatar’s provisions describe supervisory/complaint-handling and enforcement powers (Arts. 26, 29) but contain no textual carve-out preventing supervision of courts acting in a judicial capacity. The cited Art. 19 phrase about executing a legal obligation or a competent court order concerns controller exemptions and does not limit the supervisory authority’s jurisdiction over courts. No article mentions courts’ processing or a judicial-capacity exclusion.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-016", "gdpr_article": 6, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for different terminology or distribution across provisions, notably Article 19 discussing exemptions related to court orders or legal obligations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام المواد (4)، (5/البنود 1، 2، 3)، (6) من هذا القانون، في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1- تنفيذ مهمة متعلقة بالمصلحة العامة وفقاً للقانون. 2- تنفيذ التزام قانوني أو أمر من محكمة مختصة.", "why": "Exemptions for the supervisor under specific circumstances, including executing a legal obligation or an order from a competent court, which might imply limited supervision in certain contexts."}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect interpretation of provisions related to judicial capacity and supervision", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "span": "تنفيذ التزام قانوني أو أمر من محكمة مختصة", "why": "Implies exemptions related to legal obligations and court orders, potentially relevant to supervision in a judicial context"}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["850decaffbbae78d371d", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 668.47, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "7f7c992f99d4824f18db", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "455aae046cacf7979576", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Concerns conditions for disclosure/transfer to a processor; does not set technical/organizational measures or research/archiving/statistics safeguards."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; not about data minimisation or safeguards for special-purpose processing."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Regulator’s functions; no controller duties relevant to minimisation measures or special-purpose safeguards."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Transparency to individuals; not about technical/organizational measures or special-purpose safeguards."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; not about data minimisation safeguards."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; does not establish technical/organizational measures or special-purpose safeguards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي:", "article": "Article 8"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8(3)"}, "scope": {"span": "تحقيق أغراض البحث العلمي الذي يجرى للمصلحة العامة", "article": "Article 19(4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام ... 4- تحقيق أغراض البحث العلمي الذي يجرى للمصلحة العامة", "article": "Article 19"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controllers", "target": "‘المراقب’ explicitly addressed.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 8 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Mandatory ‘يجب/يتعين’ formulations impose duties.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 13 (opening); Art. 8 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "ensure technical and organisational measures are in place to respect the principle of data minimisation", "target": "Requires administrative/technical/physical precautions (measures) to protect data, and separately requires data to be relevant/adequate and not retained beyond necessity (minimisation-like), but does not link measures specifically to achieving minimisation.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 8(3); Art. 13; Art. 10"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "safeguards for processing under Article 89(1) (archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes)", "target": "No safeguards regime tailored to archiving/public-interest research/historical/statistical processing; research in the public interest appears only as an exemption and official statistics are excluded from the law’s scope.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 19(4) (exemption); Art. 2 (official statistics exclusion)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "when applying safeguards for such processing", "target": "No conditional trigger concerning the application of special safeguards for these purposes.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "Introduces exemptions for scientific research in the public interest and excludes official statistics, rather than adding safeguard obligations.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 19(4); Art. 2"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No temporal element specified.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No consequence specified.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "The cited Qatar provisions do impose general duties to adopt technical/organizational precautions and to ensure data are relevant/adequate and not retained excessively. However, they do not establish a special safeguards regime triggered by processing for archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes; instead, research is treated via exemptions (Art. 19) and official statistics are excluded (Art. 2). Thus, the ‘measures to respect minimisation’ element is only partially reflected, and the Art. 89(1)-type scope/condition is missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-965", "gdpr_article": 89, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for specific safeguards might overlook broader protections in the QAT law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "span": "ولا تسري أحكام هذا القانون ... المعالجة بغرض الحصول على البيانات الإحصائية الرسمية", "why": "This provision indicates an exception for official statistics, suggesting some consideration for the use of personal data in statistical contexts."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires controllers to take measures to protect personal data, which could be related to the principle of data minimization in various processing contexts."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no special safeguards regime for archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 10", "span": "على المراقب التحقق من أن البيانات الشخصية التي يجمعها، أو التي يتم جمعها لصالحه، ذات صلة بالأغراض المشروعة وكافية لتحقيقها", "why": "This provision requires the controller to ensure that the personal data collected is relevant and sufficient for the legitimate purposes, which can be seen as a measure to respect the principle of data minimization."}, {"id": "Article 8(3)", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires the controller to take appropriate administrative, technical, and physical precautions to protect personal data, which can be seen as a measure to respect the principle of data minimization."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "f5c366135483fe580381", "455aae046cacf7979576", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "f169b712b14aea8718ee"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 718.83, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "c94beeb49f5a6251f141", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "a418980931b429c7909a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "General scope of the regulation; does not address DPO functions or informing/awareness duties."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مقدم الخدمة اتخاذ الآتي", "article": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "تحديد وتدريب وتوعية المسؤولين عن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Article 5(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "جمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية", "article": "[9f3112d28a1b850ba61f] Article 4 (chapeau)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data protection officer", "target": "مقدم الخدمة (service provider); DPO only referenced for contact details, not as duty-bearer", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Art 5 (chapeau); [a418980931b429c7909a] Art 6(2.2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Obligatory phrasing: \"على مقدم الخدمة\" / \"يجب على مقدم الخدمة\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Art 5 (chapeau); [9f3112d28a1b850ba61f] Art 4 (chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "inform the controller/processor and processing employees of their data protection obligations", "target": "\"تدريب وتوعية المسؤولين عن حماية البيانات الشخصية\" (train and raise awareness of those responsible for data protection)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "[2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a] Art 5(8)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "obligations under the GDPR and other Union or Member State data protection provisions", "target": "Obligations for lawful/transparent processing exist (\"جمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية\"; legal bases in Art 3), but no express tie that training/awareness covers those legal obligations", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[9f3112d28a1b850ba61f] Art 4 (chapeau); [b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a] Art 3 (chapeau)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No condition stated for the training/awareness duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated for the training/awareness duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No timing specified for the training/awareness duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "No specific consequence stated for non-compliance with this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "I considered distributed counterparts: the text imposes a training/awareness obligation (Art 5(8)) and defines processing obligations (Arts 3–4). However, there is no textual duty on the DPO to inform or advise the controller/processor and processing employees of their legal obligations.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-474", "gdpr_article": 39, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 5}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 5}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion might be too broad in stating no provision imposes an obligation on the DPO to inform others, as implied duties and indirect references to data protection awareness exist.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 5", "span": "أمن وحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies a need for data protection awareness and compliance among those involved in data processing, potentially involving the DPO's role."}, {"id": "Article 6(2.2)", "span": "مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Mentions the DPO as a contact point, indicating a defined role within data protection measures."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The scope of obligations might have a counterpart under different terminology or distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "span": "تحديد وتدريب وتوعية المسؤولين عن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies responsibility towards data protection, potentially covering some aspects of the scope of obligations under different terminology."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "الحصول على موافقة المستخدم صاحب البيانات", "why": "Discusses legality of data collection and processing, including user consent, which relates to data protection obligations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 5, "candidate_ids": ["a418980931b429c7909a", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 664.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "620bdb071a21039267a2", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content and transparency duties; does not impose technical/organizational measures at design or operational stages."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Notice to data subjects at collection; not about implementing protective measures."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Records for processing on realized interest; not a measures obligation."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Grounds and limits for disclosure; not a general obligation to implement protective measures."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; adjacent organizational controls but not a general privacy-by-design/default obligation."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "Supervisory/oversight framework; not a controller obligation to implement measures."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Requires choosing processors with guarantees; not a general duty to implement design- and operation-stage measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90 (Art. 23)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90 (Art. 23)"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "article": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90 (Art. 23)"}, "scope": {"span": "لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "article": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90 (Art. 23)"}, "condition": {"span": "الالتزام بالضوابط والمعايير والقواعد ذوات الصلة الصادرة عن الهيئة الوطنية للأمن السيبراني، أو أفضل ممارسات ومعايير الأمن السيبراني", "article": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90 (Art. 23(2))"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "بما في ذلك عند نقلها", "article": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0 (Art. 19)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[62cc177254bb6a5bed90] Art. 23"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "صيغة إلزام: \"على جهة التحكم\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[62cc177254bb6a5bed90] Art. 23"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures for the processing", "target_value": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[62cc177254bb6a5bed90] Art. 23"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "measures may include pseudonymisation and aim to meet GDPR requirements and protect data subjects’ rights", "target_value": "تهدف إلى ضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها؛ كما ورد ترميز (شبه-إخفاء الهوية) في سياق الإفصاح فقط", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[62cc177254bb6a5bed90] Art. 23; [7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b] Art. 20(4)(ب)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account state of the art, cost of implementation, nature, scope, context and purposes, and risks of varying likelihood and severity for rights and freedoms", "target_value": "الالتزام بضوابط/معايير الأمن السيبراني أو أفضل الممارسات (قريب من مراعاة الحالة التقنية)، والحد من مخاطر تسرب البيانات؛ تقويم آثار المعالجة لمنتجات/خدمات عامة بحسب طبيعة النشاط", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[62cc177254bb6a5bed90] Art. 23(1)-(2); [d31b8876d3426a7c919a] Art. 22"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "both at the time of determining the means (design) and at the time of processing (operation)", "target_value": "نص صريح على التطبيق أثناء النقل؛ وإلزام بتقويم الآثار قبل طرح منتجات/خدمات عامة (لكن ليس التزاماً عاماً بمراحلي التصميم والتشغيل)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "[1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0] Art. 19; [d31b8876d3426a7c919a] Art. 22"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Agree with the objection: KSA texts impose general technical/organizational measures and reference cybersecurity standards and breach-risk reduction (Arts 19, 23) but do not expressly require measures at both design and operational stages nor to weigh all GDPR-listed factors (e.g., cost, full contextual set). A limited pre-offering DPIA exists for public products/services (Art 22), and pseudonymisation appears only in specific disclosure scenarios (Art 20(4)(ب)). Therefore the counterpart is only partially covered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-209", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not fully supported by the provisions, particularly with regards to the implementation of measures at both the design and operational stages.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "أمن المعلومات على جهة التحكم اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "why": "Article 23 does not explicitly mention the implementation of measures at both the design and operational stages."}, {"id": "Article 19", "span": "على جهة التحكم اتخاذ ما يلزم من إجراءات ووسائل تنظيمية وإدارية وتقنية تضمن المحافظة على البيانات الشخصية، بما في ذلك عند نقلها", "why": "Article 19 only mentions the need to take measures to ensure the security of personal data during transfer, but it does not explicitly cover the design stage."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully support the claim of a counterpart to the GDPR requirement of implementing appropriate technical and organizational measures for processing at both the design and operational stages, and considering specified technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة", "why": "This provision only mentions the need for organizational, administrative, and technical measures, but does not explicitly mention the need for these measures to be implemented at both the design and operational stages."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "الالتزام بالضوابط والمعايير والقواعد ذوات الصلة", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention the consideration of technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 722.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "9b062900ea0af7d5098c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; does not regulate a data subject right to receive data."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure conditions; no data subject portability/access modality."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and storage limitation; no data subject receipt/format right."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing (consent/legitimate interest); does not condition the right in Article 6."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Transparency information prior to processing; no right to receive data copy/format."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Rights to withdraw, object, erase, correct; does not establish a right to receive a copy/format."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest carve-out for certain articles (not Article 6); not the portability right."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General privacy right; does not specify receipt/format. (Article 2 already selected for applicability context.)"}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية ... وله بوجه خاص الحق", "article": "Article 6"}, "modality": {"span": "له ... الحق", "article": "Article 6"}, "action": {"span": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "condition": {"span": "بعد سداد مبلغ لا يجاوز مقابل الخدمة؛ وتسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "article": "Article 6; Article 2"}, "exception": {"span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام ... (6) ... في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1- تنفيذ مهمة متعلقة بالمصلحة العامة ... 2- تنفيذ التزام قانوني أو أمر من محكمة مختصة. 3- حماية المصالح الحيوية للفرد. 4- تحقيق أغراض البحث العلمي ... 5- جمع المعلومات اللازمة للتحقيق ...؛ كما يُعفى ... في الحالتين الآتيتين: 1- إذا كان من شأن الإفصاح الإضرار بالمصالح التجارية لشخص آخر. 2- إذا كان من شأن تنفيذ هذا الالتزام الإفصاح عن بيانات شخصية تتعلق بفرد آخر لم يوافق على ذلك، وأن الإفصاح قد يترتب عليه ضرر ...", "article": "Article 19; Article 21"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "له ... الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "receive the personal data provided to a controller in a structured, commonly used and machine-readable format", "target": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "Only personal data provided by the data subject; format must be structured, commonly used and machine-readable; exercise without prejudice to Article 17", "target": "نسخة من بياناته الشخصية (no limitation to data 'provided by' the individual; no format requirement stated)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "Processing is based on consent or a contract and carried out by automated means", "target": "After paying a service fee; law applies where data are processed electronically (general applicability), with no tie to consent/contract or automation for this right", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 6; Article 2", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "No right where processing is necessary for a task in the public interest or under official authority; exercise must not adversely affect the rights and freedoms of others", "target": "Exemption from Article 6 in cases including public interest tasks, legal obligation/court order, vital interests, public-interest research, criminal investigations; plus where disclosure would harm another's commercial interests or reveal another's personal data without consent causing harm", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 19; Article 21", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 6 provides only a right to a copy (subject to a fee) and omits GDPR’s portability format and trigger conditions (consent/contract + automated means). Articles 19 and 21 create broader and differently framed exemptions (public interest, legal obligation, commercial interests, third-party data/harm) rather than GDPR’s specific carve-outs. Article 2’s electronic-processing scope does not substitute GDPR’s ‘automated means’ trigger.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-174", "gdpr_article": 20, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 16}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit mention of the format and basis for processing in the Qatari law provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية بعد سداد مبلغ لا يجاوز مقابل الخدمة", "why": "Does not specify the format in which the data should be provided"}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "why": "Does not explicitly limit the basis of processing to consent or contracts for providing data to the data subject"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may not fully capture the discrepancies in the conditions and exemptions related to the right to receive personal data in a structured format.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 6", "span": "الحصول على نسخة من بياناته الشخصية بعد سداد مبلغ لا يجاوز مقابل الخدمة", "why": "The condition of paying a service fee for receiving a copy of personal data is not aligned with GDPR requirements."}, {"id": "Article 2", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني", "why": "The law's applicability to electronic processing does not directly condition the right to receive data on automated processing or consent/contract as in the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "455aae046cacf7979576", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 706.23, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "b872e7549166a6316891", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "reason": "DPIA requirement; does not set or enumerate security measures or mention pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing, certification, and auditing framework; no obligation to include pseudonymisation in security measures."}, {"id": "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "reason": "Health-data specific processing controls (access minimisation); does not address pseudonymisation as a security measure."}, {"id": "37d872c258760ad10ae9", "reason": "Concerns anonymisation (irreversible de-identification) duties when anonymising; not a requirement to include pseudonymisation in security measures."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; no content on pseudonymisation within security measures."}, {"id": "e32b4ffefbc31a6a5072", "reason": "General confidentiality duty; does not mention pseudonymisation or specify security measures."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Legal bases for disclosure; not about security measures or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "reason": "Disclosure restrictions; not about security measures or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "reason": "DPO designation and tasks; no specification of security measures or pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "3074a33b0107bc8c40a0", "reason": "Definitions; no operative obligation to include pseudonymisation in security measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)"}, "scope": {"span": "أمن البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)"}, "condition": {"span": "تطبيق التدابير الأمنية والتقنية الضرورية للحد من المخاطر الأمنية لحدوث تسرب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures", "target_value": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90); see also Article 20(4)(ب) (7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b) mentioning ترميز in disclosure context only", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data processed", "target_value": "أمن البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "الضرورية للحد من المخاطر الأمنية لحدوث تسرب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23 (62cc177254bb6a5bed90)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.7, "reasoning_note": "Article 23 obliges controllers to implement necessary security measures but does not mention pseudonymisation. The only reference to a pseudonymisation-like technique is in Article 20(4)(ب) (ترميز) and is limited to disclosure safeguards, not to security measures. Therefore, the GDPR-specific requirement to include pseudonymisation in security measures, as appropriate, is not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-317", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement of including pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "span": "ترميز البيانات الشخصية التي تدل على هوية الشخص الآخر ما أمكن ذلك (ضمن سياق الإفصاح)", "why": "This article only mentions pseudonymisation in the context of disclosure, not as a general security measure."}, {"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "why": "This article mentions security measures, but it is not clear if it includes pseudonymisation."}, {"id": "37d872c258760ad10ae9", "span": "إخفاء الهوية", "why": "This article is related to pseudonymisation, but it is not clear if it is directly related to the implemented security measures."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit mention of pseudonymisation in security measures", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية", "why": "No explicit mention of pseudonymisation"}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "span": "ترميز البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Mentioned in the context of disclosure, not security measures"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "0ec82f88effbafd6a911", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "37d872c258760ad10ae9", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "e32b4ffefbc31a6a5072", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "4ba7db7571a9e08625c7", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "3074a33b0107bc8c40a0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 684.31, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "0d686feacbaa39917a59", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Obligation to cooperate with the Ministry and provide requested information; does not address processor-to-controller notifications about sub-processor changes or timing."}, {"id": "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "reason": "Concerns appointment and access of an external auditor; unrelated to sub-processing change notifications."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "Concerns Ministry-requested appointment of external auditor and reporting; no relation to sub-processor change notifications."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Record-keeping for processing documents; no duty to notify controller about sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Record-keeping durations; no sub-processing notification duty."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Publishing a data protection policy; does not regulate sub-processing or notifications."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller must set processing controls/procedures; no specific processor duty to inform about sub-processor changes."}, {"id": "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "reason": "Marketing consent; unrelated."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Controller’s notice to data subjects; unrelated to processor sub-processing changes."}, {"id": "a3d16e47b198e1ecb3c6", "reason": "Data subject consent; unrelated."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "General exemptions from the law’s scope; does not establish the required notification duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 39"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 39"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 39"}, "scope": {"span": "جهة المعالجة الخارجية", "article": "Article 39"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 39"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب (على المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 39"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "inform the controller of any intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors", "target_value": "إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية ومخاطر نقل/تحويل البيانات مع جهة معالجة خارجية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 39"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "sub-processing", "target_value": "جهة المعالجة الخارجية/نقل أو تحويل البيانات", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 39"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the controller has given general written authorisation to engage other processors", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "before implementing the intended changes", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.82, "reasoning_note": "No provision imposes a duty on the processor to notify the controller pre-implementation of adding/replacing sub-processors. Article 39 addresses a controller’s assessment of an external processing entity and transfer risks, not a processor-to-controller notification. Article 18 requires cooperation with the Ministry, not inter-party notice between processor and controller, so distribution or implication does not yield the GDPR duty.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-226", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential indirect counterpart in Articles 13, 14, and 39 regarding controls, notifications, and evaluations", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Implies responsibility for establishing procedures that could encompass notification requirements"}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل البدء في معالجة أي بيانات شخصية أن يخطر صاحب البيانات الشخصية كتابة بما يأتي", "why": "Establishes a notification requirement that could be interpreted to include changes in processing entities"}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Indicates a level of oversight and evaluation that might include considerations for sub-processing changes"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for implied obligation or distribution across provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالتعاون مع الوزارة، وتقديم ما تطلبه من بيانات ومستندات تراها لازمة لممارسة اختصاصها طبقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Cooperation and data provision obligations might imply a need for notification in certain circumstances"}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Risk assessment for data transfer might include evaluating changes in processing entities"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "a3d16e47b198e1ecb3c6", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 660.88, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "c379c223421d43c2cc83", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Concerns DPO functions and interactions with the authority; does not regulate notifying data recipients of rectification/erasure/restriction."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Sets contractual clauses for cross-border transfers; not about communicating rectification/erasure/restriction to recipients."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Addresses liability of DPO entities; unrelated to the notification duty."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Provides for investigation of DPO breaches; not about recipient notification."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations; no rule on notifying recipients of rectification/erasure/restriction."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; does not address communicating post-rectification/erasure/restriction."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Special category data processing conditions; no relevant notification rule."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Defines consent; no obligation to notify recipients of changes."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of authority-held information; not about data recipient notification."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "DPO external disclosure to employer; unrelated to notifying data recipients."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Controller’s notification to the authority about processing; different audience and purpose."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "scope": {"span": "أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "condition": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة ... الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "exception": {"span": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال.", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "Obligatory phrasing: \"على مدير البيانات\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "communicate rectification or erasure or restriction of processing", "target": "إخطار ... عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed", "target": "أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "after carrying out rectification/erasure/restriction in accordance with Articles 16, 17(1) or 18", "target": "only when rectification/erasure/blocking was done as a result of a data subject request under Art. 23(1)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(5) (read with Art. 23(1))", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "unless this proves impossible or involves disproportionate effort", "target": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال (impossible/cannot be achieved; no disproportionate effort carve‑out)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "within 15 days of responding (fully or partially) to the request", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(5)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Article 23(5) BHR establishes a duty to notify third-party recipients of rectification/erasure/blocking, but it is triggered only when those measures result from a request under Art. 23(1), making it narrower than GDPR Art. 19, which ties to actions carried out in accordance with Arts. 16, 17(1), or 18. It also adds a 15‑day timeframe and lacks the GDPR’s ‘disproportionate effort’ exception. Thus, the core duty is present, but the conditions for when notification must be made are narrower.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-172", "gdpr_article": 19, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 34}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision in Article 23(5) may not fully cover the scope of the GDPR requirement, as it only mentions notification to third parties, but does not explicitly state that the controller must communicate with each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة، إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه", "why": "The provision only mentions notification to third parties, but does not explicitly state that the controller must communicate with each recipient to whom the personal data have been disclosed."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR provision may not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-172] in terms of the conditions under which notification must be made.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23(5)", "span": "على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة، إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه، مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال.", "why": "The BHR provision only requires notification within 15 days of responding to a request, whereas the GDPR requirement unit [RU-172] requires notification when such measures have been carried out in accordance with Articles 16, 17(1) or 18."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "762372b7329c44286e43", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 677.68, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "d1f042ac084ccb39b97e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fcbd13532c69b340214e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Controller breach notification; does not regulate processor acting only on controller’s instructions."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Applies to the controller’s legal basis for processing (لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية...) and not to the processor’s duty to act only on the controller’s instructions; addressee and content mismatch."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border transfer rule for controllers; no processor instruction-binding."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no operative rule about processor instructions."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Public authority exemptions; not about controller–processor instruction relationship."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Data subject rights; no rule on processor acting on instructions."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from giving reasons for refusal of data subject rights; unrelated to processor instructions."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access rights; unrelated to processor instructions."}, {"id": "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "reason": "General invalidity of contracts contrary to the law; no instruction-binding for processors."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations; does not impose instruction-bound processing on processors."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "كل من المراقب والمعالج", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": "وأن تكون تلك البيانات معالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "article": "Article 12"}, "scope": {"span": "البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "processor", "target": "المعالج", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "prohibition", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "process personal data", "target": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "personal data to which the processor has access", "target": "البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 12", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "when acting on controller instructions; or when required by law", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 4 does contain a prohibition modality, but it regulates the controller’s legal basis for processing, not the processor’s obligation to act only on the controller’s instructions. None of the cited Qatari provisions impose an instruction-bound prohibition on processors or provide the ‘required by law’ exception for processors. Therefore, the modality for the RU-251 processor rule remains uncovered despite Article 4’s general controller prohibition.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-251", "gdpr_article": 29, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the absence of counterparts for GDPR requirements in QAT law might be too absolute, given the regulatory framework in articles like 4 and 18.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "span": "لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إلا بعد الحصول على موافقة الفرد، ما لم تكن المعالجة ضرورية لتحقيق غرض مشروع للمراقب أو الغير الذي تُرسل إليه البيانات.", "why": "Establishes conditions for processing personal data, similar to GDPR's requirements."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية:", "why": "Provides exceptions for processing personal data under specific conditions, akin to GDPR's allowance for processing under Union or Member State law."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The modality slot is not entirely uncovered, as Article 4 implies a prohibition on processing personal data without consent.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "span": "لا يجوز للمراقب معالجة البيانات الشخصية، إلا بعد الحصول على موافقة الفرد، ما لم تكن المعالجة ضرورية لتحقيق غرض مشروع للمراقب أو الغير الذي تُرسل إليه البيانات.", "why": "This provision implies a prohibition on processing personal data without consent, which could be seen as a modality of prohibition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 704.47, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "05d329a9fefa88111497", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-proceedings data with specific prohibitions/exceptions; does not set the law’s general scope for automated processing or a blanket duty to comply."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Sets lawful bases for processing (substantive conditions), not the scope trigger (automated means) or a general ‘comply with the law’ clause."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Data subject right to be informed; not about applicability of the law or automated-processing scope."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Addresses referral of DPOs to investigation (enforcement/oversight), not applicability/scope."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of legal-person DPO providers; not about scope or a general compliance obligation."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of authority-held information; unrelated to processing scope or general compliance duty."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security obligations for controllers/processors are substantive compliance duties, but do not articulate the scope trigger (automated means) or a general ‘comply with the law’ mandate."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual requirements; not about automated-processing scope or general compliance obligation."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions; no operative scope or compliance mandate relevant to this RU."}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "reason": "Public register of notifications/permits; administrative transparency, not scope or general compliance."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "action": {"span": "الالتزام بواجباته المقرَّرة بموجب أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 10(1)(أ)"}, "scope": {"span": "عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": "ويُعفى مدير البيانات من تقديم الإخطار المشار إليه بشأن ما يأتي: أ - المعالَجة التي يكون الغرض الوحيد منها إمساك سجل وِفقاً للقانون بهدف توفير معلومات للجمهور... ب - معالجة البيانات التي تتم في سياق أنشطة الجمعيات... ج - معالجة صاحب العمل لبيانات العاملين لديه... د - الحالات التي يتم فيها تعيين مراقب حماية بيانات.", "article": "Article 14(1)(أ)-(د)"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل بدء عملية المعالجة", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controllers and processors", "target_value": "على مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "comply with this Regulation", "target_value": "الالتزام بواجباته المقرَّرة بموجب أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10(1)(أ)-(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data wholly or partly by automated means", "target_value": "عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No express condition", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "Exclusions (a)-(d) where the Regulation does not apply", "target_value": "إعفاءات من واجب الإخطار لسيناريوهات محددة (السجلات العامة، الجمعيات غير الهادفة للربح، بيانات العاملين، تعيين مراقب حماية بيانات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 14(1)(أ)-(د)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "قبل بدء عملية المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No express consequence", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Article 14(1) directly ties obligations to processing carried out wholly or partly by automated means, and Article 10(1) expressly references the controller’s “obligations under this law,” evidencing a compliance mandate, albeit not as a single umbrella clause. However, the GDPR-style scope exceptions (Art. 2(2)(a)-(d)) are not mirrored; Art. 14(1)(a)-(d) are only exemptions from a notification duty, and Art. 7 concerns a specific data category rather than scope exclusions.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-003", "gdpr_article": 2, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions supplied indicate a stronger alignment with GDPR requirements than initially assessed, particularly regarding exclusions and obligations for data protection.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "span": "Article 7", "why": "Provides exemptions related to criminal proceedings that could be analogous to GDPR exclusions."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "span": "Article 4", "why": "Outlines general conditions for lawful data processing, including necessity for a contract or legal obligation."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8", "why": "Addresses the security of processing, including technical and organizational measures to protect data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of no counterpart to the GDPR requirement for the action of 'comply with this Regulation' is unsupported.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14(1)", "why": "Requires the data controller to notify the Authority before starting automated processing, implying compliance with the regulation."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "span": "Article 7(1)", "why": "Outlines exceptions to the prohibition on processing criminal-proceedings data, implying that the data controller must comply with the regulation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "762372b7329c44286e43", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "e38e0bed35316765ba57"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 697.76, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a53a1df4b4699a933dab", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations; no concept of codes of conduct, no permission for adherence by non-subject entities, and no transfer-safeguard mechanism. Cross-border is only mentioned for record-keeping (cl. 7)."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making rights; unrelated to codes of conduct or international transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact mechanisms; no relevance to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward the DPO; does not address codes of conduct or transfer mechanisms."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; no link to codes of conduct or Art. 46(2)(e)-type transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; no mechanism for adherence to approved codes of conduct as transfer safeguards. Cross-border is mentioned only as a record entry (cl. 4)."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; unrelated to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions; does not create or reference codes of conduct or transfer mechanisms."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; no relevance to codes of conduct or international transfer safeguards."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security of personal data; establishes general security measures but no codes of conduct or transfer-safeguard mechanism."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; compliance oversight but no codes of conduct or transfer mechanism allowing non-subject adherence."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; no connection to codes of conduct or transfer safeguards."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "art