ations. None of the provided provisions establishes a prior-consultation advisory duty functionally akin to GDPR Art. 36(2). Accordingly, the requirement is textually uncovered in the supplied Bahrain provisions.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-389", "gdpr_article": 35, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C5 may not be entirely accurate, as there are provisions that could be considered as counterparts to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 44", "span": "The President of the Executive Body shall represent the Authority before the judiciary and in its relations with others", "why": "This provision suggests that there is a mechanism in place for oversight and regulation of data processing."}, {"id": "Article 25", "span": "Any interested person may submit a complaint to the Authority if they have reason to believe that there has been a violation of the provisions of this Law", "why": "This provision suggests that there is a mechanism in place for individuals to report violations of data processing regulations."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's label of C5 may be incorrect, as there are provisions in the target jurisdiction's law that could be considered counterparts to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "44", "span": "Article 44: President of the Executive Body", "why": "This provision suggests that there is an entity responsible for representing the Authority and overseeing its activities."}, {"id": "25", "span": "Article 25: Complaints to the Authority", "why": "This provision allows interested persons to submit complaints, which could be related to data processing activities."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "daaf1e5a7eedf0d7755e", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 670.27, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "b6c6de44dbbc3cb0e4b4", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
