ng or administrative deadline extensions, not a lis pendens/related-actions stay mechanism.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1010", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C5 is not entirely accurate, as some provisions could be interpreted as providing a basis for staying proceedings.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "ضبط وإثبات الجرائم", "why": "This article mentions investigating and proving crimes, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "منع أي جريمة جنائية، أو جمع معلومات عنها، أو التحقيق فيها", "why": "This article mentions preventing any criminal offense, or collecting information about it, or investigating it, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "span": "توفيق أوضاعهم بما يتفق وأحكامه", "why": "This article mentions adjusting situations to comply with its provisions, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "يبت الوزير في التظلم خلال ستين يوماً من تاريخ تقديمه", "why": "This article mentions the Minister deciding on an appeal within sixty days, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "provisions in Qatari law may be related to GDPR requirement unit [RU-1010]", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "ضبط وإثبات الجرائم", "why": "implies investigating and proving crimes, potentially related to staying proceedings"}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "منع أي جريمة جنائية، أو جمع معلومات عنها، أو التحقيق فيها", "why": "implies considering related proceedings"}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "span": "يجوز بقرار من مجلس الوزراء، بناءً على اقتراح الوزير، مد هذه المهلة لمدة أو مدد أخرى مماثلة", "why": "implies allowing for modification or extension of proceedings"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5", "9548224453cca1301899"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 516.51, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "4f6c87b4426a87eb7257", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Addresses withdrawal of consent procedures, not how a consent request is presented within mixed written declarations."}, {"id": "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "reason": "Concerns data accuracy before processing; no relation to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "reason": "Allows marketing processing with consent; does not regulate the form or separateness of consent requests."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Relates to processing for a realized interest; not about consent form or presentation."}, {"id": "0269f42c0015a544c475", "reason": "Sets consent rules for advertising/outreach and opt-out mechanics; does not require consent requests to be distinguishable from other matters in a written declaration."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "General rule that consent is required; does not specify distinguishable presentation within documents."}, {"id": "be168d2284c2b332add1", "reason": "Rectification obligations; unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Data erasure obligations; unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Transparency at collection; does not mandate separateness of consent text within mixed declarations."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Controller–processor arrangements; unrelated to consent request formatting."}, {"id": "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "reason": "Prohibits making consent a condition for service (anti-tying); does not address how consent text is distinguished within a written declaration."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لجهة التحكم الحصول على موافقة صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 11(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يشترط في الموافقة ما يأتي", "article": "Article 11(1)"}, "action": {"span": "أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة", "article": "Article 11(1)(هـ)"}, "scope": {"span": "بما في ذلك الموافقات الكتابية أو الشفوية أو باستخدام الطرق الإلكترونية", "article": "Article 11(1)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يشترط في الموافقة ما يأتي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in a manner clearly distinguishable from other matters", "target_value": "أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة؛ وألا تستخدم أي طرق مضللة في سبيل الحصول عليها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11(1)(هـ), Article 11(1)(أ)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": "بما في ذلك الموافقات الكتابية أو الشفوية أو باستخدام الطرق الإلكترونية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 11(1)(هـ) (separate consent per purpose) and 11(1)(أ) (no misleading methods) partly reflect separateness and clarity in obtaining consent, supporting the reviewer’s point that a counterpart exists. However, the text does not expressly require that, when consent is embedded in a written declaration covering other matters, the consent request be presented as clearly distinguishable from those other matters. Hence the match is partial rather than full.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-018", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition is partially covered by Article 11(1) and Article 11(1)(هـ)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "أ- أن تصدر الموافقة بإرادة حرة، وألا تستخدم أي طرق مضللة في سبيل الحصول عليها", "why": "Implies that consent must be given freely and independently"}, {"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "هـ- أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة", "why": "Implies that consent must be independent for each purpose of the processing"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, and a counterpart for the proposition does exist in the KSA jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "Article 11(1)(هـ): \"أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة\"", "why": "This provision implies that the request for consent should be presented in a manner that is clearly distinguishable from other matters."}, {"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "Article 11(1)(أ): \"ألا تستخدم أي طرق مضللة في سبيل الحصول عليها\"", "why": "This provision further supports the idea that the request for consent should be presented in a clear and distinguishable manner."}, {"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "Article 11(1): \"كتابية أو شفوية أو باستخدام الطرق الإلكترونية\"", "why": "This provision could be interpreted to include written declarations that concern other matters."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "21847c9e87d6df45a9a7", "557230873031d6e5cb2c", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "0269f42c0015a544c475", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "be168d2284c2b332add1", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 574.84, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "7f6963fed3b22de8470b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal case data; no supervisory authority advice or prior consultation mechanism."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Sets Data Protection Officer duties and liaison; does not impose supervisory authority advice to controllers on intended processing."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Criminal penalties; no rule on supervisory authority advice or timelines for prior consultation."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions (privacy by design) in a decision; no supervisory authority advice obligation."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Procedure/timeframe for registering internal DPOs; unrelated to supervisory authority advice on intended processing."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Data subject right to object; addresses controllers, not supervisory authority advice duties."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Procedure/timeframe for registering external DPOs; not about supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "reason": "Enforcement measures after violations; no prior consultation advice duty or timing."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Controller’s duty to inform data subjects; not supervisory authority advice or consultation."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; no supervisory authority advice obligation."}, {"id": "408dbb9b6c020c67f01f", "reason": "Notifying concerned parties after an investigation report; unrelated to advising controllers on intended processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لل\u0000هيئة", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "modality": {"span": "لل\u0000هيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار ... أن تطلب", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "action": {"span": "أن تطلب من مدير البيانات استيفاء أيّ نقص في بيانات الإخطار", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "scope": {"span": "الإخطار المشار إليه في البندين (1) أو (3) من هذه المادة", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وعلى مقدِّم الطلب التوقف عن المعالَجة لحين استيفاء النقص بالإخطار.", "article": "Article 14(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (must)", "target_value": "لل\u0000هيئة ... أن تطلب (permission)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide written advice to the controller and, where applicable, the processor", "target_value": "أن تطلب من مدير البيانات استيفاء أيّ نقص في بيانات الإخطار (request to complete notification data)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "intended processing referred to in paragraph 1 (high-risk processing subject to prior consultation)", "target_value": "الإخطار المشار إليه في البندين (1) أو (3) من هذه المادة (pre-processing notification regime)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority is of the opinion that the intended processing would infringe the GDPR", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "within up to eight weeks of receipt of the request for consultation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "وعلى مقدِّم الطلب التوقف عن المعالَجة لحين استيفاء النقص بالإخطار.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "No Bahrain provision requires the supervisory authority to issue written advice to a controller (or processor) about intended processing, nor sets an 8-week (or any) deadline for such advice. Article 14(4) only allows the authority to request completion of a notification within 10 working days and compels the applicant to pause processing, which is not a substitute for GDPR Art. 36 advice. Therefore the temporal element and the advice obligation remain uncovered.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-416", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "broader", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly address the supervisory authority's obligation to provide written advice in cases of potential GDPR infringement, suggesting a potential gap or need for clarification.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14(4)", "why": "This article discusses the authority's power to request completion of notification deficiencies but does not explicitly mention providing written advice to prevent GDPR infringements."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit timeframe for authority's response or advice in provided provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14(4)", "why": "Does not specify a timeframe for the authority's response or advice."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "14fe9b