textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include pseudonymisation in the implemented security measures", "target_value": "تشمل هذه التدابير آلية إخفاء البيانات / تطبيق آلية إخفاء البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 7(2); Article 20(1)(أ)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data processed", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية (ضمن أمن معلومات المعالجة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)(أ)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as appropriate to the risk", "target_value": "ملائمة وتتناسب مع المخاطر المصاحبة للمعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 20(1)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.61, "reasoning_note": "Article 7(2) expressly states that the controller’s measures include a data-masking mechanism, and Article 20(1) makes those measures risk-appropriate. However, the text uses “إخفاء البيانات” (data masking) rather than the GDPR term “pseudonymisation,” and Article 20 frames it as an example (“يمكن أن يشمل”), so equivalence is functional but not exact.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-317", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "