 البيانات الشخصية ... 5- الآثار والمخاطر ... ومدى تأثيرها على صاحب البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 39"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "processor", "target": "المتحكم والمعالج", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk", "target": "أن يوفر أنظمة الحماية الفنية للاحتفاظ الآمن بمستندات المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 27(3)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing of personal data", "target": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "taking into account the state of the art, implementation costs, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, as well as risks of varying likelihood and severity to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "وصف طبيعة وحجم البيانات، الغرض ونطاق المعالجة، المدة الزمنية، والآثار والمخاطر ومدى تأثيرها على صاحب البيانات الشخصية (في تقييم يجريه المتحكم)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 39"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.56, "reasoning_note": "I limited the action slot to Article 27(3), which binds the processor but only for technical protection of processing documents, hence a narrower match. For the condition slot, Article 39 lists risk-related factors, but it applies to the controller’s assessment (not the processor) and omits state of the art and cost, so only partial conceptual alignment. This directly addresses the reviewer’s concern about overreach in those two slots.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-316", "gdpr_article": 32, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict for the 'condition' slot is unsupported by the citation, as Article 39 provides a partial counterpart to the GDPR's requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "يجب على المتحكم إجراء تقييم لمستوى الحماية التي توفرها جهة المعالجة الخارجية ومخاطر نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Article 39 requires a risk assessment that takes into account the nature and scope of the processing, as well as the potential risks to the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's action and condition slot verdicts may not be fully supported by the cited provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the action slot verdict, but it may not fully align with the proposition."}, {"id": "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "span": "تقييم يشمل طبيعة وحجم البيانات، الغرض ونطاق المعالجة، المدة الزمنية، والآثار والمخاطر ومدى تأثيرها على صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the condition slot verdict, but it may not fully align with the specified factors mentioned in the proposition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "fd2c91edc2e3ff926c6b", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "dcd007160208896c8632", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "09d77a4e064de5fe6273", "6ada991a77a31372fb4c", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 675.39, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "a3e837977d0c3c657d0e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
