الالتزامات العامة للمعالج", "why": "Article 8 outlines processor obligations but does not clearly state the authority's power to request information for its tasks."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "ebfe638a86be87347658"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 385.67, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "ad8795151235c216033b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing conditions; does not confer a right for the data subject to obtain information on purposes."}, {"id": "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "reason": "Definitions only; does not establish an access right to information on purposes."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "DPO obligations; no data subject right to obtain purpose information."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ transparency duties; not a data subject’s on-request right to obtain information."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification to the authority; not about informing the data subject of purposes upon request."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing carve-outs; unrelated to the access right to purpose information."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual terms; situational transparency, not a general right of access to purposes."}, {"id": "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "reason": "Information at collection (proactive notice); not the data subject’s right to obtain information upon request."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no access right to purpose information."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Right to object to direct marketing; not the right to obtain purpose information."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing; not related to the access right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار صاحب البيانات في صورة مفهومة بما يأتي: ... ج - الغرض من معالجة البيانات.", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات ... عما إذا كان مدير البيانات يعالِج بيانات شخصية خاصة بصاحب الطلب، وفي حالة وجود معالَجة من أيّ نوع لهذه البيانات يلتزم مدير البيانات بإخطار صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب ... إذا لم يكن مستوفياً ... وله رفْضُه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة.", "article": "Article 18(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "في حالة رفض الطلب ... يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات.", "article": "Article 18(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "على مدير البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب (obligation correlating to the data subject’s request)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller information on the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "إخطار صاحب البيانات ... بالغرض من معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "purposes of the processing", "target_value": "الغرض من معالجة البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)(ج)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target_value": "إذا كان مدير البيانات يعالِج بيانات شخصية لصاحب الطلب، ففي حالة وجود معالَجة يلتزم بالإخطار", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "عدم قبول الطلب إذا لم يكن مستوفياً؛ ورفضه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً في استعمال الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 18(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18(1)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة عند الرفض أو عدم الرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 18(4)"}], "holistic_label": "covered with narrowing exceptions", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 18(1) BHR expressly requires the controller, upon the data subject’s request, to inform them of the purpose of processing where their personal data are processed, functionally matching GDPR Art. 15’s element here. However, Article 18(3) introduces refusal grounds (incomplete request or abusive use), so the right is not textually absolute. This addresses the reviewer’s objection: the coverage exists but with explicit procedural/abuse limitations.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-124", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 24}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The right to obtain information on the purposes of the processing is not explicitly covered in the target jurisdiction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "Article 18(1)", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the right to obtain information on the purposes of the processing."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "span": "Article 18(1)(ج)", "why": "The provision mentions the purpose of the processing, but it is not clear if this grants the data subject a right to obtain this information."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law does not provide an absolute right to obtain information on the purposes of the processing from the controller, and there may be limitations and exceptions to this right.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 18(3)", "span": "لمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب المشار إليه في البند (1) من هذه المادة، إذا لم يكن مستوفياً، بشرط الالتزام بمتطلبات البند (2) من هذه المادة وفوات مدة الإعذار.", "why": "This provision suggests that the data subject's right to obtain information is not absolute and may be subject to certain limitations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8344697d1f1dc661161", "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "93fde8c87940ae524c86", "762372b7329c44286e43", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 417.74, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "d267b92640d75179650f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "823830174d241884bd73"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "reason": "General applicability clause; does not allocate complaint-handling power or territorial derogation."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Concerns breach notifications handling by the administration, not data-subject complaints or supervisory authority competence."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Substantive restriction on disclosure; unrelated to supervisory authority complaint-handling or jurisdiction."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Scope exemptions from the law; do not create a derogation from a lead-authority rule or allocate complaint competence."}, {"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "reason": "Controller-processor relationship; not about supervisory authority powers or complaint allocation."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit for special categories; unrelated to complaint handling or supervisory jurisdiction."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External audit obligations; not about complaint-handling power or allocation."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation; not about supervisory authority complaint competence."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Representation of incapacitated persons; does not address supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "reason": "Confers law-enforcement (judicial police) status on certain staff; not allocation of complaint-handling authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 7"}, "modality": {"span": "ولها على الأخص الآتي", "article": "Article 7"}, "action": {"span": "تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى التي يودعها أصحاب البيانات الشخصية، والبت فيها", "article": "Article 7(ج)"}, "scope": {"span": "تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 7"}, "condition": {"span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 12"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الوزارة (السلطة المشرفة) تتولى مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["498c9cb637b86367567b"]}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "ولها على الأخص: تلقي الشكاوى والبت فيها", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["498c9cb637b86367567b"]}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "handle a complaint lodged with it", "target_value": "تلقي البلاغات والشكاوى ... والبت فيها؛ ويجوز لصاحب البيانات التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "823830174d241884bd73"]}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "a case under this Regulation", "target_value": "تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون / شكاوى تتعلق بعدم التوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "823830174d241884bd73"]}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the subject matter relates only to an establishment in its Member State or substantially affects data subjects only in its Member State", "target_value": "لا تُذكر أي شروط إقليمية؛ الشرط المذكور هو أن الشكوى تُقدَّم إذا اعتبر صاحب البيانات أن المعالجة لا تتوافق مع أحكام القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ["498c9cb637b86367567b", "823830174d241884bd73"]}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "by derogation from paragraph 1", "target_value": "لا يوجد نص مماثل لنظام «سلطة قيادية» أو استثناء منه؛ الاستثناءات في المادة (3) هي استبعادات نطاق القانون وليست توزيع اختصاص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814"]}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": []}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "OMN law clearly empowers the Ministry to receive and decide complaints, satisfying the core ‘power to handle complaints’ element. However, it lacks GDPR’s specific territorial condition and the derogation from a lead-authority rule; Article 3 exemptions do not serve as such a derogation. Article 12 provides a complaint condition (noncompliance) but not the GDPR’s local-only criterion.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-652", "gdpr_article": 56, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition for handling complaints is not entirely uncovered, as Article 12 provides a basis for the Ministry to handle complaints.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article provides a basis for the Ministry to handle complaints, which could be interpreted as including the condition that the subject matter relates only to an establishment in its Member State or substantially affects data subjects only in its Member State."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition and exception slots may be covered by implied provisions or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Implied condition for submitting a complaint"}, {"id": "Article 3", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية", "why": "Exceptions to the general rules, potentially derogating from the lead competence"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "823830174d241884bd73", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 387.05, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "465ff05a8095e34182af", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": ["32f2136681f29047cd6a", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and storage limitation; no requirement to keep a record or include joint controller identity/contact."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Lawful basis for processing; no record-keeping duty or joint controller identification."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; does not mandate maintaining a controller record or content thereof."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; unrelated to a record of processing or naming joint controllers."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; no record-keeping content requirement."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Disclosure/transfer to processor; no obligation to include joint controller details in any record."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Material scope clause; does not create record-keeping obligations."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Direct marketing; no relevance to records of processing or joint controllers."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller duties (fairness, security, policies); no specific record-keeping fields or joint controller identification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المراقب", "article": "Article 1"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "المراقب: الشخص الطبيعي أو المعنوي الذي يقوم منفرداً أو بالاشتراك مع آخرين بتحديد كيفية معالجة البيانات الشخصية والغرض منها.", "article": "Article 1"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 1", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "include the name and contact details of the joint controller in the record", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "the record of processing activities maintained under Article 30(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where applicable (a joint controller exists)", "target": "المراقب ... يقوم منفرداً أو بالاشتراك مع آخرين ...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 1", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.7, "reasoning_note": "Articles 9 and 11 impose certain controller duties (e.g., informing individuals and maintaining internal systems), and Article 1 recognizes joint controllers, but none establish a statutory record of processing or mandate inclusion of a joint controller’s name/contact in such a record. The cited duties are directed at data-subject notice or internal governance, not at maintaining a GDPR-like ROPA with specified fields. Therefore, the specific Art. 30(1) content requirement remains textually unaddressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-257", "gdpr_article": 30, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 12}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for partial coverage under different terminology or distributed provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله.", "why": "Implies transparency about who processes personal data, potentially including joint controllers"}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "span": "المراقب: الشخص الطبيعي أو المعنوي الذي يقوم منفرداً أو بالاشتراك مع آخرين بتحديد كيفية معالجة البيانات الشخصية والغرض منها.", "why": "Defines controller to include those who determine purpose and means of processing, possibly jointly"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not directly address the obligation to include the name and contact details of the joint controller in a record, but they imply responsibilities of controllers that could support such a requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله.", "why": "This provision implies the controller's obligation to inform the individual about their data, which could be related to including contact details in a record."}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "span": "المراقب: الشخص الطبيعي أو المعنوي الذي يقوم منفرداً أو بالاشتراك مع آخرين بتحديد كيفية معالجة البيانات الشخصية والغرض منها.", "why": "This definition of the controller includes joint controllers, suggesting a framework for their responsibilities."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["455aae046cacf7979576", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "c098856a98e89debe630", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 412.38, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260802, "id": "2f95458e99ed80b80429", "condition": "stability", "rep": 1}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "Regulates cross-border transfers and adequacy; no permission or grandfathering for religious bodies' pre-existing data-protection rules."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Defines 'institutional rules' (akin to corporate group binding rules) for data protection and intra-group transfers, but limited to corporate/regional/international groups and submission to the Authority; no provision on churches/religious associations or grandfathering of pre-existing comprehensive rules."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "General security-of-processing obligations; does not address permission for religious entities to continue applying pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "reason": "Journalism/art/literature processing exception; unrelated to religious organizations’ pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality obligations of the Authority; no relevance to grandfathering of religious bodies’ data-protection regimes."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Sets Authority’s tasks and powers; contains no sectoral exemption or continuation permission for religious entities’ rules."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definition of Privacy by Design; no provision on religious bodies or continuation of pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Rules on processing criminal case data; no relevance to churches’ pre-existing data-protection rules."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Contract-based cross-border transfers; no permission for religious entities to apply pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; does not address sectoral grandfathering for religious organizations."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for Data Protection Officers’ register; unrelated to religious bodies’ pre-existing rules."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Public registers data constraints; no connection to religious organizations or continuation of their rules."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "churches and religious associations or communities", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "continue to apply their pre-existing comprehensive data-protection rules", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "in a Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the entities applied such comprehensive rules at the time of entry into force of this Regulation and the rules are brought into line with this Regulation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "I considered the definition of 'institutional rules' (cf27d7263418b5d502ef) as potential