"877fafe0080725188d05", "span": "Article 11: أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Implies a role in compliance monitoring, though not explicitly with codes of conduct."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "Article 10: تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Requires a DPO with sufficient skills and knowledge, potentially for monitoring compliance."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "span": "Article 12: واجبات المتحكم والمعالج تجاه مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "Outlines duties towards the DPO, including support for performing tasks that could encompass compliance monitoring."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5d949837d7aab073cd67"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 560.35, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "dff1c0cda324c89a324e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General statement of privacy and lawful processing; does not grant an access right."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; not about data-subject access."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Special-category data processing conditions; not about access."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National-security exemptions for certain articles (4,9,15,17); does not address or limit Article 6 access."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure conditions; not access."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Rights to withdraw consent, object, erase, and correct; does not create a right of access."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security safeguards; not access."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; not access."}, {"id": "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "reason": "Pre-processing information duties; not the access right."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal basis for processing; not access."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; not access."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد", "article": "Article 6"}, "modality": {"span": "وله بوجه خاص الحق", "article": "Article 6"}, "action": {"span": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "scope": {"span": "بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 6"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "في أي وقت", "article": "Article 6"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "data subject", "target": "الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": "الحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "obtain access to personal data concerning the data subject", "target": "الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية (ويشمل: الحصول على نسخة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "personal data concerning the data subject", "target": "بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "where the personal data concerning the data subject are being processed", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "في أي وقت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 6", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.83, "reasoning_note": "Article 6 alone directly establishes a data subject’s right to access their personal data (including obtaining a copy), satisfying the GDPR Art. 15 core entitlement. Article 3 is a general privacy principle and is not needed to constitute the access right. The GDPR’s processing-condition is not textually mirrored in Article 6, making the Qatari formulation broader rather than a gap.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-123", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict on the condition slot is not entirely accurate, as the Qatari law implies that the processing of personal data is a relevant factor.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 2", "span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية عندما تتم معالجتها على نحو إلكتروني، أو يتم الحصول عليها أو جمعها أو استخراجها على أي نحو آخر تمهيداً لمعالجتها إلكترونياً، أو تتم معالجتها عن طريق الجمع بين المعالجة الإلكترونية والمعالجة التقليدية.", "why": "This article implies that the law applies to the processing of personal data."}, {"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله. 2- الأغراض المشروعة التي يرغب المراقب أو أي طرف آخر في معالجة البيانات الشخصية من أجلها.", "why": "This article requires the controller to inform the individual about the purposes of processing their personal data before starting the processing, implying that the processing of personal data is a relevant factor."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions, while related, do not directly and comprehensively address the GDPR requirement as a single, unified counterpart.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها، في مواجهة أي مراقب، وله بوجه خاص الحق فيما يلي:", "why": "Article 6 provides a right to access personal data but does not explicitly mirror the GDPR's condition regarding the processing of personal data."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "span": "لكل فرد الحق في حماية خصوصية بياناته الشخصية، ولا يجوز معالجة تلك البيانات إلا في إطار الشفافية والأمانة واحترام كرامة الإنسان والممارسات المقبولة، وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "Article 3 emphasizes the right to privacy and lawful processing but does not directly address access to personal data during processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 549.15, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "759637f070693d4fa03b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "About Data Protection Officer duties and DPO–authority interactions, not the controller’s breach-notification duty to the authority."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions for the DPO register; no breach-notification rule."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Procedures on DPO external registration; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations; does not set breach-notification to the authority."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Procedures on DPO internal registration; unrelated to breach notification."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no breach-notification rule."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/blocking/erasure rights; not breach notification to authority."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Processing of criminal data; not breach notification."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Criminal penalties generally; no specific breach-notification timing duty."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "DPO disciplinary referral; not breach notification."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Right to object to processing; unrelated to breach-notification to authority."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات ... ويجب عليه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "scope": {"span": "الهيئة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "condition": {"span": "حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات ... من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي حال لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة، يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير", "article": "Article 4(b)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "يلتزم ... ويجب عليه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target": "الهيئة (سلطة الإشراف الوطنية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "in the case of a personal data breach and where feasible", "target": "عند حدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات ومن وقت اكتشافه؛ مع السماح بالتبرير عند تجاوز المهلة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (وجملة: «وفي حال لم يلتزم ...»)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "unless the personal data breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "not later than 72 hours after becoming aware of the personal data breach", "target": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "إذا تأخر الإخطار عن المهلة المحددة، يجب تسبيب التأخير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 4(b)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.87, "reasoning_note": "Article 4(b) uses mandatory language and expressly ties notification to a 72-hour limit: “ويجب عليه … لإخطار الهيئة … خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه,” and reinforces the obligation by addressing noncompliance: “وفي حال لم يلتزم المدير بإخطار الهيئة في المدة المحددة…”. Functional equivalence suffices; no mention of the GDPR is required to meet RU-346. The exception and staged-information clauses track GDPR Art. 33’s structure.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-346", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based solely on Article 4(b) and does not consider other relevant provisions, such as Article 58. Additionally, the verdict lacks evidence to support the claim that the BHR law has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 58", "span": "The penalties for non-compliance with the law, including the failure to notify the supervisory authority of a personal data breach.", "why": "This provision suggests that the BHR law does have consequences for non-compliance, which is not explicitly mentioned in the analyst's verdict."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provision (Article 4(b)) does not explicitly mention the 72-hour time frame as an obligation, and the analyst's verdict claims that the target jurisdiction (BHR) has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement without explicit mention of the GDPR or equivalent regulation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "The provision does not explicitly state that it is an obligation to notify the authority within 72 hours."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "074363ee1a72941c8326", "762372b7329c44286e43", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "88af48316f67d59351aa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 649.51, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "26b8a9ec294169786879", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["8394f801a0a97e521f68", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Regulates disclosure of personal data; does not address DPO support or provision of resources."}, {"id": "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "reason": "Limits/conditions data subject access rights; not about DPO or controller support/resources."}, {"id": "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "reason": "Collection purpose and data minimization; no DPO support/resource obligation."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "General duty to preserve data via organizational/administrative/technical means; does not mention DPO nor require providing resources to a DPO."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Disclosure safeguards and documentation; unrelated to providing resources to a DPO."}, {"id": "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "reason": "Specific to processing for a realized interest; no DPO support/resources."}, {"id": "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "reason": "Response timelines to data subject requests; no DPO support/resources."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National register of controllers; no DPO support/resources."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; not about DPO support/resources."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "reason": "Inspection and enforcement powers; not about controller’s internal duty to resource a DPO."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين أو تحديد شخص أو أكثر ليكون مسؤولاً عن حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "article": "Article 23"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "يتولى مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في جهة التحكم متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام ولوائحه، ومراقبة الإجراءات المعمول بها داخل جهة التحكم والإشراف عليها، ... ويتولى على وجه الخصوص الآتي:", "article": "Article 32"}, "condition": {"span": "تقوم جهة التحكم بتعيين أو تحديد شخص أو أكثر ليكون مسؤولاً عن حماية البيانات الشخصية، وذلك في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ- أن تكون جهة التحكم جهة عامة تقدم خدمات تتضمن معالجة بيانات شخصية على نطاق واسع. ب- أن تقوم الأنشطة الأساسية لجهة التحكم على عمليات المعالجة التي تتطلب بطبيعتها مراقبة منتظمة وممنهجة لأصحاب البيانات الشخصية. ج- أن تقوم الأنشطة الأساسية لجهة التحكم على معالجة بيانات شخصية حساسة.", "article": "Article 32"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 32(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم ... اتخاذ التدابير ... اللازمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the resources necessary for the data protection officer to carry out the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target_value": "No explicit duty to “provide resources” to the DPO; related texts require appointing/designating a DPO and taking organizational/administrative/technical measures.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 32(1), 32(3); Article 23"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "supporting the data protection officer in performing the tasks referred to in Article 39", "target_value": "DPO tasks are specified (e.g., متابعة تنفيذ أحكام النظام، الإشراف على تقويم الأثر، تمكين الحقوق، إشعار الجهة المختصة...) but no express duty on the controller to support or provide means to perform them.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 32(3)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "DPO appointment (and thus any related support) arises only in specified cases (جهة عامة على نطاق واسع، مراقبة منتظمة وممنهجة، أو معالجة بيانات حساسة).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 32(1)(أ-ج)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No express exceptions relevant to resourcing a DPO.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No temporal qualifiers stated for resourcing/support.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence tied to (non-)provision of resources to a DPO.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "I accounted for Articles 32 and 23: they require appointing a DPO, define DPO tasks, and impose general organizational/technical measures, which conceptually imply some support. However, the KSA text does not expressly obligate the controller to provide the “resources necessary” to the DPO as in GDPR Art. 38(2), so coverage is only partial and more implicit than textual.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-456", "gdpr_article": 38, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for modality and action might be too strict, given the implications of Articles 23 and 32.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "المادة الثالثة والعشرون: أمن المعلومات على جهة التحكم اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "why": "Implies an obligation for the controller to ensure data security and privacy, potentially including resource provision for the DPO."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون: مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Requires the appointment of a DPO under certain conditions, suggesting an indirect obligation to provide necessary resources."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion about the absence of a counterpart for the obligation to provide resources to the DPO might be too absolute, overlooking implicit obligations in Articles 23 and 32.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "span": "المادة الثالثة والعشرون: أمن المعلومات على جهة التحكم اتخاذ التدابير التنظيمية والإدارية والتقنية اللازمة لضمان أمن البيانات الشخصية وخصوصية أصحابها", "why": "Implicitly suggests the controller's responsibility to ensure data protection, which could include providing resources for the DPO."}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "المادة الثانية والثلاثون: مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Outlines the DPO's responsibilities, implying the controller's obligation to support the DPO in performing their duties."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "6f4fee23b0aedf942410", "a7597ada8323b333cc94", "62cc177254bb6a5bed90", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "90da7bc2380e8f3f2fb8", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 596.97, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "9160f3faa59c59ae091f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["1f0de28c69e3ad65d235"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to obtain information; does not address designation or supervision by a specific authority."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "General scope and exclusions (including free zones); does not provide for designating a specific supervisory authority for religious bodies."}, {"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions; not about establishing or designating supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object to processing; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Controller/processor duties toward DPO; not about governmental supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; not about designating a supervisory authority."}, {"id": "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Contact methods with controller; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Right to rectification/erasure; not about supervisory authority designation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لمجلس الوزراء", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "التفويض ... تفويض", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": "تفويض أي من الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة ... ببعض الاختصاصات المنوطة بالمكتب في هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "وفي نطاق اختصاصها المحلي", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب", "article": "Article 27"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "لمجلس الوزراء", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1f0de28c69e3ad65d235] Art. 27"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "التفويض ... تفويض", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[1f0de28c69e3ad65d235] Art. 27"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "designate a specific independent supervisory authority for supervising churches and religious associations that apply comprehensive rules under Article 91(1)", "target_value": "تفويض أي من الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة ... ببعض الاختصاصات المنوطة بالمكتب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "[1f0de28c69e3ad65d235] Art. 27 (delegation to local authorities; no mention of churches/religious associations or a specific independent supervisory authority)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "وفي نطاق اختصاصها المحلي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "[1f0de28c69e3ad65d235] Art. 27"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the designated specific authority fulfils the conditions laid down in Chapter VI of this Regulation", "target_value": "بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Article 27 allows the Council of Ministers to delegate some powers of the federal data office to competent local government entities, but it does not create or allow designation of a specific independent supervisory authority for churches or religious associations. Nor does it require that any delegated body meet Chapter VI-like independence and conditions. Therefore, there is no direct counterpart for GDPR Article 91(2).", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-978", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's label of C4 (partial match) might not fully capture the nuances of the UAE law's data protection framework.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 11", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "The role of the data protection officer includes ensuring compliance with the regulation and providing guidance on data protection, which could be seen as a form of indirect supervision."}, {"id": "Article 12", "span": "المادة (12) واجبات المتحكم والمعالج تجاه مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "The responsibilities of the controller and processor towards the data protection officer, including providing necessary resources and support, establish a framework for data protection and oversight."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct counterpart for supervising churches and religious associations under specific conditions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "span": "المادة (27) التفويض لمجلس الوزراء - بناءً على اقتراح مدير عام المكتب - تفويض أي من الجهات الحكومية المحلية المختصة وفي نطاق اختصاصها المحلي، ببعض الاختصاصات المنوطة بالمكتب في هذا المرسوم بقانون.", "why": "Does not explicitly address supervision of churches and religious associations"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "26fa00c5f73d496e939b", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "c34922f387019af45e42", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "877fafe0080725188d05"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 641.99, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "8df61496cb58292ae247", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "reason": "General savings clause about stronger protections; does not address movement of data or a prohibition on restricting movement."}, {"id": "ba8aef540689169aa848", "reason": "Regulatory details on indirect collection; not about free movement or cross-border transfer principles."}, {"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Operational rules for disclosure; not a principle on free movement or a ban on restricting it."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to free movement."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Substantive grounds for disclosure (including to public bodies); does not establish a no-restriction principle on movement."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Collection/processing purpose limitation; not about movement of data."}, {"id": "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "reason": "Access right; not about movement."}, {"id": "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "reason": "Privacy policy content; not about movement."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Transparency about whether data will be transferred abroad; does not set a rule prohibiting restrictions on movement."}, {"id": "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "reason": "Security measures including during transfer; not a free-movement principle."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing and extraterritorial enforcement; not about free movement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية ... مع مراعاة ما ورد في الفقرة (2) ... وتكون الشروط الواجب توافرها عند نقل البيانات الشخصية أو الإفصاح عنها ... على النحو الآتي:", "article": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, "action": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "إلى خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: ... وتكون الشروط الواجب توافرها عند نقل البيانات الشخصية أو الإفصاح عنها ...", "article": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, "exception": {"span": "لا يسري ما ورد في الفقرة (2) من هذه المادة على حالات الضرورة القصوى للمحافظة على حياة صاحب البيانات الشخصية أو مصالحه الحيوية أو الوقاية من عدوى مرضية أو فحصها أو معالجتها.", "article": "Article 29(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "جهة التحكم (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "prohibition (shall not restrict)", "target_value": "conditional permission with mandatory conditions on transfer", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "restrict the free movement of personal data", "target_value": "transfer/disclose personal data to outside the Kingdom", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "within the Union", "target_value": "cross-border outbound (to outside the Kingdom)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "for reasons connected with the protection of natural persons regarding processing", "target_value": "specified purposes plus adequacy, national security, and data minimization conditions", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "emergency necessity exception to transfer conditions", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(3)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed in the provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Article 29 imposes conditions and limits on cross-border transfers from KSA, which is the opposite of a rule forbidding restrictions on free movement. The cited counter-evidence (Art. 29; Art. 10) indeed shows restrictions, not a no-restriction principle, and it concerns outbound transfers rather than intra-area free movement as in GDPR Art. 1. Therefore, RU-001 finds no functional counterpart in the KSA text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-001", "gdpr_article": 1, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 22}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of 'uncovered' modality is not entirely accurate, as the KSA provisions provide conditions and exceptions for the transfer of personal data, which could be seen as restricting the free movement of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "Article 29(1)", "why": "Allows for the transfer of personal data under certain conditions, which seems to align with the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "span": "Article 3", "why": "States that the provisions of the system do not prejudice any provision that grants a right to the data subject or provides better protection, which is in line with the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is partially correct, but there are some provisions that seem to restrict the movement of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 29", "span": "المادة التاسعة والعشرون: 1- مع مراعاة ما ورد في الفقرة (2) من هذه المادة، يجوز لجهة التحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية:", "why": "This provision implies that there are restrictions on the movement of personal data."}, {"id": "Article 10", "span": "المادة العاشرة: لا يجوز لجهة التحكم جمع البيانات الشخصية إلا من صاحبها مباشرة، ولا تجوز كذلك معالجة تلك البيانات إلا لتحقيق الغرض الذي جمعت من أجله.", "why": "This provision restricts the collection and processing of personal data."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "ba8aef540689169aa848", "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "6ee1b976a5203de50c77", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "1fc3063dbbcf8d500da0", "06b918a4049719ed530f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 623.02, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "1320a48da3e78f835871", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
