{"span": "إلا بعد الحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "article": "[ae67f8fe376642167563] Article 5"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "يلتزم المتحكم (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[a0040ee4dad7d4440e19] Article 5"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "prohibition", "target_value": "تحظر معالجة ... إلا بعد الحصول على تصريح", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[ae67f8fe376642167563] Article 5"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "process personal data", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[ae67f8fe376642167563] Article 5"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures", "target_value": "البيانات الشخصية المتعلقة بـ \"الإدانة الجزائية أو المتعلقة بتدابير أمنية\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "[ae67f8fe376642167563] Article 5"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the processing is based on Article 6(1) GDPR", "target_value": "no condition expressed regarding lawful basis analogous to GDPR Art. 6(1)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "when under control of official authority; or when authorized by Union/Member State law with appropriate safeguards", "target_value": "exception only when a Ministry permit is obtained", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "[ae67f8fe376642167563] Article 5"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "OMN law directly prohibits processing of conviction/security-measure data and allows it only with a Ministry permit, covering addressee, modality, action, and scope. However, it does not mirror GDPR Art. 10’s Art. 6(1)-linked condition, nor the specific exceptions (official authority control or authorization by law with safeguards). The reviewer’s objection is correct on those two points.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-030", "gdpr_article": 10, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction has provisions that cover some aspects of the GDPR requirement, and the analyst's verdict of 'C2' may be too conservative.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires the controller to obtain a permit from the Ministry before processing any personal data, which could be seen as a broader requirement that encompasses the GDPR's Article 6(1) basis."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This provision grants the Ministry the power to take various measures to protect the rights of data subjects, which could be seen as a provision that provides appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of data subjects."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the Article 6(1) basis for processing personal data, and do not provide for exceptions under the control of official authority or when authorized by Union or Member State law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "[ae67f8fe376642167563]", "span": "تحظر معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتعلق بالبيانات الجينية أو البيانات الحيوية أو البيانات الصحية أو الأصول العرقية أو الحياة الجنسية أو الآراء السياسية أو الدينية أو المعتقدات أو الإدانة الجزائية أو المتعلقة بتدابير أمنية إلا بعد الحصول على تصريح من الوزارة", "why": "This provision prohibits the processing of personal data related to criminal convictions or security measures without a permit from the Ministry, but does not mention the Article 6(1) basis."}, {"id": "[a0040ee4dad7d4440e19]", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires the controller to obtain a permit from the Ministry before processing personal data, but does not provide for exceptions under the control of official authority or when authorized by Union or Member State law."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "3f916831456908af27d8", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "ae67f8fe376642167563", "38c6f7484322711d7d32"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 639.42, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "3eb9b1bb5bf421ac9e7b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["9630e6d967b64e07d339"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles and tasks after appointment; does not impose or trigger the designation obligation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Sets duties of controller/processor toward an already-appointed DPO; does not govern when a DPO must be designated."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "General processor obligations; mentions keeping records including DPO data but does not require or trigger DPO designation."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations; recordkeeping references DPO details but does not impose the processor’s duty to appoint or set triggers."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; references DPO contact if appointed but does not create or trigger a designation duty."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Addresses right to restriction and exceptions allowing continued processing (including when related to judicial proceedings); it does not regulate DPO designation or carve out courts from a public-authority trigger."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Data subject rights regarding automated processing; unrelated to DPO designation triggers."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Correction/erasure rights; unrelated to DPO designation triggers."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Right to information; unrelated to DPO designation triggers."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to DPO designation triggers."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; does not govern DPO designation or its triggers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 10(1)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك في أي من الأحوال الآتية:\nأ. إذا كانت المعالجة من شأنها إحداث خطر ذو مستوى عالي على سرية وخصوصية البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات نتيجة اعتماد تقنيات جديدة أو مرتبطة بحجم البيانات.\nب. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتضمن تقييم ممنهج وشامل للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة بما يشمل التنميط والمعالجة المؤتمتة.\nج. إذا كانت المعالجة ستتم على حجم كبير من البيانات الشخصية الحساسة.", "article": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "المعالج (والمتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "designate a data protection officer", "target_value": "تعيين مسؤول لحماية البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 10(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "(a) processing by a public authority or body; (b) core activities require regular and systematic monitoring of data subjects on a large scale; (c) core activities include large-scale processing of special-category and criminal-conviction data", "target_value": "تعيين DPO إذا: (أ) كانت المعالجة تُحدث خطراً عالياً بسبب تقنيات جديدة أو حجم البيانات؛ (ب) تتضمن تقييماً ممنهجاً وشاملاً للبيانات الشخصية الحساسة بما يشمل التنميط والمعالجة المؤتمتة؛ (ج) تتم على حجم كبير من البيانات الشخصية الحساسة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 10(1)(a)-(c)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "For point (a), except for courts acting in their judicial capacity", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "UAE Article 10 directly obligates processors to appoint a DPO but under a different set of risk- and sensitivity-based triggers, not the GDPR’s public authority/monitoring/special-category + criminal data triggers. There is no expressed carve-out for courts acting in a judicial capacity. Article 16(3)(b) concerns exceptions to restriction of processing for legal claims/judicial proceedings and does not operate as an institutional exception to DPO designation.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR's requirement for designating a data protection officer, although the conditions and exceptions may differ.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "Article 10(1)", "why": "Requires the designation of a data protection officer in certain circumstances."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "Article 11", "why": "Defines the roles and responsibilities of the data protection officer."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity is partially covered in Article 16(3)(b)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية", "why": "This provision can be interpreted as an exception for courts acting in their judicial capacity"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "674524dee00496cb5de7"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 577.6, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "e7573c28145de148d39f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Right to data portability; not a rule governing cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Internal controls and procedures; does not set substantive conditions for cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Prohibits disclosure of special-category data generally; not specific to cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General protection statement; no operative cross-border transfer conditions."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right; unrelated to cross-border transfer conditions."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit/notification content for special data includes storage/transfer locations, but does not impose cross-border transfer conditions."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation; not a cross-border transfer rule."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification; not about cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Confidentiality and security measures; not specific to cross-border transfers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم", "article": "Article 37"}, "modality": {"span": "ويحظر عليه نقل البيانات الشخصية إذا تمت معالجتها بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا القانون، أو كان من شأنها إلحاق ضرر بصاحب البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 23"}, "action": {"span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "article": "Article 23"}, "scope": {"span": "قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "article": "Article 38"}, "condition": {"span": "بضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة.", "article": "Article 38"}, "exception": {"span": "ولا يشترط الحصول على موافقة صاحب البيانات الشخصية في إحدى الحالات الآتية: 1- إذا كان تنفيذاً لالتزام دولي بموجب اتفاقية تكون سلطنة عمان طرفاً فيها. 2- إذا كان النقل أو التحويل قد تم بطريقة تؤدي إلى إخفاء هوية صاحب البيانات الشخصية...", "article": "Article 37"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 37"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 37; Article 38", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "prohibition: shall not transfer unless Chapter V conditions are met", "target_value": "Conditional permission to transfer; prohibition only if processing is unlawful or harmful; plus obligations to obtain consent and ensure adequacy", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 23; Article 37; Article 38", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "transfer personal data to a third country or international organisation, including onward transfers", "target_value": "transfer or permit transfer of personal data outside Oman", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23; Article 37; Article 38", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "personal data undergoing or intended for processing after transfer; includes onward transfers from the third country/international organisation", "target_value": "personal data transferred outside Oman; no express coverage of onward transfers", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 23; Article 37; Article 38", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "subject to the other provisions of the GDPR", "target_value": "must comply with the law/regulation and ensure destination provides protection not less than that prescribed by law", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23; Article 38", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "exception when Chapter V conditions are complied with", "target_value": "transfer allowed per regulatory controls; consent required but waived for treaty obligations or anonymisation", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23; Article 37; Article 38", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "consent must be obtained before transfer", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 37", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated in the cited provisions", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "OMN law imposes gating conditions (consent, adequacy, and general-law compliance) that functionally restrict cross-border transfers, but it does not expressly regulate onward transfers. The modality also differs: GDPR states a blanket prohibition unless conditions are met, whereas OMN uses conditional permission plus limited prohibitions.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-545", "gdpr_article": 44, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of weaker modality and narrower scope may be incorrect based on the provisions cited.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان وفقاً للضوابط والإجراءات التي تحددها اللائحة.", "why": "This provision seems to align with the GDPR's requirements for transferring personal data to a third country or international organization."}, {"id": "Article 38", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بضمان أن لدى جهة المعالجة الخارجية قدراً كافياً من الحماية للبيانات الشخصية لا يقل عن مستوى الحماية المقررة وفقاً للقانون وهذه اللائحة.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to ensure that the recipient has an adequate level of protection for personal data, which seems to be a stronger requirement than the GDPR's conditions."}, {"id": "Article 37", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان بالحصول على الموافقة الصريحة لصاحب البيانات الشخصية،", "why": "This provision requires explicit consent from the data subject before transferring personal data outside the Sultanate of Oman, which seems to be a stronger requirement than the GDPR's conditions."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN jurisdiction's provisions do not fully cover the scope of the GDPR requirement unit [RU-545], specifically with regards to onward transfers.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يجوز للمتحكم نقل البيانات الشخصية، والسماح بتحويلها خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "why": "Does not explicitly address onward transfers."}, {"id": "Article 37", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "why": "Does not explicitly address onward transfers."}, {"id": "Article 38", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم قبل نقل أو تحويل البيانات الشخصية خارج حدود سلطنة عمان", "why": "Does not explicitly address onward transfers."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["1f1d8b7b23195c0f44fc", "b9a68f2ecdc5b6ee64c9", "434ad096940e27397f81", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "495e30846d7a1f70c077"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 706.87, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "8f0c5a6c556c1cfb832c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Provides a right to obtain information, including procedures that will be taken in case of a breach, but does not create an operational obligation to notify data subjects of an actual breach."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Concerns rectification/erasure rights; no breach-notification duty to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; irrelevant to breach notification."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing and objections; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; not the breach-notification obligation."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support duties; not about notifying data subjects of breaches."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not the breach-notification obligation."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not establish data subject breach notification."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures (e.g., encryption) but no exception framework for waiving data subject notification."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller contact methods; not a breach-notification duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "scope": {"span": "يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق...", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "exception": {"span": "وفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ... التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}, "consequence": {"span": "وتوقيع الجزاءات الإدارية المشار إليها في المادة (26) ... في حال ثبوت مخالفة المتحكم أو المعالج لأحكامه", "article": "Article 9(4) (e05de90f481c9410c6e0)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يجب (obligation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "communicate the personal data breach to the data subject", "target": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... (إخطار صاحب البيانات بالاختراق/الانتهاك)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "communication of personal data breaches to data subjects", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات في حال وقوع اختراق/انتهاك", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "a personal data breach is likely to result in a high risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "no communication required if: (a) appropriate technical/organizational measures rendered data unintelligible; (b) subsequent measures removed the high risk; or (c) individual notice is disproportionate", "target": "الإخطار يكون وفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية (قد تنص على شروط/قيود)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 9(2): \"وفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية\"", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "without undue delay", "target": "خلال المدة التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Art. 9(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "توقيع الجزاءات الإدارية في حال ثبوت مخالفة أحكام المرسوم بقانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 9(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 9(2) directly imposes an obligation on controllers to notify data subjects of a breach, but the trigger is narrower (impact on privacy/confidentiality/security) and the timing is set by executive regulations rather than “without undue delay.” The statute itself does not enumerate GDPR-like exceptions; it defers to executive regulations for procedures/conditions, which may include exceptions, hence a partial match for the exceptions slot. This addresses the reviewer’s point: the cross-reference signals potential conditions, but their substance is not stated in the provided text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-362", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 18}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provision does not explicitly state that the communication must be done without undue delay.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية، خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون، وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله.", "why": "The provision does not match the GDPR requirement of communicating the personal data breach without undue delay."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of 'uncovered' (C5) for exceptions to data subject notification might be incorrect, as Article 9(2) mentions that the notification should be done in accordance with the procedures and conditions set by the executive regulations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "why": "This phrase implies that there might be exceptions or conditions under which the notification is not required, which are defined in the executive regulations."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 633.66, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "e0f00ae2f0fc918fb91f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["593beb6b1fe15a8fda31"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "67a122f7dc547487996a", "reason": "General sanctions/enforcement; does not regulate sub-processing notification duties."}, {"id": "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "reason": "Inspection and enforcement powers; not about processor sub-processing or notification."}, {"id": "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "reason": "Controller-to-data-subject information duties; unrelated to processor sub-processing."}, {"id": "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "reason": "Rules on legal guardians and consent; not about processor sub-processing."}, {"id": "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "reason": "Public interest processing by public bodies; not about sub-processing notification."}, {"id": "85947edc5717161ced74", "reason": "Public-sector disciplinary accountability; not about sub-processing."}, {"id": "0269f42c0015a544c475", "reason": "Marketing communications; not about sub-processing."}, {"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "reason": "Data protection impact assessment; not about sub-processing notification."}, {"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Withdrawal of consent; not about processor sub-processing."}, {"id": "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "reason": "National controller register; not about sub-processing."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "reason": "Data subject information rights; not about processor sub-processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "جهة المعالجة", "article": "Article 17(5) (593beb6b1fe15a8fda31)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 17(5) (593beb6b1fe15a8fda31)"}, "action": {"span": "إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج) (593beb6b1fe15a8fda31)"}, "scope": {"span": "أي تعاقدات لاحقة مع جهات معالجة فرعية", "article": "Article 17(5) (593beb6b1fe15a8fda31)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات", "article": "Article 17(5)(ج) (593beb6b1fe15a8fda31)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "processor", "target_value": "جهة المعالجة (processor)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب (must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "inform the controller of any intended changes concerning the addition or replacement of other processors", "target_value": "إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات (notify the controller before entering into such sub-processor contracts)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5) chapeau and (ج)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "sub-processing", "target_value": "أي تعاقدات لاحقة مع جهات معالجة فرعية (subsequent contracts with sub-processors)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the controller has given general written authorisation to engage other processors", "target_value": "No such condition stated; obligation applies generally and also requires prior approval", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5)(ج)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "before implementing the intended changes", "target_value": "قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات (before undertaking those contracts)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31 Art. 17(5)(ج)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated in the operative clause", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Although KSA Art. 17(5)(ج) requires prior approval (a stricter condition), it also expressly requires the processor to notify the controller before entering into sub-processor contracts and to allow objection—functionally satisfying the GDPR duty to inform before changes. The GDPR-specific condition (general written authorisation) is not present; hence the condition slot is broader, but the core notification obligation is covered.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-226", "gdpr_article": 28, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction does not have an exact counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-226], as Article 17(5) does not explicitly require the processor to inform the controller of any intended changes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "span": "ج- الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم، على أن يتم إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات وتمكين جهة التحكم من الاعتراض عليها خلال مدة يتفق عليها بين جهة التحكم وجهة المعالجة.", "why": "This provision requires prior approval from the controller, but does not explicitly require the processor to inform the controller of any intended changes."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA jurisdiction's regulations may not provide an exact counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-226], as Article 17(5) implies prior approval is required rather than just notification.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "span": "ج- الحصول على الموافقة المسبقة من جهة التحكم، على أن يتم إشعار جهة التحكم قبل القيام بتلك التعاقدات وتمكين جهة التحكم من الاعتراض عليها خلال مدة يتفق عليها بين جهة التحكم وجهة المعالجة.", "why": "This provision implies prior approval is required, rather than just notification."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["67a122f7dc547487996a", "04f45ac99bac1acaa486", "ea8306cd18f9261f6413", "7780dca28ee02b6e0f07", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "3a56eed81feb3655d1d1", "85947edc5717161ced74", "0269f42c0015a544c475", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "4de7a5d9d6e42dc170c3", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 573.19, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "24cf188df39d570f58e9", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["90a1f5873d102c323383"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Administrative complaint to the ministry; does not address courts, parallel proceedings, or suspension."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Permit application content; no court-related procedural rules."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; no judicial coordination or suspension of proceedings."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Decree issuance preamble; not an operative provision on courts."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Disclosure restrictions/exceptions; unrelated to court procedure or lis pendens."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit revocation grounds; no court suspension mechanism."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no rule on courts suspending proceedings."}, {"id": "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "reason": "Duty to cooperate with the ministry; not about courts or proceedings."}, {"id": "5483caf68765f09059fb", "reason": "Record retention; no judicial procedure content."}, {"id": "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "reason": "Administrative licensing decision and ministerial appeal; not judicial lis pendens/suspension."}, {"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Records of processing; no court-related procedural rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المحكمة المختصة", "article": "Article 31"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز ... أن تحكم", "article": "Article 31"}, "action": {"span": "أن تحكم، بالإضافة إلى الغرامة، بمصادرة الأدوات التي استعملت لارتكاب الجريمة", "article": "Article 31"}, "scope": {"span": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 31"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "any competent court other than the court first seized", "target_value": "المحكمة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 31"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجوز ... أن تحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 31"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "suspend its proceedings", "target_value": "أن تحكم ... بمصادرة الأدوات (no text on suspending proceedings)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 31 (only addresses confiscation powers)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون (no 'same subject matter' or 'same controller/processor' criterion)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 31"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": "no condition about proceedings pending in another state's court", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 31 does mention a competent court and uses permissive language, but it concerns the power to order confiscation as a criminal sanction, not suspending proceedings. There is no text on lis pendens, same-subject-matter, same controller/processor, or proceedings pending in another state. Therefore, the GDPR requirement has no functional counterpart in the provided OMN texts.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-927", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 21, "total": 33}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 43}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information to conclusively determine the absence of a counterpart", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.5}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart may exist under different terminology or in Article 31", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "90a1f5873d102c323383", "span": "يجوز للمحكمة المختصة في نطاق تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون أن تحكم", "why": "Article 31 mentions the court's authority to rule on matters related to the law, which could be related to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["823830174d241884bd73", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "6e8de83975a220288296", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "caad155111190c1aa274", "a37f6f979ece2e1de6bf", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "90a1f5873d102c323383", "14d93ec3a517dd1d4e42", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 529.44, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b9e620159344562845b7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "dec351a1e477287e3b22"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints procedure; not about content of breach communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; unrelated to breach notification content."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated processing/decision-making; not about breach communications."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; does not prescribe what must be included in breach notices to data subjects."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO support/duties; no requirement to include DPO/contact details in breach communications."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; not about breach notification content."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "General controller obligations and records; not specific to breach notice content to data subjects."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment triggers; not about including contact details in breach communications."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Restriction of processing; not about breach notification content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على المتحكم", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "action": {"span": "أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "إخطار صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"يجب على المتحكم\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "include at least: (b) contact point; (c) likely consequences; (d) measures taken/proposed incl. mitigation in the data-subject communication", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله (no express requirement to include contact point or likely consequences)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"... ويجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله\"; cf. Article 19 (general contact channels, not content of breach notice)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "content of the communication to data subjects under Article 34(1)", "target": "إخطار صاحب البيانات عن الانتهاك/الاختراق مع تزويده بالإجراءات المتخذة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"أن يخطر صاحب البيانات ... وموافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله\""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "when communicating a personal data breach to data subjects pursuant to Article 34(1)", "target": "إذا كان الانتهاك/الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2): \"في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9(2)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed specific to this duty", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "UAE Article 9(2) requires notifying the data subject and providing the measures taken, but it does not mandate inclusion of a contact point or the likely consequences in that communication. Article 19 provides general contact channels and Article 13(h) addresses procedures in case of breach upon request, yet neither substitutes for the specific content requirements of GDPR Art. 34(2) cross-referencing 33(3)(b)-(d). Therefore, the target text covers only part of the GDPR unit.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-364", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction does not have a direct counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-364]", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "المادة (9) الإبلاغ عن انتهاك البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision requires the controller to notify the data subject and the authorities about the personal data breach, but does not explicitly mention the inclusion of information and measures referred to in points (b), (c), and (d) of Article 33(3) of the GDPR"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law may not explicitly cover all aspects of GDPR's Article 33(3)(b), (c), and (d) in the context of communicating a personal data breach to the data subject, particularly regarding the provision of a contact point and the likely consequences of the breach.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "Article 9(1): \"يجب على المتحكم بمجرد علمه بوجود أي اختراق أو انتهاك للبيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات الذي من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته، بإبلاغ المكتب عن هذا الاختراق أو الانتهاك\"", "why": "This provision indicates the controller must notify the Office about the breach but does not directly address the data subject's right to be informed about the breach in detail."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "Article 9(2): \"يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية، خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية\"", "why": "This provision requires the controller to inform the data subject about the breach under certain conditions but lacks specificity on the details that must be provided to the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "877fafe0080725188d05", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 570.96, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "24f2b5b39b587845580a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "General implementation duty for authorities; does not address penalties’ effectiveness, proportionality, or dissuasiveness."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; no relation to penalties or their characteristics."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementing decisions; no substantive standard for penalties (effective/proportionate/dissuasive)."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedures for data subject rights; not about penalties or the E-P-D standard."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from giving reasons; unrelated to penalties’ nature."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations; not a meta-rule on penalties."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from rights; not about penalties or ensuring E-P-D."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain obligations; not about penalty standards."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Competent authority may take necessary measures; no mention of penalties or E-P-D characteristics."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow restriction; unrelated to penalties."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "ensure that penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are effective, proportionate and dissuasive", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Articles 23 and 25 establish fixed maximum fines but contain no requirement that penalties be effective, proportionate, and dissuasive, nor any mandate on authorities to ensure such qualities. No cited provision in the target text articulates the E–P–D standard or an obligation on the state to guarantee it. General implementation or ‘necessary measures’ clauses do not bridge this textual gap.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-950", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict that the slot 'addressee' is 'uncovered' is not supported, as Article 27 could be interpreted as giving the competent authority a role in ensuring that penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This article gives the competent authority the power to take necessary measures to implement the law, which could include ensuring that penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive."}, {"id": "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال، كل من خالف أياً من أحكام المواد", "why": "This article imposes a penalty for non-compliance with certain provisions of the law, which could be seen as a counterpart to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not provide sufficient evidence to support the claim that the target jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "This article mentions a penalty, but it does not explicitly state that the penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive."}, {"id": "Article 25", "span": "يُعاقب الشخص المعنوي المخالف بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "This article mentions a penalty, but it does not explicitly state that the penalties are effective, proportionate, and dissuasive."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This article gives the competent administration the power to take necessary measures, but it does not explicitly mention penalties or their characteristics."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "9548224453cca1301899", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 631.78, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "84b1708f48a0a8d9ebf6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions only; no provision creating a right to individual compensation."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Lists data subject rights (withdrawal, rectification, copy, portability, erasure, breach notice) but does not provide compensation for damages."}, {"id": "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "reason": "Record-keeping obligations; no individual compensation mechanism."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Scope/exemptions from the law; not about remedies or compensation."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Regulatory powers and complaints administration; does not grant compensation to individuals."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Designation of DPO; unrelated to compensation."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "reason": "Allows filing complaints to the competent department, but contains no right to compensation for damages."}, {"id": "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "reason": "Administrative sanctions against entities; no victim compensation."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Allows complaints to the Ministry about non-compliance; does not provide compensation."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach response and guidance; no compensation right."}, {"id": "f09642dcc53965e1f6de", "reason": "Criminal fines for legal persons; no individual compensation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "source": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "source": null}, "action": {"span": null, "source": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "source": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "source": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "source": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "source": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "source": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "any person who has suffered material or non-material damage", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "right", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "receive compensation from the controller or processor for the damage suffered", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "damage resulting from an infringement of this Regulation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the person has suffered material or non-material damage as a result of an infringement of this Regulation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.84, "reasoning_note": "The target texts provide complaint mechanisms and administrative/criminal sanctions but contain no express right for an individual to obtain compensation for damage from a controller or processor. The only civil-liability-related clause treats the processor as the controller’s agent vis-à-vis third parties, without creating a data subject compensation right. Therefore, GDPR Art. 82’s compensation right is textually absent.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-929", "gdpr_article": 82, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct and explicit provision for the right to receive compensation for damages suffered due to an infringement in the target jurisdiction's provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "span": "في نطاق تطبيق أحكام المسؤولية المدنية", "why": "Indicates application of civil liability, which could imply a basis for compensation but does not directly state the right to receive compensation for damages suffered."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "span": "الضرر الناتج عن الاختراق", "why": "Refers to the damage resulting from a breach, indirectly relating to the concept of damage but not explicitly granting a right to compensation."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct provision for individual compensation for damages suffered due to infringement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام القانون", "why": "This provision allows for complaints about violations but does not explicitly mention compensation for damages."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Similar to the previous, this allows for complaints to the Ministry about non-compliant data processing but does not specify compensation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["caad155111190c1aa274", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "f6764b5004b8f04e4aa5", "823830174d241884bd73", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "f09642dcc53965e1f6de"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 622.17, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "18dad4945020f1aadacc", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
