"article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال المدة ووفقاً للإجراءات والشروط التي تحددها اللائحة التنفيذية لهذا المرسوم بقانون", "article": "Article 9(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "يجب على", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "describe in clear and plain language the nature of the personal data breach in the communication", "target_value": "Notify the data subject and provide the measures taken; no textual requirement to describe the nature of the breach or to use clear/plain language.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 9(2); cf. Article 9(1)(a) (nature of breach required only in notification to the Office)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "content of the communication to data subjects under Article 34(1)", "target_value": "Content element specified: \"موافاته بالإجراءات المتخذة من قبله\" (measures taken).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "when communicating a personal data breach to data subjects pursuant to Article 34(1)", "target_value": "Notification to the data subject is required if the breach would affect the privacy, confidentiality, and security of their personal data.", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Within the period determined by the executive regulations (خلال المدة ...)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 9(2)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for the content of the communication", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 9(2) requires the controller to notify the data subject and inform them of measures taken, but it does not require describing the nature of the breach or mandate clear/plain language. The requirement to state the nature of the breach appears only for notifications to the Office (Article 9(1)(a)). The reviewer’s implication argument is not supported by the text under a strict textual analysis.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-363", "gdpr_article": 34, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement of describing the nature of the personal data breach is incorrect.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "أ. بيان طبيعة الاختراق أو الانتهاك، وصورته، وأسبابه، والعدد التقريبي له وسجلاته.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to provide a statement of the nature of the breach, which is similar to the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incorrect interpretation of the provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "span": "يجب على المتحكم أن يخطر صاحب البيانات في حال كان الانتهاك أو الاختراق من شأنه المساس بخصوصية وسرية وأمن بياناته الشخصية", "why": "This provision implies that the controller has an obligation to notify the data subject of the breach, and although it does not explicitly state that the notification must include a description of the nature of the breach in clear and plain language, it can be argued that this is implied."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 671.76, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "447105b5dd56413d5ea8", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["3f916831456908af27d8", "498c9cb637b86367567b"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Breach-response steps by the competent department (assessment, notify data subjects, guidance); no mention of fines or sanctioning power."}, {"id": "6e8de83975a220288296", "reason": "Promulgation clause of the executive regulation; no operative enforcement powers."}, {"id": "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "reason": "Confers judicial enforcement capacity on ministry staff; does not grant authority to impose administrative fines."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Substantive processing prohibition; no supervisory powers or fines."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External audit requirement; not an enforcement fine."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation; not an enforcement power."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "DPO tasks; not an enforcement power."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Permit revocation grounds; an administrative measure but not an administrative fine power."}, {"id": "caad155111190c1aa274", "reason": "Definitions; no fine power."}, {"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "reason": "Processor’s administrative responsibility before the ministry; does not create a fining power."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8"}, "modality": {"span": "تتخذ الوزارة ... أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "article": "Article 8"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الوزارة (الجهة المشرفة على تطبيق القانون)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 7; Article 8"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "تتخذ الوزارة ... أياً من الإجراءات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "impose an administrative fine", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target_value": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 8 grants the Ministry broad remedial powers and discretion, but there is no textual authorization to impose an administrative fine, nor any fining framework analogous to GDPR Article 83. General clauses such as “any other measure it deems necessary” and Article 31’s “measures it deems appropriate” are not specific enough to infer a monetary administrative sanction. The listed measures (warnings, correction/erasure orders, suspensions, transfer bans) and permit revocation elsewhere indicate non-monetary tools; a fining power would ordinarily be expressed explicitly.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be partially correct, but the OMN law does provide some counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-147]", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This provision suggests that the Ministry has the power to take various measures to protect the rights of data subjects"}, {"id": "Article 7", "span": "إصدار الضوابط والإجراءات اللازمة لمعالجة البيانات الشخصية والتحقق من التزام المتحكم والمعالج بها", "why": "This provision could be interpreted as including the power to impose administrative fines"}, {"id": "Article 31", "span": "ما تراه مناسباً من الإجراءات", "why": "This provision mentions that the administration may take any measures it deems appropriate in response to a data breach"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention 'Article 83' or 'administrative fine', but Article 8 provides a general power to the Ministry to take measures to protect personal data, which could be interpreted as including the power to impose administrative fines.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "span": "أي إجراء آخر تراه الوزارة ضرورياً لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision gives the Ministry the power to take measures to protect personal data, which could be interpreted as including the power to impose administrative fines."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "span": "ولها اتخاذ ما تراه مناسباً من الإجراءات", "why": "This provision gives the Ministry the power to take measures it deems appropriate, which could be interpreted as including the power to impose administrative fines."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["38c6f7484322711d7d32", "6e8de83975a220288296", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "3ebf8596bc5a77b0eeea", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "3f916831456908af27d8", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "caad155111190c1aa274", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 653.48, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "026afb82636e2d7a52a3", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
