 "revise", "objection": "The provisions suggest that the data controller has significant responsibilities, which may include providing resources for the data protection officer.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "Article 10", "why": "This article mentions the role of the data protection officer and their responsibilities, which may imply that the controller is obliged to provide resources."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14", "why": "This article mentions the obligation of the data controller to notify the authority before starting data processing operations, which may imply that the controller has significant responsibilities."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8", "why": "This article discusses the security measures that the data controller must take to protect personal data, which may imply that the controller has significant responsibilities."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit mention of the controller's obligation to provide resources necessary for the data protection officer's tasks in the BHR legislation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "span": "يتولى مراقب حماية البيانات ما يأتي:", "why": "Article 10 discusses the data protection officer's role but does not explicitly mention the controller's obligation to provide necessary resources."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "0c872442bf005518c094", "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 622.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "db8f9be65296f4c708d5", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
