urt to contact foreign courts to verify parallel proceedings. No provision addresses the RU’s core action, modality, or condition. Functional mapping is possible only for the addressee and scope.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-1009", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["2ef716a5a0437defc8f2", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "0c6c8a278f0b3b395e23", "bcc7ee2c6007b34ff5a5"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 422.48, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "521a4eb19509214bd37c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["32f2136681f29047cd6a", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Concerns procedures for exercising data subject rights; does not address designation or structure of supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "General implementing authority for the minister; no text on designating a specific independent supervisory authority or sectoral oversight for religious bodies."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Addresses powers of judicial officers to detect violations; not about supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Sets controller exemptions; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from disclosure obligations; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; not about supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Execution clause for the law; does not create or authorize designation of supervisory authorities."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from stating reasons for refusal; unrelated to supervisory authority designation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "Member States", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "permission", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "designate a specific independent supervisory authority for supervising churches and religious associations that apply comprehensive rules under Article 91(1)", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "the designated specific authority fulfils the conditions laid down in Chapter VI of this Regulation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "The Qatari provisions define supervisory actors (a ministerial unit and any legally competent government entity) and complaints handling, but contain no text permitting designation of a specific independent supervisory authority for churches or religious associations. No independence criteria akin to GDPR Chapter VI are provided. The closest material concerns coordination with associations for self-regulation, not authority designation.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-978", "gdpr_article": 91, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "9548224453cca1301899", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314"], "n_llm_calls": 3, "latency_s": 323.6, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "8dbeb26d14e440264cb7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "e54c53229ed1382a5fb4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Institutional/coordination powers; does not regulate the wording or manner of information to individuals."}, {"id": "c098856a98e89debe630", "reason": "Sets mandatory content for direct marketing messages (identity, purpose, opt-out address) but does not require clear/plain language."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Concerns alignment of disclosures/transfers with legitimate purposes; no rule on how information is worded."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Internal governance and rights-enablement measures; no requirement about linguistic clarity of notices/communications."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General obligations (lawfulness, safeguards, policies); does not specify clear/plain language for data-subject information."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duty (to individual and authority) without any requirement of clear/plain language."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Promulgation/execution clause; not substantive."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality and retention; not about wording of information to individuals."}, {"id": "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "reason": "Definitions; contains no plain-language or clarity requirement."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 9"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد", "article": "Article 9"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي:", "article": "Article 9"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "صيغة إلزامية: \"على المراقب ... أن يُعلم\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 9"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "use clear and plain language for the information and communications provided", "target_value": "No express requirement to use clear/plain or child-appropriate language", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "the information and communications covered by Article 12(1), including information addressed specifically to a child", "target_value": "Pre-processing information to the individual (Article 9) and a notice on child-directed websites (Article 17)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 9; Article 17"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for any plain-language requirement", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for any plain-language requirement", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for any plain-language requirement", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated for any plain-language requirement", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.64, "reasoning_note": "Article 3’s transparency principle and Article 9’s duty to inform specify that disclosures must occur and what they must contain, but they do not require that such information be in clear and plain (or child-appropriate) language. Article 17 requires a notice for child-directed websites but likewise does not prescribe clarity/plainness of wording. Therefore, the GDPR’s specific manner-of-communication obligation is not textually present.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-049", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 9, "total": 9}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that there is no counterpart to the GDPR requirement is not entirely accurate, as some provisions in the Qatari law relate to the use of clear and plain language.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي:", "why": "This article requires the controller to inform the individual of certain information before processing their personal data, implying that the information should be comprehensible."}, {"id": "Article 17", "span": "يجب على مالك أو مشغل أي موقع إلكتروني موجه للأطفال، مراعاة ما يلي: 1- وضع إخطار على الموقع حول ماهية بيانات الأطفال، وكيفية استخدامها، والسياسات التي يتبعها في الإفصاح عنها.", "why": "This provision requires the owner or operator of a website directed at children to provide notice on the site about the collection and use of children's personal data, suggesting that the information should be clear and understandable."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions in the target jurisdiction imply a requirement for clear and plain language, contrary to the analyst's verdict.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3", "span": "لكل فرد الحق في حماية خصوصية بياناته الشخصية، ولا يجوز معالجة تلك البيانات إلا في إطار الشفافية والأمانة واحترام كرامة الإنسان والممارسات المقبولة", "why": "This provision implies that personal data should be processed in a transparent and honest manner, respecting human dignity and accepted practices, which could be interpreted as requiring clear and plain language."}, {"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to provide the individual with a description of the processing activities and any other necessary information, which could be interpreted as requiring clear and plain language."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["e54c53229ed1382a5fb4", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "c098856a98e89debe630", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "f5c366135483fe580381", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "455aae046cacf7979576", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 701.1, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "7226f1d01b075f993c10", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "db1b46495b01511abeef"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Requires the controller to provide DPO contact details to data subjects; does not impose or describe a processor obligation to designate a DPO."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Controller must include DPO contact in a permit application; does not create or describe a processor obligation to designate a DPO or any triggers."}, {"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Concerns documents attached to a controller’s permit application; no DPO designation duty for processors."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Obliges controller or processor to publish a privacy policy; unrelated to designating a DPO."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "Addresses appointment of an external auditor upon request; not about DPO designation."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights; no DPO designation rule."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Regulator’s powers and duties; no DPO designation rule for processors."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "Controller’s internal controls; no DPO designation rule."}, {"id": "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "reason": "Representation of incapacitated persons; unrelated to DPO designation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 20"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 20"}, "action": {"span": "بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 20"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "processor", "target": "controller (المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "obligation (يلتزم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "designate a data protection officer", "target": "تحديد/تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No specific scope expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "Triggers (a)-(c): public authority; large-scale regular/systematic monitoring; large-scale special/criminal data", "target": "No triggers stated (unconditional for controller)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 20; Art. 34"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "Courts acting in their judicial capacity excluded from point (a)", "target": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "The cited Omani provisions impose DPO designation on the controller, not on the processor, and contain no triggers or the courts-in-judicial-capacity exception. Although Art. 35 assigns the DPO tasks that relate to both controllers and processors (implying a DPO may interact with processors), there is no textual obligation on processors to designate a DPO. Therefore, the GDPR processor-specific duty under Art. 37(1) is not expressed in the target text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-431", "gdpr_article": 37, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 26}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential absence of explicit triggers and exceptions in provided provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Indicates an obligation to designate a data protection officer but lacks explicit triggers and exceptions"}, {"id": "Article 34", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، وفق الضوابط الآتية", "why": "Provides qualifications for the data protection officer but does not address triggers or exceptions explicitly"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully match the GDPR requirement unit [RU-431], but they imply a similar requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision mentions the controller's obligation to designate a data protection officer, but it does not explicitly mention the processor or the triggers."}, {"id": "Article 34", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، وفق الضوابط الآتية", "why": "The provision outlines the controller's obligation to designate a data protection officer, but it does not explicitly mention the processor or the triggers."}, {"id": "Article 5", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision implies that the controller is responsible for designating a data protection officer, but it does not explicitly mention the processor or the triggers."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "de5924c49336b5580d1e", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 702.06, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "d1ff476902e224320e72", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "877fafe0080725188d05", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information vis-à-vis a controller; does not address disclosure of official documents to the public or a balancing with public access."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability right; no relation to public access to official documents or permission to disclose them."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Regulator’s exemption powers for certain establishments; not about disclosure of official documents or reconciling public access with data protection."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward Data Protection Officer; no bearing on disclosure of official documents."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security of personal data; general safeguards, not a permission or framework for public access to official documents."}, {"id": "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "reason": "Cross-border transfers; unrelated to domestic disclosure of official documents to the public."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; does not establish or regulate disclosure of official documents."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها", "article": "Article 2(2)(b)"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون على ما يأتي: أ. البيانات الحكومية. ب. الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها.", "article": "Article 2(2)(a)-(b)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تكون المعالجة بطريقة عادلة وشفافة ومشروعة", "article": "Article 5(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "public authorities, public bodies, and private bodies performing a task carried out in the public interest that hold official documents", "target": "Excludes government entities: \"الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 2(2)(b)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "permission", "target": "not expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "disclose personal data contained in official documents they hold", "target": "not expressed (no reference to disclosure of official documents)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "personal data in official documents held for the performance of a task carried out in the public interest", "target": "Governmental data and government entities are outside the law’s scope", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 2(2)(a)-(b)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "disclosure is made in accordance with applicable law and aims to reconcile public access to official documents with data protection", "target": "General lawfulness/fairness/transparency principle; references elsewhere to prevailing legislation/public interest in specific contexts", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 5(1); Art. 15(2); Art. 16(3)(د)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "not expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "not expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": "not expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "I considered indirect links: the PDPL excludes government entities/data (Art. 2(2)(a)-(b)), and contains general lawfulness (Art. 5(1)) and public‑interest interplay in other rights contexts (Art. 15(2), Art. 16(3)(د)). However, it does not provide a permission or framework to disclose personal data in official documents or to reconcile such public access with data protection.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-957", "gdpr_article": 86, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 15}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict does not fully consider indirect or partial matches in the UAE law that could relate to the disclosure of personal data in official documents.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 2(2)(b)", "span": "الجهات الحكومية المتحكمة بالبيانات الشخصية أو تلك التي تقوم بمعالجتها", "why": "Exclusion of government entities from the law's scope could indirectly relate to public authorities or bodies performing public interest tasks."}, {"id": "Article 5", "span": "ضوابط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Controls for processing personal data emphasize fairness, transparency, and lawfulness, which could be a basis for disclosing personal data under certain conditions."}, {"id": "Article 7", "span": "الالتزامات العامة للمتحكم", "why": "General obligations of the controller include protecting personal data, which might indirectly relate to the protection of personal data in official documents."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "877fafe0080725188d05", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "a079a5ac446830a74bfc", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 532.02, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "71594e81f74eeb955e24", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Informational right to receive procedures, not the operative right to object; does not itself confer or define the objection right."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Erasure/correction rights; does not govern a general right to object to processing."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; not a substantive right to object to processing."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to objection to processing."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification obligations; unrelated to objection to processing."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not grant a data-subject right to object."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the statute; not a data-subject right."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent withdrawal; distinct from an objection right based on controller’s public/legitimate interest grounds."}, {"id": "9d65c2815c41a25064db", "reason": "Security measures; not about a right to object."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 17"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 17"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17"}, "scope": {"span": "إذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض التسويق المباشر بما في ذلك التنميط ذات العلاقة بالتسويق المباشر. وإذا كانت المعالجة لأغراض إجراء المسوح الإحصائية ... وإذا كانت المعالجة بالمخالفة لأحكام المادة (5).", "article": "Article 17"}, "condition": {"span": "في أي من الحالات الآتية:", "article": "Article 17"}, "exception": {"span": "إلا إذا كانت المعالجة لازمة لتحقيق المصلحة العامة (للمسوح الإحصائية). ولا يجوز الاعتراض على القرارات التي تصدر عن المعالجة المؤتمتة إذا كانت ضمن شروط التعاقد، أو ضرورية وفق تشريعات أخرى نافذة، أو تمت بموافقة مسبقة من صاحب البيانات.", "article": "Article 17(2) and Article 18(2)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "إيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 17"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17: \"يحق لصاحب البيانات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17: \"يحق\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "object to processing of personal data concerning him or her", "target_value": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 17: \"يحق لصاحب البيانات الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية وإيقاف المعالجة\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing based on point (e) or (f) of Article 6(1), including profiling based on those provisions", "target_value": "اعتراض مقصور على حالات محددة: التسويق المباشر (بما في ذلك التنميط المتعلق به)، والمسوح الإحصائية (مع استثناء للمصلحة العامة)، والمعالجة بالمخالفة للمادة 5؛ واعتراض على القرارات الناتجة عن المعالجة المؤتمتة (بما فيها التنميط).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 17(1)-(3); Art. 18(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "on grounds relating to the data subject's particular situation", "target_value": "لا يرد شرط يتعلق بـ\"الظروف الخاصة\"؛ الحقوق مشروطة بفئات حالات محددة (\"في أي من الحالات الآتية\")", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات: للمسوح الإحصائية إذا كانت لازمة للمصلحة العامة؛ ولا يجوز الاعتراض على قرارات المعالجة المؤتمتة إذا كانت تعاقدية أو لازمة بموجب قانون أو بموافقة مسبقة.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 17(2); Art. 18(2)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "at any time", "target_value": "غير منصوص عليه صراحة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إيقاف المعالجة (عند الاعتراض في الحالات المحددة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 17: \"وإيقاف المعالجة\""}], "holistic_label": "narrower", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "UAE law recognizes objection-type rights, but they are limited to specific purposes (direct marketing, some statistics, unlawful processing) and to automated-decision outcomes, not to all processing based on a controller’s public-interest or legitimate-interest grounds. It also lacks the GDPR condition of “grounds relating to the data subject’s particular situation” and the “at any time” temporal element. Articles 17, 18, and 16 together show distributed coverage of objection/restriction concepts, but collectively remain narrower than GDPR Art. 21(1).", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-178", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law partially covers the GDPR requirement, but does not fully align with it.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 17", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة", "why": "Provides the right to object to processing for direct marketing purposes, including profiling."}, {"id": "Article 18", "span": "المادة (18) حق المعالجة والمعالجة المؤتمتة", "why": "Provides the right to object to automated decision-making, including profiling."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction may have a counterpart to the GDPR requirement under different terminology and distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "span": "المادة (17) الحق في إيقاف المعالجة", "why": "This article grants the data subject the right to object to the processing of their personal data for direct marketing purposes, including profiling, and also for statistical surveys, unless the processing is necessary for the public interest."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "span": "المادة (18) حق المعالجة والمعالجة المؤتمتة", "why": "This article grants the data subject the right to object to decisions made by automated processing, including profiling."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "This article grants the data subject the right to restrict processing in certain circumstances, including when the data subject objects to the processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "877fafe0080725188d05", "c34922f387019af45e42", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "9d65c2815c41a25064db"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 647.97, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "ba732584c0ead4ee4a89", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "reason": "Licensing submission (privacy policy and breach precautions); does not impose design/operational measures obligation."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Disclosure of privacy policy and rights-exercise mechanisms; not a duty to implement technical/organisational measures."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Lawful basis/consent and transparency; unrelated to design-by-default/operations measures."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice to data subjects; not a requirement to implement protection measures."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; not controller obligations to design/implement measures."}, {"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General declaration of protection; no operative duty regarding measures."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External audit on request; ancillary oversight, not the primary measures obligation."}, {"id": "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "reason": "Record retention; not design/operational protection measures."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Data subject rights and breach notice; does not mandate controller design/operational measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم", "article": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "scope": {"span": "لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "condition": {"span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 13(a) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "Controller (المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 26 [495e30846d7a1f70c077]"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation (shall)", "target": "Obligation: \"يلتزم\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures for the processing", "target": "Require \"التدابير الفنية والإجرائية\" to ensure processing per the law; plus security controls and testing", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 26(1)-(3) [495e30846d7a1f70c077]; Article 28(9) [79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06]"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "measures may include pseudonymisation and aim to meet GDPR requirements and protect data subjects’ rights", "target": "Measures aim to ensure processing complies with the law; confidentiality, recovery, and testing are specified; no mention of pseudonymisation or an explicit rights-protection aim.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(c) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]; Article 26 [495e30846d7a1f70c077]"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "taking into account state of the art, cost of implementation, nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, and risks to rights and freedoms", "target": "Requires identifying risks to the data subject arising from processing; no express reference to state of the art, cost, or nature/scope/context/purpose.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(a) [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exception stated for these duties.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "both at design time (determination of means) and at the time of processing", "target": "Obligation framed \"عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية\"; no explicit design-time (by-design/by-default) requirement.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13 [a0a0194dd91481c29c6e]"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None specified in the requirement unit", "target": "No specific consequence tied to this duty in the cited provisions.", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.72, "reasoning_note": "Action is directly supported by the explicit duty to adopt “التدابير الفنية والإجرائية,” which functionally maps to technical and organisational measures (and is reinforced by Art. 26 and the RoPA item on technical/organizational security). The GDPR’s multifactor condition is only partially reflected—OMN requires risk identification but does not mention state of the art, cost, or nature/scope/context/purpose; likewise, the temporal element lacks a design-stage mandate. Hence a partial match overall.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-209", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 30}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The OMN law may not fully consider all the factors required by the GDPR when implementing technical and organizational measures for the processing of personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The provision does not explicitly mention the consideration of technological, economic, contextual, and risk factors."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully support the analyst's claim of a partial match, and the 'action' and 'condition' slots are not adequately covered.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بوضع الضوابط والإجراءات الواجب الالتزام بها عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "The article does not explicitly mention 'technical and organizational measures' as required by the GDPR."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "The article does not explicitly mention 'taking into account the state of the art, cost of implementation, and the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing, and risks to rights and freedoms' as required by the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["495e30846d7a1f70c077", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "40626451a5025d77cff5", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "3f916831456908af27d8", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "79ac84c7165bc6aa1c06", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "b08fd8d6893cd6de53e8", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 658.74, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "944b434dc1a9bdebb33e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; no rule for courts to contact other courts or coordinate parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Data subject rights to withdraw consent/object/delete/correct; nothing about courts or inter-court communication."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Investigative powers of ministry officers (judicial police) to detect violations; does not address court-to-court coordination."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions including compliance with a court order; no obligation on courts to communicate with other courts."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Administrative complaints and appeal to minister; no mention of courts or parallel proceedings."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security measures and processor notification; unrelated to judicial coordination."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no judicial coordination provision."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; unrelated."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and privacy policies; no court communication duty."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to individuals and authority; no judicial cooperation rule."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer to processor; no court-to-court contact rule."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access obligations; no relation to courts coordinating parallel proceedings."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "a competent court of a Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "contact the court in the other Member State to confirm the existence of the parallel proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "proceedings concerning the same subject matter as regards processing by the same controller or processor", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the court has information that such proceedings are pending in a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.94, "reasoning_note": "The provided Qatari provisions regulate data subject rights, controller/processor duties, exemptions, enforcement, and administrative complaints. None establish any court-to-court communication duty or a mechanism for confirming parallel proceedings. Therefore, no functional counterpart to GDPR Art. 81 is present in the cited texts.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-926", "gdpr_article": 81, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "75852a697f66691bfbfb"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 317.82, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "3ee6b83718e93fa4fae7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Grants the Authority power to accredit data protection officers (اعتماد مراقبي حماية البيانات) under Article 10; does not mention codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies for codes, nor the Article 41(2)(a)-(d) criteria."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Provides supervision/inspection of internal and external data protection officers; not about accrediting a body to monitor compliance with a code of conduct."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Addresses liability of legal-person DPO providers; contains no authority power to accredit code-of-conduct monitoring bodies or related criteria."}, {"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board’s general organizational powers; no reference to codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "129b122a7d0386567e65", "reason": "CEO’s administrative powers; no provision on codes of conduct or accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "3e6cee6b3f058328aa31", "reason": "Ministerial oversight of the Authority; unrelated to accreditation of monitoring bodies for codes of conduct."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of information; no accreditation or codes-of-conduct content."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection powers; does not establish accreditation of code monitoring bodies or criteria."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Rules for public registers; unrelated to codes of conduct or accreditation."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/blocking/erasure rights; no relevance to accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing exceptions; unrelated to accreditation of monitoring bodies."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions in a secondary decision; no provision establishing accreditation of code monitoring bodies."}], "target