ction or supervisory authority enforcement provisions) is supplied, I will reassess.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 0, "total": 0}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Insufficient information to confirm the absence of a counterpart in KWT legislation", "counter_evidence": [], "confidence": 0.0}], "n_candidates": 0, "candidate_ids": [], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 295.2, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "772a1bf099da2d11865b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["823830174d241884bd73", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "3f916831456908af27d8"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Addresses erasure requests to the controller, not judicial remedies or complaint/redress mechanisms."}, {"id": "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "reason": "Lists data subject rights (consent withdrawal, access, portability, etc.) but not a right to seek a judicial remedy."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Concerns administrative handling of breach notifications, not data subject remedies against a controller/processor."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Relates to controller authorization requirements; no remedy for data subjects."}, {"id": "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "reason": "Sets grounds for a controller to refuse data subject requests; not about judicial remedies."}, {"id": "546cfd19de051c612c06", "reason": "Procedures and timelines for data subject requests to controllers; no court remedy provided."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification to authority and data subjects; not a remedial avenue."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requires a privacy policy to include rights-exercise mechanisms; does not create a judicial remedy."}, {"id": "de8d26aee9201d58a52b", "reason": "Concerns revocation of controller authorization; not a data subject judicial remedy."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 12"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 12"}, "action": {"span": "التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "article": "Article 12"}, "scope": {"span": "التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 41"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 12"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة أقصاها (30) ثلاثون يوماً من تاريخ العلم اليقيني بالمخالفة", "article": "Article 41"}, "consequence": {"span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية: أ- إنذار المتحكم أو المعالج ... ب- الأمر بتصحيح ومحو البيانات الشخصية ... ج- وقف معالجة البيانات الشخصية بشكل مؤقت، أو دائم. د- وقف تحويل البيانات الشخصية إلى دولة أخرى، أو منظمة دولية.", "article": "Article 8"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يجوز (may/permitted) to lodge a complaint", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "seek an effective judicial remedy before a court against a controller or processor", "target_value": "التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة/الإدارة المختصة (administrative complaint)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Articles 12, 41"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "in addition to any available administrative or non-judicial remedies, including the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority", "target_value": "Availability of administrative/non-judicial complaint mechanisms", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Articles 12, 41"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "the data subject considers their GDPR rights have been infringed due to non-compliant processing", "target_value": "إذا رأى أن المعالجة لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 12"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "30-day limit from certain knowledge to file complaint", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 41"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Authority may warn, order correction/erasure, suspend processing or transfers", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 8"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "OMN law clearly provides administrative complaint avenues and associated redress by the authority, which partially addresses the remedial aspect. However, there is no express right to bring a court action against a controller or processor. Thus, the core ‘judicial remedy before a court’ element of GDPR Art. 79 remains unmet, even though non-judicial remedies exist.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-915", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of direct counterpart to GDPR's requirement for seeking an effective judicial remedy", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "why": "This provision mentions the right to lodge a complaint but does not explicitly provide for a judicial remedy."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة", "why": "Similar to the previous, it allows for complaints but does not specify judicial action."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of uncovered aspects, especially regarding the modality (right) and action (seek an effective judicial remedy), may be too broad. While the provisions do not directly mirror the GDPR's language on seeking judicial remedies, they do provide avenues for complaint and redress that could be interpreted as partial coverage under different terminology.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "why": "This provision indicates a right to lodge a complaint, which could be seen as a form of redress, albeit not explicitly judicial."}, {"id": "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية أو لأي شخص آخر ذي مصلحة التقدم بشكوى أو بلاغ للإدارة المختصة", "why": "Similar to the previous point, this provision supports the idea that there are mechanisms for complaint and potential redress, even if not framed as judicial remedies."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "823830174d241884bd73", "3f916831456908af27d8", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "db6e2be94f2388e169a8", "546cfd19de051c612c06", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "b9380a5b8800d55add8c", "de8d26aee9201d58a52b"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 693.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "ea052511b4ff3ede332f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Addresses provider security obligations and internal complaint/intake systems, not a data subject's right to a judicial remedy against supervisory authority inaction or delay."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Sets lawful bases for processing; does not concern complaints to a supervisory authority or judicial remedies."}, {"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Concerns breach notification duties; no rights to judicial remedies or supervisory authority complaint handling."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General provisions on guidance and sanctions; does not establish a judicial remedy for data subjects regarding supervisory authority inaction."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"text": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"text": null, "article": null}, "action": {"text": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"text": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"text": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"text": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"text": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"text": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each data subject", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain an effective judicial remedy before a court", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "regarding a complaint lodged under Article 77", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority competent under Articles 55 and 56 does not handle the complaint or does not inform the data subject on its progress or outcome within three months", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Without prejudice to any other administrative or non-judicial remedy", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.9, "reasoning_note": "The provided Kuwaiti provisions set controller obligations, breach notifications, and regulator powers, but they do not grant data subjects a right to seek a judicial remedy due to supervisory authority inaction or delay on a complaint. No timeframe, court access, or linkage to authority complaint handling appears. Therefore, the GDPR Art. 78 right is not expressed.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-912", "gdpr_article": 78, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 3}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 4}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 4, "candidate_ids": ["2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "a418980931b429c7909a"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 363.5, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "c5686f7f87400248a83d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Authority powers and promotional functions; not controller implementation measures."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial rulemaking on data subject rights procedures; not measures by controllers."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; does not specify implementing measures to ensure/demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "Enactment/implementation clause; no substantive controller obligations."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General principle/right; not an operational requirement to implement measures."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Substantive data principles (minimization, accuracy, storage); not the meta-duty to implement measures and demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption on giving reasons for refusing rights; irrelevant to Art. 24-type measures."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/law enforcement exemptions; not about controller measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي:", "article": "Article 8"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعين", "article": "Article 8"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة.", "article": "Article 8"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8"}, "condition": {"span": "ويجب أن تكون تلك الاحتياطات متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية المراد حمايتها.", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8: \"يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي:\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "صيغة الإلزام: \"يتعين\" / \"يجب\"", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8; Article 13"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is in accordance with the Regulation", "target_value": "اتخاذ احتياطات/تدابير إدارية وفنية ومادية مناسبة لحماية البيانات؛ وإجراء عمليات تدقيق ومراجعة عن مدى الالتزام", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(3); Article 11(7), (8)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "واجبات على المراقب تتعلق بـ \"معالجة البيانات الشخصية\" و\"عمليات معالجة\"", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1); Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "تكون الاحتياطات متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية؛ مراعاة ضوابط التصميم وتقييم قبل عمليات معالجة جديدة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13 (\"متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات...\"); Article 8(2); Article 11(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا يُنص على استثناء متعلق بهذا الواجب في المواد المختارة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No specific exception in Articles 8, 11, 12, 13"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No temporal qualifier specified"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "No consequence clause in the cited provisions"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Agreed with the objection: Article 13 calibrates measures only by the nature and importance of the personal data, not by scope, context, purposes, or risks to rights and freedoms. Nevertheless, Articles 8 and 11 impose the core duty to implement appropriate technical/organisational measures and to conduct audits, supporting the ‘ensure’ and ‘demonstrate’ aspects. The remaining gap is the narrower risk/context factors compared to GDPR Art. 24.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law does not explicitly require the controller to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with the law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "يجب على كل من المراقب والمعالج اتخاذ الاحتياطات اللازمة لحماية البيانات الشخصية من الضياع أو التلف أو التعديل أو الإفشاء، أو الوصول إليها، أو استخدامها بشكل عارض أو غير مشروع.", "why": "This article requires the controller and processor to take necessary measures to protect personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the need to demonstrate compliance."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية، وفقاً لما تحدده الإدارة المختصة.", "why": "This article requires the controller to take administrative, technical, and material measures to protect personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the need to demonstrate compliance."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target provision (Article 13) does not fully align with the GDPR requirement for taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "span": "متناسبة مع طبيعة وأهمية البيانات الشخصية المراد حمايتها", "why": "This provision only considers the nature and importance of the personal data, but not the scope, context, and purposes of processing, as well as the risks to the rights and freedoms of natural persons."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "f5c366135483fe580381", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "455aae046cacf7979576", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 673.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "6c8d96feb8c0ef744ee6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "9548224453cca1301899", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest derogations; not about ensuring implementation of penalties."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller duties on processing/security; not about state measures to implement penalties."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising data subject rights; unrelated to implementing penalties."}, {"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality/retention obligations on controllers; not about penalty implementation."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Exemption from disclosing reasons to individuals; unrelated to implementing penalties."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duty; not about ensuring penalties are implemented."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه", "article": "Article 32"}, "modality": {"span": "على ... تنفيذ هذا القانون", "article": "Article 32"}, "action": {"span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": "جميع الجهات المختصة (وكذلك الوزير والإدارة المختصة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art.32; Art.31; Art.27"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على ... تنفيذ هذا القانون; يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art.32; Art.31"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "take all measures necessary to ensure that the penalties laid down under Article 84(1) are implemented", "target_value": "اتخاذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لتطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون؛ إصدار القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ الأحكام؛ تنفيذ هذا القانون", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art.27; Art.31; Art.32; Art.29"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "أحكام هذا القانون", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art.27"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.57, "reasoning_note": "While no provision explicitly says “ensure penalties are implemented,” the law imposes a general duty on competent authorities to implement the law, empowers the minister to issue decisions necessary for implementation, and authorizes the competent administration to take all necessary measures to apply and implement the law—functionally encompassing penalty implementation. Enforcement powers to detect and establish offences further support the implementation of penalties. Because the text does not single out penalties expressly, coverage is assessed as partial.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-949", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The cited provisions do not directly support the implementation of penalties as specified in the GDPR proposition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 32", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "why": "Does not explicitly mention penalties or their implementation."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Suggests a broader scope than just implementing penalties."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly address the implementation of penalties as stated in the proposition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 32", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "why": "Does not explicitly mention penalties or their implementation."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Does not specifically address the implementation of penalties."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["83fae53ff99059f02f05", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "ee1ae0df2d9432ae32a5", "9548224453cca1301899", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "455aae046cacf7979576", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 672.47, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "880c75b1ad8273eb4b69", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "0897840c01b58a706cd5", "reason": "Defines violations and administrative penalties via Cabinet decision; no mention of a supervisory authority annual report or permission to list infringements/measures."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Sets complaint procedures and office powers; does not address content of an annual report or permissions to include lists."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of application; unrelated to supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "reason": "Data protection impact assessments; no annual report or reporting content."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties towards Data Protection Officer; no provision on supervisory authority annual reporting."}, {"id": "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "reason": "Controller communication methods; not about supervisory authority reports."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification and office verification/sanctions; no authority annual report or listing requirement/permission."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Processing principles; no relation to supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "DPO roles; no supervisory authority annual report content."}, {"id": "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "reason": "Processor obligations/records; unrelated to supervisory authority annual report."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Data subject right to information; not about supervisory authority annual report."}, {"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Automated decision-making; not about supervisory authority annual report."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "include in the annual report a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken in accordance with Article 58(2)", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "content of the annual activity report", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided UAE PDPL articles establish an annual report by the supervisory authority or permit inclusion of lists of infringements and measures. While some provisions address complaints, breaches, and sanctions, they do not concern annual reporting content. Therefore the GDPR requirement is not represented in the target text.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 19}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 20}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["0897840c01b58a706cd5", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "fdfffc71ce002ff82134", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "dec351a1e477287e3b22", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "0cc06e3d3b107448da5a", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "c34922f387019af45e42"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 363.87, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "56e510f330e03d68ebba", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["fca1aa50445ca4475333", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access/notification/copy rights; no right to restrict or functionally equivalent remedy in the stated unlawful-processing scenario."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow limitation; unrelated to data subject’s right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions on disclosure/transfer to processor; no individual right to restrict."}, {"id": "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; does not create a data subject right to restrict."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no substantive right relevant to restriction."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest derogations; not a data subject right to restrict."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General right to privacy; too general to constitute or imply a specific right to restrict processing as an alternative to erasure."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification; not a restriction right."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access right (Art. 6); no bearing on restriction right."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; procedural remedy, not the substantive right to restrict processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الفرد", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز للفرد", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "إذا كانت غير ضرورية لتحقيق الأغراض التي جمعت من أجلها، أو كانت زائدة على متطلباتها، أو تمييزية أو مجحفة أو مخالفة للقانون", "article": "Article 5(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "في أي وقت", "article": "Article 5 (chapeau)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "الفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يجوز للفرد", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target_value": "الاعتراض على معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(2)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target_value": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 5(2)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure of the personal data and requests restriction of their use instead", "target_value": "إذا كانت ... مخالفة للقانون (ضمن أسباب أخرى للاعتراض)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في أي وقت", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 5 (chapeau)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "Considering combined provisions, Article 5(2) grants a right to object when processing is unlawful, which functionally curtails processing, but the law does not articulate a right to restrict processing as an alternative to erasure when the individual prefers restriction. Article 11 reinforces controller processes for certain requests (access/correction/deletion) but does not add a restriction remedy. Thus, only partial equivalence is achieved.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 8, "total": 8}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly mention the right to request restriction of processing, and the analyst's citations do not fully support the verdict.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "span": "Article 5(2)", "why": "This provision mentions the right to object to the processing of personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the right to request restriction of processing."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "Article 6", "why": "This provision mentions the right to access and review personal data, but it does not explicitly mention the right to request restriction of processing."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion might overlook how combined provisions could provide a functional equivalent to the GDPR's right to restrict processing, despite differences in terminology or specific actions described.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "span": "Article 5(2)", "why": "This provision, while not directly matching the GDPR's requirement, does offer individuals control over their personal data when processing is unlawful, suggesting a potential functional equivalent when considered in conjunction with other rights and provisions."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "f169b712b14aea8718ee", "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 678.94, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "41f696969dc083513b87", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "General lawful-basis conditions for processing; not about breach notification to the authority."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Civil compensation; does not regulate breach notification to the authority."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO functions and reporting; not the controller’s breach-notification duty to the authority."}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "Data quality principles; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Direct marketing objection right; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Referral of DPO to investigation; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sensitive data processing conditions; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal proceedings data; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Penalties; does not set the breach-notification obligation’s elements."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject correction/erasure rights; not about breach notification."}, {"id": "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf", "reason": "Internal investigation and record-keeping; not a duty to notify the authority of a breach."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "modality": {"span": "ويجب عليه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "scope": {"span": "إخطار الهيئة", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "condition": {"span": "بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "exception": {"span": "ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "article": "Article 4(b)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات (data controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"يلتزم مدير البيانات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (shall)", "target_value": "obligation (\"يلتزم\" / \"يجب عليه\")", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"ويجب عليه\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "notify the competent supervisory authority of the personal data breach", "target_value": "notify the Authority of the data breach/violation", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"إخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "to the supervisory authority competent in accordance with Article 55", "target_value": "to the national Data Protection Authority (\"الهيئة\")", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"إخطار الهيئة\""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "in the case of a personal data breach", "target_value": "upon occurrence/discovery of a data breach or violation", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "unless the breach is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target_value": "unless the breach is unlikely to lead to a risk threatening data subjects’ rights", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"ما لم يكن من غير المحتمل أن يؤدي خرق البيانات إلى خطر يُهدد حقوق أصحاب البيانات\""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay after becoming aware of the breach", "target_value": "within 72 hours from discovery; if later, notification must include reasons for delay", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 4(b) (1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3): \"خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه... يجب أن يكون الإخطار مشفوعاً بمبررات التأخير\""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No specific consequence stated in this provision", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Article 4(b) squarely imposes a controller duty to notify the Authority of a data breach and contains the same risk-based exception. The temporal element differs: Bahrain sets a hard 72-hour deadline (with reasons if exceeded) rather than the GDPR’s “without undue delay,” so the target is weaker on timeliness. This addresses the objection by treating the 72-hour standard as not fully aligning with GDPR’s undue-delay requirement.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-345", "gdpr_article": 33, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 31}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law does not explicitly state that the notification should be made 'without undue delay' as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "يجب على مدير البيانات وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "The provision specifies a 72-hour timeframe for notification, which might not always be considered 'without undue delay'."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on a provision that does not fully align with the GDPR requirement, and the citation provided does not support the claim that the target jurisdiction has a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "span": "يجب على مدير البيانات وضع إجراءات محددة لإخطار الهيئة بحدوث خرق أو انتهاك للبيانات خلال مدة لا تجاوز اثنان وسبعين ساعة من وقت اكتشافه", "why": "This provision seems to contradict the GDPR requirement, which states that the notification shall be made without undue delay after becoming aware of the breach."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["762372b7329c44286e43", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "cbcb4f73e9dfbf01c9bf"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 698.85, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "1efefcc6e45d1774e192", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
