{"candidates_selected": ["3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "9548224453cca1301899", "32f2136681f29047cd6a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Sets procedures for exercising data subject rights; does not address designation of a controller or criteria for its nomination."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Creates exemptions from access-related obligations; no relation to determining a controller or nomination criteria."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Obligations of the controller and ministerial policies; does not provide for designating a controller or nomination criteria."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Prohibits limiting cross-border data flows; unrelated to controller designation."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer to a processor; not about appointing/designating the controller."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Empowers enforcement officers; unrelated to designation or nomination criteria for controllers."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; does not address controller designation."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Lists functions of the competent administration (awareness, research, coordination); no designation power over controllers."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Substantive exemptions for certain processing bases; does not provide for designating a controller or nomination criteria."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الوزير", "article": "Article 31"}, "modality": {"span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر", "article": "Article 18"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: 1- حماية الأمن الوطني والأمن العام. 2- حماية العلاقات الدولية للدولة. 3- حماية المصالح الاقتصادية أو المالية للدولة. 4- منع أي جريمة جنائية، أو جمع معلومات عنها، أو التحقيق فيها.", "article": "Article 18"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Union or Member State legislator", "target_value": "الوزير (and, separately, الجهة المختصة)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["Article 31: يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون.", "Article 18: للجهة المختصة أن تقرر ..."], "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر / يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["Article 18", "Article 31"], "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide for the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "designation of the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": [], "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the purposes and means of the processing of personal data are determined by Union or Member State law", "target_value": "الأغراض محددة بنص القانون (الأمن الوطني، العلاقات الدولية، المصالح الاقتصادية أو المالية، منع/التحقيق في الجرائم) مع تمكين الجهة المختصة من تقرير المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": ["Article 18"], "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": [], "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.56, "reasoning_note": "Article 18 supports the condition partially by setting statutory purposes and conferring a power to decide processing, but it does not determine the means nor address controller designation. Article 31 is a general implementation clause and does not provide authority to designate the controller or set nomination criteria. No target provision expressly allows the legislator (or an empowered body) to provide for the controller or criteria for its nomination when processing is determined by law.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-013", "gdpr_article": 4, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 10}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart might exist in Articles 18 and 31", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون، وذلك لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية...", "why": "Provides the competent authority with the power to decide on the processing of personal data under certain circumstances"}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "span": "يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "Implies that the Minister has the power to issue decisions, which could include providing for the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is incomplete, as the condition slot is uncovered, but the provisions suggest a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 18", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون", "why": "This article implies that the purposes and means of processing can be determined by the competent authority."}, {"id": "Article 31", "span": "يصدر الوزير القرارات اللازمة لتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article suggests that the Minister has the power to provide for the controller or the specific criteria for its nomination."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "9548224453cca1301899", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "32f2136681f29047cd6a", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "850decaffbbae78d371d"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 651.41, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b15f6564a7d14ef507f6", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "3f916831456908af27d8", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "reason": "General statement that personal data are protected; does not create or target a duty for public authorities in inquiry contexts."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Complaints mechanism; no operative rule about how public authorities must process data received for inquiries."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Institutional powers of the ministry; not a substantive processing obligation for the scenario."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Confidentiality and security safeguards generally; not specific to public authorities receiving data for inquiries."}, {"id": "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "reason": "Restriction on publishing/disclosing certain data; does not regulate subsequent processing by public authorities after receipt in an inquiry."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "General consent/processing principle; not specific to the receipt of data by public authorities for a particular inquiry."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج", "article": "Article 15"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 15"}, "action": {"span": "لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 15"}, "scope": {"span": "تسري أحكام هذا القانون على البيانات الشخصية التي تتم معالجتها", "article": "Article 2"}, "condition": {"span": "كشف أو منع أي جريمة جزائية بناء على طلب رسمي مكتوب من جهات التحقيق", "article": "Article 3"}, "exception": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم في الأحوال الآتية: ... ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "article": "Article 3"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "إنذار المتحكم أو المعالج، بالمخالفة التي تقع منه لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 8"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "public authorities", "target_value": "Controllers and processors generally; public administrative units executing legal competences are exempted.", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 15; Article 3(b)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يلتزم (shall/must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 15"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "process those personal data in compliance with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing", "target_value": "Ensure processing is in accordance with the law; purposes are specified in permitting documentation", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 15; Article 13(c); Article 5 (permit content: 'الغرض من معالجة البيانات الشخصية')"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing of personal data received in the framework of a particular inquiry", "target_value": "General application to processing of personal data (no specific tie to ‘receipt’ in a particular inquiry)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 2"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "they receive personal data in the framework of a particular inquiry in accordance with Union or Member State law", "target_value": "Official written request from investigative authorities (context of criminal inquiry/investigation)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3(و)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Law inapplicable where public administrative units perform legally assigned competences; also for investigative requests", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 3(b), 3(و)"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Administrative measures (warning, correction/erasure, suspension, etc.) for violations", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 8"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 3 explicitly contemplates investigative contexts but does so to exempt such processing (including by public authorities) from the law’s application. While Oman imposes general compliance duties on controllers/processors (Arts. 15, 13) and requires purposes to be identified in certain filings, it does not impose the GDPR-equivalent duty on public authorities processing data received for a particular inquiry. Therefore the condition is textually acknowledged, but the operative obligation for that scenario is missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-012", "gdpr_article": 4, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Misinterpretation of modality and action slots in relation to public authorities' obligations and exemptions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون.", "why": "This article establishes an obligation for controllers and processors to comply with ministry-determined controls and procedures, ensuring personal data processing aligns with the law."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of 'uncovered' for the condition slot may be too absolute given the exemptions and obligations outlined in Articles 3 and 15, which could imply a form of regulation for processing personal data in specific contexts.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3", "span": "ب- تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "This exemption could relate to processing data in the context of public authorities' legal competences, potentially aligning with the concept of processing data in accordance with Union or Member State law for particular inquiries."}, {"id": "Article 15", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم والمعالج بالضوابط والإجراءات التي تقررها الوزارة، لضمان أن معالجة البيانات الشخصية تمت وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This obligation to adhere to ministry-set controls and procedures for ensuring compliance with the law in personal data processing could indirectly support the notion of processing data according to applicable rules."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "3f916831456908af27d8", "823830174d241884bd73", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 770.56, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "84aaca1d1e40a7b89156", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Sets substantive conditions/exemptions for processing sensitive data; does not confer a legislator’s power to restrict data-subject rights/obligations nor set Art. 23-type safeguards."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Concerns Data Protection Officer roles and duties; unrelated to legislative restrictions of rights/obligations."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Defines authority’s tasks/powers; does not provide a legislative-measure restriction regime on rights/obligations."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations on controllers/processors; not about legislator-imposed restrictions on rights/obligations."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual requirements; does not address restricting data-subject rights by legislative measure."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent formalities and withdrawal; unrelated to the power to restrict rights/obligations by law."}, {"id": "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "reason": "Board can issue implementing regulations, not a general legislative power with necessity/proportionality limits to restrict data rights."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal data categories; not a clause restricting the scope of data-subject rights/obligations in the sense of GDPR Art. 23."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection/enforcement powers; not about restricting rights/obligations by legislative measure."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality duties of the authority and disclosure exceptions; does not concern restricting data-subject rights/obligations."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": "لا تسري أحكام المواد (3) و(4) و(5) من هذا القانون على معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم حصراً للأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية ...؛ ولا يسري حكم البند (1) من هذه المادة على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور الاطلاع عليه، إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة للتصحيح أو الحَجْب أو المسح.", "article": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم حصراً للأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية؛ أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور الاطلاع عليه إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة.", "article": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "بِشَرط: أن تكون البيانات صحيحة ودقيقة ... وتوافر تدابير تكفل عدم استخدام البيانات لأغراض أخرى ... وعدم الإخلال بتشريعات تنظيم الصحافة والطباعة والنشر؛ وإذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة للتصحيح أو الحَجْب أو المسح.", "article": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "Union or Member State legislator", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "restrict, by legislative measure, the scope of the obligations and rights in Arts. 12–22 and 34, and of Art. 5 insofar as it corresponds to Arts. 12–22", "target_value": "لا تسري أحكام المواد (3) و(4) و(5) ... على ... الأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية؛ ولا يسري حكم ... على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور ... إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "laws to which controllers or processors are subject", "target_value": "سياقات محددة: المعالجة للأغراض الصحفية/الفنية/الأدبية؛ السجلات العامة التي يحدد قانونها إجراءات معينة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "only if the restriction respects the essence of fundamental rights and freedoms and is necessary and proportionate in a democratic society to safeguard specified public interests", "target_value": "شروط تتعلق بدقة البيانات وتدابير الاستخدام وعدم الإخلال بتشريعات الصحافة؛ وقيام القانون المنشئ للسجل بتحديد إجراءات معينة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Art. 6; Art. 23(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "I accept the objection: Art. 6 (and Art. 23(2)) create specific statutory carve-outs but do not establish a general legislative power to restrict rights subject to necessity/proportionality, protection of the essence of rights, or the enumerated public interests. The Bahraini texts therefore do not cover GDPR Art. 23’s conditional empowerment; they only show narrow, context-specific disapplications.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-195", "gdpr_article": 23, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for some slots might be incorrect, as there are provisions that seem to be related to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-195].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "span": "معالَجة البيانات لأغراض الصحافة أو الآداب أو الفنون لا تسري أحكام المواد (3) و(4) و(5) من هذا القانون على معالَجة البيانات الشخصية التي تتم حصراً للأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية، بشرط: أ - أن تكون البيانات صحيحة ودقيقة وتخضع لعمليات التحديث والتصحيح.", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the restriction of obligations and rights."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "لا يسري حكم البند (1) من هذه المادة على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور الاطلاع عليه، إذا تطلَّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة للتصحيح أو الحَجْب أو المسح.", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the scope of the obligations and rights."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "span": "بشرط: ج - عدم الإخلال بالتشريعات المعمول بها بشأن تنظيم الصحافة والطباعة والنشر.", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the condition of respecting the essence of fundamental rights and freedoms."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's reasoning is flawed, and the cited provisions do not support the claimed partial match.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "span": "لا تسري أحكام المواد (3) و(4) و(5) من هذا القانون على ... الأغراض الصحفية أو الفنية أو الأدبية; ولا يسري حكم البند (1) على أيّ سجل متاح للجمهور ... إذا تطلّب القانون المنشئ للسجل إجراءات معينة", "why": "This provision is related to the exemption of certain data processing activities from the law's provisions, rather than the power of the legislator to restrict the scope of obligations and rights."}, {"id": "9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "span": "بشرط ... (دقة البيانات؛ تدابير منع الاستخدام لغير الأغراض؛ عدم الإخلال بتشريعات الصحافة والطباعة والنشر)", "why": "This provision is related to the conditions for data processing, rather than the condition for restricting the scope of obligations and rights."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["9cd82ef51e2d36369a4f", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 745.58, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "5994b9aa6ba9c5cb71c4", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
