2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 29}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 33}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be too conservative, and there may be some provisions that could be interpreted as providing a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-432].", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، وتحدد اللائحة ضوابط اختيار هذا المسؤول ومهامه.", "why": "This provision mentions the appointment of a data protection officer, which could be applicable to a group of undertakings."}, {"id": "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "span": "يجب على المتحكم نشر البيانات المتعلقة بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية، والتي تتضمن اسمه وبيانات التواصل معه بأي وسيلة، ولصاحب البيانات الشخصية الحق في الاتصال بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية في كل المسائل المتعلقة بمعالجة بياناته الشخصية.", "why": "This provision outlines the tasks of the data protection officer, which includes coordinating with the relevant administration on matters related to personal data processing, suggesting that the data protection officer has a role that can be applied to a group of undertakings."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "span": "في نطاق تطبيق حكم المادة (5) من القانون، يلتزم المتحكم بالحصول على تصريح من الوزارة قبل معالجة أي من البيانات الشخصية وفقاً للنموذج المعد لذلك، متضمناً البيانات الآتية: 1- الاسم والعنوان والبريد الإلكتروني لمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية.", "why": "This provision requires the controller to provide the name and contact information of the data protection officer, implying that the data protection officer is a single point of contact, which could be applicable to a group of undertakings."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not explicitly support the claim that a group of undertakings can appoint a single data protection officer with the condition of being easily accessible from each establishment.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 20", "span": "يلتزم المتحكم بتحديد مسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Does not explicitly mention a group of undertakings appointing a single data protection officer."}, {"id": "Article 36", "span": "يجب على المتحكم نشر البيانات المتعلقة بمسؤول حماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Addresses publication of contact information but not the condition of accessibility from each establishment."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["6822d8664264bc19842c", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "a2a61b7c9316716b7e74", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 698.36, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "92cb31e29faef1e10b44", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Access/notification rights vis-à-vis controllers; does not provide a judicial remedy before a court or address supervisory authority inaction."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access obligations; no judicial remedy for data subjects and no link to supervisory authority complaints."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; unrelated to remedies or complaints."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Substantive exemptions for controllers; not about data subject judicial remedies or supervisory authority inaction."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest processing; no data subject judicial remedy mechanism."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Data subject operational rights (withdrawal, objection, deletion, rectification); no court remedy or supervisory authority complaint handling."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duties; not a judicial remedy for individuals."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Inspection/enforcement powers (judicial police status) for officials; no individual court remedies."}, {"id": "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "reason": "Penal sanctions; does not create a right to a judicial remedy before a court for data subjects."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Implementing decisions by the minister; no rights to judicial remedies for data subjects."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "reason": "Administrative powers of the competent authority to take measures; does not grant data subjects a judicial (court) remedy or address inaction timelines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للفرد", "article": "Article 26"}, "modality": {"span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى", "article": "Article 26"}, "action": {"span": "يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 26"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "each data subject", "target_value": "الفرد (the individual/data subject) may initiate a complaint", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى (the individual may/lawful entitlement to file a complaint)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain an effective judicial remedy before a court", "target_value": "Administrative complaint to the competent authority (يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة); no mention of courts or judicial remedies for the individual", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 26", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "regarding a complaint lodged under Article 77", "target_value": "No provision linking any court remedy to a supervisory-authority complaint; only an administrative complaint mechanism is stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority does not handle the complaint or does not inform on progress/outcome within three months", "target_value": "No handling/information duty timeframe for the authority vis-à-vis the complainant; no three-month trigger", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Without prejudice to any other administrative or non-judicial remedy", "target_value": "No such savings/without-prejudice clause", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None stated regarding a judicial remedy", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "mostly_uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Articles 26 and 27 establish an administrative complaint to the competent authority and empower that authority, but they do not grant the data subject a judicial remedy before a court or any right triggered by the authority’s inaction within three months. Article 26 mentions only intra-administrative steps (authority decision; controller/processor may appeal to the minister), not court review for the complainant. Therefore the action (judicial remedy), the specific scope, and the inaction/timeline condition remain uncovered.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-912", "gdpr_article": 78, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 14}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 16}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim of uncovered slots might be too hasty, given potential interpretations of the provided provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "why": "This provision implies a right to submit a complaint, potentially leading to a judicial remedy."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "ويجوز للمراقب أو المعالج التظلم من هذا القرار، إلى الوزير", "why": "This provision mentions an appeal process, which could lead to a judicial remedy."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The action slot may not be entirely uncovered, as Article 26 and Article 27 provide mechanisms that could be interpreted as a form of judicial remedy.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "This provision mentions the right to lodge a complaint with the competent administration, which could be a form of judicial remedy."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "This provision grants the competent administration the power to take all necessary measures to apply and enforce the provisions of the law, which could include providing a judicial remedy."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "f5c366135483fe580381", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "9548224453cca1301899", "192caaa530952a30ad50"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 735.04, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "9cced13e0ccab74a7fc5", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
