t is silent on any permission to include a list of types of infringements notified and types of measures taken. No other provided provision specifies or permits such content. Therefore, the GDPR permission is not evidenced in the target texts.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions supplied do not provide sufficient evidence to support the proposition.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 44", "span": "المهام والصلاحيات", "why": "The article mentions the preparation of an annual report, but does not explicitly mention the permission to include a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["601ddc5fd8dcb81306cb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "b334fb41dcb796c50b6b", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "129b122a7d0386567e65", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 604.8, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "095d8b38c74d24cd71ea", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "b157dcad6a3e8daf5f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Pre-processing notice content to data subjects; no duty to inform other controllers upon erasure."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "General consent and transparency requirement; unrelated to post-erasure notification to other controllers."}, {"id": "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "reason": "Direct marketing consent; not about erasure or informing other controllers."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "reason": "General technical/procedural controls; not tied to an obligation to inform other controllers after erasure."}, {"id": "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "reason": "Security/confidentiality measures; no relation to notifying other controllers of erasure requests."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requires publishing a privacy policy and mechanisms for rights; does not impose inter-controller notification duties."}, {"id": "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "reason": "Breach notification to authority and data subject; not about erasure or informing other controllers."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO designation criteria; irrelevant to erasure notification to other controllers."}, {"id": "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to erasure notification."}, {"id": "4cae06662b03e16ab229", "reason": "Child data processing safeguards; not about erasure or inter-controller notification."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 18"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": "لصاحب البيانات الشخصية الحق في طلب محو بياناته الشخصية لدى المتحكم في أي من الحالات الآتية: 1- إذا انتهى الغرض من المعالجة. 2- إذا ألغى موافقته على معالجة بياناته، وذلك دون الإخلال بحكم المادة (17) من هذه اللائحة. 3- إذا كانت معالجة البيانات لا تتوافق مع أحكام القانون أو هذه اللائحة.", "article": "Article 18"}, "exception": {"span": "ويجوز للمتحكم - بحسب الأحوال - رفض طلب صاحب البيانات الشخصية في الحالات الآتية: 1- تنفيذ التزام قانوني ملقى على عاتق المتحكم بموجب أي قانون أو حكم أو قرار قضائي. 2- وجود نزاع قائم بين المتحكم وصاحب البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 18"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 18: \"... لدى المتحكم ...\"; \"يجوز للمتحكم ...\"", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr": "obligation", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr": "take reasonable steps to inform other controllers to erase links/copies/replications of the personal data", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr": "taking account of available technology and cost; steps may include technical measures", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr": "controller has made the personal data public and is obliged under paragraph 1 to erase them", "target": "حق محو البيانات على حالات محددة (انتهاء الغرض، سحب الموافقة، عدم توافق المعالجة مع القانون)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 18", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr": "exceptions where paragraphs 1 and 2 do not apply: freedom of expression/information; legal obligation/public task; public health; archiving/research/statistics; legal claims", "target": "استثناءات من محو البيانات: التزام قانوني أو قضائي؛ نزاع قائم (Art. 18). واستثناء الحفظ والتوثيق الوطنية (Art. 11/هـ).", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 18; Article 11(e)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "OMN provides a right to erasure and some exceptions but contains no obligation for a controller to inform other controllers to delete links, copies, or replications when data were made public. There is also no qualifier about technology/cost or technical measures in this context. Thus the core duty in GDPR RU-027 is missing.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-027", "gdpr_article": 8, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["40626451a5025d77cff5", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "26ab9db083b17ff619f2", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "495e30846d7a1f70c077", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "3a6219e8839cbad1f76e", "b157dcadab6a3e8daf5f", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "d0bb19cb0c67952144b4", "4cae06662b03e16ab229"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 431.34, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "22323cd62bf2fb55075a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "ca31304d94e06fa35850"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising data subject rights; no enforcement or fining powers."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security and similar exemptions from substantive obligations; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementing decisions; does not confer fining power on the supervisory authority."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Substantive exemptions for controllers; unrelated to supervisory authority sanctioning powers."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification duty; not about enforcement powers or fines."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions concerning disclosures; not about supervisory authority sanctions."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow limitation; not about supervisory authority fines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": "أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 27", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "impose an administrative fine", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Articles 23, 24 (fines exist but not as SA power); Article 27 (general measures); Article 29 (criminal enforcement)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "pursuant to Article 83, in addition to or instead of the measures referred to in paragraph 2", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "depending on the circumstances of each individual case", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Articles 23 and 24 establish fines, and Article 27 grants the competent authority broad powers; however, the text does not confer a power on that authority to impose fines. The fining provisions are framed as penal sanctions (reinforced by Article 29’s criminal enforcement language), not administrative fines imposed by the supervisory authority. Hence the action and related scope/condition elements remain textually uncovered despite the presence of related provisions.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-147", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 7, "total": 7}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect coverage of scope and condition through administrative powers and decision-making processes in Qatari law", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "Imposition of fines for violations, potentially covering administrative fine aspect"}, {"id": "Article 26", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة", "why": "Process for complaints and investigations implies consideration of individual circumstances"}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for the action and scope slots may be too definitive, given the presence of related provisions in the Qatari law. However, without direct counterparts, especially for the scope, the verdict might still hold, albeit with a need for further clarification or revision based on a more detailed analysis of the Qatari law's provisions and their application.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 23", "span": "يعاقب بالغرامة التي لا تزيد على (1,000,000) مليون ريال", "why": "Indicates the presence of administrative fines in the Qatari law."}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Grants the competent authority the power to take necessary actions, which could be interpreted as including the imposition of fines."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "9548224453cca1301899", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "8e42fa09dd797a4c0ce1", "f5c366135483fe580381", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "f7b25ae4825c6ea8053b", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "07962910da55dbce48d3"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 738.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "dd2c753ff4cdb4e1bf8b", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["5a79146e04b73c99685c"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-case data; does not address data-subject confirmation rights."}, {"id": "d958c933b41c24227c12", "reason": "Confidentiality and prohibitions on disclosure/processing; no right of confirmation to the data subject."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Conditions for processing sensitive data; unrelated to confirmation right."}, {"id": "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "reason": "Right to object to direct marketing; not a confirmation-of-processing right."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ arrangements and transparency; no confirmation entitlement."}, {"id": "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "reason": "Definitions only; does not itself establish a right to obtain confirmation."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border transfer contractual clauses; not a general right to confirmation."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent conditions; unrelated to confirmation right."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Rectification/blocking/erasure rights; not the confirmation right."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of data protection officer; no confirmation right."}, {"id": "3bf5db493f62912c0a15", "reason": "DPO disclosure obligation; irrelevant to confirmation right."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات، ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار مقدِّم الطلب دون مقابل خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب، عما إذا كان مدير البيانات يعالِج بيانات شخصية خاصة بصاحب الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "عما إذا كان مدير البيانات يعالِج بيانات شخصية خاصة بصاحب الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "exception": {"span": "لِمدير البيانات عدم قبول الطلب ... إذا لم يكن مستوفياً ... وله رفْضُه إذا تضمَّن تعسُّفاً لاستعمال صاحب البيانات لحقه في المعرفة", "article": "Article 18(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال ميعاد أقصاه خمسة عشر يوم عمل من تاريخ الطلب", "article": "Article 18(1)"}, "consequence": {"span": "يكون لصاحب البيانات تقديم شكوى إلى الهيئة ضد مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 18(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات (data subject)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "Obligation on the controller to notify upon the data subject’s request", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1): \"على مدير البيانات ... إخطار مقدِّم الطلب\"", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller confirmation whether personal data concerning them are being processed", "target_value": "Controller must notify the applicant whether it processes personal data concerning them", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "confirmation of processing status of personal data concerning the data subject", "target_value": "Whether the controller is processing personal data relating to the applicant", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Request required and must be accompanied by proof of identity", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 18(1): \"بناءً على طلب من صاحب البيانات مشفوع بما يثبت هويته\"", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Controller may reject if the request is incomplete (after cure period) or abusive", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 18(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Controller must respond within 15 working days", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 18(1)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Right to complain to the Authority if refused or no response within the period", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Art. 18(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered", "confidence": 0.86, "reasoning_note": "Article 18(1) of the Bahrain law directly compels the controller to inform the data subject whether their personal data are being processed, which functionally satisfies the GDPR Art. 15 confirmation right. The target text adds procedural conditions (identity proof) and refusal grounds, and sets a 15-working-day deadline with a complaint mechanism. These additions narrow conditions but do not detract from the core confirmation entitlement.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-122", "gdpr_article": 15, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 15, "total": 27}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 35}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3d71a23a91370cadf799", "d958c933b41c24227c12", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "98fa9fe9b0650c71a971", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "552b4ae6d34230dd6e1f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "3bf5db493f62912c0a15"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 405.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "85891505dc2c0f3de72c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "candidates_excluded": [], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 3"}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 3 (\"وفي جميع الأحوال يجب أن يكون لمقدم الخدمة القدرة على إثبات موافقة صاحب البيانات...\")", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in a manner clearly distinguishable from other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 3 addresses consent as a legal basis, proof of consent, and written guardian consent for minors, but contains no requirement to present a consent request distinctly within a written declaration covering other matters. The cited phrase about written guardian consent (\"الحصول على موافقة خطية من قبل ولي أمر القاصر\") does not impose any distinguishability rule. Accordingly, RU-018 is not expressed in the target text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-018", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 1}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit provisions or clear citations supporting the presence of specific GDPR requirements in KWT law, particularly regarding the distinguishability of consent requests in written declarations and the modality of obligation.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "span": "الحصول على موافقة خطية من قبل ولي أمر القاصر", "why": "This provision mentions written consent but does not explicitly address the distinguishability of consent requests in written declarations concerning other matters."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 1, "candidate_ids": ["b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a"], "n_llm_calls": 5, "latency_s": 573.98, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b3e511793b42279a812d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
