{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "Scope exemptions for processing (e.g., national security, public bodies) but no grant of a data subject right to bring judicial proceedings or any court-venue rule."}, {"id": "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "reason": "Erasure right and controller refusal grounds; does not address judicial proceedings or venue."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Pre-processing permit requirements for controllers; no judicial remedy for data subjects."}, {"id": "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "reason": "Ministry’s post-breach measures; administrative oversight only, no court access right for data subjects."}, {"id": "823830174d241884bd73", "reason": "Allows a complaint to the Ministry (administrative), not proceedings before a court or any venue rule."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Defines Ministry responsibilities including receiving complaints; does not confer a judicial right on data subjects."}, {"id": "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "reason": "External auditor appointment; unrelated to data subject judicial proceedings."}, {"id": "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "reason": "Requirement to publish a data protection policy and rights-exercise mechanism; no court proceedings right."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "Designation of a data protection officer; no judicial remedy described."}, {"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Administrative enforcement measures by the Ministry; no data-subject right to bring court proceedings."}, {"id": "db1b46495b01511abeef", "reason": "DPO tasks; no judicial remedy for data subjects."}, {"id": "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa", "reason": "Allocates civil/administrative/criminal liability between controller and processor; does not grant data subjects a right to sue or specify court venue."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "bring proceedings against a controller or processor before the courts of the Member State where the data subject has his or her habitual residence", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "judicial proceedings under Article 79", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "unless the controller or processor is a public authority of a Member State acting in the exercise of its public powers", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.9, "reasoning_note": "None of the cited OMN provisions grant a data subject the power to bring judicial proceedings or specify venue based on habitual residence. They provide only an administrative complaint path via the Ministry (e.g., Article 12; supported by Articles 7 and 8), which is not a judicial remedy under GDPR Article 79. No parallel exception regarding public authorities exists in the context of court actions.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-917", "gdpr_article": 79, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 21}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's conclusion of 'uncovered' for modality and action slots might be too definitive given the potential interpretation of certain provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة إذا رأى أو اعتبر أن معالجة بياناته الشخصية لا تتوافق مع أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article suggests a mechanism for data subjects to initiate proceedings or have grievances addressed."}, {"id": "Article 8", "span": "تتخذ الوزارة في سبيل حماية حقوق أصحاب البيانات الشخصية أياً من الإجراءات الآتية", "why": "This article outlines measures the Ministry can take to enforce data protection rights, indirectly supporting the data subject's power to bring proceedings."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provided provisions do not explicitly grant the data subject the power to bring judicial proceedings against the controller or processor before a court, as required by GDPR Article 79.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 12", "span": "يجوز لصاحب البيانات الشخصية التقدم بشكوى إلى الوزارة", "why": "This article allows for a complaint to the Ministry but does not explicitly mention bringing proceedings before a court."}, {"id": "Article 7", "span": "تتولى الوزارة مسؤولية تطبيق أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This article outlines the Ministry's responsibilities in applying the law but does not provide for judicial proceedings by the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "38c6f7484322711d7d32", "823830174d241884bd73", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "bb26cffae1f1c0beb85d", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "3f916831456908af27d8", "db1b46495b01511abeef", "c42f4cd9e24977c1a2aa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 733.08, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "fb9535b20306076afd91", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "04322a32135a68c65bb5"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "reason": "Specific safeguards and documentation for disclosures only; not a general obligation to implement and evidence TOMS across all processing."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "Legal bases and purpose-compatibility exceptions; does not impose implementation of TOMS or demonstration of compliance."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Sets conditions for disclosure; not an accountability/TOMs obligation."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure duties in specific circumstances; not a general TOMS/accountability requirement."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Controller due diligence in selecting processors (Art 28-analogue); adjacent but not the general Art 24-style TOMs/accountability duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على جهة التحكم", "article": "Article 25(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب", "article": "Article 25(1)"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير التي ستتخذ لمنع المخاطر والحد منها", "article": "Article 25(2)(ز)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 25(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "يجب أن يحتوي تقويم الأثر على العناصر الآتية كحد أدنى: أ- الغرض من المعالجة والمسوغ النظامي لها. ب- وصف لطبيعة المعالجة التي سيتم تنفيذها، وأنواع ومصادر البيانات الشخصية محل المعالجة وأي جهات سيتم الإفصاح لها عن البيانات الشخصية. ج- وصف لنطاق المعالجة الذي يحدد نوع البيانات الشخصية والنطاق الجغرافي للمعالجة. د- وصف لسياق المعالجة الذي يحدد العلاقة بين أصحاب البيانات الشخصية وجهة التحكم وجهات المعالجة وأي ظروف أخرى ذوات صلة. هـ- ضرورة وتناسب التدابير المتبعة لتمكين جهة التحكم وجهات المعالجة من معالجة الحد الأدنى من البيانات الشخصية المطلوبة لتحقيق أغراض المعالجة. و- الآثار المترتبة على المعالجة بناءً على شدة تأثيرها مادياً ومعنوياً واحتمال حدوث أي آثار سلبية على أصحاب البيانات الشخصية، ويتضمن ذلك أي آثار نفسية أو اجتماعية أو جسدية أو مالية واحتمال حدوث أي منها. ز- التدابير التي ستتخذ لمنع المخاطر والحد منها. ح- مدى ملاءمة التدابير المتبعة لتفادي المخاطر المحددة.", "article": "Article 25(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "يجب على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 25(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 25(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with the Regulation", "target_value": "التدابير التي ستتخذ لمنع المخاطر والحد منها", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 25(2)(ز); Article 25(2)(ح); Article 32(3)(و); Article 12; Article 30(4)(أ); Article 36(1); Article 22"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target_value": "معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 25(1)(أ-د) (DPIA triggers limit application); Article 22"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for rights and freedoms", "target_value": "يجب أن يحتوي تقويم الأثر على العناصر الآتية كحد أدنى: أ- الغرض من المعالجة... ج- وصف لنطاق المعالجة... د- وصف لسياق المعالجة... و- الآثار المترتبة... واحتمال حدوث أي آثار سلبية...", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 25(2)(أ),(ج),(د),(و),(ز),(ح)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.68, "reasoning_note": "Agreeing with the objection: the KSA texts do not contain a general Art 24-style duty to implement and evidence appropriate TOMS across all processing. They provide partial elements (risk-based DPIA content, records/DPO/audit/cooperation) that support risk mitigation and some demonstrability but only in specific contexts, not as a comprehensive accountability obligation.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 16, "total": 28}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 37}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit requirement for technical and organizational measures in the KSA jurisdiction's provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "14105f25ea49e7794aaa", "span": "Article 25", "why": "Does not explicitly require the implementation of technical and organizational measures to ensure compliance"}, {"id": "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "span": "Article 32(3)(ب)(و)", "why": "Only mentions the responsibility of the data protection officer to follow up on the updating of records of personal data processing activities, but does not directly relate to the implementation of technical and organizational measures"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction does not have a complete counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 25(1)", "span": "يجب على جهة التحكم أن تعد تقويماً مكتوباً وموثقاً للآثار والمخاطر التي قد تلحق بصاحب البيانات الشخصية نتيجة معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision requires an assessment of the effects and risks of processing personal data, but it does not explicitly require the implementation of technical and organizational measures to ensure and demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}, {"id": "Article 25(2)", "span": "يجب أن يحتوي تقويم الأثر على العناصر الآتية كحد أدنى: أ- الغرض من المعالجة والمسوغ النظامي لها. ب- وصف لطبيعة المعالجة التي سيتم تنفيذها، وأنواع ومصادر البيانات الشخصية محل المعالجة وأي جهات سيتم الإفصاح لها عن البيانات الشخصية.", "why": "This provision specifies the elements that the assessment must include, but it does not explicitly require the implementation of technical and organizational measures to ensure and demonstrate compliance with the Regulation."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7ddbf4e54143664b8b8b", "04322a32135a68c65bb5", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "ce107f77eb9119ba01b0", "d31b8876d3426a7c919a", "8394f801a0a97e521f68", "f10a3fa820a149065de0", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "14105f25ea49e7794aaa"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 844.17, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "d2a1cf2ba04f9054a470", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["6c76988b817262e3e312", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "fca1aa50445ca4475333"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Sets timelines for complaint handling by the authority/minister; does not impose a controller duty to inform the data subject about action on rights requests."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Creates exceptions to Article 6 rights; does not address the controller's duty to inform on action taken or any response timeline."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; unrelated to informing data subjects about action on their rights requests."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Obligations when disclosing/transferring data; not about responding to data-subject requests."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; not about data-subject request handling."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations and privacy policies; no requirement to inform on action taken or specific response timelines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب", "article": "Article 11"}, "modality": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية:", "article": "Article 11"}, "action": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد.", "article": "Article 11"}, "scope": {"span": "الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "article": "Article 11"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 11", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target_value": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الطلبات وإتاحتها للأفراد (تمكين واستلام/دراسة الطلبات)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 11", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target_value": "طلبات الوصول وتصحيح البيانات أو حذفها (+ حقوق الاعتراض/التصحيح/الحذف المنصوص عليها في المادتين 5 و6)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 11; Article 5; Article 6", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target_value": "لا نص صريح يربط بإخطار الفرد عند تلقي الطلب", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا استثناء منصوصاً عليه لهذه الواجبات بالذات", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "without undue delay and in any event within one month of receipt of the request", "target_value": "لا يوجد أجل للرد على طلبات الأفراد", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "لا نص بالعقوبة/الجزاء الخاص بهذه المسألة", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Art. 11 establishes systems to receive and study access/rectification/deletion requests and make them available, and Arts. 5–6 define several individual rights, but there is no textual duty to inform the data subject of action taken on a request nor any one‑month/undue‑delay timeline. Art. 26’s timelines govern administrative complaints/appeals, not controller responses to data‑subject requests. Hence some scope alignment exists, but the core action and temporal elements remain uncovered.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 9}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The Qatari law provisions do not explicitly address the temporal aspect of responding to data subject requests within one month as required by the GDPR.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "why": "This provision indicates the setup of internal systems for handling requests and complaints but lacks specificity on the response time frame."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of C4 might be too conservative, and a more thorough analysis of the provisions reveals that there is more coverage for the GDPR requirement than initially thought.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the GDPR requirement of providing information on action taken on a request under Articles 15 to 22."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "للفرد، في أي وقت، الوصول إلى بياناته الشخصية وطلب مراجعتها", "why": "This provision provides the individual with the right to access their personal data and request its review, which is also related to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "دون مدة تحددها", "why": "This provision mentions a temporal limitation, although it does not exactly match the GDPR requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 9, "candidate_ids": ["dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 706.59, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "39b2adfc55586d0b5a6f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Addresses lawful bases for processing; not about designing technical/organizational measures or privacy by design."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Data subject access right; not about design of measures or privacy by design/default."}, {"id": "a8603a05076226e9b8fc", "reason": "DPO registry structure; not about controller’s design of measures."}, {"id": "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "reason": "Procedures to register external DPOs; not about design of measures."}, {"id": "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "reason": "Procedures to register internal DPOs; not about design of measures."}, {"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "Obligations of DPOs; not the controller’s design obligations under privacy by design."}, {"id": "231a37f671238dbf7112", "reason": "Definitions; no operative obligation on designing measures."}, {"id": "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "reason": "Joint controllers’ allocation and transparency; not privacy-by-design obligations."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; not controller design obligations."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام بالتدابير الفنية والتنظيمية التالية", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام", "article": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات القائمة على معالجة البيانات بأنواعها", "article": "Article 2(1) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "scope": {"span": "حماية الخصوصية", "article": "Article 2(1) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "condition": {"span": "أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة، وذلك بناءً على طبيعة نطاق المعالجة أو سياقها أو أغراضها أو مخاطرها", "article": "Article 2 (chapeau) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام", "article": "Article 2(1) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على مدير البيانات الالتزام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "design the technical and organisational measures to implement data-protection principles effectively", "target_value": "تطبيق تصميم لحماية الخصوصية (Privacy by Design) عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام التطبيقات والخدمات والمنتجات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2(1)-(2) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "data-protection principles include, for example, data minimisation", "target_value": "حماية الخصوصية (ضمن أطر وإجراءات حماية البيانات)، مع تركيز ملحوظ على الأمن", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e); Article 8(1) (7e2914aa34ab2739dafd)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "as part of implementing measures under Article 25(1)", "target_value": "أثناء إجراء عمليات المعالجة ... بناءً على طبيعة النطاق أو السياق أو الأغراض أو المخاطر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 2 (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "both at the time of the determination of the means for processing and at the time of the processing itself", "target_value": "عند إعداد وتصميم واختيار واستخدام", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 2(1) (0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e)", "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.69, "reasoning_note": "Bahrain’s Article 2 expressly mandates Privacy by Design at design/selection/use stages and related organisational frameworks, which functionally maps to GDPR Art. 25(1)’s design obligation and temporal element. However, the framing is security/privacy-centric and does not explicitly require implementing the full set of data-protection principles (e.g., data minimisation) “effectively.” Hence overall coverage is partial/narrower.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-210", "gdpr_article": 25, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 5, "total": 17}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "762372b7329c44286e43", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "51a58b98a34fba9eb037", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "a8603a05076226e9b8fc", "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "231a37f671238dbf7112", "063ab5d9ef023666aed7", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 432.76, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "4f85c849188f41fa989d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a418980931b429c7909a", "reason": "Breach-notification duties to the authority/data subjects; not about responding to data-subject requests or timelines."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General provisions and sanctions; no rule on informing data subjects about action on their requests or timing."}, {"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service information/consent; does not set obligations to inform on action taken on data-subject requests or deadlines."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Legal bases for processing; no procedural response obligation to data-subject requests or timing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة أثناء توفير الخدمة أو بعد انتهائها أن يقوم بجمع ومعالجة البيانات وفقاً للشروط التالية:", "article": "Article 4"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "article": "Article 4"}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": "تحديد آلية الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Article 4"}, "condition": {"span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ودراستها على مدار الساعة، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها.", "article": "Article 5"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب على مقدم الخدمة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide the data subject with information on action taken on a request", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "requests under Articles 15 to 22", "target_value": "الحصول على أو تصحيح أو إزالة البيانات الشخصية أو تقييد الوصول إليها أو معالجتها، أو الاعتراض على معالجتها أو طلب نقل البيانات الشخصية.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 4"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "upon receipt of the data subject's request", "target_value": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقى الشكاوى ... وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 5"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "without undue delay and in any event within one month of receipt of the request", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "The target text requires service providers to enable and receive data-subject requests and to define mechanisms for exercising rights, but it does not require informing the data subject about action taken on a request, nor does it set a response deadline. Accordingly, the core of RU-034 (response content and one‑month timeframe) is missing.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-034", "gdpr_article": 11, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 3, "total": 3}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 6}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 0, "total": 6}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 6, "candidate_ids": ["a418980931b429c7909a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 423.31, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "dde291b00cbf5645a864", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "5483caf68765f09059fb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3f916831456908af27d8", "reason": "Ministry enforcement powers; not a controller-facing obligation to implement measures."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "reason": "Pre-processing permit content; does not impose a general duty to implement risk-based technical/organizational measures."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "reason": "General exemptions from the law; not a provision on controller compliance measures."}, {"id": "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "reason": "Consent/legality basis; not about implementing compliance measures."}, {"id": "498c9cb637b86367567b", "reason": "Ministry roles in issuing controls; not directly the controller’s obligation under RU-204."}, {"id": "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "reason": "DPO designation requirement; a specific governance role, not the general Art. 24-style measures duty."}, {"id": "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "reason": "DPO qualifications; not a general duty to implement measures."}, {"id": "40626451a5025d77cff5", "reason": "Transparency/notice; not about implementing compliance measures."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "المتحكم", "article": "Article 13"}, "modality": {"span": "يلتزم", "article": "Article 13"}, "action": {"span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 13"}, "scope": {"span": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 13"}, "condition": {"span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "article": "Article 13"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controller", "target": "المتحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يلتزم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation", "target": "إلزام بوضع ضوابط وإجراءات تشمل \"التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون\" مع إمكان الإثبات عبر تعيين مدقق خارجي عند طلب الوزارة و\"الاحتفاظ بمستندات عمليات المعالجة\"", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 13(c); Article 16; Article 27; Article 15"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing under the controller’s responsibility", "target": "عند معالجة البيانات الشخصية (المتلزم به المتحكم)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 13"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons", "target": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 13(a)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "لا استثناء مذكور لواجب المتحكم في هذا السياق", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "غير منصوص", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "غير منصوص خاص بهذا الواجب", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "Article 13 requires the controller to set rules and include technical and procedural (organizational) measures to ensure processing complies with the law, and Articles 16 and 27 provide mechanisms that support demonstrating compliance. However, the risk/context factors are limited to identifying risks to the data subject and do not expressly require taking into account the nature, scope, context, and purposes, and the ‘ability to demonstrate’ is weaker (primarily via audit upon request). The reviewer’s objection is valid on these points, though ‘technical and procedural’ is functionally equivalent to ‘technical and organisational’ in substance.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-204", "gdpr_article": 24, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on incomplete or inaccurate citations.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision only partially covers the GDPR requirement of implementing appropriate technical and organizational measures."}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "This provision only partially covers the GDPR requirement of taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing and the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The provisions do not fully align with the GDPR proposition, particularly with regards to 'taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing' and 'appropriate technical and organisational measures'", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "تحديد المخاطر التي قد تقع على صاحب البيانات الشخصية جراء المعالجة", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention 'taking into account the nature, scope, context and purposes of processing'"}, {"id": "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "span": "التدابير الفنية والإجرائية لضمان تنفيذ المعالجة وفقاً لأحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention 'appropriate technical and organisational measures'"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3f916831456908af27d8", "a0a0194dd91481c29c6e", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "b59c6e3df96d0cdf91f8", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "9afcca9ce75d4e0c23f1", "6e6fc1f4d7421fb141d6", "5483caf68765f09059fb", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "05b7537a91d92a0529ad", "40626451a5025d77cff5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 748.42, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "4bb4c48df9687a230057", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Addresses data subject right to obtain information; no mention of certification schemes or supervisory authority powers over certification bodies."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "Sets general processing principles; does not address certification or supervisory authority orders to certification bodies."}, {"id": "c0282661f0bb9313ca4c", "reason": "General repeal clause; no relevance to certification or supervisory authority powers."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Data subject right to rectification/erasure; no certification or supervisory authority power implicated."}, {"id": "674524dee00496cb5de7", "reason": "Controller obligations; no provisions on certification bodies or supervisory authority power to prevent issuance of certifications."}, {"id": "57844ac856d11c289650", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing without consent; unrelated to certification mechanisms or supervisory authority control over them."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification and administrative penalties reference; no certification scheme or power to order certification bodies addressed."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Data subject right to object/stop processing; no certification or supervisory authority power content."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Conditions for consent; no certification or supervisory authority power content."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward the Data Protection Officer; unrelated to certification schemes or supervisory authority orders."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Roles of the Data Protection Officer; no mention of certification or supervisory authority powers over certification bodies."}, {"id": "ffb151edc5703b569765", "reason": "Procedure to appeal Office decisions; does not establish a certification regime or the specific power to order a certification body not to issue certifications."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "power", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "order the certification body not to issue a certification", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "certifications under Articles 42 and 43", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the requirements for the certification are not or are no longer met", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.82, "reasoning_note": "None of the provided UAE PDPL provisions establish a certification scheme or grant the supervisory authority power to direct certification bodies regarding issuance. The texts focus on rights, obligations, breach notification, DPO roles, and appeals. Therefore, the GDPR requirement has no textual counterpart in the supplied target provisions.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-146", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 10, "total": 10}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 18}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 19}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 0, "objections": [], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "c0282661f0bb9313ca4c", "877fafe0080725188d05", "674524dee00496cb5de7", "57844ac856d11c289650", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "ffb151edc5703b569765"], "n_llm_calls": 4, "latency_s": 410.25, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "14c6973b448dce6a6975", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["5bedab371a9fc40ba93a"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Regulates objections to automated decision-making; does not address restriction of processing conditions."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Addresses rectification and erasure; does not set the conditions for restriction of processing."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Provides a right to stop processing for marketing/statistical purposes; not the restriction right at issue."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Information access right; not an operative right to restrict processing."}, {"id": "ebfe638a86be87347658", "reason": "Data portability; unrelated to restriction of processing."}, {"id": "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "reason": "Scope of the law; not about the right to restriction."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Complaint mechanism; not the substantive right to restriction."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "DPO appointment; unrelated to restriction conditions."}, {"id": "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "reason": "General processing principles; does not create the specific right to restrict in the stated condition."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "DPO duties; unrelated to restriction of processing."}, {"id": "e05de90f481c9410c6e0", "reason": "Breach notification; not about restriction of processing."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "صاحب البيانات", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يحق", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "action": {"span": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "article": "Article 16(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 16(1)(ب)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "article": "Article 16(1)(ج)"}, "exception": {"span": "على الرغم مما ورد في البند (1) من هذه المادة، للمتحكم المضي في معالجة البيانات الشخصية لصاحب البيانات دون موافقته في أي من الحالات الآتية: أ. إذا كانت المعالجة مقتصرة على تخزين البيانات الشخصية. ب. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لإقامة أي من إجراءات المطالبة بالحقوق والدعاوى القانونية أو الدفاع عنها أو تتعلق بالإجراءات القضائية. ج. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية حقوق الغير وفقاً للتشريعات السارية. د. إذا كانت المعالجة ضرورية لحماية المصلحة العامة.", "article": "Article 16(3)"}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي جميع الأحوال، يجب على المتحكم في حال قام برفع التقييد المنصوص عليه في هذه المادة، أن يخطر صاحب البيانات بذلك.", "article": "Article 16(4)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "data subject", "target_value": "صاحب البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "right", "target_value": "يحق", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "obtain from the controller the restriction of processing", "target_value": "إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "processing of the data subject's personal data", "target_value": "معالجة بياناته الشخصية", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 16(1)(ب)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the processing is unlawful and the data subject opposes erasure and requests restriction instead", "target_value": "أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16(1)(ج)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "استثناءات تتيح للمتحكم المضي في المعالجة (تخزين فقط، المطالبة بالحقوق/الإجراءات القضائية، حماية حقوق الغير، حماية المصلحة العامة).", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 16(3)", "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "يجب إخطار صاحب البيانات عند رفع التقييد.", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 16(4)", "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "covered_broader_with_exceptions", "confidence": 0.77, "reasoning_note": "Article 16(1)(ج) grants a right to restrict when processing is unlawful without requiring the data subject to oppose erasure; thus the UAE condition is broader than RU-167’s conjunctive trigger. However, Article 16(3) introduces exceptions allowing continued processing, which the GDPR unit does not mention. The RU-167 scenario (unlawful processing + DS prefers restriction) is nevertheless covered under Article 16.", "label": "C1", "ru_id": "RU-167", "gdpr_article": 18, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 21}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE law does not fully match the GDPR's requirements for restricting processing, particularly regarding the data subject's opposition to erasure and request for restriction.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة", "why": "Article 16 provides some provisions related to restricting processing, but it may not fully align with the GDPR's requirements."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "ج. أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية", "why": "Article 16(1)(ج) provides a condition for restricting processing when the processing is unlawful, but it does not explicitly mention the data subject's opposition to erasure and request for restriction instead."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE jurisdiction's provision (Article 16) does not fully align with the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167] regarding the conditions for requesting restriction of processing.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (16) حق تقييد المعالجة 1. يحق لصاحب البيانات إلزام المتحكم بتقييد وإيقاف المعالجة في أي من الحالات الآتية: ... ج. أن تكون المعالجة قد تمت بالمخالفة لأحكام هذا المرسوم بقانون والتشريعات السارية.", "why": "The condition for restricting processing in the UAE jurisdiction does not explicitly require the data subject to oppose erasure and request restriction instead, as stated in the GDPR requirement unit [RU-167]."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "877fafe0080725188d05", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "ebfe638a86be87347658", "743bfdd72ed773ff5ba9", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "3cc10eb2dd7e95bdd0c2", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "e05de90f481c9410c6e0"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 773.66, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "d023c194d3f6971ab66d", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
