r": "None.", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.47, "reasoning_note": "Reassessed to address the objection: there is no Omani text granting a permission to disclose personal data from official documents or imposing the GDPR-like balancing condition. Art. 3 only exempts certain public-interest/public-body processing from the PDPL and does not mention official documents; Art. 5’s reference to “disclosure” is administrative and not a substantive permission.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-957", "gdpr_article": 86, "jurisdiction": "OMN", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 23}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the action and condition slots might be incorrect, as the provisions suggest a possible counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3(b)", "span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "This provision suggests that the OMN law has a concept related to public authorities and bodies performing tasks in the public interest."}, {"id": "Article 3(y)", "span": "إذا كانت البيانات متاحة للجمهور وبما لا يخالف أحكام هذا القانون", "why": "This provision implies that there might be a provision related to the disclosure of personal data in accordance with applicable law."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's slot verdicts for the 'action' and 'condition' slots are not entirely supported by the provided provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "تنفيذ وحدات الجهاز الإداري للدولة وغيرها من الأشخاص الاعتبارية العامة للاختصاصات المقررة لها قانوناً", "why": "This provision seems to be related to the addressee slot verdict, but it does not explicitly mention 'official documents'."}, {"id": "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "span": "الإفصاح عن البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision mentions 'disclosure of personal data', but it does not explicitly mention 'official documents'."}, {"id": "865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "span": "لا تسري أحكام هذا القانون على ...", "why": "This provision does not seem to explicitly mention 'in accordance with applicable Union or Member State law, to reconcile public access to official documents with the right to the protection of personal data'."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["865fbf2c2a6ca6fcb814", "a0040ee4dad7d4440e19", "3f916831456908af27d8", "93f989531fe30cac1ed5", "6e8de83975a220288296", "487015f110e7b88b5c03", "498c9cb637b86367567b", "a4136d70ee84d058ef85", "823830174d241884bd73", "4f65c1f467f9e61b2f46", "2712fe4ebdba355a134b", "c62011bb3dda1c9374e5"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 850.64, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b77df54cf64dd364cf16", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "f5c366135483fe580381", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "75852a697f66691bfbfb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "455aae046cacf7979576", "reason": "Data quality (relevance, accuracy, retention) duties; does not govern providing information/communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Conditions for disclosure/transfer to a processor; not about informing data subjects."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "General controller obligations and security/precaution policies; not specifically about providing the GDPR-listed information/communications to data subjects."}, {"id": "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "reason": "Security precautions and processor-to-controller breach notice; not controller-to-data-subject communications."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial procedures for exercising rights; not a direct controller obligation to provide information/communications."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Territorial/material scope of the law; not about information/communication duties."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على المراقب اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية", "article": "Art. 11"}, "modality": {"span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة", "article": "Art. 14"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الإجراءات التالية: ... وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد. ... استخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة لتمكين الأفراد من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها بشكل مباشر.", "article": "Art. 11(4), 11(6)"}, "scope": {"span": "أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب ... 2- الأغراض المشروعة ... 3- الوصف الشامل والدقيق لأنشطة المعالجة ... 4- أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية ولازمة لاستيفاء شروط معالجة البيانات الشخصية.", "article": "Art. 9(1)-(4)"}, "condition": {"span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد ... بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات ... إذا كان من شأن ذلك إحداث ضرر جسيم بالبيانات الشخصية أو بخصوصية الفرد.", "article": "Art. 14"}, "exception": {"span": "يُعفى المراقب من الالتزام بأحكام المادة (6) ... إذا كان من شأن الإفصاح الإضرار بالمصالح التجارية لشخص آخر، أو إذا كان من شأن تنفيذ هذا الالتزام الإفصاح عن بيانات شخصية تتعلق بفرد آخر...", "article": "Art. 21(1)-(2) (see also Art. 19 exemptions including Art. 6)"}, "temporal": {"span": "قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية", "article": "Art. 9"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "على المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 11"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يجب / على (shall/must)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 14; Art. 9; Art. 11"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "take appropriate measures to provide to the data subject the information and communications specified", "target_value": "اتخاذ إجراءات ونظم داخلية وتمكين الأفراد من ممارسة حقوقهم، وإعلام الفرد بالمعلومات المحددة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 11(4),(6); Art. 9; Art. 14"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "any information referred to in Articles 13 and 14 and any communication under Articles 15 to 22 and 34 relating to processing", "target_value": "الإعلام قبل المعالجة بمعلومات مفصلة تشمل \"أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية\"؛ تمكين واستلام طلبات الوصول والتصحيح والحذف؛ وإخطار الفرد بوقوع إخلال بالاحتياطات عند احتمال الضرر الجسيم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 9(1)-(4) (esp. \"أية معلومات أخرى...\"); Art. 11(4),(6); Art. 14"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إخطار الفرد بالخرق مشروط بإمكان إحداث ضرر جسيم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 14"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "إعفاءات من التزامات المادة (6) في حالات محددة (المصالح التجارية، حماية الغير، وغيرها)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 21(1)-(2); Art. 19"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "الإعلام قبل البدء في المعالجة؛ تمكين مستمر للأفراد من ممارسة حقوقهم", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 9; Art. 11(6)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.71, "reasoning_note": "Article 9’s catch-all (“أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية”) and Article 14’s duty to notify individuals of certain breaches broaden the informational reach, and Article 11 requires concrete measures to enable and handle rights requests. However, not all GDPR Art. 15–22 communications are clearly encompassed (e.g., portability, objection), so the overall scope is best assessed as partial rather than narrower. This directly addresses the reviewer’s counter-evidence while recognizing remaining textual gaps.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-047", "gdpr_article": 12, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 7}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's reasoning is incomplete and inconsistent with the provisions supplied.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 9", "span": "على المراقب، قبل البدء في معالجة أية بيانات شخصية، أن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي: 1- بيانات المراقب، أو أي طرف آخر يتولى معالجة البيانات لصالح المراقب أو لاستغلالها من قبله. 2- الأغراض المشروعة التي يرغب المراقب أو أي طرف آخر في معالجة البيانات الشخصية من أجلها. 3- الوصف الشامل والدقيق لأنشطة المعالجة ودرجات الإفصاح عن البيانات الشخصية للأغراض المشروعة، وإذا لم يتمكن المراقب من ذلك، فيتعين عليه تمكين الفرد من وصف عام لها. 4- أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية ولازمة لاستيفاء شروط معالجة البيانات الشخصية.", "why": "The provision only mentions the information that the controller must provide before processing personal data, which is narrower than the scope of information required by the GDPR."}, {"id": "Article 11(4) and Article 11(6)", "span": "وضع نظم داخلية لتلقي ودراسة الشكاوى، وطلبات الوصول للبيانات، وطلبات تصحيحها أو حذفها، وإتاحة ذلك للأفراد؛ واستخدام الوسائل التكنولوجية المناسبة لتمكين الأفراد من ممارسة حقهم... وأن يُعلم الفرد بما يلي (قبل المعالجة).", "why": "The provisions only mention the controller's obligation to establish internal procedures for receiving and processing requests from data subjects, which is not directly related to providing information to data subjects."}, {"id": "None", "span": "None", "why": "The analyst has not provided any citation for the 'temporal' slot, which refers to the timing of the controller's obligation to provide information to the data subject."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's claim that the scope of the information to be provided to the data subject is narrower in the QAT law is not entirely accurate.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "span": "أية معلومات أخرى تكون ضرورية ولازمة لاستيفاء شروط معالجة البيانات الشخصية", "why": "This provision in Article 9 of the QAT law requires the controller to provide broader information to the individual."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "span": "يجب على المراقب إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة", "why": "This provision in Article 14 of the QAT law requires the controller to notify the individual and the relevant authority of any breach of the security measures, which is similar to the GDPR's requirement."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["455aae046cacf7979576", "89d1bb9a58e65b732117", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "f5c366135483fe580381", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 857.69, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b0de2a0f55bb349fe51c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "reason": "Pre-service information and consent requirements; does not establish or mention a right to object to processing for marketing."}, {"id": "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; no textual right to object and no marketing-specific rule."}, {"id": "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "reason": "Security, records, and governance obligations; unrelated to a data subject's right to object to marketing."}, {"id": "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "reason": "General and enforcement provisions; no substantive right to object to processing."}, {"id": "e8fe267db21063b1b45f", "reason": "Scope clause; does not create or detail a right to object."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "التي تمكن المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم في الوصول إلى البيانات الشخصية ومراجعتها وتصحيحها", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "modality": {"span": "تمكين المستخدمين من ممارسة حقهم", "article": "Article 4(6)"}, "action": {"span": "الاعتراض على معالجتها", "article": "Article 4(8)"}, "scope": {"span": "لأغراض تسويقية لا تتعلق مباشرة بتوفير خدمات الاتصالات وتقنية المعلومات", "article": "Article 4(11)"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "يوفر وسيلة سهلة الاستخدام، وعملية، ويمكن النفاذ إليها بسهولة تمكن المستخدم من ... سحب موافقته، أو تعطيل خدمة، أو طريقة جمع، أو استخدام أو معالجة أو الإفصاح عن بياناته الشخصية", "article": "Article 4(12)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "data subject", "target": "users/data subjects are referenced as the holders of rights the provider must enable", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(6)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "right", "target": "“practice their right” (exercise of rights must be enabled by the provider)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(6)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "object to processing of personal data concerning him or her", "target": "“الاعتراض على معالجتها” (object to its processing)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 4(8)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "processing for direct marketing purposes, including profiling related to such direct marketing", "target": "General objection to processing; marketing is addressed for third‑party disclosures (“لأغراض تسويقية …”) but the objection right is not expressly tied to marketing/profiling", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(8); Article 4(11)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where personal data are processed for direct marketing purposes", "target": "No condition stated; the mechanism to object applies generally to processing", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 4(8)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No exceptions stated for exercising the objection mechanism", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "at any time", "target": "Provider must offer an easy and accessible means to withdraw consent/disable collection, use, processing or disclosure; no explicit “at any time” phrasing", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 4(12)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "No explicit consequence specified upon objection (e.g., stop processing for marketing)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "n/a"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "KWT Art. 4(8) expressly provides a general right to object to processing, which functionally encompasses any marketing-related processing, and Art. 4(12) ensures users can act via an accessible mechanism. However, there is no explicit tie of the objection right to direct marketing (or profiling for such marketing) nor an explicit “at any time” clause; Art. 4(11) addresses marketing only in the context of third‑party disclosures. Hence only partial correspondence to RU‑180.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-180", "gdpr_article": 21, "jurisdiction": "KWT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 1, "total": 1}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 4}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 6}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit temporal aspect and condition in the target jurisdiction's provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8)", "why": "Does not explicitly mention the right to object at any time or specifically condition it on direct marketing purposes"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KWT jurisdiction does not explicitly provide a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit (RU-180) regarding the right to object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(8)", "why": "The article mentions the right to object to processing of personal data, but it does not explicitly state that this right applies to direct marketing purposes."}, {"id": "9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "span": "Article 4(11)", "why": "The article mentions that the service provider must obtain the user's consent before disclosing their personal data to a third party for marketing purposes, but it does not explicitly state that the user has the right to object to processing of personal data for direct marketing purposes."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 6, "candidate_ids": ["9f3112d28a1b850ba61f", "b983a5ed0e1c7a2b779a", "62dc9e8ad2aa962982ad", "2c020ba48e817e4f4c7a", "9b42add02f4d45cf8a57", "e8fe267db21063b1b45f"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 841.81, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "5594556b1ba39f88b7b5", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Regulates processing of criminal-case data; not about safeguards/TOMs for research, historical, statistical, or archiving contexts."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Concerns investigation of DPO; no substantive rule on safeguards or data minimisation."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Sets minimisation for publicly accessible registers; context-specific and not the research/historical/statistical safeguards contemplated by GDPR Art. 89(1)."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "Defines DPO tasks; no direct safeguard/TOM requirement linked to data minimisation."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Supervisory authority powers; not a controller obligation to implement TOMs/minimisation in research contexts."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "International transfer contract clauses; unrelated to safeguards for research/historical/statistical processing."}, {"id": "762372b7329c44286e43", "reason": "Lawful bases for processing; does not address technical/organisational safeguards or data minimisation in the relevant contexts."}, {"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "reason": "Notification to authority; procedural and security-assessment reference, not a substantive TOMs-for-minimisation safeguard."}, {"id": "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "reason": "Register of notifications/permits; no substantive safeguard obligation."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "DPO registration conditions; unrelated to safeguards or data minimisation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "ويجب أن تكفل هذه التدابير توفير مستوى مناسب من الأمان", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "action": {"span": "تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "حصراً لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي", "article": "Article 3(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "بشرط ألا تتم لدعم اتخاذ أيّ قرار أو إجراء بشأن فرد محدد", "article": "Article 3(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controllers", "target_value": "مدير البيانات", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "صيغة إلزامية (على/يجب)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8(1)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "ensure technical and organisational measures are in place to respect the principle of data minimisation", "target_value": "التزام عام بتطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية لأمان المعالجة (Art 8(1)) + مبدأ عدم الإِفراط/الملاءمة (Art 3(3)) + إجراء تقني خاص في سياق الأغراض التاريخية/الإحصائية/العلمية (إخفاء الهوية أو تشفيرها عند التخزين الأطول) (Art 3(5))", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(1); Article 3(3), 3(5)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "safeguards for processing under Article 89(1) (archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, statistical purposes)", "target_value": "المعالجة/الاحتفاظ لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 3(2), 3(5)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "when applying safeguards for processing for archiving in the public interest, scientific or historical research, or statistical purposes", "target_value": "تعد المعالجة اللاحقة لتلك الأغراض غير مُخالِفة بشرط عدم دعم القرارات بشأن فرد محدد، ومع التخزين الأطول تُخفى الهوية أو تُشفَّر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 3(2), 3(5)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None identified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None identified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None identified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "A distributed counterpart exists: Article 8(1) imposes TOMs (for security), while Article 3(3) states data minimisation and Article 3(5) mandates anonymisation or encryption for historical/statistical/scientific retention. However, the law does not expressly require TOMs to ensure the minimisation principle in those contexts, nor does it cover ‘archiving in the public interest,’ hence only partial coverage.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-965", "gdpr_article": 89, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 14, "total": 26}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's provisions do not explicitly mention archiving in the public interest, which could be considered a narrower scope.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 3(5)", "span": "تُحفَظ البيانات التي يتم تخزينها لفترات أطول لأغراض تاريخية أو إحصائية أو للبحث العلمي في صورة مجهولة بتحويرها، وذلك بوضعها في صورة لا تُمكِّن مِنْ نسبة هذه البيانات إلى صاحبها.", "why": "This provision supports the principle of data minimization, but the scope is narrower than the GDPR requirement unit."}, {"id": "Article 8(1)", "span": "على مدير البيانات تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية الكفيلة بحماية البيانات من الإتلاف غير المقصود أو غير المصرَّح به، أو من الفقْد العَرَضي، أو مما هو غير مصرَّح به من التغيير أو الإفصاح أو النفاذ أو أيٍّ من الصور الأخرى للمعالَجة.", "why": "This provision supports the requirement for technical and organizational measures, but it does not explicitly mention the principle of data minimization."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Counterpart exists under different terminology and distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "span": "Article 3(5)", "why": "Mentions principle of data minimisation"}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "Article 8(1)", "why": "Mentions need for technical and organisational measures to protect data"}, {"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "span": "Article 3(2)", "why": "Mentions data should not be processed for purposes incompatible with purpose for which it was collected"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "762372b7329c44286e43", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "e38e0bed35316765ba57", "0c872442bf005518c094"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 866.42, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "953c597d4d985f9d11f7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "reason": "Administrative complaint and ministerial appeal procedure; no rule empowering courts to stay proceedings or addressing related actions/lis pendens."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Substantive exemptions for controllers (including compliance with a court order); does not regulate judicial case management or staying proceedings."}, {"id": "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "reason": "Controller may be excused from disclosing reasons regarding data-subject rights; unrelated to courts or stays."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Further exemptions from data-subject rights where disclosure would harm third-party interests; no judicial stay mechanism."}, {"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "reason": "Grants enforcement officers powers to detect/prove PDPL crimes; does not address courts staying proceedings or inter-jurisdictional related actions."}, {"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Ministerial regulation of rights procedures; no content on courts or stays."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period for regulated parties; no relation to judicial proceedings management."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Prohibits controllers from restricting cross-border data flows; not about judicial proceedings or stays."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Authorizes certain processing for national security/public interests; no court-related stay or lis pendens rule."}, {"id": "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "reason": "Nullity of contracts contrary to the PDPL; does not concern courts staying proceedings."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementation powers; no judicial stay provision."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Individual rights (withdraw consent, object, delete, correct); no judicial proceeding management rule."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "any court other than the court first seized", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "stay its proceedings", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "related proceedings are pending before a court in another Member State", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.83, "reasoning_note": "All provided PDPL provisions regulate data protection obligations, exemptions, enforcement, and ministerial/administrative procedures; none confer or describe a court’s discretionary power to stay proceedings due to related actions in another state. The cited counter-evidence concerns police powers, transitional compliance, national security processing, and controller decisions on data flows—conceptually distinct from judicial lis pendens or case-management permissions. No distributed or definitional pathway in these texts yields the required court-focused permission.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-1010", "gdpr_article": 263, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 14}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incomplete analysis of the provisions. There may be a counterpart to the GDPR requirement unit [RU-1010] in the Qatari jurisdiction, albeit under different terminology or distributed across several provisions.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "span": "ضبط وإثبات الجرائم", "why": "This article mentions investigating and proving crimes, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "span": "توفيق أوضاعهم", "why": "This article mentions regulating affairs, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "حماية الأمن الوطني والأمن العام", "why": "This article mentions protecting national security and public safety, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "span": "الحظر على المراقب اتخاذ أي قرار أو إجراء", "why": "This article mentions prohibiting the controller from taking any decision or action, which could be related to the issue of staying proceedings."}], "confidence": 0.6}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "18cb1cd8191cffb1c314", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "ca31304d94e06fa35850", "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "ebf74cfd82d3e6cbc442", "9548224453cca1301899", "fca1aa50445ca4475333"], "n_llm_calls": 5, "latency_s": 480.08, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "a263a80e75d2e953bca7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "reason": "Addresses withdrawal of consent procedures; does not regulate how consent is presented within a mixed written declaration."}, {"id": "0269f42c0015a544c475", "reason": "Marketing-specific consent and opt-out mechanics; no requirement to distinguish a consent request within a document that covers other matters."}, {"id": "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "reason": "Sets general rule that consent is a legal basis and delegates consent conditions to regulations; does not address distinguishability in written declarations."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Right to erasure; irrelevant to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection and oversight; unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "reason": "Processor selection (statutory article); unrelated to consent request presentation."}, {"id": "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "reason": "Legal bases where consent is not required; does not concern how a consent request is presented."}, {"id": "85947edc5717161ced74", "reason": "Public-sector disciplinary measures; not about consent presentation."}, {"id": "d9a05a425b46428120ee", "reason": "Supervisory arrangements; not about consent presentation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على جهة التحكم قبل أو عند جمع البيانات اتخاذ التدابير اللازمة لإبلاغ صاحب البيانات الشخصية", "article": "المادة الرابعة (1)"}, "modality": {"span": "على جهة التحكم", "article": "المادة الرابعة (1)"}, "action": {"span": "هـ- أن تكون هناك موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض من أغراض المعالجة.", "article": "المادة الحادية عشرة (1)(هـ)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الرابعة (1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "على جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "المادة الرابعة (1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "present the request for consent in a manner clearly distinguishable from other matters", "target_value": "لا تُستخدم طرق مضللة؛ تكون أغراض المعالجة واضحة ومحددة؛ وتوجد موافقة مستقلة لكل غرض", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "المادة الحادية عشرة (1)(أ)، (1)(ب)، (1)(هـ)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "If consent is sought within a written declaration that also concerns other matters", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "No exception stated", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Not specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "Not specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "The cited KSA provisions stress clarity, non-deception, and purpose-specific (independent) consent, which supports transparency but does not impose the GDPR-like duty to present a consent request as clearly distinguishable within a composite written declaration. No target text articulates the specific scope/condition trigger of a mixed written instrument. Hence only partial alignment on the action and none on the scope/condition.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-018", "gdpr_article": 7, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 20}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 23}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 2, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The KSA provisions partially address the principle of distinguishable consent through emphasis on transparency and free will in the consent process.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "span": "المادة الحادية عشرة: الموافقة", "why": "Article 11 discusses conditions for consent, including free will and no deception, implying a need for clarity."}, {"id": "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "span": "المادة الرابعة: الحق في العلم", "why": "Article 4 emphasizes the right to information, which includes how personal data is processed, supporting clarity in consent requests."}, {"id": "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "span": "المادة السابعة: لا يجوز أن تكون الموافقة المشار إليها في الفقرة (1) من المادة (الخامسة) من النظام شرطاً لإسداء خدمة أو تقديم منفعة", "why": "Article 7 prohibits making consent a condition for a service unless directly related to the data processing, indirectly supporting distinguishable consent."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["01ac249fbbc2f2fcee1e", "952167864cc3b0d724c1", "0269f42c0015a544c475", "914fd2814b8a65e8cae6", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "9cfd6fbae8182dbc0028", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "dd4534e9a092f99ef423", "78ae2c40eaf4fb3870fc", "6ce308b7241fe0cf26f0", "85947edc5717161ced74", "d9a05a425b46428120ee"], "n_llm_calls": 6, "latency_s": 565.22, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "e09e509ae3bde8fbaf0a", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "reason": "General data quality principles; no supervisory authority advice/consultation mechanism."}, {"id": "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "reason": "Conditions for processing sensitive data; does not address supervisory authority advice or timelines."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO duties and liaison; no obligation on the authority to provide advice on intended processing."}, {"id": "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "reason": "Definitions (Privacy by Design); not operative on supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "reason": "Data subject access-style notification by controller; unrelated to authority’s prior-consultation advice."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "reason": "Timeframe for authority to decide DPO internal registry applications; not about advising controllers on processing."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Criminal data processing regimes; no supervisory authority advice/consultation rule."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Data subject right to object and controller’s duty; not an authority advice duty."}, {"id": "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "reason": "Timeframe for authority to decide DPO external registry applications; not about advising on intended processing."}, {"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "reason": "Sanctioning/measures upon violation; no prior-consultation advice obligation or timeline."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للهيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار ... أن تطلب من مدير البيانات...", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "modality": {"span": "للهيئة ... أن تطلب من مدير البيانات استيفاء أيّ نقص في بيانات الإخطار...", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "action": {"span": "أن تطلب من مدير البيانات استيفاء أيّ نقص في بيانات الإخطار...", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "scope": {"span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة قبل بدء عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً...", "article": "Article 14(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "أن تطلب من مدير البيانات استيفاء أيّ نقص في بيانات الإخطار...", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "للهيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار...", "article": "Article 14(4)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الهيئة (the Authority)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 14(4): \"للهيئة ... أن تطلب من مدير البيانات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (must)", "target_value": "permission/discretion (\"للهيئة ... أن تطلب\")", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide written advice to the controller and, where applicable, the processor", "target_value": "may request the controller to complete deficiencies in the notification; no duty to advise and no reference to the processor", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "intended processing referred to in Article 36(1) (high-risk prior consultation context)", "target_value": "processing notified before commencement of automated processing in general", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 14(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority considers the intended processing would infringe the GDPR (e.g., insufficient risk mitigation)", "target_value": "authority may act to seek completion where the notification is deficient; no infringement-assessment trigger", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "within up to eight weeks of receiving the consultation request", "target_value": "within ten working days of receiving the notification (for the authority to request completion)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 14(4)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed for failure to advise; (text instead imposes a stop-processing duty on the controller when completion is requested)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.63, "reasoning_note": "I incorporated Article 14(4) to acknowledge the authority-focused temporal window and its discretionary power, and Article 14(1) for the pre-processing notification context. However, Bahrain’s text lacks the core obligation for the authority to issue written advice on potential infringements within a set period and contains no reference to advising the processor. Thus, only peripheral elements (addressee, temporal window, general pre-processing context) are reflected, not the GDPR duty itself.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-416", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Provisions in BHR law suggest regulatory oversight and interaction mechanisms that could be considered counterparts to GDPR requirements.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "span": "Article 14", "why": "Establishes a framework for notification to the authority before starting personal data processing."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "span": "Article 17", "why": "Mentions the authority's role in supervision and inspection."}, {"id": "074363ee1a72941c8326", "span": "Article 11", "why": "Discusses the decision process on applications for internal data protection officers, showing a structured authority-controller interaction."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, and some of the uncovered slots may have counterparts in the BHR law.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 14(4)", "span": "للهيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار أن تطلب من مدير البيانات...", "why": "Implies an obligation on the authority to take action, related to the 'modality' slot."}, {"id": "Article 14(1)", "span": "على مدير البيانات إخطار الهيئة قبل بدء عملية المعالجة التي تتم آلياً كلياً أو جزئياً...", "why": "Implies an action that the data controller must take, related to the 'action' slot."}, {"id": "Article 21(1)", "span": "على مدير البيانات، بعد مُضيّ فترة لا تجاوز عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّمه طلباً من صاحب البيانات...", "why": "Implies a condition under which the data controller must take action, related to the 'condition' slot."}, {"id": "Article 14(4)", "span": "للهيئة خلال عشرة أيام عمل من تاريخ تسلُّم الإخطار أن تطلب من مدير البيانات...", "why": "Implies a temporal limitation, related to the 'temporal' slot."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["7448a27e7806f2c0c143", "f8344697d1f1dc661161", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "34ea02d93464e8e2fa05", "5a79146e04b73c99685c", "074363ee1a72941c8326", "1d8fd3d4070b1ff36d68", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "cf6dbe21d2b4a64f32a8", "c24849787475f274ecac", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 719.69, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "771052bfc055b5373b26", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "fcbd13532c69b340214e"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach-notification duty; does not set safeguards or conditions on using national identifiers or similar."}, {"id": "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "reason": "General principle of lawful, honest, transparent processing; no identifier-specific safeguards rule."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Public-interest exemptions; does not regulate safeguards for identifiers."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "reason": "Special-category data authorization and extra safeguards; no mention of national identifiers or identifiers of general application."}, {"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; unrelated to safeguards for identifiers."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Purpose-alignment on disclosure/transfer; no identifier-specific safeguards rule."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Organizational governance measures; no rule limiting use of identifiers to circumstances with safeguards."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow; not about identifiers or safeguards for their use."}, {"id": "dce663972f2d5e58176e", "reason": "Scope of the law; no operative safeguards for identifiers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يتعين على المراقب الالتزام بما يلي", "article": "Article 8 (chapeau)"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعين على", "article": "Article 8 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "article": "Article 8(3)"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "controllers", "target": "المراقب", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "obligation", "target": "يتعين على", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 8 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "use national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application only under appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of the data subject", "target": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(3); Article 13(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "use/processing of national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "where a Member State has determined specific conditions for processing such identifiers", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "I limited coverage to explicit safeguard duties (Arts 8(3), 13) and did not ascribe identifier-specific or condition-triggered rules that the text does not state. The scope and condition slots are marked uncovered because the Qatari provisions do not mention national identifiers or state-set conditions for their processing. This addresses the objection by providing explicit citations and avoiding overreach.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-959", "gdpr_article": 87, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 4, "total": 4}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 4, "total": 8}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 3, "total": 11}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The 'condition' slot is not entirely uncovered as claimed by the analyst.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "span": "للجهة المختصة أن تقرر معالجة بعض البيانات الشخصية دون التقيد بأحكام المواد (4)، (9)، (15)، (17) من هذا القانون", "why": "This article suggests that the competent authority can determine specific conditions for processing certain personal data."}, {"id": "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "span": "وللوزير أن يضيف أصنافاً أخرى من البيانات الشخصية ذات الطبيعة الخاصة", "why": "This article suggests that the Minister can determine specific conditions for processing certain personal data."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Lack of explicit support for some slot verdicts", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 8(3)", "span": "اتخاذ الاحتياطات الإدارية والفنية والمادية المناسبة لحماية البيانات الشخصية", "why": "Does not explicitly mention 'use national identification numbers or other identifiers of general application only under appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of the data subject'"}, {"id": "Articles 16, 18", "span": "ولا يجوز معالجة البيانات الشخصية ذات الطبيعة الخاصة، إلا بعد الحصول على تصريح بذلك من الإدارة المختصة، وفقاً للإجراءات والضوابط التي يصدر بتحديدها قرار من الوزير.", "why": "Does not explicitly mention 'where a Member State has determined specific conditions for processing such identifiers'"}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 11, "candidate_ids": ["f5c366135483fe580381", "2bcce9feda2fcb9d35fe", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "fcbd13532c69b340214e", "76d28900b8b4cbbb215d", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "dce663972f2d5e58176e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 795.52, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "609cce624263f12b9589", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "reason": "DPO confidentiality and conflict-of-interest duties; not about erasure or notifying other controllers."}, {"id": "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "reason": "Registration of DPOs; irrelevant to erasure/notification obligations."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Liability of DPO entities; not about controller duties to inform third parties or erase."}, {"id": "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "reason": "Cross-border contract clauses; no duty to inform other controllers about erasure requests."}, {"id": "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "reason": "DPO role and registry; not about right to erasure notifications."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Enforcement against DPO; unrelated to the substantive erasure/notification duty."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality of authority-held information; not relevant to controller notification of erasure."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Special rules for criminal proceedings data; not addressing the RU-027 notification mechanism."}, {"id": "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "reason": "Public registers data principles; not about notifying other controllers to erase links/copies."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent conditions; unrelated to the erasure-related notification duty."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "على مدير البيانات", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "modality": {"span": "على مدير البيانات ... إخطار", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "action": {"span": "إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "scope": {"span": "تطبيق التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية ... بمراعاة ما وصلت إليه أحدث أساليب الحماية التقنية، والتكلفة المترتبة على ذلك", "article": "Article 8(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "exception": {"span": "مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "temporal": {"span": "خلال خمسة عشر يوماً", "article": "Article 23(5)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "controller", "target_value": "مدير البيانات (controller)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"على مدير البيانات\""}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "Obligation to notify third parties", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"على مدير البيانات ... إخطار\""}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "take reasonable steps to inform other controllers processing the data that the data subject requested they erase links/copies/replications", "target_value": "notify any third party to whom the data were disclosed about the correction/erasure/blocking carried out", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم\""}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "taking account of available technology and cost; steps may include technical measures", "target_value": "technical and organizational measures must consider latest technical protection methods and cost", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 8(1): \"التدابير الفنية والتنظيمية ... بمراعاة ما وصلت إليه أحدث أساليب الحماية التقنية، والتكلفة المترتبة على ذلك\""}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "controller made the data public and is obliged to erase under paragraph 1", "target_value": "after responding (wholly or partially) to a data subject request under Art. 23(1) resulting in correction/erasure/blocking", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب ... استناداً لحكم البند (1)\""}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "freedom of expression/information; legal obligation/public interest/official authority; public health; archiving/research/statistics (Art. 89(1)); legal claims", "target_value": "notification not required if impossible or cannot be achieved", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال\""}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "within fifteen days", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 23(5): \"خلال خمسة عشر يوماً\""}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None specified", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ""}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.67, "reasoning_note": "Key functional overlap exists via Article 23(5), which obliges the controller to notify third parties after rectification/erasure, but it does not require instructing other controllers to erase links/copies nor hinge on data being made public. The scope qualifier is partially addressed by Article 8(1), which embeds technology-and-cost-aware technical measures, albeit in the security context rather than the erasure-notification step. The GDPR’s specific exceptions are not mirrored.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-027", "gdpr_article": 8, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 11, "total": 11}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The counterpart in the target jurisdiction is not fully equivalent to the GDPR requirement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "span": "Article 23(5): \"على مدير البيانات، خلال خمسة عشر يوماً من تاريخ استجابته - كلياً أو جزئياً - لطلب قُدِّم إليه استناداً لحكم البند (1) من هذه المادة، إخطار أيّ طرف ثالث أفصح له عن تلك البيانات عن التصحيح أو المسح أو الحَجْب الذي تم نتيجة الطلب المشار إليه، مالم يكن ذلك متعذراً أو لا يمكن تحقيقه بحسب الأحوال\"", "why": "The provision only requires notification in cases where the controller has responded to a request for correction, blocking, or erasure, and does not explicitly state that the controller must take account of available technology and cost"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The scope slot is partially covered by Article 8(1)", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "span": "بمراعاة ما وصلت إليه أحدث أساليب الحماية التقنية، والتكلفة المترتبة على ذلك", "why": "This provision suggests that the controller must take into account the available technology and cost when implementing technical and organizational measures to protect the data."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["23f5fda398d01b0f5865", "c9f5b5ef9189452960fe", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "4f0c7ea198f3c5b3627c", "74358e437cd9e85fdabb", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "10e6e0e9f2f36b4c7b42", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 774.9, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "c66e9337dd456e9432d7", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
