{"candidates_selected": ["14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Procedural provision on deputizing judicial officers; does not lay down penalty rules."}, {"id": "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "reason": "Definitions; no operative rules on penalties."}, {"id": "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "reason": "Inspection and enforcement powers; not rules establishing penalties."}, {"id": "79c959efd73d5d166449", "reason": "Settlement (composition) procedure; affects prosecution but does not itself lay down the penalties."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Substantive rules on processing criminal-justice data; not penalty rules."}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Power to compel information; not penalties."}, {"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "reason": "Investigative powers (“may conduct an investigation”); does not impose a duty on the State to lay down penalties nor set penalty rules."}, {"id": "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "reason": "International data transfer conditions; not penalties."}, {"id": "0c872442bf005518c094", "reason": "DPO registration criteria; not penalties."}, {"id": "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311", "reason": "Civil compensation; a remedy, not a ‘penalty’ in the sense of punitive sanctions."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": "يعاقَب بالحبس مدة لا تزيد على سنة وبالغرامة التي لا تقل عن ألف دينار ولا تتجاوز عشرين ألف دينار، أو بإحدى هاتين العقوبتين", "article": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5"}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "Member States", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "lay down rules on other penalties applicable to infringements of this Regulation", "target_value": "يعاقَب بالحبس مدة لا تزيد على سنة وبالغرامة ... أو بإحدى هاتين العقوبتين", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "covered", "citation": ["14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff"], "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "particularly for infringements not subject to administrative fines under Article 83", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.66, "reasoning_note": "Articles 58 and 59 clearly lay down punitive rules (criminal fines/imprisonment and corporate liability), so the ‘other penalties’ action is covered. However, the GDPR’s meta‑duty on the State (addressee/modality) and the ‘particularly where not subject to administrative fines’ qualifier are not textually present in the Bahrain provisions; Art. 47 is an investigative power (“may”), not a legislative duty to establish penalties. Accordingly, coverage is partial: penalties exist, but the Member-State obligation and the specific scope nuance are not expressed.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-948", "gdpr_article": 84, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 10, "total": 22}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 6, "total": 28}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The target jurisdiction's law provides some rules on other penalties applicable to infringements, particularly where infringements are not subject to administrative fines.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "span": "Article 58", "why": "Outlines penalties for various infringements, including processing of sensitive personal data and transfer of personal data outside the kingdom."}, {"id": "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "span": "Article 59", "why": "Provides for the liability of legal persons, which could be seen as covering infringements not subject to administrative fines."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "span": "Article 58 (chapeau)", "why": "Includes a savings clause allowing for additional penalties to be applied in cases where infringements are not subject to administrative fines under Article 83."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is based on an incomplete analysis of the provisions. The presence of an addressee imposing a duty on the State and rules on other penalties applicable to infringements can be inferred from Articles 47, 58, and 59.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "68b279470816abafcdd4", "span": "للهيئة أنْ تُجرِي تحقيقاً من تلقاء نفسها أو بناءً على طلب الوزير أو مما تتلقاه من بلاغات أو شكاوٍ جدية", "why": "This provision grants the Authority the power to investigate, which can be seen as an addressee imposing a duty."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "span": "يعاقَب بالحبس مدة لا تزيد على سنة وبالغرامة التي لا تقل عن ألف دينار ولا تتجاوز عشرين ألف دينار", "why": "This provision sets out penalties for infringements, which aligns with the proposition."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["4415e9a46823d9615000", "cf27d7263418b5d502ef", "bd5a2bbf9e9652a21d70", "79c959efd73d5d166449", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "701e535e6a5af8ac9fff", "68b279470816abafcdd4", "803cdc5aa2ea085c3461", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "0c872442bf005518c094", "5e5fa8a4888b88a04311"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 792.0, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "1439d175c01e37aaa430", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["c24849787475f274ecac"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "reason": "Concerns registration of internal data protection officers; does not address administrative fine assessment criteria."}, {"id": "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "reason": "Concerns registration of external data protection officers; does not address administrative fine assessment criteria."}, {"id": "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "reason": "Addresses responsibility of legal-person DPOs; not about supervisory authority fine assessment."}, {"id": "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "reason": "Sets complaint procedure; no criteria for imposing or sizing administrative fines."}, {"id": "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "reason": "Security of processing obligations; unrelated to administrative fine assessment by the authority."}, {"id": "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "reason": "Enumerates authority tasks; does not specify factors to consider when imposing/assessing fines."}, {"id": "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "reason": "Inspection powers; no criteria for administrative fines."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Refers DPOs to investigation; not about administrative fines assessment."}, {"id": "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "reason": "Breach notification duties; unrelated to administrative fine assessment criteria."}, {"id": "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "reason": "Criminal penalties set by courts; not the supervisory authority’s administrative fine criteria."}, {"id": "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e", "reason": "Technical and organizational measures; not about administrative fines."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً مسبَّباً بما يأتي: ... توقيع غرامة تهديدية ... توقيع غرامة إدارية", "article": "Art. 55(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يتعيَّن عند تقدير الغرامة مراعاة ...", "article": "Art. 55(2)"}, "action": {"span": "مراعاة ... عند تقدير الغرامة", "article": "Art. 55(2)"}, "scope": {"span": "مراعاة جسامة المخالفة، والعنت الذي بدا من المخالف، والمنافع التي جناها، والضرر الذي أصاب صاحب البيانات", "article": "Art. 55(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "في الحالتين المنصوص عليهما في البندين (1/ب) و(1/ج) من هذه المادة", "article": "Art. 55(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": "عند تقدير الغرامة", "article": "Art. 55(2)"}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "مجلس الإدارة (بوصفه الجهة التي تُصدر قرارات توقيع الغرامات الإدارية)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 55(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": "يتعيَّن ... مراعاة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 55(2)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "give due regard to the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement", "target_value": "مراعاة ... عند تقدير الغرامة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 55(2)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "including the nature, scope or purpose of the processing, the number of data subjects affected, and the level of damage", "target_value": "جسامة المخالفة، العنت، المنافع، الضرر", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 55(2)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "في الحالتين المنصوص عليهما في البندين (1/ب) (غرامة تهديدية) و(1/ج) (غرامة إدارية)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Art. 55(2)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "when deciding whether to impose an administrative fine and when deciding on the amount in each individual case", "target_value": "عند تقدير الغرامة (عند تحديد مقدار الغرامة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 55(2)"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.78, "reasoning_note": "Art. 55(2) obliges the Board to consider certain factors when assessing fines (seriousness, obstinacy, benefits gained, and harm). It does not mention duration of the infringement, number of data subjects affected, or the nature/scope/purpose of processing, and it ties the obligation to assessing the fine amount rather than the initial decision to impose. Therefore the correspondence is partial and narrower than GDPR RU-938.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-938", "gdpr_article": 83, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 17, "total": 29}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 9, "total": 38}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The counterpart in the target jurisdiction does not fully consider the duration of the infringement", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 55(2)", "span": "جسامة المخالفة، العنت الذي بدا من المخالف، المنافع التي جناها، الضرر الذي أصاب صاحب البيانات", "why": "This provision does not explicitly mention the duration of the infringement"}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The BHR law does not explicitly consider the duration of the infringement when deciding on the fine, which is a key aspect of the GDPR requirement unit (RU-938).", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "جسامة المخالفة، العنت، المنافع، الضرر", "why": "This provision does not mention the duration of the infringement, which is a crucial factor in determining the fine under the GDPR."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["f8e27ed18c61ec00ea9c", "7e54d45e18f8371cc670", "c9145cc9a91d8ff7530c", "a3c79315ae2d7920a38f", "7e2914aa34ab2739dafd", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "c24849787475f274ecac", "8e585010f3f5f3f24dbb", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "1d9b90bc8d164f514dc3", "14fe9b230c7ba11703d5", "0dfa8d201a449ae5a66e"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 756.34, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "b4845eec02a6d9559aa9", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
