{"candidates_selected": ["c24849787475f274ecac", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "bcc7ee2c6007b34ff5a5", "reason": "Procedural power to hear witnesses in investigations; does not address certifications or orders to certification bodies."}, {"id": "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "reason": "Investigation tool to obtain data/documents; no relation to certifications or ordering non-issuance."}, {"id": "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "reason": "Substantive rules for processing criminal-case data; no supervisory power over certifications."}, {"id": "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "reason": "Consent requirements; not about supervisory orders or certification schemes."}, {"id": "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "reason": "Data subject rectification/blocking/erasure; not supervisory powers over certifications."}, {"id": "4415e9a46823d9615000", "reason": "Delegation to law enforcement officers for investigation; not about certification bodies."}, {"id": "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "reason": "Confidentiality obligations of the Authority; unrelated to certification orders."}, {"id": "88af48316f67d59351aa", "reason": "Data subject right to object; not supervisory orders or certification schemes."}, {"id": "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "reason": "Disciplinary investigation of Data Protection Officer; no certification-body order power."}, {"id": "60ac6548bc5d2db87414", "reason": "Removal of CEO; unrelated to supervisory certification powers."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "تتولى الهيئة مباشرة كافة المهام والصلاحيات اللازمة... ولها في سبيل ذلك القيام بوجه خاص بما يلي", "article": "Article 30 (chapeau)"}, "action": {"span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة وإزالة أسبابها أو آثارها", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "مراقبة مدى الالتزام بأحكام هذا القانون", "article": "Article 30(2)"}, "condition": {"span": "عند ثبوت المخالفة", "article": "Article 55(1)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": "وفي حالة عدم امتثاله لذلك التكليف في الفترة المحددة، فإن لمجلس الإدارة أن يصدر قراراً مسبَّباً بما يأتي: أ - سحب التصريح المسبق... ب - توقيع غرامة تهديدية... ج - توقيع غرامة إدارية", "article": "Article 55(1)(أ)(ب)(ج)"}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr": "supervisory authority", "target": "Board of the Authority (مجلس الإدارة) issues orders", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr": "power", "target": "Authority has the necessary powers to act (ولها... القيام)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 30 (chapeau)"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr": "order the certification body not to issue a certification", "target": "order a violator to cease a violation and remove its causes/effects", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr": "certifications under Articles 42 and 43", "target": "general enforcement of this law; no mention of certifications or certification bodies", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 30(2); Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr": "the requirements for the certification are not or are no longer met", "target": "upon establishment of a violation (عند ثبوت المخالفة)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 55(1)"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed specific to this power", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr": "None", "target": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr": "None", "target": "If the violator does not comply with the order, the Board may withdraw prior authorization and impose daily or administrative fines", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "broader", "citation": "Article 55(1)(أ)(ب)(ج)"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 55(1) does confer a general order power (to stop violations), but the statute does not mention certification bodies, certification schemes, or conditions tied to certification requirements. Therefore, the GDPR-specific power to order a certification body not to issue a certification when certification requirements are not met is not expressed in the target text.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-146", "gdpr_article": 17, "jurisdiction": "BHR", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 13, "total": 25}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 27}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The 'action' slot is not entirely uncovered, as Article 55(1) provides some support for the idea that the supervisory authority has the power to order a certification body not to issue a certification.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة", "why": "This provision suggests that the council has the power to order a person to stop a violation, which could be interpreted as ordering a certification body not to issue a certification if the requirements are not met."}], "confidence": 0.6}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict is not entirely accurate, as Article 55(1) provides some power to the council to regulate and enforce compliance with the law, but it does not explicitly mention certification bodies or certifications.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "c24849787475f274ecac", "span": "يأمر مجلس الإدارة المخالف بالتوقف عن المخالفة وإزالة أسبابها أو آثارها فوراً أو خلال فترة زمنية يحدِّدها المجلس", "why": "This provision shows that the council has the power to order the violator to stop the violation and remove its causes or effects, which could be related to certifications."}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["bcc7ee2c6007b34ff5a5", "9bcb8d6e5e38974e2a1b", "3d71a23a91370cadf799", "5bd7541a2690632a7c77", "6b500d26673394f3d7e6", "4415e9a46823d9615000", "348fe2ada83b7d57f33a", "8cd7b777aa3cd8ca5f1f", "c24849787475f274ecac", "88af48316f67d59351aa", "6a403e591ecc2a5638fc", "60ac6548bc5d2db87414"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 752.6, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "36334ff751ae7bf2446f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": [], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c34922f387019af45e42", "reason": "Concerns data subject rights regarding automated processing; does not address appointing a representative or any analogous local representative requirement."}, {"id": "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "reason": "Sets out complaint procedures before the Office; no obligation to designate a representative."}, {"id": "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "reason": "Duties toward a Data Protection Officer (DPO); a DPO is an internal/compliance role, not an external representative for jurisdictional purposes."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "reason": "Right to restriction of processing; unrelated to representative designation."}, {"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "reason": "Requires appointment of a DPO in certain high-risk cases and allows the DPO to be inside or outside the UAE; does not require designating a representative in the Union or any functionally equivalent local representative for non-established entities."}, {"id": "877fafe0080725188d05", "reason": "Rectification/erasure rights; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "reason": "Access to information (including cross-border safeguards); does not mandate appointment of a representative."}, {"id": "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "reason": "Defines DPO roles (including liaison with the Office); not an external representative akin to GDPR Art. 27."}, {"id": "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "reason": "Right to object/stop processing; unrelated."}, {"id": "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "reason": "Administrative delegation of powers; no representative requirement."}, {"id": "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "reason": "Consent conditions; unrelated."}, {"id": "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2", "reason": "Authority to exempt certain establishments from PDPL requirements; does not create a representative obligation."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": null, "article": null}, "modality": {"span": null, "article": null}, "action": {"span": null, "article": null}, "scope": {"span": null, "article": null}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller or processor to whom Article 3(2) GDPR applies", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "obligation", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "designate in writing a representative established in the Union", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "representation for processing activities to which Article 3(2) applies", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "Where Article 3(2) GDPR applies", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "Does not apply where (a) the processing is occasional, low-risk, and not large-scale special/criminal data; or (b) the controller/processor is a public authority", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.9, "reasoning_note": "Agreeing with the objection: the UAE PDPL provisions provided contain no requirement to designate a representative in the Union or any functionally equivalent local representative for non-established controllers/processors. Articles on appointing/empowering a DPO (Arts. 10–12) and liaison roles (Art. 11) do not amount to the GDPR Art. 27 representative obligation. Therefore RU-220 is uncovered.", "label": "C5", "ru_id": "RU-220", "gdpr_article": 27, "jurisdiction": "UAE", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 25}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart exists under different terminology or context", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article discusses the appointment of a data protection officer, which could be considered a counterpart to designating a representative in the Union for data protection purposes."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The UAE provisions do not explicitly require the designation of a representative in the Union, as stated in the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "span": "المادة (10) تعيين مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article mentions the appointment of a data protection officer, but not the designation of a representative in the Union."}, {"id": "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "span": "المادة (11) أدوار مسؤول حماية البيانات", "why": "This article mentions the role of the data protection officer as a liaison between the controller or processor and the office, but not as a representative in the Union."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["c34922f387019af45e42", "5d949837d7aab073cd67", "9c38ab11b550755816f5", "5bedab371a9fc40ba93a", "9630e6d967b64e07d339", "877fafe0080725188d05", "717a67a0d311f88c5fd9", "34f7595acb9df257ef5e", "4a1a7742c2a181be0640", "1f0de28c69e3ad65d235", "80f95c322bb3204c7f65", "2b337b9a20a4e33b6ad2"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 724.24, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "35c9c1af9f45545f865f", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
