{"candidates_selected": ["192caaa530952a30ad50", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "f5c366135483fe580381"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "a200ece03fd0ba143354", "reason": "Procedural rules for exercising data-subject rights; no supervisory authority reporting or annual report content."}, {"id": "9548224453cca1301899", "reason": "Ministerial implementing decisions; no reporting or annual report content."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "Security/public interest processing exemptions; no relevance to supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "reason": "General execution clause; does not address reports or their content."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Controller disclosure exemptions; unrelated to authority reports."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow limitation by controllers; no supervisory authority reporting."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Controller exemptions; no authority reporting obligations or permissions."}, {"id": "6c76988b817262e3e312", "reason": "Controller internal governance duties; not about the authority’s annual reporting."}, {"id": "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf", "reason": "Controller obligations and policies; no supervisory authority report content."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 27"}, "modality": {"span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "article": "Article 27"}, "action": {"span": "إجراء البحوث، ورصد التطورات ... وإعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأنها", "article": "Article 27"}, "scope": {"span": "في مجالات التكنولوجيا المتصلة بالمسائل التي يشملها هذا القانون", "article": "Article 27"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "each supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة (competent authority)", "basis": "conceptual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 27"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "للإدارة المختصة ... أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة (may take all necessary measures), ومنها إعداد التقارير", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Art. 27"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "include in the annual report a list of types of infringement notified and types of measures taken in accordance with Article 58(2)", "target_value": "إعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأن التطورات التكنولوجية؛ وجود تدابير تُتخذ بحق المخالفات (إلزام بتدارك المخالفة)؛ وجود إخطار للجهة المختصة بحالات إخلال جسيم بأمن البيانات", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Art. 27; Art. 26; Art. 14"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "content of the annual activity report", "target_value": "تقارير بشأن التطورات التكنولوجية المتصلة بمسائل القانون؛ لا نص على تقرير سنوي أو على تضمين قوائم بأنواع المخالفات أو التدابير", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed (no annual-report element stated)", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "-"}], "holistic_label": "partial", "confidence": 0.62, "reasoning_note": "Article 27 expressly permits the competent authority to prepare reports, which addresses the reviewer’s point, and Articles 26 and 14 show that infringements and measures exist in the system. However, there is no text authorizing or describing an annual activity report or the inclusion of lists of types of infringements and measures therein. Thus the core GDPR permission is only partially reflected.", "label": "C2", "ru_id": "RU-698", "gdpr_article": 59, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 5, "total": 5}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 7, "total": 12}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 1, "total": 13}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict of 'uncovered' for the 'action' slot might be too narrow, and a more nuanced interpretation of the Qatari law could reveal a counterpart to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "إعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأن التطورات التكنولوجية", "why": "This provision mentions preparing reports, which could potentially include reporting on infringements and measures taken."}, {"id": "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "span": "على جميع الجهات المختصة، كل فيما يخصه، تنفيذ هذا القانون", "why": "This provision implies some level of reporting or transparency, which could include reporting on infringements and measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The analyst's verdict may be too narrow, as there are provisions in the Qatari law that could be considered as counterparts to the GDPR requirement.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "إعداد التقارير أو التوصيات بشأن التطورات التكنولوجية المتصلة بمسائل القانون", "why": "This provision suggests that the competent authority has some reporting obligations, which could be related to the GDPR requirement."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "تشجيع وتطوير التنظيم الذاتي، ونشر الوعي بهذا القانون، وتطوير برامج التدريب والتعليم", "why": "This provision suggests that the competent authority has some responsibilities related to promoting awareness and education about the law, which could potentially include reporting on types of infringement notified and measures taken."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["a200ece03fd0ba143354", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "9548224453cca1301899", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "83fae53ff99059f02f05", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "f5c366135483fe580381", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "850decaffbbae78d371d", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "85d05fccf5b4f57eceaf"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 785.75, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "c951fb510243aa1cf58c", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "reason": "Record-keeping about disclosures/transfers; does not create a permission ground for cross-border transfers."}, {"id": "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "reason": "Processor selection/contracting duties; no rule on cross-border transfer permissions."}, {"id": "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "reason": "Breach notification; unrelated to transfer grounds."}, {"id": "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "reason": "Domestic disclosure grounds (including judicial requirements) not specific to cross-border transfer permissions."}, {"id": "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "reason": "Erasure rights and related notifications; no cross-border transfer permission."}, {"id": "295bad3524a8fa35d18c", "reason": "Territorial scope of the law; not a transfer permission."}, {"id": "06b918a4049719ed530f", "reason": "Licensing/certification and oversight mechanisms; not a transfer permission."}, {"id": "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "reason": "General collection/processing purpose-change grounds (including judicial requirements) but not cross-border transfer permissions."}, {"id": "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "reason": "Content of records of processing, including documenting transfers; does not authorize transfers."}, {"id": "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "reason": "Means to handle data subject requests; no transfer permission."}, {"id": "fa368b0d433d7765b715", "reason": "Non-derogation clause; does not create a specific transfer ground."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "يجوز لجهة التحكم", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "modality": {"span": "يجوز", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "action": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "scope": {"span": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "article": "Article 29(1)"}, "condition": {"span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: أ- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لالتزام بموجب اتفاقية تكون المملكة طرفاً فيه. ب- إذا كان ذلك لخدمة مصالح المملكة. ج- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لالتزام يكون صاحب البيانات الشخصية طرفاً فيه. د- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لأغراض أخرى وفق ما تحدده اللوائح. | تكون الشروط الواجب توافرها عند نقل البيانات الشخصية أو الإفصاح عنها: أ- ألا يترتب على النقل أو الإفصاح مساس بالأمن الوطني أو بمصالح المملكة الحيوية. ب- أن يتوافر مستوى مناسب لحماية البيانات الشخصية في خارج المملكة... ج- أن يقتصر النقل أو الإفصاح على الحد الأدنى من البيانات الشخصية الذي تدعو الحاجة إليه.", "article": "Article 29(1)-(2)"}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"gdpr_value": "controller or processor", "target_value": "جهة التحكم", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "narrower", "citation": "Article 29(1)", "slot": "addressee"}, {"gdpr_value": "permission", "target_value": "يجوز", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)", "slot": "modality"}, {"gdpr_value": "transfer personal data to a third country or an international organisation", "target_value": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)", "slot": "action"}, {"gdpr_value": "transfers of personal data to a third country or an international organisation", "target_value": "نقل البيانات الشخصية إلى خارج المملكة أو الإفصاح عنها لجهة خارج المملكة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 29(1)", "slot": "scope"}, {"gdpr_value": "the transfer is necessary for the establishment, exercise or defence of legal claims", "target_value": "الأغراض المحددة في الفقرات (أ) إلى (د) من الفقرة (1) والشروط الإضافية في الفقرة (2) (الأمن الوطني، الملاءمة، التقليل)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": "Article 29(1)-(2)", "slot": "condition"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None expressed for the permission itself", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "exception"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "temporal"}, {"gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": "None", "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null, "slot": "consequence"}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.73, "reasoning_note": "Article 29(1) enumerates permissible cross-border transfer grounds, but none expressly cover transfers necessary for the establishment, exercise, or defence of legal claims. The open clause in Article 29(1)(d) defers to future regulations; absent regulatory text, this specific ground is not stated. Therefore, the GDPR permission is not textually covered by the cited KSA provision.", "label": "C4", "ru_id": "RU-571", "gdpr_article": 46, "jurisdiction": "KSA", "ablation": "full", "direction": "narrower", "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 12, "total": 12}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 12, "total": 24}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 8, "total": 32}], "sufficiency_met": false, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "The condition for transferring personal data is not entirely uncovered in the target jurisdiction, and there are provisions that could potentially be interpreted to include the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims as a valid reason for transferring personal data.", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 29(1)", "span": "لتحقيق أي من الأغراض الآتية: ... د- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لأغراض أخرى وفق ما تحدده اللوائح", "why": "This provision provides a general framework for transferring personal data outside the Kingdom for purposes determined by the regulations, which could potentially include the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims."}, {"id": "Article 15", "span": "إذا كان الإفصاح ضروريا لتحقيق مصالح مشروعة لجهة التحكم", "why": "This provision mentions that personal data can be disclosed if it is necessary to achieve legitimate interests of the controller, which could potentially include the establishment, exercise, or defense of legal claims as a legitimate interest of the controller."}], "confidence": 0.8}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterpart to GDPR requirement unit [RU-571] found in Article 29(1) د-", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "span": "د- إذا كان ذلك تنفيذاً لأغراض أخرى وفق ما تحدده اللوائح", "why": "This provision could potentially include the transfer of personal data for the establishment, exercise, or defence of legal claims, depending on how the regulations are defined."}], "confidence": 0.8}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["3e9d037ae7bf1b125ff2", "c95a0b593cc554df0eae", "593beb6b1fe15a8fda31", "a79606d0fb564d3b2b5d", "f8c6dae3f69fbe207307", "0922609ffbfd96a70f90", "295bad3524a8fa35d18c", "06b918a4049719ed530f", "c511c9bf7779067e64f4", "f8f94d8d9d379713d656", "d29636711e8dc90e5e69", "fa368b0d433d7765b715"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 824.33, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "662b2a9e9ead61f4d122", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
{"candidates_selected": ["43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "6c76988b817262e3e312"], "candidates_excluded": [{"id": "85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "reason": "Data subject access rights; no supervisory authority consultation/advice mechanism."}, {"id": "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "reason": "Controller-to-processor disclosure alignment; no supervisory authority advisory role."}, {"id": "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "reason": "Exemptions from access obligation; unrelated to supervisory authority prior advice."}, {"id": "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "reason": "Data subject rights (withdraw, object, erase, rectify); not about supervisory authority advice."}, {"id": "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "reason": "Transitional compliance period; no relevance to consultation or advice."}, {"id": "07962910da55dbce48d3", "reason": "Cross-border data flow rule for controllers; no supervisory authority advisory duty."}, {"id": "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "reason": "National security/public interest exemptions; no supervisory authority advisory mechanism."}, {"id": "f5c366135483fe580381", "reason": "Breach notification to the authority and individuals; post-breach reporting, not authority advice on intended processing."}, {"id": "850decaffbbae78d371d", "reason": "Exemptions from certain controller obligations; no supervisory authority advisory function."}], "target_frame": {"addressee": {"span": "الإدارة المختصة", "article": "Article 26"}, "modality": {"span": "وللإدارة المختصة، بعد التحقيق في الشكوى وثبوت جديتها، أن تصدر قراراً مسبباً", "article": "Article 26"}, "action": {"span": "أن تصدر قراراً مسبباً بإلزام المراقب أو المعالج، بحسب الأحوال، بتدارك تلك المخالفة خلال مدة تحددها", "article": "Article 26"}, "scope": {"span": "مراجعة إجراءات حماية الخصوصية قبل إدراج عمليات معالجة جديدة", "article": "Article 11"}, "condition": {"span": null, "article": null}, "exception": {"span": null, "article": null}, "temporal": {"span": null, "article": null}, "consequence": {"span": null, "article": null}}, "slot_verdicts": [{"slot": "addressee", "gdpr_value": "supervisory authority", "target_value": "الإدارة المختصة", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "covered", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "modality", "gdpr_value": "obligation (must)", "target_value": "وللإدارة المختصة ... أن تصدر قراراً مسبباً (permission/authority to act)", "basis": "direct_textual", "verdict": "weaker_modality", "citation": "Article 26"}, {"slot": "action", "gdpr_value": "provide written advice to the controller and, where applicable, the processor", "target_value": "تصدر الإدارة المختصة قراراً مسبباً بإلزام المراقب أو المعالج ...؛ كما يجوز لها إعداد تقارير أو توصيات عامة", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 26; Article 27"}, {"slot": "scope", "gdpr_value": "intended processing referred to in paragraph 1 (high-risk processing subject to prior consultation)", "target_value": "قبل إدراج عمليات معالجة جديدة (new/intended processing at controller level)", "basis": "distributed", "verdict": "partial", "citation": "Article 11"}, {"slot": "condition", "gdpr_value": "where the supervisory authority is of the opinion that the intended processing would infringe the GDPR", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "exception", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "temporal", "gdpr_value": "within up to eight weeks of receipt of the consultation request", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "uncovered", "citation": null}, {"slot": "consequence", "gdpr_value": "None", "target_value": null, "basis": "absent", "verdict": "covered", "citation": null}], "holistic_label": "uncovered", "confidence": 0.58, "reasoning_note": "I considered distributed counterparts (Art. 11 on new processing, Art. 27 on recommendations, and Art. 26 on reasoned decisions). However, the Qatar text lacks a duty for the authority to provide written advice to controllers/processors upon a consultation about intended processing, and it provides no response timeline. Art. 26 is reactive (post-complaint) and coercive, not advisory; Art. 27’s recommendations are general, not tied to controller consultations.", "label": "C3", "ru_id": "RU-416", "gdpr_article": 36, "jurisdiction": "QAT", "ablation": "full", "direction": null, "sufficiency_curve": [{"round": 1, "n_queries": 1, "new": 2, "total": 2}, {"round": 2, "n_queries": 4, "new": 11, "total": 13}, {"round": 3, "n_queries": 4, "new": 2, "total": 15}], "sufficiency_met": true, "slot_completeness": 1.0, "rule_vs_holistic_agree": false, "n_revisions": 4, "objections": [{"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential for indirect or differently framed counterparts in Qatari law", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "span": "للفرد أن يتقدم بشكوى إلى الإدارة المختصة، في حالة مخالفة أحكام هذا القانون والقرارات الصادرة تنفيذاً له.", "why": "Implies a role for the competent department in addressing complaints, which could involve advisory actions."}, {"id": "192caaa530952a30ad50", "span": "للإدارة المختصة، في سبيل تطبيق وتنفيذ أحكام هذا القانون، أن تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Suggests the competent department has a broad mandate to take necessary actions, potentially including guidance or advice."}], "confidence": 0.7}, {"verdict": "revise", "objection": "Potential counterparts for 'scope' and 'condition' slots might exist under different terminology or distributed across several provisions", "counter_evidence": [{"id": "Article 11", "span": "مراجعة إجراءات حماية الخصوصية قبل إدراج عمليات معالجة جديدة", "why": "Related to intended processing"}, {"id": "Article 14", "span": "إعلام الفرد والإدارة المختصة، بحدوث أي إخلال بالاحتياطات المنصوص عليها في المادة السابقة", "why": "Connected to the condition of the supervisory authority considering the intended processing"}, {"id": "Article 27", "span": "تتخذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة لذلك", "why": "Potential form of written advice"}], "confidence": 0.7}], "n_candidates": 12, "candidate_ids": ["85e94dba24cbfb8955cd", "43a894c88a019f80b1d4", "75db9db720e9e34a1148", "75852a697f66691bfbfb", "fca1aa50445ca4475333", "dbaab43b07be19b5483e", "07962910da55dbce48d3", "3f5cc5a2c4af5fb90388", "f5c366135483fe580381", "6c76988b817262e3e312", "192caaa530952a30ad50", "850decaffbbae78d371d"], "n_llm_calls": 7, "latency_s": 856.44, "temperature": 0.7, "seed": 20260803, "id": "6a1a2bc72d97aa89249e", "condition": "stability", "rep": 2}
